{"format":"srcd","version":1,"generator":"闪星卡（StarCard）· SAT800（严格按 SAT800.apkg 重建 · 现在模板 · 英文例句）","exportedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","parameters":{"algorithm":"FSRS-5","algorithmVersion":"5","requestRetention":0.9,"maximumInterval":36500,"weights":[0.40255,1.18385,3.173,15.69105,7.1949,0.5345,1.4604,0.0046,1.54575,0.1192,1.01925,1.9395,0.11,0.29605,2.2698,0.2315,2.9898,0.51655,0.6621],"newCardsPerDay":20,"reviewCardsPerDay":200,"learningSteps":[1,10],"relearningSteps":[10],"graduatingInterval":1,"easyInterval":4,"leechThreshold":8,"leechAction":"tag","buryRelated":true,"newOrder":"mix","reviewOrder":"due"},"decks":[{"id":"sat800-list-01","name":"SAT800 核心 › List 01","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["sat800","imported"],"options":{},"cards":[{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351961","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"auspicious","back":"释义\n吉兆的、幸运的\n词根词缀\nau-鸟（avis 的组合形式）+spic看，观察（specere）+-ious形容词后缀，具有…性质的\n古罗马占卜师通过观察飞鸟（avis）的飞行与鸣叫（specere）来判断神意，即 auspicium（鸟占）；结果吉利便称 auspicium bonum，引申为“吉祥的、顺利的”。\n助记\nawe带着敬畏心去看，spect=看的意思；像看相一样，带着敬畏的心去看很吉祥的东西\n例句\nThe ==auspicious== weather on the wedding day delighted the couple.","fields":{"Front":"auspicious","Back":"释义\n吉兆的、幸运的\n词根词缀\nau-鸟（avis 的组合形式）+spic看，观察（specere）+-ious形容词后缀，具有…性质的\n古罗马占卜师通过观察飞鸟（avis）的飞行与鸣叫（specere）来判断神意，即 auspicium（鸟占）；结果吉利便称 auspicium bonum，引申为“吉祥的、顺利的”。\n助记\nawe带着敬畏心去看，spect=看的意思；像看相一样，带着敬畏的心去看很吉祥的东西\n例句\nThe ==auspicious== weather on the wedding day delighted the couple.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351963","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"automate","back":"释义\n使自动化\n词根词缀\nauto-自己，自身+mat意愿、思考（automatos 中 -matos，与 menos“精神”同源）+-ate动词后缀，使成为\n源自希腊语 automatos“自动行动的”，auto-（自己）+ -matos（意愿），即“自己会动的”；1950 年代由 automation 逆构为动词 automate，意为“使自动化”。\n助记\nauto=自动，ate是动词后缀\n例句\nThe company decided to ==automate== its customer service system.","fields":{"Front":"automate","Back":"释义\n使自动化\n词根词缀\nauto-自己，自身+mat意愿、思考（automatos 中 -matos，与 menos“精神”同源）+-ate动词后缀，使成为\n源自希腊语 automatos“自动行动的”，auto-（自己）+ -matos（意愿），即“自己会动的”；1950 年代由 automation 逆构为动词 automate，意为“使自动化”。\n助记\nauto=自动，ate是动词后缀\n例句\nThe company decided to ==automate== its customer service system.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351965","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"bellicose","back":"释义\n好战的、好斗的\n词根词缀\nbell战争（bellum）+-icose形容词后缀，好…的、倾向于…的（-osus 的变体）\n拉丁语 bellum“战争”派生 bellicosus“好战的”，由 bell-（战争）+ -icose（倾向于）构成，意为“好争斗的、喜战的”。\n助记\nbell有两个意思：美和战斗（战争女神雅典娜同时也是美女）；cos合在一起\n例句\nHis ==bellicose== remarks alarmed the peace activists.","fields":{"Front":"bellicose","Back":"释义\n好战的、好斗的\n词根词缀\nbell战争（bellum）+-icose形容词后缀，好…的、倾向于…的（-osus 的变体）\n拉丁语 bellum“战争”派生 bellicosus“好战的”，由 bell-（战争）+ -icose（倾向于）构成，意为“好争斗的、喜战的”。\n助记\nbell有两个意思：美和战斗（战争女神雅典娜同时也是美女）；cos合在一起\n例句\nHis ==bellicose== remarks alarmed the peace activists.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351967","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"browse","back":"释义\n浏览；吃草\n词根词缀\n简单词。源自古法语 brost/broust“嫩芽、新枝”（可能源自日耳曼语），本义指牲畜啃食树叶嫩枝，后引申为“随意翻阅、浏览”。无清晰的前缀后缀可拆。\n助记\n浏览器的命名就来源于这个词，核心是快速查看内容\n例句\nShe spent the afternoon ==browsing== through the shelves of the old bookstore.","fields":{"Front":"browse","Back":"释义\n浏览；吃草\n词根词缀\n简单词。源自古法语 brost/broust“嫩芽、新枝”（可能源自日耳曼语），本义指牲畜啃食树叶嫩枝，后引申为“随意翻阅、浏览”。无清晰的前缀后缀可拆。\n助记\n浏览器的命名就来源于这个词，核心是快速查看内容\n例句\nShe spent the afternoon ==browsing== through the shelves of the old bookstore.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351969","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cacophonous","back":"释义\n刺耳的、不和谐\n词根词缀\ncaco-坏的、恶的+phon声音、嗓音（phone）+-ous形容词后缀，充满…的\n希腊语 kakophōnos = kako-（坏的）+ phōnē（声音），即“难听的声音”，加形容词后缀 -ous，意为“刺耳的、不和谐音的”。\n助记\n核心词根phone=声音；cackle像卡壳的声音，不悦耳\n例句\nThe ==cacophonous== shouting of the crowd drowned out the speaker.","fields":{"Front":"cacophonous","Back":"释义\n刺耳的、不和谐\n词根词缀\ncaco-坏的、恶的+phon声音、嗓音（phone）+-ous形容词后缀，充满…的\n希腊语 kakophōnos = kako-（坏的）+ phōnē（声音），即“难听的声音”，加形容词后缀 -ous，意为“刺耳的、不和谐音的”。\n助记\n核心词根phone=声音；cackle像卡壳的声音，不悦耳\n例句\nThe ==cacophonous== shouting of the crowd drowned out the speaker.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351971","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"concede","back":"释义\n承认；让步\n词根词缀\ncon-共同、完全（com- 的同化形式，此处加强语气）+cede行走、让步（cedere）\n拉丁语 concedere = con-（完全）+ cedere（让步、走开），本义“让与、允许”，引申为“承认（对手有理）、退让”。\n助记\nseed=脚步，con=双方/加强；双方一起往后退一步，打不过了勉强认输\n例句\nAfter hours of debate, she finally ==conceded== that his argument was stronger.","fields":{"Front":"concede","Back":"释义\n承认；让步\n词根词缀\ncon-共同、完全（com- 的同化形式，此处加强语气）+cede行走、让步（cedere）\n拉丁语 concedere = con-（完全）+ cedere（让步、走开），本义“让与、允许”，引申为“承认（对手有理）、退让”。\n助记\nseed=脚步，con=双方/加强；双方一起往后退一步，打不过了勉强认输\n例句\nAfter hours of debate, she finally ==conceded== that his argument was stronger.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351973","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"conjecture","back":"释义\n推测、猜想\n词根词缀\ncon-一起+ject投掷（jacere）+-ure名词后缀，表示行为/结果\n拉丁语 conjicere = con-（一起）+ jacere（投），即“把事实凑在一起抛出推测”；名词 conjectura 引申为“猜测、臆测”。\n助记\ncon=加强，ject=扔；project=往前扔；联想投石问路，往前扔石头探路摸清前面情况\n例句\nScientists can only ==conjecture== about life on other planets.","fields":{"Front":"conjecture","Back":"释义\n推测、猜想\n词根词缀\ncon-一起+ject投掷（jacere）+-ure名词后缀，表示行为/结果\n拉丁语 conjicere = con-（一起）+ jacere（投），即“把事实凑在一起抛出推测”；名词 conjectura 引申为“猜测、臆测”。\n助记\ncon=加强，ject=扔；project=往前扔；联想投石问路，往前扔石头探路摸清前面情况\n例句\nScientists can only ==conjecture== about life on other planets.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351975","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"constitute","back":"释义\n组成；任命\n词根词缀\ncon-一起、加强语气+stit站立、设立（statuere，源 stare“站立”）+-ute动词后缀\n拉丁语 constituere = con-（一起）+ statuere（设立、安放），即“放到一起建立起来”，意为“构成、设立、制定”。\n助记\n坐下来，共同坐下来构成一个整体；宪法是一个国家所有法律条文的基础框架\n例句\nDozens of small islands ==constitute== the scattered archipelago.","fields":{"Front":"constitute","Back":"释义\n组成；任命\n词根词缀\ncon-一起、加强语气+stit站立、设立（statuere，源 stare“站立”）+-ute动词后缀\n拉丁语 constituere = con-（一起）+ statuere（设立、安放），即“放到一起建立起来”，意为“构成、设立、制定”。\n助记\n坐下来，共同坐下来构成一个整体；宪法是一个国家所有法律条文的基础框架\n例句\nDozens of small islands ==constitute== the scattered archipelago.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351977","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"contamination","back":"释义\n污染\n词根词缀\ncon-一起+tamin触碰（tangere，经 contagmen“接触污染”）+-ation名词后缀，表示行为/状态\n拉丁语 contaminare“弄脏、玷污”，源自 contagmen“接触传染”，由 con-（一起）+ tangere（触碰）构成，即“混在一起被玷污”，引申为“污染”。\n助记\n之前家园主题课文里见过的常见词\n例句\nTests revealed ==contamination== of the water supply by industrial waste.","fields":{"Front":"contamination","Back":"释义\n污染\n词根词缀\ncon-一起+tamin触碰（tangere，经 contagmen“接触污染”）+-ation名词后缀，表示行为/状态\n拉丁语 contaminare“弄脏、玷污”，源自 contagmen“接触传染”，由 con-（一起）+ tangere（触碰）构成，即“混在一起被玷污”，引申为“污染”。\n助记\n之前家园主题课文里见过的常见词\n例句\nTests revealed ==contamination== of the water supply by industrial waste.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351979","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"convoluted","back":"释义\n费解的、复杂的\n词根词缀\ncon-一起、互相+volut滚动、卷绕（volvere）+-ed形容词后缀，已…的\n拉丁语 convolvere = con-（一起）+ volvere（卷），即“卷绕在一起”，过去分词 convolutus；引申为（句子、情节）“错综复杂的、费解的”。\n助记\nvol=螺旋（像volume），想象绳子卷在一起一团乱；con=加强，ed=形容词后缀，很多东西旋在一起\n例句\nThe instructions were so ==convoluted== that no one could follow them.","fields":{"Front":"convoluted","Back":"释义\n费解的、复杂的\n词根词缀\ncon-一起、互相+volut滚动、卷绕（volvere）+-ed形容词后缀，已…的\n拉丁语 convolvere = con-（一起）+ volvere（卷），即“卷绕在一起”，过去分词 convolutus；引申为（句子、情节）“错综复杂的、费解的”。\n助记\nvol=螺旋（像volume），想象绳子卷在一起一团乱；con=加强，ed=形容词后缀，很多东西旋在一起\n例句\nThe instructions were so ==convoluted== that no one could follow them.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351981","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"curative","back":"释义\n有疗效的\n词根词缀\ncur照料、治疗（cura）+-ative形容词后缀，有…倾向的\n拉丁语 cura“照料、治疗”派生 curare“医治”，再加 -ative（有…作用的），意为“治愈的、有疗效的”。\n助记\n核心是cure=治愈\n例句\nThe herb was believed to have ==curative== properties.","fields":{"Front":"curative","Back":"释义\n有疗效的\n词根词缀\ncur照料、治疗（cura）+-ative形容词后缀，有…倾向的\n拉丁语 cura“照料、治疗”派生 curare“医治”，再加 -ative（有…作用的），意为“治愈的、有疗效的”。\n助记\n核心是cure=治愈\n例句\nThe herb was believed to have ==curative== properties.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351983","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"deceptive","back":"释义\n欺骗性的\n词根词缀\nde-离开、偏离+cept抓取、拿取（capere 的过去分词 captus）+-ive形容词后缀，有…性质的\n拉丁语 decipere = de-（离开）+ capere（抓），即“把人骗走、抓住”；过去分词 deceptus 加 -ive，意为“欺骗性的、误导的”。\n助记\n来自动词deceive=欺骗；可结合甄嬛传素材\n例句\nThe advertisement was ==deceptive== about the product's real effects.","fields":{"Front":"deceptive","Back":"释义\n欺骗性的\n词根词缀\nde-离开、偏离+cept抓取、拿取（capere 的过去分词 captus）+-ive形容词后缀，有…性质的\n拉丁语 decipere = de-（离开）+ capere（抓），即“把人骗走、抓住”；过去分词 deceptus 加 -ive，意为“欺骗性的、误导的”。\n助记\n来自动词deceive=欺骗；可结合甄嬛传素材\n例句\nThe advertisement was ==deceptive== about the product's real effects.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351985","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"defiance","back":"释义\n反抗；蔑视\n词根词缀\nde-相反、去除（此处表否定/背离）+fi信任（fidere）+-ance名词后缀，表示行为/状态\n源自古 French defier“挑战、背弃忠诚”，由 de-（背离）+ fier（信任，源自拉丁 fidere）构成，即“背弃信任”；名词 defiance 意为“违抗、蔑视”。\n助记\n来自动词defy=跟你抗着、反着干；是反抗性\n例句\nShe spoke in ==defiance== of the unjust rule.","fields":{"Front":"defiance","Back":"释义\n反抗；蔑视\n词根词缀\nde-相反、去除（此处表否定/背离）+fi信任（fidere）+-ance名词后缀，表示行为/状态\n源自古 French defier“挑战、背弃忠诚”，由 de-（背离）+ fier（信任，源自拉丁 fidere）构成，即“背弃信任”；名词 defiance 意为“违抗、蔑视”。\n助记\n来自动词defy=跟你抗着、反着干；是反抗性\n例句\nShe spoke in ==defiance== of the unjust rule.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351987","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"degrade","back":"释义\n贬低；降解\n词根词缀\nde-向下、降低+grad步、等级（gradus）+-e动词词尾\n拉丁语 degradare = de-（向下）+ gradus（等级、步），即“降级、降格”，引申为“贬低、使堕落”。\n助记\nde=向下，grade=等级；等级往下走，和upgrade（升级）互为反义\n例句\nHumiliating comments only ==degrade== the person who makes them.","fields":{"Front":"degrade","Back":"释义\n贬低；降解\n词根词缀\nde-向下、降低+grad步、等级（gradus）+-e动词词尾\n拉丁语 degradare = de-（向下）+ gradus（等级、步），即“降级、降格”，引申为“贬低、使堕落”。\n助记\nde=向下，grade=等级；等级往下走，和upgrade（升级）互为反义\n例句\nHumiliating comments only ==degrade== the person who makes them.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351989","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"depict","back":"释义\n描绘\n词根词缀\nde-加强语气（彻底地）+pict绘画、着色（pingere 的过去分词 pictus）\n拉丁语 depingere = de-（彻底）+ pingere（画），即“画出来、描绘”，引申为“描述、刻画”。\n助记\nde=出来，pict=picture画；把想法像画画一样清晰呈现出来\n例句\nThe painting ==depicts== a peaceful countryside scene at dawn.","fields":{"Front":"depict","Back":"释义\n描绘\n词根词缀\nde-加强语气（彻底地）+pict绘画、着色（pingere 的过去分词 pictus）\n拉丁语 depingere = de-（彻底）+ pingere（画），即“画出来、描绘”，引申为“描述、刻画”。\n助记\nde=出来，pict=picture画；把想法像画画一样清晰呈现出来\n例句\nThe painting ==depicts== a peaceful countryside scene at dawn.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351991","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"deprecate","back":"释义\n反对；轻视\n词根词缀\nde-离开、去除+prec祈祷、恳求（precari，名词 prex）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁语 deprecari = de-（去除）+ precari（祈祷），即“祈祷使（某事）远离”，转义为“不赞成、贬低、反对”。\n助记\npre=之前/提前；很早就已经表明反对态度，你还这么干，我更加反对\n例句\nThe committee voted to ==deprecate== the outdated practice.","fields":{"Front":"deprecate","Back":"释义\n反对；轻视\n词根词缀\nde-离开、去除+prec祈祷、恳求（precari，名词 prex）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁语 deprecari = de-（去除）+ precari（祈祷），即“祈祷使（某事）远离”，转义为“不赞成、贬低、反对”。\n助记\npre=之前/提前；很早就已经表明反对态度，你还这么干，我更加反对\n例句\nThe committee voted to ==deprecate== the outdated practice.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351993","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"derivative","back":"释义\n衍生物；派生的\n词根词缀\nde-从…离开、出自+riv小溪、河流（rivus）+-ative形容词/名词后缀\n拉丁语 derivare = de-（从）+ rivus（溪流），即“从主流引出一条支流”；引申为“派生的、衍生的（缺乏原创性的）”。\n助记\n核心是river=河流，从主源头流淌出来的分支\n例句\nThis new design is a ==derivative== of an older famous model.","fields":{"Front":"derivative","Back":"释义\n衍生物；派生的\n词根词缀\nde-从…离开、出自+riv小溪、河流（rivus）+-ative形容词/名词后缀\n拉丁语 derivare = de-（从）+ rivus（溪流），即“从主流引出一条支流”；引申为“派生的、衍生的（缺乏原创性的）”。\n助记\n核心是river=河流，从主源头流淌出来的分支\n例句\nThis new design is a ==derivative== of an older famous model.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351995","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"deter","back":"释义\n阻止；威慑\n词根词缀\nde-离开+ter恐吓（terrere）\n拉丁语 deterrere = de-（离开）+ terrere（恐吓），即“把人吓跑”，意为“制止、威慑、阻止”。\n助记\n谐音'敌退'，吓退敌人\n例句\nHigh prices did not ==deter== the eager buyers.","fields":{"Front":"deter","Back":"释义\n阻止；威慑\n词根词缀\nde-离开+ter恐吓（terrere）\n拉丁语 deterrere = de-（离开）+ terrere（恐吓），即“把人吓跑”，意为“制止、威慑、阻止”。\n助记\n谐音'敌退'，吓退敌人\n例句\nHigh prices did not ==deter== the eager buyers.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351997","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dictator","back":"释义\n独裁者\n词根词缀\ndict说、宣告（dicere）+-ator名词后缀，表示做…的人\n拉丁语 dicere（说）派生动词 dictare（口授、命令），再加 -ator（执行者），原指古罗马临时任命的“独裁官”，引申为“独裁者、发号施令者”。\n助记\n一个人说话、一个人说了算的掌权者\n例句\nThe ==dictator== ruled the country with an iron fist for decades.","fields":{"Front":"dictator","Back":"释义\n独裁者\n词根词缀\ndict说、宣告（dicere）+-ator名词后缀，表示做…的人\n拉丁语 dicere（说）派生动词 dictare（口授、命令），再加 -ator（执行者），原指古罗马临时任命的“独裁官”，引申为“独裁者、发号施令者”。\n助记\n一个人说话、一个人说了算的掌权者\n例句\nThe ==dictator== ruled the country with an iron fist for decades.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885351999","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"diplomacy","back":"释义\n外交；交际手腕\n词根词缀\ndiploma对折的公文、国书（diploun 对折）+-cy名词后缀\n古代外交靠互换对折的国书凭证，diploma 由此引申为“外交、外交手腕”。\n助记\ndiploma（文凭、国书，即对折的文件）+ -cy（名词后缀）→ 凭国书往来交涉→外交、交际手腕。\n例句\nSkillful ==diplomacy== prevented the conflict from escalating into war.","fields":{"Front":"diplomacy","Back":"释义\n外交；交际手腕\n词根词缀\ndiploma对折的公文、国书（diploun 对折）+-cy名词后缀\n古代外交靠互换对折的国书凭证，diploma 由此引申为“外交、外交手腕”。\n助记\ndiploma（文凭、国书，即对折的文件）+ -cy（名词后缀）→ 凭国书往来交涉→外交、交际手腕。\n例句\nSkillful ==diplomacy== prevented the conflict from escalating into war.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352001","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dire","back":"释义\n严重的、可怕的\n词根词缀\n简单词。直接借自拉丁语 dirus“可怕的、不祥的、悲惨的”，无活跃前缀后缀。\n助记\n像落水狗刚掉到水里上来还被人一顿打的狼狈样子\n例句\nThe flood left the village in ==dire== need of clean water.","fields":{"Front":"dire","Back":"释义\n严重的、可怕的\n词根词缀\n简单词。直接借自拉丁语 dirus“可怕的、不祥的、悲惨的”，无活跃前缀后缀。\n助记\n像落水狗刚掉到水里上来还被人一顿打的狼狈样子\n例句\nThe flood left the village in ==dire== need of clean water.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352003","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"disaffected","back":"释义\n不满的、有叛意\n词根词缀\ndis-相反、去除+fect做、施加（facere，经 afficere“施加于”）+-ed形容词后缀\ndis-（失去）+ affected（原本受感情/忠诚影响的，源自 ad- + facere“施加于”），即“不再保有忠诚与好感的”，意为“不满的、离心离德的”。\n助记\ndis=否定，affect=爱/关爱/爱意；不喜欢你了，给你差评，友好的感觉去掉了\n例句\nThe ==disaffected== employees organized a protest against management.","fields":{"Front":"disaffected","Back":"释义\n不满的、有叛意\n词根词缀\ndis-相反、去除+fect做、施加（facere，经 afficere“施加于”）+-ed形容词后缀\ndis-（失去）+ affected（原本受感情/忠诚影响的，源自 ad- + facere“施加于”），即“不再保有忠诚与好感的”，意为“不满的、离心离德的”。\n助记\ndis=否定，affect=爱/关爱/爱意；不喜欢你了，给你差评，友好的感觉去掉了\n例句\nThe ==disaffected== employees organized a protest against management.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352005","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"discernible","back":"释义\n可察觉的、明显的\n词根词缀\ndis-分开+cern筛分、区分（cernere）+-ible形容词后缀，可…的\n拉丁语 discernere = dis-（分开）+ cernere（筛、辨），即“分辨出来”；加 -ible（可…的），意为“可辨识的、看得清的”。\n助记\ndiscern=审视、能看出来；延伸为能够察觉、辨别\n例句\nA faint smell of smoke was ==discernible== in the air.","fields":{"Front":"discernible","Back":"释义\n可察觉的、明显的\n词根词缀\ndis-分开+cern筛分、区分（cernere）+-ible形容词后缀，可…的\n拉丁语 discernere = dis-（分开）+ cernere（筛、辨），即“分辨出来”；加 -ible（可…的），意为“可辨识的、看得清的”。\n助记\ndiscern=审视、能看出来；延伸为能够察觉、辨别\n例句\nA faint smell of smoke was ==discernible== in the air.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352007","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"distract","back":"释义\n使分心\n词根词缀\ndis-分开、向不同方向+tract拖拽（trahere 的过去分词 tractus）\n拉丁语 distrahere = dis-（向不同方向）+ trahere（拉），即“把注意力拉散”，意为“使分心、扰乱”。\n助记\ndrag=拉，dis=分开；本来注意力集中在学习，脑子里各种东西把注意力拉走，精气神被拉走\n例句\nA sudden noise outside the window served to ==distract== the class.","fields":{"Front":"distract","Back":"释义\n使分心\n词根词缀\ndis-分开、向不同方向+tract拖拽（trahere 的过去分词 tractus）\n拉丁语 distrahere = dis-（向不同方向）+ trahere（拉），即“把注意力拉散”，意为“使分心、扰乱”。\n助记\ndrag=拉，dis=分开；本来注意力集中在学习，脑子里各种东西把注意力拉走，精气神被拉走\n例句\nA sudden noise outside the window served to ==distract== the class.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352009","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"divergent","back":"释义\n分歧的、不同的\n词根词缀\ndi-分开（dis- 的变体）+verg转向、倾斜（vergere）+-ent形容词后缀\n拉丁语 divergere = di-（分开）+ vergere（倾斜、朝向），即“朝不同方向倾斜”，引申为（意见、路线）“分歧的、发散的”。\n助记\nd=分开，verge=边；分开成两条边，分叉了，势不两立\n例句\nThe two brothers have ==divergent== views on politics.","fields":{"Front":"divergent","Back":"释义\n分歧的、不同的\n词根词缀\ndi-分开（dis- 的变体）+verg转向、倾斜（vergere）+-ent形容词后缀\n拉丁语 divergere = di-（分开）+ vergere（倾斜、朝向），即“朝不同方向倾斜”，引申为（意见、路线）“分歧的、发散的”。\n助记\nd=分开，verge=边；分开成两条边，分叉了，势不两立\n例句\nThe two brothers have ==divergent== views on politics.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352011","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"duplicate","back":"释义\n复制；复制品\n词根词缀\ndupl-二倍的（duo“二” + plicare“折叠”）+plic折叠（plicare）+-ate动词/形容词后缀\n拉丁语 duplicare“加倍”，由 duo（二）+ plicare（折）构成，即“折成两份”，意为“复制、完全相同的副本”。\n助记\n跟copy paste一样\n例句\nCould you ==duplicate== this key for me, please?","fields":{"Front":"duplicate","Back":"释义\n复制；复制品\n词根词缀\ndupl-二倍的（duo“二” + plicare“折叠”）+plic折叠（plicare）+-ate动词/形容词后缀\n拉丁语 duplicare“加倍”，由 duo（二）+ plicare（折）构成，即“折成两份”，意为“复制、完全相同的副本”。\n助记\n跟copy paste一样\n例句\nCould you ==duplicate== this key for me, please?","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352013","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"embellish","back":"释义\n装饰、润色\n词根词缀\nem-进入、使…（in- 在 b 前的同化）+bell美丽、俊美的（bellus）+-ish动词后缀（-ir）\n源自古 French embellir = em-（使）+ bel（美丽，拉丁 bellus）+ -ir（动词尾），即“使美丽”，意为“美化、修饰”。注意与 bellum“战争”的 bell 不同源。\n助记\nem(in)=使，bell=美；使东西变得更美，装潢、让人更好看\n例句\nThe writer likes to ==embellish== the truth with colorful details.","fields":{"Front":"embellish","Back":"释义\n装饰、润色\n词根词缀\nem-进入、使…（in- 在 b 前的同化）+bell美丽、俊美的（bellus）+-ish动词后缀（-ir）\n源自古 French embellir = em-（使）+ bel（美丽，拉丁 bellus）+ -ir（动词尾），即“使美丽”，意为“美化、修饰”。注意与 bellum“战争”的 bell 不同源。\n助记\nem(in)=使，bell=美；使东西变得更美，装潢、让人更好看\n例句\nThe writer likes to ==embellish== the truth with colorful details.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352015","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"embolden","back":"释义\n使勇敢\n词根词缀\nem-使…（en- 的变体）+bold勇敢的（beald）+-en动词后缀，使成为\n本族语派生词：em-（使）+ bold（勇敢）+ -en（使动后缀），即“使勇敢”，意为“鼓励、壮胆”。\n助记\nem(in)=使，bold=大胆/粗；让这个人变得大胆、勇敢，更愿意去做事情\n例句\nThe early victory ==emboldened== the team to take bigger risks.","fields":{"Front":"embolden","Back":"释义\n使勇敢\n词根词缀\nem-使…（en- 的变体）+bold勇敢的（beald）+-en动词后缀，使成为\n本族语派生词：em-（使）+ bold（勇敢）+ -en（使动后缀），即“使勇敢”，意为“鼓励、壮胆”。\n助记\nem(in)=使，bold=大胆/粗；让这个人变得大胆、勇敢，更愿意去做事情\n例句\nThe early victory ==emboldened== the team to take bigger risks.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352017","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"empathy","back":"释义\n共情、共鸣\n词根词缀\nem-进入、在…之中（en- 在 p 前的同化）+path感情、感受（pathos）+-y名词后缀\n希腊语 empatheia = en-（进入）+ pathos（感情），即“把感情投入（他人处境）”，意为“共情、同理心”。\n助记\nen(in)=进入，pathy=情感；进入你的情感，我同情你，跟你共同的情感\n例句\nA good nurse shows ==empathy== for her patients and their families.","fields":{"Front":"empathy","Back":"释义\n共情、共鸣\n词根词缀\nem-进入、在…之中（en- 在 p 前的同化）+path感情、感受（pathos）+-y名词后缀\n希腊语 empatheia = en-（进入）+ pathos（感情），即“把感情投入（他人处境）”，意为“共情、同理心”。\n助记\nen(in)=进入，pathy=情感；进入你的情感，我同情你，跟你共同的情感\n例句\nA good nurse shows ==empathy== for her patients and their families.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352019","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"encompass","back":"释义\n包围；包含\n词根词缀\nen-进入、在…之内+compass环绕测量（com-“一起” + passus“步”）\nen-（在…之内）+ compass（绕圈测量，拉丁 compassare = com- + passus“步幅”），即“走一圈把…围住”，意为“包围、包含”。\n助记\nen=使，compass=指南针；指南针东南西北各方向都有，把各方向都包起来；像inclusive\n例句\nThe course will ==encompass== all the major periods of history.","fields":{"Front":"encompass","Back":"释义\n包围；包含\n词根词缀\nen-进入、在…之内+compass环绕测量（com-“一起” + passus“步”）\nen-（在…之内）+ compass（绕圈测量，拉丁 compassare = com- + passus“步幅”），即“走一圈把…围住”，意为“包围、包含”。\n助记\nen=使，compass=指南针；指南针东南西北各方向都有，把各方向都包起来；像inclusive\n例句\nThe course will ==encompass== all the major periods of history.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352021","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"endorse","back":"释义\n代言；认可\n词根词缀\nen-在…之上+dors背（dorsum）+-e动词词尾\n源自古 French endosser“在背面签字”，由 en-（在…上）+ dos（背，拉丁 dorsum）构成；原指在票据背面签名担保，引申为“认可、支持”。\n助记\n来自法语dors=背部；你摔下来我在背后接住你、一直支持你；也指在支票背面写名字代表认可\n例句\nThe famous actor agreed to ==endorse== the new product.","fields":{"Front":"endorse","Back":"释义\n代言；认可\n词根词缀\nen-在…之上+dors背（dorsum）+-e动词词尾\n源自古 French endosser“在背面签字”，由 en-（在…上）+ dos（背，拉丁 dorsum）构成；原指在票据背面签名担保，引申为“认可、支持”。\n助记\n来自法语dors=背部；你摔下来我在背后接住你、一直支持你；也指在支票背面写名字代表认可\n例句\nThe famous actor agreed to ==endorse== the new product.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352023","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"exacerbate","back":"释义\n加重、恶化\n词根词缀\nex-加强语气+acerb辛辣的、苦涩的（acerbus，源 acer“尖锐”）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁语 exacerbare = ex-（加强）+ acerbus（苦涩、尖锐），即“使更苦涩尖锐”，意为“激怒、使恶化”。\n助记\nacid=酸；酸越来越多流出来，人体要保持酸碱平衡（阴阳平衡），酸多了就容易生病恶化\n例句\nThe drought ==exacerbated== the shortage of food in the region.","fields":{"Front":"exacerbate","Back":"释义\n加重、恶化\n词根词缀\nex-加强语气+acerb辛辣的、苦涩的（acerbus，源 acer“尖锐”）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁语 exacerbare = ex-（加强）+ acerbus（苦涩、尖锐），即“使更苦涩尖锐”，意为“激怒、使恶化”。\n助记\nacid=酸；酸越来越多流出来，人体要保持酸碱平衡（阴阳平衡），酸多了就容易生病恶化\n例句\nThe drought ==exacerbated== the shortage of food in the region.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352025","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"flourish","back":"释义\n茂盛；繁荣\n词根词缀\nflour花（flos, 属 floris）+-ish动词后缀（-ir）\n源自古 French flurir“开花、茂盛”，源自 Latin flos（花）；本义“开花”，引申为“繁荣、茁壮成长”。\n助记\nflor=flower开花；哪哪都开花，春天来了什么都在开花\n例句\nSmall businesses began to ==flourish== in the newly developed district.","fields":{"Front":"flourish","Back":"释义\n茂盛；繁荣\n词根词缀\nflour花（flos, 属 floris）+-ish动词后缀（-ir）\n源自古 French flurir“开花、茂盛”，源自 Latin flos（花）；本义“开花”，引申为“繁荣、茁壮成长”。\n助记\nflor=flower开花；哪哪都开花，春天来了什么都在开花\n例句\nSmall businesses began to ==flourish== in the newly developed district.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352027","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"forerunner","back":"释义\n先驱；前兆\n词根词缀\nfore-在前、先于+run奔跑（rinnan）+-er名词后缀，做…动作的人\n本族语复合词：fore-（在前）+ run（跑）+ -er（人），即“跑在前面的人”，意为“先驱、前兆、先行者”。\n助记\n前面跑的人\n例句\nThe invention was a ==forerunner== of the modern computer.","fields":{"Front":"forerunner","Back":"释义\n先驱；前兆\n词根词缀\nfore-在前、先于+run奔跑（rinnan）+-er名词后缀，做…动作的人\n本族语复合词：fore-（在前）+ run（跑）+ -er（人），即“跑在前面的人”，意为“先驱、前兆、先行者”。\n助记\n前面跑的人\n例句\nThe invention was a ==forerunner== of the modern computer.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352029","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"frugal","back":"释义\n节俭的、朴素的\n词根词缀\nfrug果实、产出（frux, 属格 frugis）+-al形容词后缀\n拉丁语 frugalis“善用产出、节俭的”，源自 frux（果实、出产），即“只取用果实所需”，意为“节俭的、朴素的”。\n助记\n谐音'腐乳哥'；一天只吃一餐，一个粥加一块腐乳，简到极致，一毛不拔\n例句\nHis ==frugal== lifestyle allowed him to save money every month.","fields":{"Front":"frugal","Back":"释义\n节俭的、朴素的\n词根词缀\nfrug果实、产出（frux, 属格 frugis）+-al形容词后缀\n拉丁语 frugalis“善用产出、节俭的”，源自 frux（果实、出产），即“只取用果实所需”，意为“节俭的、朴素的”。\n助记\n谐音'腐乳哥'；一天只吃一餐，一个粥加一块腐乳，简到极致，一毛不拔\n例句\nHis ==frugal== lifestyle allowed him to save money every month.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352031","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"galvanize","back":"释义\n刺激、激励\n词根词缀\nGalvan-人名 Galvani（意大利医生，发现动物电）+-ize动词后缀，使…化\n源自意大利医生 Luigi Galvani 的姓氏：他发现电流可使青蛙肌肉抽动；故 galvanize 原义“通电流刺激”，引申为“激励、使迅速行动”。\n助记\n来自科学家Galva的镀锌实验；给金属镀上锌后能导电，人通上电会发抖有刺激感\n例句\nThe stirring speech ==galvanized== the crowd into immediate action.","fields":{"Front":"galvanize","Back":"释义\n刺激、激励\n词根词缀\nGalvan-人名 Galvani（意大利医生，发现动物电）+-ize动词后缀，使…化\n源自意大利医生 Luigi Galvani 的姓氏：他发现电流可使青蛙肌肉抽动；故 galvanize 原义“通电流刺激”，引申为“激励、使迅速行动”。\n助记\n来自科学家Galva的镀锌实验；给金属镀上锌后能导电，人通上电会发抖有刺激感\n例句\nThe stirring speech ==galvanized== the crowd into immediate action.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352033","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"garner","back":"释义\n积累；获得\n词根词缀\ngran谷物（granum）+-er名词→动词转化\n源自古 French gernier“谷仓”，源自 Latin granarium（granum“谷物”）；由“谷仓”转动词，意为“收集、贮藏、获得”。\n助记\n\n例句\nShe worked hard to ==garner== support for her proposal.","fields":{"Front":"garner","Back":"释义\n积累；获得\n词根词缀\ngran谷物（granum）+-er名词→动词转化\n源自古 French gernier“谷仓”，源自 Latin granarium（granum“谷物”）；由“谷仓”转动词，意为“收集、贮藏、获得”。\n助记\n\n例句\nShe worked hard to ==garner== support for her proposal.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352035","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"hamper","back":"释义\n阻碍；大篮子\n词根词缀\n简单词。中古英语 hamperen“阻碍、捆住”，词源不明，可能与中古荷兰语 hacken“束缚”相关；无活跃词根词缀。\n助记\n\n例句\nThe heavy rain did not ==hamper== their plans for the picnic.","fields":{"Front":"hamper","Back":"释义\n阻碍；大篮子\n词根词缀\n简单词。中古英语 hamperen“阻碍、捆住”，词源不明，可能与中古荷兰语 hacken“束缚”相关；无活跃词根词缀。\n助记\n\n例句\nThe heavy rain did not ==hamper== their plans for the picnic.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352037","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"hostile","back":"释义\n敌对的、有敌意\n词根词缀\nhost敌人（hostis）+-ile形容词后缀（-ilis），属于…性质的\n拉丁语 hostis“敌人”派生 hostilis“敌人的、敌对的”，意为“怀有敌意的、不友善的”。\n助记\n反义hospitable=非常好客的\n例句\nThe crowd turned ==hostile== toward the unpopular referee.","fields":{"Front":"hostile","Back":"释义\n敌对的、有敌意\n词根词缀\nhost敌人（hostis）+-ile形容词后缀（-ilis），属于…性质的\n拉丁语 hostis“敌人”派生 hostilis“敌人的、敌对的”，意为“怀有敌意的、不友善的”。\n助记\n反义hospitable=非常好客的\n例句\nThe crowd turned ==hostile== toward the unpopular referee.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352039","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"idiosyncratic","back":"释义\n独特的、特质的\n词根词缀\nidio-自己的、私人的+crat混合、气质（krasis“混合”，经 synkrasis“调和”）+-ic形容词后缀\n希腊语 idiosynkrasia = idio-（自己的）+ syn（一起）+ krasis（混合），即“个人特有的气质混合”，引申为“特立独行的、怪异的”。\n助记\nsync=同步（sync一下电脑），idiot=傻瓜；跟傻瓜同步=傻乎乎的\n例句\nShe has an ==idiosyncratic== way of arranging her books.","fields":{"Front":"idiosyncratic","Back":"释义\n独特的、特质的\n词根词缀\nidio-自己的、私人的+crat混合、气质（krasis“混合”，经 synkrasis“调和”）+-ic形容词后缀\n希腊语 idiosynkrasia = idio-（自己的）+ syn（一起）+ krasis（混合），即“个人特有的气质混合”，引申为“特立独行的、怪异的”。\n助记\nsync=同步（sync一下电脑），idiot=傻瓜；跟傻瓜同步=傻乎乎的\n例句\nShe has an ==idiosyncratic== way of arranging her books.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"sat800-list-02","name":"SAT800 核心 › List 02","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["sat800","imported"],"options":{},"cards":[{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352041","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"abrasive","back":"释义\n粗糙的；研磨料\n词根词缀\nab-离开、去掉+ras刮、擦（radere 的过去参数 rasus）+-ive形容词后缀\n拉丁语 abradere = ab-（去掉）+ radere（刮），即“刮掉”；过去分词 abrasus 加 -ive，本义“研磨的”，引申为人“生硬刺耳的”。\n助记\nab=离开，ras=摩擦，ive=形容词后缀；摩擦让东西离开\n例句\nThe ==abrasive== cleaner scratched the delicate surface.","fields":{"Front":"abrasive","Back":"释义\n粗糙的；研磨料\n词根词缀\nab-离开、去掉+ras刮、擦（radere 的过去参数 rasus）+-ive形容词后缀\n拉丁语 abradere = ab-（去掉）+ radere（刮），即“刮掉”；过去分词 abrasus 加 -ive，本义“研磨的”，引申为人“生硬刺耳的”。\n助记\nab=离开，ras=摩擦，ive=形容词后缀；摩擦让东西离开\n例句\nThe ==abrasive== cleaner scratched the delicate surface.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352043","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"acclaim","back":"释义\n称赞；v.喝彩\n词根词缀\nac-朝向、加强（ad- 在 c 前的同化）+claim呼喊（clamare）\n拉丁语 acclamare = ac-（朝向）+ clamare（呼喊），即“朝…呼喊喝彩”，意为“欢呼、称赞”。\n助记\na=朝向，claim=大声喊；向着你们大声宣告\n例句\nThe film received widespread ==acclaim== from critics and audiences.","fields":{"Front":"acclaim","Back":"释义\n称赞；v.喝彩\n词根词缀\nac-朝向、加强（ad- 在 c 前的同化）+claim呼喊（clamare）\n拉丁语 acclamare = ac-（朝向）+ clamare（呼喊），即“朝…呼喊喝彩”，意为“欢呼、称赞”。\n助记\na=朝向，claim=大声喊；向着你们大声宣告\n例句\nThe film received widespread ==acclaim== from critics and audiences.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352045","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"adroit","back":"释义\n熟练的、灵巧的\n词根词缀\na-朝向（à，源自拉丁 ad）+droit直的、正确的（directus，源 regere“引导”）\n法语 à droit“朝右侧”（右手灵巧），由 à（向）+ droit（右、直，拉丁 directus）构成，引申为“机敏的、熟练的”。反义词 maladroit（笨拙）。\n助记\na=朝向，droit=法语里的右手；一般人左手灵活，右手也能做很多事就非常灵活\n例句\nHe is an ==adroit== negotiator who rarely loses a deal.","fields":{"Front":"adroit","Back":"释义\n熟练的、灵巧的\n词根词缀\na-朝向（à，源自拉丁 ad）+droit直的、正确的（directus，源 regere“引导”）\n法语 à droit“朝右侧”（右手灵巧），由 à（向）+ droit（右、直，拉丁 directus）构成，引申为“机敏的、熟练的”。反义词 maladroit（笨拙）。\n助记\na=朝向，droit=法语里的右手；一般人左手灵活，右手也能做很多事就非常灵活\n例句\nHe is an ==adroit== negotiator who rarely loses a deal.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352047","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"alleviate","back":"释义\n减轻；缓和\n词根词缀\nal-朝向（ad- 在 l 前的同化）+lev轻的（levis）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁语 alleviare = al-（朝向）+ levis（轻），即“使变轻”，意为“减轻（痛苦）、缓解”。\n助记\na=朝向，levi=level（层级，动词义为拎起来/往上翘），ate=动词后缀；把沉重的东西拎起来卸掉\n例句\nThe medicine helped ==alleviate== her back pain.","fields":{"Front":"alleviate","Back":"释义\n减轻；缓和\n词根词缀\nal-朝向（ad- 在 l 前的同化）+lev轻的（levis）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁语 alleviare = al-（朝向）+ levis（轻），即“使变轻”，意为“减轻（痛苦）、缓解”。\n助记\na=朝向，levi=level（层级，动词义为拎起来/往上翘），ate=动词后缀；把沉重的东西拎起来卸掉\n例句\nThe medicine helped ==alleviate== her back pain.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352049","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"approximate","back":"释义\n近似的；v.接近\n词根词缀\nap-朝向（ad- 在 p 前的同化）+proxim最近的（proximus，prope“近”的最高级）+-ate动词/形容词后缀\n拉丁语 appropinquare/adproximare = ap-（靠近）+ proximus（最近），即“靠近到最近点”，意为“接近、大约的”。\n助记\n\n例句\nThe cost figure is only an ==approximate== estimate.","fields":{"Front":"approximate","Back":"释义\n近似的；v.接近\n词根词缀\nap-朝向（ad- 在 p 前的同化）+proxim最近的（proximus，prope“近”的最高级）+-ate动词/形容词后缀\n拉丁语 appropinquare/adproximare = ap-（靠近）+ proximus（最近），即“靠近到最近点”，意为“接近、大约的”。\n助记\n\n例句\nThe cost figure is only an ==approximate== estimate.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352051","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"atypical","back":"释义\n非典型的\n词根词缀\na-不、无+typ模型、印记（typos）+-ical形容词后缀\na-（不）+ typical（典型的，源自 typos“模型”），即“不具备典型模型的”，意为“非典型的、异常的”。\n助记\na=否定，type=形状/类型；没有形状，无法归类到已有类别\n例句\nIt was an ==atypical== winter with no snow at all.","fields":{"Front":"atypical","Back":"释义\n非典型的\n词根词缀\na-不、无+typ模型、印记（typos）+-ical形容词后缀\na-（不）+ typical（典型的，源自 typos“模型”），即“不具备典型模型的”，意为“非典型的、异常的”。\n助记\na=否定，type=形状/类型；没有形状，无法归类到已有类别\n例句\nIt was an ==atypical== winter with no snow at all.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352053","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"bastion","back":"释义\n堡垒\n词根词缀\n简单词。源自意大利语 bastione“棱堡、堡垒”，可能由 bastire“筑营”（与 bastum“驮鞍”相关）经法语进入英语；无活跃前缀后缀，意为“设防据点、堡垒”。\n助记\nbas=base=基地，军事基地，防御最强的地方\n例句\nThe old fortress was the last ==bastion== of resistance.","fields":{"Front":"bastion","Back":"释义\n堡垒\n词根词缀\n简单词。源自意大利语 bastione“棱堡、堡垒”，可能由 bastire“筑营”（与 bastum“驮鞍”相关）经法语进入英语；无活跃前缀后缀，意为“设防据点、堡垒”。\n助记\nbas=base=基地，军事基地，防御最强的地方\n例句\nThe old fortress was the last ==bastion== of resistance.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352055","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"buoyancy","back":"释义\n浮力\n词根词缀\nbuoy浮标、铁链（boie，可能源自拉丁 boia“镣铐”）+-ancy名词后缀，表示性质/状态\nbuoy（浮标）+ -ancy（性质），即“浮标漂浮的性质”，本义“浮力”，引申为“乐观情绪、上涨态势”。\n助记\n\n例句\nSalt water increases the ==buoyancy== of the swimmer.","fields":{"Front":"buoyancy","Back":"释义\n浮力\n词根词缀\nbuoy浮标、铁链（boie，可能源自拉丁 boia“镣铐”）+-ancy名词后缀，表示性质/状态\nbuoy（浮标）+ -ancy（性质），即“浮标漂浮的性质”，本义“浮力”，引申为“乐观情绪、上涨态势”。\n助记\n\n例句\nSalt water increases the ==buoyancy== of the swimmer.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352057","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cerebral","back":"释义\n大脑的；理智的\n词根词缀\ncerebr脑（cerebrum）+-al形容词后缀\n拉丁语 cerebrum“脑”加 -al，意为“大脑的、理智的、理性的”。\n助记\n\n例句\nShe prefers ==cerebral== puzzles to physical games.","fields":{"Front":"cerebral","Back":"释义\n大脑的；理智的\n词根词缀\ncerebr脑（cerebrum）+-al形容词后缀\n拉丁语 cerebrum“脑”加 -al，意为“大脑的、理智的、理性的”。\n助记\n\n例句\nShe prefers ==cerebral== puzzles to physical games.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352059","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"circumscribe","back":"释义\n限制；外接\n词根词缀\ncircum-环绕、周围+scrib书写、画线（scribere）\n拉丁语 circumscribere = circum-（绕一圈）+ scribere（画线），即“画外接圆/圈定范围”，引申为“限制、约束”。\n助记\ncircum=环绕/圆（circle），scribe=写/圈；画一个圈\n例句\nThe new law will ==circumscribe== the power of local officials.","fields":{"Front":"circumscribe","Back":"释义\n限制；外接\n词根词缀\ncircum-环绕、周围+scrib书写、画线（scribere）\n拉丁语 circumscribere = circum-（绕一圈）+ scribere（画线），即“画外接圆/圈定范围”，引申为“限制、约束”。\n助记\ncircum=环绕/圆（circle），scribe=写/圈；画一个圈\n例句\nThe new law will ==circumscribe== the power of local officials.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352061","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"communal","back":"释义\n公共的\n词根词缀\ncom-共同、一起+mun职责、服务（munus）+-al形容词后缀\n拉丁语 communis“共有的” = com-（一起）+ munis（尽职的，源 munus“职责”），加 -al，意为“公共的、社区共有的”。\n助记\n来自communion=社群，像communicate=互相交流\n例句\nThe village has a ==communal== kitchen and a shared garden.","fields":{"Front":"communal","Back":"释义\n公共的\n词根词缀\ncom-共同、一起+mun职责、服务（munus）+-al形容词后缀\n拉丁语 communis“共有的” = com-（一起）+ munis（尽职的，源 munus“职责”），加 -al，意为“公共的、社区共有的”。\n助记\n来自communion=社群，像communicate=互相交流\n例句\nThe village has a ==communal== kitchen and a shared garden.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352063","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"complementary","back":"释义\n互补的\n词根词缀\ncom-一起+plet填满（plere，源 plenus“满”）+-ment + -ary名词/形容词后缀组合\ncomplere = com-（完全）+ plere（填满），即“填满所缺”；complementary 意为“互补的、补足其余的”。\n助记\n核心来自complete=完整，ment=东西；两个东西相互补充成为完整\n例句\nThe sweet wine is ==complementary== to the spicy main course.","fields":{"Front":"complementary","Back":"释义\n互补的\n词根词缀\ncom-一起+plet填满（plere，源 plenus“满”）+-ment + -ary名词/形容词后缀组合\ncomplere = com-（完全）+ plere（填满），即“填满所缺”；complementary 意为“互补的、补足其余的”。\n助记\n核心来自complete=完整，ment=东西；两个东西相互补充成为完整\n例句\nThe sweet wine is ==complementary== to the spicy main course.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352065","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"compromise","back":"释义\n妥协；危及\n词根词缀\ncom-共同、相互+miss发送、许诺（mittere 的过去分词 missus；经 promittere“预先答应”）\n拉丁语 compromittere = com-（共同）+ promittere（pro-“向前” + mittere“送”，即“承诺”），原指双方共同承诺服从仲裁；引申为“妥协、折中”。\n助记\ncom=共同，promise=承诺；吵架时想起曾经共同的誓言，你让一步我让一步\n例句\nThey reached a ==compromise== after long and difficult negotiations.","fields":{"Front":"compromise","Back":"释义\n妥协；危及\n词根词缀\ncom-共同、相互+miss发送、许诺（mittere 的过去分词 missus；经 promittere“预先答应”）\n拉丁语 compromittere = com-（共同）+ promittere（pro-“向前” + mittere“送”，即“承诺”），原指双方共同承诺服从仲裁；引申为“妥协、折中”。\n助记\ncom=共同，promise=承诺；吵架时想起曾经共同的誓言，你让一步我让一步\n例句\nThey reached a ==compromise== after long and difficult negotiations.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352067","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"conceptualize","back":"释义\n概念化\n词根词缀\ncon-一起+cept抓取、领会（capere 的过去分词 captus）+-ual + -ize形容词+动词后缀组合\nconcipere = con-（一起）+ capere（抓），即“把事物抓到一起形成概念”；conceptualize 意为“使概念化、构思”。\n助记\nconcept=概念，ize=动词后缀；把具体的东西说成抽象的东西\n例句\nChildren gradually learn to ==conceptualize== abstract ideas.","fields":{"Front":"conceptualize","Back":"释义\n概念化\n词根词缀\ncon-一起+cept抓取、领会（capere 的过去分词 captus）+-ual + -ize形容词+动词后缀组合\nconcipere = con-（一起）+ capere（抓），即“把事物抓到一起形成概念”；conceptualize 意为“使概念化、构思”。\n助记\nconcept=概念，ize=动词后缀；把具体的东西说成抽象的东西\n例句\nChildren gradually learn to ==conceptualize== abstract ideas.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352069","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"confound","back":"释义\n使困惑；挫败\n词根词缀\ncon-一起+found倾倒（fundere 的过去分词 fusus）\n拉丁语 confundere = con-（一起）+ fundere（倒），即“倒在一起混作一团”，引申为“使困惑、使混淆、惊讶”。\n助记\ncom=共同/一起来，found=找到；大家一起来找东西：①在乱屋里找不到很惊讶②在信息堆里找到证据证明别人错③共同找到敌人弱点战胜敌人\n例句\nThe sudden news served to ==confound== all our careful plans.","fields":{"Front":"confound","Back":"释义\n使困惑；挫败\n词根词缀\ncon-一起+found倾倒（fundere 的过去分词 fusus）\n拉丁语 confundere = con-（一起）+ fundere（倒），即“倒在一起混作一团”，引申为“使困惑、使混淆、惊讶”。\n助记\ncom=共同/一起来，found=找到；大家一起来找东西：①在乱屋里找不到很惊讶②在信息堆里找到证据证明别人错③共同找到敌人弱点战胜敌人\n例句\nThe sudden news served to ==confound== all our careful plans.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352071","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"conscientious","back":"释义\n认真的、尽责的\n词根词缀\ncon-加强语气+sci知道（scire）+-ent + -ious形容词后缀组合\nconscire = con-（加强）+ scire（知道），即“内心共同知晓（对错）”；conscientious 意为“凭良心做事的、认真尽责的”。\n助记\n良知；有良知发现自己做错事就开始内疚\n例句\nShe is a ==conscientious== worker who checks everything twice.","fields":{"Front":"conscientious","Back":"释义\n认真的、尽责的\n词根词缀\ncon-加强语气+sci知道（scire）+-ent + -ious形容词后缀组合\nconscire = con-（加强）+ scire（知道），即“内心共同知晓（对错）”；conscientious 意为“凭良心做事的、认真尽责的”。\n助记\n良知；有良知发现自己做错事就开始内疚\n例句\nShe is a ==conscientious== worker who checks everything twice.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352073","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"corrosive","back":"释义\n腐蚀的；腐蚀剂\n词根词缀\ncor-加强语气（com- 在 r 前的同化）+ros咬、啮（rodere 的过去分词 rosus）+-ive形容词后缀\n拉丁语 corrodere = cor-（加强）+ rodere（咬），即“咬坏”；过去分词 corrosus 加 -ive，意为“腐蚀性的、刻薄伤人的”。\n助记\nrot=rotten=腐烂，ive=形容词后缀；东西会慢慢被磨损、腐蚀、侵蚀\n例句\nThe ==corrosive== acid damaged the metal container.","fields":{"Front":"corrosive","Back":"释义\n腐蚀的；腐蚀剂\n词根词缀\ncor-加强语气（com- 在 r 前的同化）+ros咬、啮（rodere 的过去分词 rosus）+-ive形容词后缀\n拉丁语 corrodere = cor-（加强）+ rodere（咬），即“咬坏”；过去分词 corrosus 加 -ive，意为“腐蚀性的、刻薄伤人的”。\n助记\nrot=rotten=腐烂，ive=形容词后缀；东西会慢慢被磨损、腐蚀、侵蚀\n例句\nThe ==corrosive== acid damaged the metal container.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352077","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"credulity","back":"释义\n轻信\n词根词缀\ncred相信（credere）+-ulity名词后缀（-ulitas，表倾向）\n拉丁语 credulus“轻信的”（credere“相信”）加抽象名词后缀 -ulitas，意为“轻信、易信”。\n助记\ncredit=信用，dul=多；对别人信任很多，别人说什么都信\n例句\nThe scam relied on the ==credulity== of trusting people.","fields":{"Front":"credulity","Back":"释义\n轻信\n词根词缀\ncred相信（credere）+-ulity名词后缀（-ulitas，表倾向）\n拉丁语 credulus“轻信的”（credere“相信”）加抽象名词后缀 -ulitas，意为“轻信、易信”。\n助记\ncredit=信用，dul=多；对别人信任很多，别人说什么都信\n例句\nThe scam relied on the ==credulity== of trusting people.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352079","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"debilitate","back":"释义\n使衰弱\n词根词缀\nde-去除、相反+bilit能够（habilis“能干的”，源 habere“拥有”）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁语 debilis“虚弱的” = de-（去除）+ habilis（能干的），即“失去能力”；派生动词 debilitare，意为“使衰弱”。\n助记\nde=去掉，ability=能力，ate=动词后缀；去掉别人的能力\n例句\nBeaten to extent that you have lost your ability to function. You are debilitated.","fields":{"Front":"debilitate","Back":"释义\n使衰弱\n词根词缀\nde-去除、相反+bilit能够（habilis“能干的”，源 habere“拥有”）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁语 debilis“虚弱的” = de-（去除）+ habilis（能干的），即“失去能力”；派生动词 debilitare，意为“使衰弱”。\n助记\nde=去掉，ability=能力，ate=动词后缀；去掉别人的能力\n例句\nBeaten to extent that you have lost your ability to function. You are debilitated.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352081","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"denounce","back":"释义\n谴责\n词根词缀\nde-向下、公开+nounce报告、宣布（nuntiare，源 nuntius“信使”）\n拉丁语 denuntiare = de-（公开、彻底）+ nuntiare（通报），即“公开宣告、告发”，意为“谴责、揭发”。\n助记\nnounce=发声（pronounce=发出声音），de=出去/离开；所有人都发出声音说你给我滚出去\n例句\nThe leader publicly ==denounced== the acts of violence.","fields":{"Front":"denounce","Back":"释义\n谴责\n词根词缀\nde-向下、公开+nounce报告、宣布（nuntiare，源 nuntius“信使”）\n拉丁语 denuntiare = de-（公开、彻底）+ nuntiare（通报），即“公开宣告、告发”，意为“谴责、揭发”。\n助记\nnounce=发声（pronounce=发出声音），de=出去/离开；所有人都发出声音说你给我滚出去\n例句\nThe leader publicly ==denounced== the acts of violence.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352083","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"discerning","back":"释义\n有眼光的、敏锐的\n词根词缀\ndis-分开+cern筛分、辨别（cernere）+-ing形容词后缀\ndiscernere（dis- 分开 + cernere 筛辨）的现在分词作形容词，意为“有辨别力的、眼光敏锐的”。\n助记\n\n例句\nA ==discerning== customer can spot poor quality immediately.","fields":{"Front":"discerning","Back":"释义\n有眼光的、敏锐的\n词根词缀\ndis-分开+cern筛分、辨别（cernere）+-ing形容词后缀\ndiscernere（dis- 分开 + cernere 筛辨）的现在分词作形容词，意为“有辨别力的、眼光敏锐的”。\n助记\n\n例句\nA ==discerning== customer can spot poor quality immediately.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352085","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"discriminating","back":"释义\n能辨别的\n词根词缀\ndis-分开+crimin判断、区分（crimen“判断、诉讼”）+-ating形容词/分词后缀\ndiscrimen“分界线、判断”由 discernere 而来；discriminating 意为“有鉴赏力的、精细区分的”（也指“歧视的”）。\n助记\n\n例句\nShe has a ==discriminating== taste in fine art and music.","fields":{"Front":"discriminating","Back":"释义\n能辨别的\n词根词缀\ndis-分开+crimin判断、区分（crimen“判断、诉讼”）+-ating形容词/分词后缀\ndiscrimen“分界线、判断”由 discernere 而来；discriminating 意为“有鉴赏力的、精细区分的”（也指“歧视的”）。\n助记\n\n例句\nShe has a ==discriminating== taste in fine art and music.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352087","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"disingenuous","back":"释义\n虚伪的、不诚实\n词根词缀\ndis-否定、相反+gen生育、天生（gignere；ingenuus“出身高贵、坦率的”）+-ous形容词后缀\ningenuus = in-（在内）+ gignere（生），即“本族出生、率真的”；dis-（不）+ ingenuous，意为“不坦率的、虚伪狡诈的”。\n助记\ndis=否定，gene=基因，ingenuous=基因里带来的真诚；不真诚\n例句\nHis apology seemed ==disingenuous== and deeply insincere.","fields":{"Front":"disingenuous","Back":"释义\n虚伪的、不诚实\n词根词缀\ndis-否定、相反+gen生育、天生（gignere；ingenuus“出身高贵、坦率的”）+-ous形容词后缀\ningenuus = in-（在内）+ gignere（生），即“本族出生、率真的”；dis-（不）+ ingenuous，意为“不坦率的、虚伪狡诈的”。\n助记\ndis=否定，gene=基因，ingenuous=基因里带来的真诚；不真诚\n例句\nHis apology seemed ==disingenuous== and deeply insincere.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352089","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dispel","back":"释义\n驱散；消除\n词根词缀\ndis-散开、离开+pel驱赶（pellere 的过去分词 pulsus）\n拉丁语 dispellere = dis-（散开）+ pellere（驱赶），即“驱散”，意为“消除（疑虑、恐惧）”。\n助记\nspell=下诅咒/咒语（巫婆spell the curse），dis=去掉；把施加在你身上的咒语驱散掉\n例句\nThe warm sunshine soon ==dispelled== the morning fog.","fields":{"Front":"dispel","Back":"释义\n驱散；消除\n词根词缀\ndis-散开、离开+pel驱赶（pellere 的过去分词 pulsus）\n拉丁语 dispellere = dis-（散开）+ pellere（驱赶），即“驱散”，意为“消除（疑虑、恐惧）”。\n助记\nspell=下诅咒/咒语（巫婆spell the curse），dis=去掉；把施加在你身上的咒语驱散掉\n例句\nThe warm sunshine soon ==dispelled== the morning fog.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352091","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dowager","back":"释义\n王太后；贵妇人\n词根词缀\ndow嫁妆、赠予（dotare，名词 dos）+-ager名词后缀，表相关人\n源自古 French douagiere“领亡夫遗产的寡妇”，源自 douage“嫁妆、遗产”（拉丁 dotare“赠予嫁妆”），意为“受亡夫遗产的贵妇”。\n助记\ndower=嫁妆，有丰厚嫁妆的老女人；也可拆wage=工资+do=活，靠工资优渥生活的老年人\n例句\nThe ==dowager== queen attended the ceremony dressed in black.","fields":{"Front":"dowager","Back":"释义\n王太后；贵妇人\n词根词缀\ndow嫁妆、赠予（dotare，名词 dos）+-ager名词后缀，表相关人\n源自古 French douagiere“领亡夫遗产的寡妇”，源自 douage“嫁妆、遗产”（拉丁 dotare“赠予嫁妆”），意为“受亡夫遗产的贵妇”。\n助记\ndower=嫁妆，有丰厚嫁妆的老女人；也可拆wage=工资+do=活，靠工资优渥生活的老年人\n例句\nThe ==dowager== queen attended the ceremony dressed in black.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352093","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"eclectic","back":"释义\n折衷的、博采众长\n词根词缀\nec-出来（ek-，即 ex-）+lect挑选、收集（legein）+-ic形容词后缀\n希腊语 eklektikos = ek-（出来）+ legein（挑选），即“挑选出来的”；原指古希腊折衷派哲学家择各家之长，引申为“兼收并蓄的”。\n助记\ne=向外，collect=收集；把外面东西都收集进来\n例句\nThe museum has an ==eclectic== collection of artifacts from many cultures.","fields":{"Front":"eclectic","Back":"释义\n折衷的、博采众长\n词根词缀\nec-出来（ek-，即 ex-）+lect挑选、收集（legein）+-ic形容词后缀\n希腊语 eklektikos = ek-（出来）+ legein（挑选），即“挑选出来的”；原指古希腊折衷派哲学家择各家之长，引申为“兼收并蓄的”。\n助记\ne=向外，collect=收集；把外面东西都收集进来\n例句\nThe museum has an ==eclectic== collection of artifacts from many cultures.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352095","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"eccentric","back":"释义\n古怪的；n.怪人\n词根词缀\nec-出、脱离+centr中心（kentron）+-ic形容词后缀\n希腊语 ekkentros = ek-（脱离）+ kentron（中心），原指圆周“偏离圆心的”，引申为人“古怪的、不合常规的”。\n助记\ne=向外，center=中心；远离中心，不是主流的人\n例句\nThe ==eccentric== professor wore a different hat every single day.","fields":{"Front":"eccentric","Back":"释义\n古怪的；n.怪人\n词根词缀\nec-出、脱离+centr中心（kentron）+-ic形容词后缀\n希腊语 ekkentros = ek-（脱离）+ kentron（中心），原指圆周“偏离圆心的”，引申为人“古怪的、不合常规的”。\n助记\ne=向外，center=中心；远离中心，不是主流的人\n例句\nThe ==eccentric== professor wore a different hat every single day.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352097","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"eliminate","back":"释义\n消除；淘汰\n词根词缀\ne-外、出去（ex- 在 l 前的形式）+limin门槛（limen）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁语 eliminare = e-（出外）+ limen（门槛），即“赶出门外”，引申为“排除、淘汰、根除”。\n助记\n\n例句\nThe team was ==eliminated== in the first round of the tournament.","fields":{"Front":"eliminate","Back":"释义\n消除；淘汰\n词根词缀\ne-外、出去（ex- 在 l 前的形式）+limin门槛（limen）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁语 eliminare = e-（出外）+ limen（门槛），即“赶出门外”，引申为“排除、淘汰、根除”。\n助记\n\n例句\nThe team was ==eliminated== in the first round of the tournament.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352099","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"enormous","back":"释义\n巨大的\n词根词缀\ne-超出（ex- 在 n 前的形式）+norm规则、模式（norma）+-ous形容词后缀\n拉丁语 enormis = e-（超出）+ norma（规则），即“超出常规的”，引申为“巨大的、庞大的”。\n助记\n\n例句\nThe blue whale is an ==enormous== creature.","fields":{"Front":"enormous","Back":"释义\n巨大的\n词根词缀\ne-超出（ex- 在 n 前的形式）+norm规则、模式（norma）+-ous形容词后缀\n拉丁语 enormis = e-（超出）+ norma（规则），即“超出常规的”，引申为“巨大的、庞大的”。\n助记\n\n例句\nThe blue whale is an ==enormous== creature.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352101","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"evade","back":"释义\n躲避；回避\n词根词缀\ne-出外、离开（ex-）+vad行走（vadere）\n拉丁语 evadere = e-（出外）+ vadere（走），即“走掉、逃出”，意为“逃避、规避”。\n助记\ne=出去，vad=走；看到你来了我就走，躲避你\n例句\nThere is no way to ==evade== the question any longer.","fields":{"Front":"evade","Back":"释义\n躲避；回避\n词根词缀\ne-出外、离开（ex-）+vad行走（vadere）\n拉丁语 evadere = e-（出外）+ vadere（走），即“走掉、逃出”，意为“逃避、规避”。\n助记\ne=出去，vad=走；看到你来了我就走，躲避你\n例句\nThere is no way to ==evade== the question any longer.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352103","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"evade","back":"释义\n躲避；回避\n词根词缀\ne-出外、离开（ex-）+vad行走（vadere）\n拉丁语 evadere = e-（出外）+ vadere（走），即“走掉、逃出”，意为“逃避、规避”。\n助记\ne=出去，vad=走；看到你来了我就走，躲避你\n例句\nThere is no way to ==evade== the question any longer.","fields":{"Front":"evade","Back":"释义\n躲避；回避\n词根词缀\ne-出外、离开（ex-）+vad行走（vadere）\n拉丁语 evadere = e-（出外）+ vadere（走），即“走掉、逃出”，意为“逃避、规避”。\n助记\ne=出去，vad=走；看到你来了我就走，躲避你\n例句\nThere is no way to ==evade== the question any longer.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352105","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"exhaustive","back":"释义\n详尽的、彻底的\n词根词缀\nex-出外、彻底+haust汲取、排干（haurire 的过去分词 haustus）+-ive形容词后缀\nexhaurire = ex-（出）+ haurire（汲干），即“抽干、用尽”；exhaustive 意为“彻底的、详尽无遗的”。\n助记\nexhausted=我很累；exhaustive是说这件事情很让人累心\n例句\nThe team carried out an ==exhaustive== search of the entire area.","fields":{"Front":"exhaustive","Back":"释义\n详尽的、彻底的\n词根词缀\nex-出外、彻底+haust汲取、排干（haurire 的过去分词 haustus）+-ive形容词后缀\nexhaurire = ex-（出）+ haurire（汲干），即“抽干、用尽”；exhaustive 意为“彻底的、详尽无遗的”。\n助记\nexhausted=我很累；exhaustive是说这件事情很让人累心\n例句\nThe team carried out an ==exhaustive== search of the entire area.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352107","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"extol","back":"释义\n颂扬、赞美\n词根词缀\nex-向上+tol举起（tollere）\n拉丁语 extollere = ex-（向上）+ tollere（举起），即“高高举起”，引申为“高度赞扬、颂扬”。\n助记\nex=向外/向上，tol=高；把你高高举起来\n例句\nThe poem ==extols== the beauty of the natural world.","fields":{"Front":"extol","Back":"释义\n颂扬、赞美\n词根词缀\nex-向上+tol举起（tollere）\n拉丁语 extollere = ex-（向上）+ tollere（举起），即“高高举起”，引申为“高度赞扬、颂扬”。\n助记\nex=向外/向上，tol=高；把你高高举起来\n例句\nThe poem ==extols== the beauty of the natural world.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352109","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"facilitate","back":"释义\n促进；使便利\n词根词缀\nfacil容易做的（facilis，源 facere“做”）+-itate动词后缀，使成为\n拉丁语 facilis“容易的”（facere“做”）转动词 facilitare“使容易”，意为“促进、使便利”。\n助记\nfacile=法语easy；让一件事变简单的动作就是协助\n例句\nThe new software will ==facilitate== communication between the teams.","fields":{"Front":"facilitate","Back":"释义\n促进；使便利\n词根词缀\nfacil容易做的（facilis，源 facere“做”）+-itate动词后缀，使成为\n拉丁语 facilis“容易的”（facere“做”）转动词 facilitare“使容易”，意为“促进、使便利”。\n助记\nfacile=法语easy；让一件事变简单的动作就是协助\n例句\nThe new software will ==facilitate== communication between the teams.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352111","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"forgo","back":"释义\n放弃；戒除\n词根词缀\nfor-离开、放弃（否定/离开义前缀）+go行走（gan）\n古英语 forgān = for-（离开、舍弃）+ go（走），即“走开不要了”，意为“放弃、摒弃、作罢”。\n助记\n让他走，我不要了，没有这个也行\n例句\nWithout abstain from give up.","fields":{"Front":"forgo","Back":"释义\n放弃；戒除\n词根词缀\nfor-离开、放弃（否定/离开义前缀）+go行走（gan）\n古英语 forgān = for-（离开、舍弃）+ go（走），即“走开不要了”，意为“放弃、摒弃、作罢”。\n助记\n让他走，我不要了，没有这个也行\n例句\nWithout abstain from give up.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352113","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"formidable","back":"释义\n可怕的；难对付的\n词根词缀\nformid恐惧（formido）+-able形容词后缀，值得…的\n拉丁语 formido“恐惧”派生 formidabilis“令人恐惧的”，意为“令人敬畏的、难对付的”。\n助记\nform=形成/形体；形体很大让人觉得害怕；鬼魂无声无息不可怕，但成形的庞然大物可怕\n例句\nThey face a ==formidable== opponent in the championship final.","fields":{"Front":"formidable","Back":"释义\n可怕的；难对付的\n词根词缀\nformid恐惧（formido）+-able形容词后缀，值得…的\n拉丁语 formido“恐惧”派生 formidabilis“令人恐惧的”，意为“令人敬畏的、难对付的”。\n助记\nform=形成/形体；形体很大让人觉得害怕；鬼魂无声无息不可怕，但成形的庞然大物可怕\n例句\nThey face a ==formidable== opponent in the championship final.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352115","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"generic","back":"释义\n通用的；类的\n词根词缀\ngen种类、出身（genus，源 gignere“生育”）+-ic形容词后缀\n拉丁语 genus“种族、种类”派生 genericus，意为“类属的、一般的、无商标名的”。\n助记\ngene=基因；人人都有基因所以很普通，没有自己牌子大家都能生产\n例句\nThe store only sells ==generic== products without brand names.","fields":{"Front":"generic","Back":"释义\n通用的；类的\n词根词缀\ngen种类、出身（genus，源 gignere“生育”）+-ic形容词后缀\n拉丁语 genus“种族、种类”派生 genericus，意为“类属的、一般的、无商标名的”。\n助记\ngene=基因；人人都有基因所以很普通，没有自己牌子大家都能生产\n例句\nThe store only sells ==generic== products without brand names.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352117","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"hallmark","back":"释义\nn.特征；标志\n词根词缀\nhall大厅（heall，指伦敦 Goldsmiths' Hall 金匠公会大厅）+mark印记、边界（mearc）\n本族语复合词：原指伦敦金匠公会大厅（Hall）在金银器上打的检验印记（mark），引申为“标志、典型特征”。\n助记\nhall=大厅，mark=标记；以前在大厅里用热铁棍在牛羊屁股上印标记\n例句\nCareful craftsmanship is the ==hallmark== of all his work.","fields":{"Front":"hallmark","Back":"释义\nn.特征；标志\n词根词缀\nhall大厅（heall，指伦敦 Goldsmiths' Hall 金匠公会大厅）+mark印记、边界（mearc）\n本族语复合词：原指伦敦金匠公会大厅（Hall）在金银器上打的检验印记（mark），引申为“标志、典型特征”。\n助记\nhall=大厅，mark=标记；以前在大厅里用热铁棍在牛羊屁股上印标记\n例句\nCareful craftsmanship is the ==hallmark== of all his work.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352119","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"haven","back":"释义\n避难所；港湾\n词根词缀\n简单词。古英语 hæfen/古诺斯语 hǫfn“港口、避风处”，无活跃前缀后缀，意为“港口、安息处、避难所”。\n助记\n特别像heaven=天堂；躲在天堂里面最安全\n例句\nHeaven is my ==haven==.","fields":{"Front":"haven","Back":"释义\n避难所；港湾\n词根词缀\n简单词。古英语 hæfen/古诺斯语 hǫfn“港口、避风处”，无活跃前缀后缀，意为“港口、安息处、避难所”。\n助记\n特别像heaven=天堂；躲在天堂里面最安全\n例句\nHeaven is my ==haven==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352121","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"hypocrisy","back":"释义\n虚伪\n词根词缀\nhypo-在…之下、假装+cris判断、辨别（krinein）+-y名词后缀\n希腊语 hypokrisis = hypo-（在…下）+ krinein（判断、演戏念白），原指演员戴面具在台后念白，即“扮演角色”，引申为“虚伪、伪善”。\n助记\nhypo=假设/假面具，crisy=criticize=批评；戴着假面具高高在上批评别人，内部跟别人一样两面\n例句\nHe was accused of ==hypocrisy== after lying about his own taxes.","fields":{"Front":"hypocrisy","Back":"释义\n虚伪\n词根词缀\nhypo-在…之下、假装+cris判断、辨别（krinein）+-y名词后缀\n希腊语 hypokrisis = hypo-（在…下）+ krinein（判断、演戏念白），原指演员戴面具在台后念白，即“扮演角色”，引申为“虚伪、伪善”。\n助记\nhypo=假设/假面具，crisy=criticize=批评；戴着假面具高高在上批评别人，内部跟别人一样两面\n例句\nHe was accused of ==hypocrisy== after lying about his own taxes.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352123","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"illuminate","back":"释义\n照亮；阐明\n词根词缀\nil-在…上（in- 在 l 前的同化）+lumin光（lumen）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁语 illuminare = il-（在…上）+ lumen（光），即“照亮”，引申为“阐明、启发、装饰（书稿）”。\n助记\nlumi=光；点亮，让脑子里面通光了\n例句\nA single lamp ==illuminated== the otherwise dark room.","fields":{"Front":"illuminate","Back":"释义\n照亮；阐明\n词根词缀\nil-在…上（in- 在 l 前的同化）+lumin光（lumen）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁语 illuminare = il-（在…上）+ lumen（光），即“照亮”，引申为“阐明、启发、装饰（书稿）”。\n助记\nlumi=光；点亮，让脑子里面通光了\n例句\nA single lamp ==illuminated== the otherwise dark room.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352125","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"implement","back":"释义\n工具；实施\n词根词缀\nim-在内（in- 在 p 前的同化）+ple填满（plere，源 plenus“满”）+-ment名词后缀\n拉丁语 implere = im-（内）+ plere（填满），即“填满所缺之物”；名词 implementem“工具、补给”，转动词“实施、执行”。\n助记\n和imply=暗示同根；把一个东西用出来让它生效\n例句\nThe company will ==implement== the new policy next month.","fields":{"Front":"implement","Back":"释义\n工具；实施\n词根词缀\nim-在内（in- 在 p 前的同化）+ple填满（plere，源 plenus“满”）+-ment名词后缀\n拉丁语 implere = im-（内）+ plere（填满），即“填满所缺之物”；名词 implementem“工具、补给”，转动词“实施、执行”。\n助记\n和imply=暗示同根；把一个东西用出来让它生效\n例句\nThe company will ==implement== the new policy next month.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352127","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"improvident","back":"释义\n无远见的；挥霍的\n词根词缀\nim-不、无（in- 在 v 前的同化）+vid看见（videre；providere“预见” = pro-“向前” + videre）+-ent形容词后缀\nprovidere = pro-（向前）+ videre（看），即“预见、未雨绸缪”；加 im-（不），意为“不顾将来的、挥霍无远虑的”。\n助记\npro=provide=提供，vid；不断为你提供、买单、养你，乱花钱\n例句\nHis ==improvident== spending left him with no savings at all.","fields":{"Front":"improvident","Back":"释义\n无远见的；挥霍的\n词根词缀\nim-不、无（in- 在 v 前的同化）+vid看见（videre；providere“预见” = pro-“向前” + videre）+-ent形容词后缀\nprovidere = pro-（向前）+ videre（看），即“预见、未雨绸缪”；加 im-（不），意为“不顾将来的、挥霍无远虑的”。\n助记\npro=provide=提供，vid；不断为你提供、买单、养你，乱花钱\n例句\nHis ==improvident== spending left him with no savings at all.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352129","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"indulge","back":"释义\n放纵；纵容\n词根词缀\n简单词。直接借自拉丁语 indulgere“纵容、迁就、宽容”，词源不确定（可能与 dulcis“甜”相关），无活跃前缀后缀，意为“放纵、沉溺、迁就”。\n助记\n吃喝拉撒放纵\n例句\nShe allowed herself to ==indulge== in a single slice of cake.","fields":{"Front":"indulge","Back":"释义\n放纵；纵容\n词根词缀\n简单词。直接借自拉丁语 indulgere“纵容、迁就、宽容”，词源不确定（可能与 dulcis“甜”相关），无活跃前缀后缀，意为“放纵、沉溺、迁就”。\n助记\n吃喝拉撒放纵\n例句\nShe allowed herself to ==indulge== in a single slice of cake.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352131","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ineffectual","back":"释义\n无效的；无能的\n词根词缀\nin-不、无+fect做、造成（facere；effectus“结果”）+-ual形容词后缀\neffectus（ex- + facere“做出来”）+ -ual；加 in-（不），即“没有产生效果的”，意为“无效的、无能的”。\n助记\nin=否定，effectual=有效果的；做的事情没有用，达不到目的\n例句\nAll our efforts to change his mind proved ==ineffectual==.","fields":{"Front":"ineffectual","Back":"释义\n无效的；无能的\n词根词缀\nin-不、无+fect做、造成（facere；effectus“结果”）+-ual形容词后缀\neffectus（ex- + facere“做出来”）+ -ual；加 in-（不），即“没有产生效果的”，意为“无效的、无能的”。\n助记\nin=否定，effectual=有效果的；做的事情没有用，达不到目的\n例句\nAll our efforts to change his mind proved ==ineffectual==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352133","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"innocuous","back":"释义\n无害的\n词根词缀\nin-不、无+noc伤害（nocere）+-uous形容词后缀（-uus）\n拉丁语 innocuus = in-（不）+ nocere（伤害），即“无害的”，意为“无伤大雅的、乏味的”。\n助记\nin=否定，noc=毒害；和innocent=无辜的相近\n例句\nIt was an ==innocuous== remark, not meant to offend anyone.","fields":{"Front":"innocuous","Back":"释义\n无害的\n词根词缀\nin-不、无+noc伤害（nocere）+-uous形容词后缀（-uus）\n拉丁语 innocuus = in-（不）+ nocere（伤害），即“无害的”，意为“无伤大雅的、乏味的”。\n助记\nin=否定，noc=毒害；和innocent=无辜的相近\n例句\nIt was an ==innocuous== remark, not meant to offend anyone.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352135","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"narcotic","back":"释义\n麻醉剂；麻醉的\n词根词缀\nnarc麻木（narkē）+-otic形容词后缀\n希腊语 narkē“麻木、僵硬”派生 narkoun“使麻木”，再加 -otic，意为“麻醉的、催眠的（药物）”。\n助记\n\n例句\nThe doctor prescribed a mild ==narcotic== for the severe pain.","fields":{"Front":"narcotic","Back":"释义\n麻醉剂；麻醉的\n词根词缀\nnarc麻木（narkē）+-otic形容词后缀\n希腊语 narkē“麻木、僵硬”派生 narkoun“使麻木”，再加 -otic，意为“麻醉的、催眠的（药物）”。\n助记\n\n例句\nThe doctor prescribed a mild ==narcotic== for the severe pain.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352137","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"involuntarily","back":"释义\n无意识地\n词根词缀\nin-不、非+volunt意愿（voluntas，源 velle“愿意”）+-ary + -ly形容词+副词后缀组合\nvoluntas（意愿，源 velle“愿意”）+ -ary；加 in-（非），意为“非自愿地、无意识地”。\n助记\nin=否定，voluntary=自愿的\n例句\nHe shivered ==involuntarily== when the cold wind blew.","fields":{"Front":"involuntarily","Back":"释义\n无意识地\n词根词缀\nin-不、非+volunt意愿（voluntas，源 velle“愿意”）+-ary + -ly形容词+副词后缀组合\nvoluntas（意愿，源 velle“愿意”）+ -ary；加 in-（非），意为“非自愿地、无意识地”。\n助记\nin=否定，voluntary=自愿的\n例句\nHe shivered ==involuntarily== when the cold wind blew.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352139","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lackadaisical","back":"释义\n懒散的、无精打采\n词根词缀\n口语派生简单词。源自古感叹语 lack-a-day / alack the day（“哎呀，可悲的日子！”，表达惋惜），加 -ical 形容词后缀；原指多愁善感的叹息，引申为“无精打采的、懒洋洋的”。\n助记\nlack=缺乏，aidas像Adidas阿迪达斯；缺乏阿迪达斯=不运动，缺乏精气神\n例句\nHer ==lackadaisical== attitude toward work worried the teacher.","fields":{"Front":"lackadaisical","Back":"释义\n懒散的、无精打采\n词根词缀\n口语派生简单词。源自古感叹语 lack-a-day / alack the day（“哎呀，可悲的日子！”，表达惋惜），加 -ical 形容词后缀；原指多愁善感的叹息，引申为“无精打采的、懒洋洋的”。\n助记\nlack=缺乏，aidas像Adidas阿迪达斯；缺乏阿迪达斯=不运动，缺乏精气神\n例句\nHer ==lackadaisical== attitude toward work worried the teacher.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353309","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"abrasive","back":"释义\n粗糙的；研磨料\n词根词缀\nab-离开、去掉+ras刮、擦（radere 的过去参数 rasus）+-ive形容词后缀\n拉丁语 abradere = ab-（去掉）+ radere（刮），即“刮掉”；过去分词 abrasus 加 -ive，本义“研磨的”，引申为人“生硬刺耳的”。\n助记\nab=离开，ras=摩擦，ive=形容词后缀；摩擦让东西离开\n例句\nThe ==abrasive== cleaner scratched the delicate surface.","fields":{"Front":"abrasive","Back":"释义\n粗糙的；研磨料\n词根词缀\nab-离开、去掉+ras刮、擦（radere 的过去参数 rasus）+-ive形容词后缀\n拉丁语 abradere = ab-（去掉）+ radere（刮），即“刮掉”；过去分词 abrasus 加 -ive，本义“研磨的”，引申为人“生硬刺耳的”。\n助记\nab=离开，ras=摩擦，ive=形容词后缀；摩擦让东西离开\n例句\nThe ==abrasive== cleaner scratched the delicate surface.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"sat800-list-03","name":"SAT800 核心 › List 03","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["sat800","imported"],"options":{},"cards":[{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352141","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"incongruous","back":"释义\n不一致的\n词根词缀\nin-不，非，否定前缀+congru一致、协调（congruere，con-+gruere“结伴奔跑”）+-ous形容词后缀，表“具有…性质的”\n与整体不协调的、不一致的——即“不(in-)一致(congru)的(-ous)状态”。\n助记\nin-（不）+ congru（=congruent 一致，con- 一起 + gruere 奔跑→结伴而行）+ -ous（形容词后缀）→ 不一致的、不协调的\n例句\nThe bright poster looked ==incongruous== on the old stone wall.","fields":{"Front":"incongruous","Back":"释义\n不一致的\n词根词缀\nin-不，非，否定前缀+congru一致、协调（congruere，con-+gruere“结伴奔跑”）+-ous形容词后缀，表“具有…性质的”\n与整体不协调的、不一致的——即“不(in-)一致(congru)的(-ous)状态”。\n助记\nin-（不）+ congru（=congruent 一致，con- 一起 + gruere 奔跑→结伴而行）+ -ous（形容词后缀）→ 不一致的、不协调的\n例句\nThe bright poster looked ==incongruous== on the old stone wall.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352143","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"indiscernible","back":"释义\n看不清的、难辨别\n词根词缀\nin-不，非+discern辨别、看清（discernere=dis-“分开”+cernere“筛选”）+-ible形容词后缀，表“可被…的”（-ibilis）\n无法分辨的、难以觉察的——“不(in-)能被辨别(discern)的(-ible)”。\n助记\nin-（不）+ discern（辨别，dis- 分开 + cern 筛选）+ -ible（可…的）→ 无法分辨、难以察觉的；参 discernible（可辨别的）\n例句\nThe difference was almost ==indiscernible== to the naked eye.","fields":{"Front":"indiscernible","Back":"释义\n看不清的、难辨别\n词根词缀\nin-不，非+discern辨别、看清（discernere=dis-“分开”+cernere“筛选”）+-ible形容词后缀，表“可被…的”（-ibilis）\n无法分辨的、难以觉察的——“不(in-)能被辨别(discern)的(-ible)”。\n助记\nin-（不）+ discern（辨别，dis- 分开 + cern 筛选）+ -ible（可…的）→ 无法分辨、难以察觉的；参 discernible（可辨别的）\n例句\nThe difference was almost ==indiscernible== to the naked eye.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352145","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inexplicable","back":"释义\n无法解释、费解的\n词根词缀\nin-不+explic展开、解释（ex-出+plicare折叠）+-able可…的\n折叠着打不开、理不清的→无法解释的——“不(in)能展开解释(explic)的”。\n助记\nin-（不）+ ex-（出）+ plic（折叠，参 complex、complicate）+ -able（可…的）→ 打不开、说不清的→无法解释的。\n例句\nHer sudden disappearance remains completely ==inexplicable==.","fields":{"Front":"inexplicable","Back":"释义\n无法解释、费解的\n词根词缀\nin-不+explic展开、解释（ex-出+plicare折叠）+-able可…的\n折叠着打不开、理不清的→无法解释的——“不(in)能展开解释(explic)的”。\n助记\nin-（不）+ ex-（出）+ plic（折叠，参 complex、complicate）+ -able（可…的）→ 打不开、说不清的→无法解释的。\n例句\nHer sudden disappearance remains completely ==inexplicable==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352147","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"insolent","back":"释义\n傲慢的、无礼的\n词根词缀\nin-过度、反常（此处非否定，而是“逾越”）+sol习惯（solere“惯常”）+-ent现在分词形容词后缀\n傲慢无礼的——原指“逾越(in-)常轨(sol)的(-ent)”，引申为放肆无礼。\n助记\nin-（逾越、反常）+ sol（=solere 习惯）+ -ent（…的）→ 逾越常轨的→傲慢无礼的\n例句\nThe ==insolent== clerk refused to apologize to the customer.","fields":{"Front":"insolent","Back":"释义\n傲慢的、无礼的\n词根词缀\nin-过度、反常（此处非否定，而是“逾越”）+sol习惯（solere“惯常”）+-ent现在分词形容词后缀\n傲慢无礼的——原指“逾越(in-)常轨(sol)的(-ent)”，引申为放肆无礼。\n助记\nin-（逾越、反常）+ sol（=solere 习惯）+ -ent（…的）→ 逾越常轨的→傲慢无礼的\n例句\nThe ==insolent== clerk refused to apologize to the customer.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352149","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lugubrious","back":"释义\n悲伤的\n词根词缀\nlug哀悼、悲伤（lugere）+-ubrious形容词后缀\n如丧考妣、满脸哀悼之色的→闷闷不乐的、悲伤的。\n助记\nlug（=lugere 哀悼，想成“哭丧着脸”）+ -ubrious（…的）→ 一直沉浸在哀伤里→闷闷不乐的。\n例句\nThe movie has a ==lugubrious== tone from start to finish.","fields":{"Front":"lugubrious","Back":"释义\n悲伤的\n词根词缀\nlug哀悼、悲伤（lugere）+-ubrious形容词后缀\n如丧考妣、满脸哀悼之色的→闷闷不乐的、悲伤的。\n助记\nlug（=lugere 哀悼，想成“哭丧着脸”）+ -ubrious（…的）→ 一直沉浸在哀伤里→闷闷不乐的。\n例句\nThe movie has a ==lugubrious== tone from start to finish.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352151","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"luxurious","back":"释义\n奢侈的、豪华的\n词根词缀\nluxur过度、繁茂（luxus“歪斜、放纵”）+-ious形容词后缀（-iosus）\n奢侈的、奢华的——“过度放纵(luxur)的(-ious)”。\n助记\nluxur（=luxus 放纵、过度）+ -ious（…的）→ 过度放纵的→奢华的；参 luxury（奢华）\n例句\nThey stayed in a ==luxurious== hotel by the sea.","fields":{"Front":"luxurious","Back":"释义\n奢侈的、豪华的\n词根词缀\nluxur过度、繁茂（luxus“歪斜、放纵”）+-ious形容词后缀（-iosus）\n奢侈的、奢华的——“过度放纵(luxur)的(-ious)”。\n助记\nluxur（=luxus 放纵、过度）+ -ious（…的）→ 过度放纵的→奢华的；参 luxury（奢华）\n例句\nThey stayed in a ==luxurious== hotel by the sea.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352153","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"marginal","back":"释义\n微小的；边缘的\n词根词缀\nmargin边缘、边界（margo）+-al形容词后缀（-alis）\n边缘的、微小不重要的——“位于边缘(margin)的(-al)”。\n助记\nmargin（边缘，参页边距 margin）+ -al（…的）→ 在边缘的→边缘的、微不足道的\n例句\nThere is only a ==marginal== difference between the two versions.","fields":{"Front":"marginal","Back":"释义\n微小的；边缘的\n词根词缀\nmargin边缘、边界（margo）+-al形容词后缀（-alis）\n边缘的、微小不重要的——“位于边缘(margin)的(-al)”。\n助记\nmargin（边缘，参页边距 margin）+ -al（…的）→ 在边缘的→边缘的、微不足道的\n例句\nThere is only a ==marginal== difference between the two versions.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352155","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mercenary","back":"释义\n雇佣兵；唯利是图\n词根词缀\nmercen报酬、工资（merces）+-ary形容词/名词后缀，表“与…相关的人/物”\n唯利是图的（人）——“为工钱(mercen)而做的(-ary)”，引申为雇佣兵。\n助记\nmercen（=merces 报酬，参 commerce、merchant）+ -ary（…的人）→ 只图报酬的人→雇佣兵、唯利是图的\n例句\nThe ==mercenary== soldier fought only for money, not for a cause.","fields":{"Front":"mercenary","Back":"释义\n雇佣兵；唯利是图\n词根词缀\nmercen报酬、工资（merces）+-ary形容词/名词后缀，表“与…相关的人/物”\n唯利是图的（人）——“为工钱(mercen)而做的(-ary)”，引申为雇佣兵。\n助记\nmercen（=merces 报酬，参 commerce、merchant）+ -ary（…的人）→ 只图报酬的人→雇佣兵、唯利是图的\n例句\nThe ==mercenary== soldier fought only for money, not for a cause.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352157","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"moderate","back":"释义\n适度的；温和的\n词根词缀\nmoder节制、调节（moderare，源自modus“尺度”）+-ate动词/形容词后缀\n适度的、有节制的——“按尺度(moder)调节的(-ate)”。\n助记\nmod（=modus 尺度，参 modest、modify）+ -erate（后缀）→ 按尺度来的→适度的、温和的\n例句\nThe weather is pleasantly ==moderate== in the spring.","fields":{"Front":"moderate","Back":"释义\n适度的；温和的\n词根词缀\nmoder节制、调节（moderare，源自modus“尺度”）+-ate动词/形容词后缀\n适度的、有节制的——“按尺度(moder)调节的(-ate)”。\n助记\nmod（=modus 尺度，参 modest、modify）+ -erate（后缀）→ 按尺度来的→适度的、温和的\n例句\nThe weather is pleasantly ==moderate== in the spring.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352159","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mollify","back":"释义\n安抚、缓和\n词根词缀\nmoll柔软的（mollis）+-ify动词后缀“使…化”（facere“做”）\n安抚、使软化——“使(-ify)变软(moll)”。\n助记\nmoll（=mollis 柔软，参 mollusk 软体动物）+ -ify（使…）→ 使变软→安抚、平息\n例句\nThe manager tried to ==mollify== the angry customer with a refund.","fields":{"Front":"mollify","Back":"释义\n安抚、缓和\n词根词缀\nmoll柔软的（mollis）+-ify动词后缀“使…化”（facere“做”）\n安抚、使软化——“使(-ify)变软(moll)”。\n助记\nmoll（=mollis 柔软，参 mollusk 软体动物）+ -ify（使…）→ 使变软→安抚、平息\n例句\nThe manager tried to ==mollify== the angry customer with a refund.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352161","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"nebulous","back":"释义\n模糊的\n词根词缀\nnebul雾、星云（nebula）+-ous形容词后缀\n模糊不清的、云雾状的——“像雾(nebul)一样的(-ous)”。\n助记\nnebul（=nebula 雾、星云）+ -ous（…的）→ 雾蒙蒙的→模糊不清的\n例句\nHis plans for the future are still quite ==nebulous==.","fields":{"Front":"nebulous","Back":"释义\n模糊的\n词根词缀\nnebul雾、星云（nebula）+-ous形容词后缀\n模糊不清的、云雾状的——“像雾(nebul)一样的(-ous)”。\n助记\nnebul（=nebula 雾、星云）+ -ous（…的）→ 雾蒙蒙的→模糊不清的\n例句\nHis plans for the future are still quite ==nebulous==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352163","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"nuance","back":"释义\n细微差别\n词根词缀\nnuance细微差异；源自Lat. nubes“云”，OFr. nuer“多云”\n简单词，借自法语，原义“云彩的渐变”，引申为色调/意义的细微差别。\n助记\n借自法语 nuer「云的色彩渐变」（nubes 云，与 nebula 同源）→ 像云彩明暗般的细微差别\n例句\nShe captured every ==nuance== of the character's complex emotion.","fields":{"Front":"nuance","Back":"释义\n细微差别\n词根词缀\nnuance细微差异；源自Lat. nubes“云”，OFr. nuer“多云”\n简单词，借自法语，原义“云彩的渐变”，引申为色调/意义的细微差别。\n助记\n借自法语 nuer「云的色彩渐变」（nubes 云，与 nebula 同源）→ 像云彩明暗般的细微差别\n例句\nShe captured every ==nuance== of the character's complex emotion.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352165","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"option","back":"释义\n选择\n词根词缀\nopt选择、希望（optare）+-ion名词后缀（-io）表行为/结果\n选择、选项——“选择(opt)这个行为(-ion)”。\n助记\nopt（=optare 选择，参 adopt）+ -ion（名词后缀）→ 选择的行为→选项\n例句\nWe have no other ==option== but to wait for the results.","fields":{"Front":"option","Back":"释义\n选择\n词根词缀\nopt选择、希望（optare）+-ion名词后缀（-io）表行为/结果\n选择、选项——“选择(opt)这个行为(-ion)”。\n助记\nopt（=optare 选择，参 adopt）+ -ion（名词后缀）→ 选择的行为→选项\n例句\nWe have no other ==option== but to wait for the results.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352167","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"overshadow","back":"释义\n遮盖；使失色\n词根词缀\nover-在…上方、过度地+shadow阴影（sceadu）\n复合词：在上方投下阴影→遮蔽、使黯然失色。\n助记\nover-（在…上方）+ shadow（影子）→ 影子罩在上方→遮蔽、使黯然失色\n例句\nHer great success served to ==overshadow== all her earlier failures.","fields":{"Front":"overshadow","Back":"释义\n遮盖；使失色\n词根词缀\nover-在…上方、过度地+shadow阴影（sceadu）\n复合词：在上方投下阴影→遮蔽、使黯然失色。\n助记\nover-（在…上方）+ shadow（影子）→ 影子罩在上方→遮蔽、使黯然失色\n例句\nHer great success served to ==overshadow== all her earlier failures.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352169","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"overweening","back":"释义\n自负的、傲慢的\n词根词缀\nover-过度、过分+ween想、认为（wenan）+-ing动名词/形容词后缀\n过于自负的、傲慢的——“过度(over-)自以为是(ween)的(-ing)”。\n助记\nover-（过度）+ ween（=wenan 想、以为）+ -ing（…的）→ 过分自以为是的→傲慢自负\n例句\nHis ==overweening== pride annoyed all of his colleagues.","fields":{"Front":"overweening","Back":"释义\n自负的、傲慢的\n词根词缀\nover-过度、过分+ween想、认为（wenan）+-ing动名词/形容词后缀\n过于自负的、傲慢的——“过度(over-)自以为是(ween)的(-ing)”。\n助记\nover-（过度）+ ween（=wenan 想、以为）+ -ing（…的）→ 过分自以为是的→傲慢自负\n例句\nHis ==overweening== pride annoyed all of his colleagues.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352171","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"perfidious","back":"释义\n不忠的、背信的\n词根词缀\nper-破坏、背离（此处非“贯穿”，而是“欺诈地”）+fid信任、忠诚（fides）+-ious形容词后缀\n背信弃义的、不忠的——“违背(per-)忠诚(fid)的(-ious)”。\n助记\nper-（背离、欺诈）+ fid（=fides 信任，参 confident、fidelity）+ -ious（…的）→ 背叛信任的→背信弃义的\n例句\nThe ==perfidious== ally betrayed them in the middle of the battle.","fields":{"Front":"perfidious","Back":"释义\n不忠的、背信的\n词根词缀\nper-破坏、背离（此处非“贯穿”，而是“欺诈地”）+fid信任、忠诚（fides）+-ious形容词后缀\n背信弃义的、不忠的——“违背(per-)忠诚(fid)的(-ious)”。\n助记\nper-（背离、欺诈）+ fid（=fides 信任，参 confident、fidelity）+ -ious（…的）→ 背叛信任的→背信弃义的\n例句\nThe ==perfidious== ally betrayed them in the middle of the battle.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352173","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"poignant","back":"释义\n辛酸的；尖锐的\n词根词缀\npoign刺、扎（Lat. pungere）+-ant现在分词形容词后缀\n辛酸的、深刻动人的——原指“刺(poign)人”，像针刺一样刺痛情感。\n助记\npoign（=pungere 刺，参 pungent 辛辣的、puncture 刺）+ -ant（…的）→ 刺人的→辛酸的、深刻的\n例句\nIt was a ==poignant== moment when the family said goodbye.","fields":{"Front":"poignant","Back":"释义\n辛酸的；尖锐的\n词根词缀\npoign刺、扎（Lat. pungere）+-ant现在分词形容词后缀\n辛酸的、深刻动人的——原指“刺(poign)人”，像针刺一样刺痛情感。\n助记\npoign（=pungere 刺，参 pungent 辛辣的、puncture 刺）+ -ant（…的）→ 刺人的→辛酸的、深刻的\n例句\nIt was a ==poignant== moment when the family said goodbye.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352175","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"polemical","back":"释义\n辩论的、有争议的\n词根词缀\npolem战争、论战（polemos）+-ic-al复合形容词后缀（-ikos+-alis）\n好争论的、论战的——“战争/论战(polem)式的”。\n助记\npolem（=polemos 战争）+ -ical（…的）→ 论战式的→挑起辩论的、好争论的\n例句\nThe article is a ==polemical== attack on the government's policy.","fields":{"Front":"polemical","Back":"释义\n辩论的、有争议的\n词根词缀\npolem战争、论战（polemos）+-ic-al复合形容词后缀（-ikos+-alis）\n好争论的、论战的——“战争/论战(polem)式的”。\n助记\npolem（=polemos 战争）+ -ical（…的）→ 论战式的→挑起辩论的、好争论的\n例句\nThe article is a ==polemical== attack on the government's policy.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352177","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pretentious","back":"释义\n自命不凡\n词根词缀\npre-在前面、预先+tent伸展（tendere）+-ious形容词后缀\n自命不凡的、做作的——“在人前提前(pre-)伸展/展示(tent)自己的(-ious)”，即炫耀。\n助记\npre-（在前）+ tent（=tendere 伸展，参 extend、pretend）+ -ious（…的）→ 提前把自己摊开给人看→自命不凡、炫耀\n例句\nHe has a rather ==pretentious== way of showing off his knowledge.","fields":{"Front":"pretentious","Back":"释义\n自命不凡\n词根词缀\npre-在前面、预先+tent伸展（tendere）+-ious形容词后缀\n自命不凡的、做作的——“在人前提前(pre-)伸展/展示(tent)自己的(-ious)”，即炫耀。\n助记\npre-（在前）+ tent（=tendere 伸展，参 extend、pretend）+ -ious（…的）→ 提前把自己摊开给人看→自命不凡、炫耀\n例句\nHe has a rather ==pretentious== way of showing off his knowledge.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352179","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"proclaim","back":"释义\n声明；表明\n词根词缀\npro-向前、公开地+claim呼喊（clamare）\n宣布、声明——“公开(pro-)呼喊(claim)”。\n助记\npro-（公开）+ claim（=clamare 呼喊，参 exclaim、acclaim）→ 公开呼喊→宣告\n例句\nThe king ==proclaimed== a public holiday for the whole kingdom.","fields":{"Front":"proclaim","Back":"释义\n声明；表明\n词根词缀\npro-向前、公开地+claim呼喊（clamare）\n宣布、声明——“公开(pro-)呼喊(claim)”。\n助记\npro-（公开）+ claim（=clamare 呼喊，参 exclaim、acclaim）→ 公开呼喊→宣告\n例句\nThe king ==proclaimed== a public holiday for the whole kingdom.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352181","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"profusion","back":"释义\n丰富、大量\n词根词缀\npro-向前、大量地+fus倾倒（fundere的过去分词fus）+-ion名词后缀\n丰富、大量浪费——“向前(pro-)倾倒(fus)出来的状态(-ion)”。\n助记\npro-（向前、大量）+ fus（=fundere 倾倒，参 confuse、refuse）+ -ion（名词）→ 大量倾倒而出→丰富、充沛\n例句\nA ==profusion== of colorful flowers grew in the garden.","fields":{"Front":"profusion","Back":"释义\n丰富、大量\n词根词缀\npro-向前、大量地+fus倾倒（fundere的过去分词fus）+-ion名词后缀\n丰富、大量浪费——“向前(pro-)倾倒(fus)出来的状态(-ion)”。\n助记\npro-（向前、大量）+ fus（=fundere 倾倒，参 confuse、refuse）+ -ion（名词）→ 大量倾倒而出→丰富、充沛\n例句\nA ==profusion== of colorful flowers grew in the garden.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352183","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prodigious","back":"释义\n巨大的、惊人的\n词根词缀\npro-提前、预示+dig预兆、奇迹（prodigium=pro-+aio“预言”）+-ious形容词后缀\n巨大的、惊人的——“像奇迹/预兆(prodig)一样的(-ious)”。\n助记\nprodig（=prodigium 奇迹，参 prodigy 神童）+ -ious（…的）→ 如奇迹般的→巨大的、惊人的\n例句\nShe has a ==prodigious== memory for faces and names.","fields":{"Front":"prodigious","Back":"释义\n巨大的、惊人的\n词根词缀\npro-提前、预示+dig预兆、奇迹（prodigium=pro-+aio“预言”）+-ious形容词后缀\n巨大的、惊人的——“像奇迹/预兆(prodig)一样的(-ious)”。\n助记\nprodig（=prodigium 奇迹，参 prodigy 神童）+ -ious（…的）→ 如奇迹般的→巨大的、惊人的\n例句\nShe has a ==prodigious== memory for faces and names.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352185","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prominence","back":"释义\n显著；卓越\n词根词缀\npro-向前、突出+min突出、悬挂（minere“突出”，见prominere）+-ence名词后缀（-entia）\n突出、显著——“向前(pro-)伸出(min)的状态(-ence)”。\n助记\npro-（向前）+ min（=minere 突出，参 eminent）+ -ence（名词）→ 向前突出→显著、名望\n例句\nThe young scholar rose to ==prominence== in her field.","fields":{"Front":"prominence","Back":"释义\n显著；卓越\n词根词缀\npro-向前、突出+min突出、悬挂（minere“突出”，见prominere）+-ence名词后缀（-entia）\n突出、显著——“向前(pro-)伸出(min)的状态(-ence)”。\n助记\npro-（向前）+ min（=minere 突出，参 eminent）+ -ence（名词）→ 向前突出→显著、名望\n例句\nThe young scholar rose to ==prominence== in her field.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352187","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"quiescent","back":"释义\n静止的；平静的\n词根词缀\nquiesc静止、休息（quiescere=quies“安静”）+-ent形容词后缀\n休眠的、静止的——“休息/静止(quiesc)的(-ent)”。\n助记\nquiesc（=quiescere 安静，与 quiet 同源）+ -ent（…的）→ 静止的、休眠的\n例句\nThe volcano has remained ==quiescent== for several decades.","fields":{"Front":"quiescent","Back":"释义\n静止的；平静的\n词根词缀\nquiesc静止、休息（quiescere=quies“安静”）+-ent形容词后缀\n休眠的、静止的——“休息/静止(quiesc)的(-ent)”。\n助记\nquiesc（=quiescere 安静，与 quiet 同源）+ -ent（…的）→ 静止的、休眠的\n例句\nThe volcano has remained ==quiescent== for several decades.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352189","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ratify","back":"释义\n批准、认可\n词根词缀\nrat固定的、确定的（ratus，reri“计算/认定”的过去分词）+-ify动词后缀“使…化”\n批准、正式认可——“使(-ify)确定/有效(rat)”。\n助记\nrat（=ratus 认定的、reri 计算，参 rate、reason）+ -ify（使…）→ 使认定有效→正式批准\n例句\nThe senate voted to ==ratify== the important treaty.","fields":{"Front":"ratify","Back":"释义\n批准、认可\n词根词缀\nrat固定的、确定的（ratus，reri“计算/认定”的过去分词）+-ify动词后缀“使…化”\n批准、正式认可——“使(-ify)确定/有效(rat)”。\n助记\nrat（=ratus 认定的、reri 计算，参 rate、reason）+ -ify（使…）→ 使认定有效→正式批准\n例句\nThe senate voted to ==ratify== the important treaty.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352191","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"recalcitrance","back":"释义\n顽抗；固执\n词根词缀\nre-向后、回+calcitr踢（calcitrare=calx“脚后跟”）+-ance名词后缀\n反抗、顽抗——“向后(re-)踢(calcitr)的状态(-ance)”，像骡子尥蹶子。\n助记\nre-（向后）+ calcitr（=calx 脚跟、踢）+ -ance（名词）→ 向后尥蹶子→抗拒、顽抗\n例句\nThe child's ==recalcitrance== frustrated the patient teacher.","fields":{"Front":"recalcitrance","Back":"释义\n顽抗；固执\n词根词缀\nre-向后、回+calcitr踢（calcitrare=calx“脚后跟”）+-ance名词后缀\n反抗、顽抗——“向后(re-)踢(calcitr)的状态(-ance)”，像骡子尥蹶子。\n助记\nre-（向后）+ calcitr（=calx 脚跟、踢）+ -ance（名词）→ 向后尥蹶子→抗拒、顽抗\n例句\nThe child's ==recalcitrance== frustrated the patient teacher.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352193","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"reclusive","back":"释义\n隐居的、遁世的\n词根词缀\nre-回、离群+clus关闭（claudere的过去分词clausus）+-ive形容词后缀\n隐居的、孤僻的——“重新(re-)关起来(clus)的(-ive)”。\n助记\nre-（回、离群）+ clus（=claudere 关闭，参 include、conclude、exclusive）+ -ive（…的）→ 把自己关起来→隐居的\n例句\nThe ==reclusive== writer rarely left her country house.","fields":{"Front":"reclusive","Back":"释义\n隐居的、遁世的\n词根词缀\nre-回、离群+clus关闭（claudere的过去分词clausus）+-ive形容词后缀\n隐居的、孤僻的——“重新(re-)关起来(clus)的(-ive)”。\n助记\nre-（回、离群）+ clus（=claudere 关闭，参 include、conclude、exclusive）+ -ive（…的）→ 把自己关起来→隐居的\n例句\nThe ==reclusive== writer rarely left her country house.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352195","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"recrimination","back":"释义\n反责；互相指责\n词根词缀\nre-反过来、回+crimin指控、罪行（crimen）+-ation名词后缀\n反责、反诉——“反过来(re-)指控(crimin)的行为(-ation)”。\n助记\nre-（反过来）+ crimin（=crimen 指控，参 crime、criminal）+ -ation（名词）→ 反过来指控→反责\n例句\nThe heated meeting ended in mutual ==recrimination==.","fields":{"Front":"recrimination","Back":"释义\n反责；互相指责\n词根词缀\nre-反过来、回+crimin指控、罪行（crimen）+-ation名词后缀\n反责、反诉——“反过来(re-)指控(crimin)的行为(-ation)”。\n助记\nre-（反过来）+ crimin（=crimen 指控，参 crime、criminal）+ -ation（名词）→ 反过来指控→反责\n例句\nThe heated meeting ended in mutual ==recrimination==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352197","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"reticence","back":"释义\n沉默、缄默\n词根词缀\nretic沉默不语（reticere=re-“否定/回”+tacere“安静”）+-ence名词后缀\n沉默寡言、含蓄——“保持沉默(retic)的状态(-ence)”。\n助记\nre-（回/加强）+ tic（=tacere 沉默，参 tacit 心照不宣的）+ -ence（名词）→ 保持沉默→缄默\n例句\nHis ==reticence== about the plan made the rest of us nervous.","fields":{"Front":"reticence","Back":"释义\n沉默、缄默\n词根词缀\nretic沉默不语（reticere=re-“否定/回”+tacere“安静”）+-ence名词后缀\n沉默寡言、含蓄——“保持沉默(retic)的状态(-ence)”。\n助记\nre-（回/加强）+ tic（=tacere 沉默，参 tacit 心照不宣的）+ -ence（名词）→ 保持沉默→缄默\n例句\nHis ==reticence== about the plan made the rest of us nervous.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352199","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"retribution","back":"释义\n报应；惩罚\n词根词缀\nre-回、回报+tribut分配、赐予（tribuere，tribus“部落”）+-ion名词后缀\n报应、惩罚——“回报(re-)所分配(tribut)之物(-ion)”，尤指恶有恶报。\n助记\nre-（回）+ tribut（=tribuere 分配，参 contribute、distribute）+ -ion（名词）→ 回报所分配之物（恶报）→报应、惩罚\n例句\nThe criminal faced swift ==retribution== for his crimes.","fields":{"Front":"retribution","Back":"释义\n报应；惩罚\n词根词缀\nre-回、回报+tribut分配、赐予（tribuere，tribus“部落”）+-ion名词后缀\n报应、惩罚——“回报(re-)所分配(tribut)之物(-ion)”，尤指恶有恶报。\n助记\nre-（回）+ tribut（=tribuere 分配，参 contribute、distribute）+ -ion（名词）→ 回报所分配之物（恶报）→报应、惩罚\n例句\nThe criminal faced swift ==retribution== for his crimes.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352201","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"revelation","back":"释义\n揭露；真相\n词根词缀\nre-去掉、回（此处=去掉面纱）+vel面纱（velum）+-ation名词后缀\n揭露、启示——“揭开(re-)面纱(vel)的行为(-ation)”。\n助记\nre-（去掉）+ vel（=velum 面纱，参 veil）+ -ation（名词）→ 揭开面纱→揭露、启示\n例句\nThe truth about the company came as a shocking ==revelation==.","fields":{"Front":"revelation","Back":"释义\n揭露；真相\n词根词缀\nre-去掉、回（此处=去掉面纱）+vel面纱（velum）+-ation名词后缀\n揭露、启示——“揭开(re-)面纱(vel)的行为(-ation)”。\n助记\nre-（去掉）+ vel（=velum 面纱，参 veil）+ -ation（名词）→ 揭开面纱→揭露、启示\n例句\nThe truth about the company came as a shocking ==revelation==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352203","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"rousing","back":"释义\n鼓舞人心\n词根词缀\nrous唤醒、激起（rouser，原指猎鹰扑水）+-ing形容词后缀\n令人振奋的、活跃的——“被激起(rous)的(-ing)”。\n助记\nrous（=rouse 唤醒，参 arouse）+ -ing（…的）→ 唤醒人的→鼓舞人心的\n例句\nThe coach gave a ==rousing== speech before the big game.","fields":{"Front":"rousing","Back":"释义\n鼓舞人心\n词根词缀\nrous唤醒、激起（rouser，原指猎鹰扑水）+-ing形容词后缀\n令人振奋的、活跃的——“被激起(rous)的(-ing)”。\n助记\nrous（=rouse 唤醒，参 arouse）+ -ing（…的）→ 唤醒人的→鼓舞人心的\n例句\nThe coach gave a ==rousing== speech before the big game.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352205","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"setback","back":"释义\n挫折；失败\n词根词缀\nset+backset（放置）+back（向后）\n复合词：向后放置→挫折、倒退。\n助记\nset（放置）+ back（向后）→ 往后放→倒退、挫折\n例句\nThe research project suffered a major ==setback== last week.","fields":{"Front":"setback","Back":"释义\n挫折；失败\n词根词缀\nset+backset（放置）+back（向后）\n复合词：向后放置→挫折、倒退。\n助记\nset（放置）+ back（向后）→ 往后放→倒退、挫折\n例句\nThe research project suffered a major ==setback== last week.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352207","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"somber","back":"释义\n昏暗的、阴沉的\n词根词缀\nsub-在…下（法语sombrer中变为som-）+umbr阴影（umbra）+\n阴沉的、忧郁的——“在阴影(umbr)之下(sub-)”，经法语sombre借入。\n助记\nsom-（sub- 在…下）+ umbr（=umbra 阴影，参 umbrella、umbrage）→ 在阴影之下→阴沉忧郁的\n例句\nThe whole room was ==somber== after they heard the bad news.","fields":{"Front":"somber","Back":"释义\n昏暗的、阴沉的\n词根词缀\nsub-在…下（法语sombrer中变为som-）+umbr阴影（umbra）+\n阴沉的、忧郁的——“在阴影(umbr)之下(sub-)”，经法语sombre借入。\n助记\nsom-（sub- 在…下）+ umbr（=umbra 阴影，参 umbrella、umbrage）→ 在阴影之下→阴沉忧郁的\n例句\nThe whole room was ==somber== after they heard the bad news.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352209","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sophisticated","back":"释义\n精密的；老练的\n词根词缀\nsophistic智者、诡辩家（sophistes=sophos“智慧”）+-ate+-ed复合动词/形容词后缀\n老练的、复杂精致的——原指“诡辩术(sophistic)化(-ate)过的(-ed)”，引申为世故精密。\n助记\nsophistic（=sophos 智慧，参 philosophy、sophomore）+ -ated（…的）→ 有智慧、懂世故的→老练精密的\n例句\nShe has a ==sophisticated== understanding of international politics.","fields":{"Front":"sophisticated","Back":"释义\n精密的；老练的\n词根词缀\nsophistic智者、诡辩家（sophistes=sophos“智慧”）+-ate+-ed复合动词/形容词后缀\n老练的、复杂精致的——原指“诡辩术(sophistic)化(-ate)过的(-ed)”，引申为世故精密。\n助记\nsophistic（=sophos 智慧，参 philosophy、sophomore）+ -ated（…的）→ 有智慧、懂世故的→老练精密的\n例句\nShe has a ==sophisticated== understanding of international politics.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352211","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"spurious","back":"释义\n假的、伪造的\n词根词缀\nspur假的、私生子（spurius）+-ious形容词后缀\n假的、伪造的——“私生子般的、非正统(spur)的(-ious)”。\n助记\nspuri（=spurius 假的、私生子）+ -ous（…的）→ 非正统的、虚假的、伪造的\n例句\nThe claim was shown to be completely ==spurious==.","fields":{"Front":"spurious","Back":"释义\n假的、伪造的\n词根词缀\nspur假的、私生子（spurius）+-ious形容词后缀\n假的、伪造的——“私生子般的、非正统(spur)的(-ious)”。\n助记\nspuri（=spurius 假的、私生子）+ -ous（…的）→ 非正统的、虚假的、伪造的\n例句\nThe claim was shown to be completely ==spurious==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352213","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"succumb","back":"释义\n屈服；死于\n词根词缀\nsub-在…之下+cumb躺下（cumbere，与cubare同源）\n屈服、死亡——“倒在(sub-)下面(cumb)”。\n助记\nsuc-（sub- 在…下）+ cumb（=cumbere 躺下，参 incumbent、recumbent）→ 倒在下面→屈服、倒下\n例句\nMany delicate plants ==succumb== to the cold winter.","fields":{"Front":"succumb","Back":"释义\n屈服；死于\n词根词缀\nsub-在…之下+cumb躺下（cumbere，与cubare同源）\n屈服、死亡——“倒在(sub-)下面(cumb)”。\n助记\nsuc-（sub- 在…下）+ cumb（=cumbere 躺下，参 incumbent、recumbent）→ 倒在下面→屈服、倒下\n例句\nMany delicate plants ==succumb== to the cold winter.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T0