ifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352223","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"viable","back":"释义\n可行的\n词根词缀\nvi路、道路（via）+-able形容词后缀“能…的”\n可行的、能存活的——“能走通路(vi)的(-able)”。\n助记\nvi（=via 路，参 viaduct）+ -able（能…的）→ 能走得通的→可行的、能存活的\n例句\nSolar power is a ==viable== alternative to coal and oil.","fields":{"Front":"viable","Back":"释义\n可行的\n词根词缀\nvi路、道路（via）+-able形容词后缀“能…的”\n可行的、能存活的——“能走通路(vi)的(-able)”。\n助记\nvi（=via 路，参 viaduct）+ -able（能…的）→ 能走得通的→可行的、能存活的\n例句\nSolar power is a ==viable== alternative to coal and oil.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352225","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"vindictive","back":"释义\n报复性的、怀恨的\n词根词缀\nvindict复仇、惩罚（vindicta=vindex“复仇者”）+-ive形容词后缀\n报复性的、怀恨的——“复仇(vindict)的(-ive)”。\n助记\nvindict（=vindex 复仇，参 revenge、vindicate）+ -ive（…的）→ 一心复仇的→怀恨的、报复性的\n例句\nHe made a ==vindictive== remark about his successful rival.","fields":{"Front":"vindictive","Back":"释义\n报复性的、怀恨的\n词根词缀\nvindict复仇、惩罚（vindicta=vindex“复仇者”）+-ive形容词后缀\n报复性的、怀恨的——“复仇(vindict)的(-ive)”。\n助记\nvindict（=vindex 复仇，参 revenge、vindicate）+ -ive（…的）→ 一心复仇的→怀恨的、报复性的\n例句\nHe made a ==vindictive== remark about his successful rival.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352227","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"vulnerable","back":"释义\n脆弱的；易受伤的\n词根词缀\nvulner伤口（vulnus）+-able形容词后缀“易…的”\n脆弱的、易受攻击的——“容易受伤(vulner)的(-able)”。\n助记\nvulner（=vulnus 伤口）+ -able（易…的）→ 易受伤的→脆弱的、易受攻击的\n例句\nThe elderly are especially ==vulnerable== to the winter flu.","fields":{"Front":"vulnerable","Back":"释义\n脆弱的；易受伤的\n词根词缀\nvulner伤口（vulnus）+-able形容词后缀“易…的”\n脆弱的、易受攻击的——“容易受伤(vulner)的(-able)”。\n助记\nvulner（=vulnus 伤口）+ -able（易…的）→ 易受伤的→脆弱的、易受攻击的\n例句\nThe elderly are especially ==vulnerable== to the winter flu.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352229","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"abridge","back":"释义\n删节；削减\n词根词缀\na-=ad-“朝向、加强”+bridge短（brevis）\n删节、缩短——“使(a-→ad-)变短(bridge←brevis)”。\n助记\na-（ad- 加强）+ bridge（=brevis 短，参 brief、abbreviate）→ 使变短→缩短、删节\n例句\nThe book was ==abridged== to make it suitable for children.","fields":{"Front":"abridge","Back":"释义\n删节；削减\n词根词缀\na-=ad-“朝向、加强”+bridge短（brevis）\n删节、缩短——“使(a-→ad-)变短(bridge←brevis)”。\n助记\na-（ad- 加强）+ bridge（=brevis 短，参 brief、abbreviate）→ 使变短→缩短、删节\n例句\nThe book was ==abridged== to make it suitable for children.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352231","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"allege","back":"释义\n断言；宣称\n词根词缀\nal-=ad-“朝向、加强”+lege指派、举证（ex-+litigare中“提起诉讼”之意；一说源自legare“派遣”）\n断言、指控（提不出证据）——“(al-=ad-)举证/派遣(lege)”。\n助记\nal-（ad- 朝向）+ lege（=legare 派遣、举证，参 legal）→ 提出说法（未必有证据）→声称、断言\n例句\nThe news report ==alleges== corruption in the department.","fields":{"Front":"allege","Back":"释义\n断言；宣称\n词根词缀\nal-=ad-“朝向、加强”+lege指派、举证（ex-+litigare中“提起诉讼”之意；一说源自legare“派遣”）\n断言、指控（提不出证据）——“(al-=ad-)举证/派遣(lege)”。\n助记\nal-（ad- 朝向）+ lege（=legare 派遣、举证，参 legal）→ 提出说法（未必有证据）→声称、断言\n例句\nThe news report ==alleges== corruption in the department.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352233","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"aloof","back":"释义\n冷漠的；疏远的\n词根词缀\na-在…状态+loof背风处、受风面（loef）\n冷淡的、疏远的——航海用语“逆风(a-loof)”→避开、保持距离。\n助记\na-（在…状态）+ loof（=loef 迎风面，航海口令 luff）→ 逆风避开、保持距离→冷淡疏远的\n例句\nHe remained ==aloof== from his coworkers at the office party.","fields":{"Front":"aloof","Back":"释义\n冷漠的；疏远的\n词根词缀\na-在…状态+loof背风处、受风面（loef）\n冷淡的、疏远的——航海用语“逆风(a-loof)”→避开、保持距离。\n助记\na-（在…状态）+ loof（=loef 迎风面，航海口令 luff）→ 逆风避开、保持距离→冷淡疏远的\n例句\nHe remained ==aloof== from his coworkers at the office party.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352235","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"anarchist","back":"释义\n无政府者\n词根词缀\nan-无、没有（alpha privativum）+arch统治者、首领（arkhos，arkhein“统治”）+-ist名词后缀“…主义者”\n无政府主义者——“无(an-)统治(arch)的人(-ist)”。\n助记\nan-（无，希腊否定前缀）+ arch（=arkhein 统治，参 monarchy、anarchy）+ -ist（…者）→ 无统治者的人→无政府主义者\n例句\nThe ==anarchist== rejected all forms of government authority.","fields":{"Front":"anarchist","Back":"释义\n无政府者\n词根词缀\nan-无、没有（alpha privativum）+arch统治者、首领（arkhos，arkhein“统治”）+-ist名词后缀“…主义者”\n无政府主义者——“无(an-)统治(arch)的人(-ist)”。\n助记\nan-（无，希腊否定前缀）+ arch（=arkhein 统治，参 monarchy、anarchy）+ -ist（…者）→ 无统治者的人→无政府主义者\n例句\nThe ==anarchist== rejected all forms of government authority.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352237","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"animosity","back":"释义\n仇恨\n词根词缀\nanim心灵、气息、愤怒（animus）+-osity名词后缀（-ositas）表性质\n憎恶、敌意——“激烈情绪/心智(anim)的状态(-osity)”。\n助记\nanim（=animus 心灵、怒气，参 animal、unanimous）+ -osity（名词）→ 强烈情绪→敌意、仇恨\n例句\nThere is deep ==animosity== between the two neighboring families.","fields":{"Front":"animosity","Back":"释义\n仇恨\n词根词缀\nanim心灵、气息、愤怒（animus）+-osity名词后缀（-ositas）表性质\n憎恶、敌意——“激烈情绪/心智(anim)的状态(-osity)”。\n助记\nanim（=animus 心灵、怒气，参 animal、unanimous）+ -osity（名词）→ 强烈情绪→敌意、仇恨\n例句\nThere is deep ==animosity== between the two neighboring families.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352239","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"astute","back":"释义\n精明的、机敏的\n词根词缀\nastut狡猾、机敏（astus“诡计、灵巧”）+-e法语形容词尾\n精明的、狡黠的——“有灵巧/诡计(astut)”。\n助记\nastut（=astus 机敏、诡计）+ -e（法语形容词尾）→ 脑子灵、有手段的→精明敏锐的\n例句\nShe is an ==astute== observer of human behavior and motives.","fields":{"Front":"astute","Back":"释义\n精明的、机敏的\n词根词缀\nastut狡猾、机敏（astus“诡计、灵巧”）+-e法语形容词尾\n精明的、狡黠的——“有灵巧/诡计(astut)”。\n助记\nastut（=astus 机敏、诡计）+ -e（法语形容词尾）→ 脑子灵、有手段的→精明敏锐的\n例句\nShe is an ==astute== observer of human behavior and motives.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352241","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"authentic","back":"释义\n真正的；可靠的\n词根词缀\nauthen-自己做的、权威的（authentes“主人、行凶者”）+-tic形容词后缀（-tikos）\n真正的、原作的——“亲手(authen-)做的(-tic)”。\n助记\nauthen-（=authentes 亲手、主人，auto 自己）+ -tic（…的）→ 亲手做的→正宗的、可靠的\n例句\nThe museum owns an ==authentic== Roman coin from that period.","fields":{"Front":"authentic","Back":"释义\n真正的；可靠的\n词根词缀\nauthen-自己做的、权威的（authentes“主人、行凶者”）+-tic形容词后缀（-tikos）\n真正的、原作的——“亲手(authen-)做的(-tic)”。\n助记\nauthen-（=authentes 亲手、主人，auto 自己）+ -tic（…的）→ 亲手做的→正宗的、可靠的\n例句\nThe museum owns an ==authentic== Roman coin from that period.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352243","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"beneficiary","back":"释义\n受益人\n词根词缀\nbene-好、善+fic做、产生（facere）+-iary名词后缀“与…相关的人”\n受益人——“做善事(bene-+fic)的人(-iary)”。\n助记\nbene-（好，参 benefit、benevolent）+ fic（=facere 做，参 factory）+ -iary（…的人）→ 得好处的人→受益人\n例句\nShe is the main ==beneficiary== of the life insurance policy.","fields":{"Front":"beneficiary","Back":"释义\n受益人\n词根词缀\nbene-好、善+fic做、产生（facere）+-iary名词后缀“与…相关的人”\n受益人——“做善事(bene-+fic)的人(-iary)”。\n助记\nbene-（好，参 benefit、benevolent）+ fic（=facere 做，参 factory）+ -iary（…的人）→ 得好处的人→受益人\n例句\nShe is the main ==beneficiary== of the life insurance policy.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352245","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"benign","back":"释义\n和善的；无害的；中性的\n词根词缀\nbeni-好、善（bene）+gn出生、产生（gignere的过去分词genitus）\n和善的、良性的——“生来(gn)善良(beni-)的”。\n助记\nbeni-（bene 好）+ gn（=gignere 生，参 genus、genuine）→ 生来善良的→和蔼的、良性的\n例句\nThe doctor confirmed that the tumor was ==benign==.","fields":{"Front":"benign","Back":"释义\n和善的；无害的；中性的\n词根词缀\nbeni-好、善（bene）+gn出生、产生（gignere的过去分词genitus）\n和善的、良性的——“生来(gn)善良(beni-)的”。\n助记\nbeni-（bene 好）+ gn（=gignere 生，参 genus、genuine）→ 生来善良的→和蔼的、良性的\n例句\nThe doctor confirmed that the tumor was ==benign==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352247","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"callous","back":"释义\n无情的、冷漠的\n词根词缀\ncall硬皮、老茧（callus）+-ous形容词后缀\n麻木不仁的、硬结的——“长了老茧(call)的(-ous)”→情感上也变硬。\n助记\ncall（=callus 老茧）+ -ous（…的）→ 长了茧的→（情感也变硬）麻木无情的\n例句\nHis ==callous== disregard for others' feelings shocked everyone.","fields":{"Front":"callous","Back":"释义\n无情的、冷漠的\n词根词缀\ncall硬皮、老茧（callus）+-ous形容词后缀\n麻木不仁的、硬结的——“长了老茧(call)的(-ous)”→情感上也变硬。\n助记\ncall（=callus 老茧）+ -ous（…的）→ 长了茧的→（情感也变硬）麻木无情的\n例句\nHis ==callous== disregard for others' feelings shocked everyone.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352249","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cannibalistic","back":"释义\n自相残杀\n词根词缀\ncannibal加勒比人（Canibales，哥伦布对Carib部落的称呼，该部被传食人）+-istic复合形容词后缀\n同类相食的、食人习性的——“加勒比人般的(cannibal)+…性质(-istic)”。\n助记\ncannibal（源自加勒比人 Canibales，传其食人）+ -istic（…习性的）→ 同类相食的\n例句\nThe novel describes a small ==cannibalistic== tribe in the jungle.","fields":{"Front":"cannibalistic","Back":"释义\n自相残杀\n词根词缀\ncannibal加勒比人（Canibales，哥伦布对Carib部落的称呼，该部被传食人）+-istic复合形容词后缀\n同类相食的、食人习性的——“加勒比人般的(cannibal)+…性质(-istic)”。\n助记\ncannibal（源自加勒比人 Canibales，传其食人）+ -istic（…习性的）→ 同类相食的\n例句\nThe novel describes a small ==cannibalistic== tribe in the jungle.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352251","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"chronicle","back":"释义\n编年史；编入编年史\n词根词缀\nchron时间（khronos）+-icle名词小称/集合后缀（-iculus）\n编年史、年代记——“按时间(chron)编排的记录(-icle)”。\n助记\nchron（=khronos 时间，参 chronic、chronology）+ -icle（名词后缀）→ 按时间编排的记录→编年史\n例句\nThe monk wrote a detailed ==chronicle== of the king's long reign.","fields":{"Front":"chronicle","Back":"释义\n编年史；编入编年史\n词根词缀\nchron时间（khronos）+-icle名词小称/集合后缀（-iculus）\n编年史、年代记——“按时间(chron)编排的记录(-icle)”。\n助记\nchron（=khronos 时间，参 chronic、chronology）+ -icle（名词后缀）→ 按时间编排的记录→编年史\n例句\nThe monk wrote a detailed ==chronicle== of the king's long reign.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352253","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"composer","back":"释义\n作曲家\n词根词缀\ncom-一起+pos放置（ponere的过去分词positus）+-er名词后缀“做…的人”\n作曲家、创作者——“把东西放在一起(com-+pos)的人(-er)”。\n助记\ncom-（一起）+ pos（=ponere 放，参 compose、position）+ -er（…的人）→ 把音符组合起来的人→作曲家\n例句\nShe is a famous ==composer== of modern classical music.","fields":{"Front":"composer","Back":"释义\n作曲家\n词根词缀\ncom-一起+pos放置（ponere的过去分词positus）+-er名词后缀“做…的人”\n作曲家、创作者——“把东西放在一起(com-+pos)的人(-er)”。\n助记\ncom-（一起）+ pos（=ponere 放，参 compose、position）+ -er（…的人）→ 把音符组合起来的人→作曲家\n例句\nShe is a famous ==composer== of modern classical music.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352255","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"conflagration","back":"释义\n大火；火灾\n词根词缀\ncon-加强语气、彻底+flagr燃烧（flagrare）+-ation名词后缀\n大火、火灾——“彻底(con-)燃烧(flagr)的事件(-ation)”。\n助记\ncon-（彻底）+ flagr（=flagrare 燃烧，参 flagrant、flame）+ -ation（名词）→ 大火、火灾\n例句\nThe sudden ==conflagration== destroyed the entire city block.","fields":{"Front":"conflagration","Back":"释义\n大火；火灾\n词根词缀\ncon-加强语气、彻底+flagr燃烧（flagrare）+-ation名词后缀\n大火、火灾——“彻底(con-)燃烧(flagr)的事件(-ation)”。\n助记\ncon-（彻底）+ flagr（=flagrare 燃烧，参 flagrant、flame）+ -ation（名词）→ 大火、火灾\n例句\nThe sudden ==conflagration== destroyed the entire city block.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352257","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"consolidate","back":"释义\n巩固；合并\n词根词缀\ncon-一起、完全+solid坚固的（solidus）+-ate动词后缀\n巩固、合并——“使(-ate)完全(con-)坚固(solid)”。\n助记\ncon-（一起、完全）+ solid（坚固）+ -ate（使…）→ 使完全坚固→巩固、合并\n例句\nThe company wants to ==consolidate== its position in the market.","fields":{"Front":"consolidate","Back":"释义\n巩固；合并\n词根词缀\ncon-一起、完全+solid坚固的（solidus）+-ate动词后缀\n巩固、合并——“使(-ate)完全(con-)坚固(solid)”。\n助记\ncon-（一起、完全）+ solid（坚固）+ -ate（使…）→ 使完全坚固→巩固、合并\n例句\nThe company wants to ==consolidate== its position in the market.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352259","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"contingency","back":"释义\n意外；偶发事件\n词根词缀\ncon-一起、紧密+ting触碰（tangere的过去分词tingere→tangent）+-ency名词后缀\n偶然事件、应急——“紧密(con-)相连/触碰(ting)的状态(-ency)”。\n助记\ncon-（一起）+ ting（=tangere 触碰，参 contact、tangible）+ -ency（名词）→ 偶然碰上的事→意外情况、应急\n例句\nWe made careful plans for every possible ==contingency==.","fields":{"Front":"contingency","Back":"释义\n意外；偶发事件\n词根词缀\ncon-一起、紧密+ting触碰（tangere的过去分词tingere→tangent）+-ency名词后缀\n偶然事件、应急——“紧密(con-)相连/触碰(ting)的状态(-ency)”。\n助记\ncon-（一起）+ ting（=tangere 触碰，参 contact、tangible）+ -ency（名词）→ 偶然碰上的事→意外情况、应急\n例句\nWe made careful plans for every possible ==contingency==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352261","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"conventional","back":"释义\n常规的；传统的\n词根词缀\ncon-一起+vent来（venire）+-ion+-al复合形容词后缀\n传统的、惯例的——“走到一起(con-+vent)开会达成的约定(-ion)+…的(-al)”。\n助记\ncon-（一起）+ vent（=venire 来，参 convene、event）+ -ional（…的）→ 开会约定俗成的→传统的、惯例的\n例句\nHe follows a ==conventional== approach to teaching literature.","fields":{"Front":"conventional","Back":"释义\n常规的；传统的\n词根词缀\ncon-一起+vent来（venire）+-ion+-al复合形容词后缀\n传统的、惯例的——“走到一起(con-+vent)开会达成的约定(-ion)+…的(-al)”。\n助记\ncon-（一起）+ vent（=venire 来，参 convene、event）+ -ional（…的）→ 开会约定俗成的→传统的、惯例的\n例句\nHe follows a ==conventional== approach to teaching literature.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352263","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"decorum","back":"释义\n礼节得体\n词根词缀\ndecor得体、美（decus）+-um拉丁中性名词后缀\n礼仪、端庄——直接借自Lat. decorum“得体之物”。\n助记\ndecor（=decus 得体，参 decent、decorate）+ -um（拉丁名词后缀）→ 得体之物→礼仪、端庄\n例句\nThe experienced judge was known for her strict ==decorum== in court.","fields":{"Front":"decorum","Back":"释义\n礼节得体\n词根词缀\ndecor得体、美（decus）+-um拉丁中性名词后缀\n礼仪、端庄——直接借自Lat. decorum“得体之物”。\n助记\ndecor（=decus 得体，参 decent、decorate）+ -um（拉丁名词后缀）→ 得体之物→礼仪、端庄\n例句\nThe experienced judge was known for her strict ==decorum== in court.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352265","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dexterous","back":"释义\n灵巧的、熟练的\n词根词缀\ndexter右边的、灵巧的（右手较灵巧）+-ous形容词后缀\n灵巧的、敏捷的——“用右手(dexter)一般熟练的(-ous)”。\n助记\ndexter（=右手、灵巧，参 dexterity；反义 awkward）+ -ous（…的）→ 像右手般熟练→灵巧的\n例句\nThe skilled surgeon has remarkably ==dexterous== hands.","fields":{"Front":"dexterous","Back":"释义\n灵巧的、熟练的\n词根词缀\ndexter右边的、灵巧的（右手较灵巧）+-ous形容词后缀\n灵巧的、敏捷的——“用右手(dexter)一般熟练的(-ous)”。\n助记\ndexter（=右手、灵巧，参 dexterity；反义 awkward）+ -ous（…的）→ 像右手般熟练→灵巧的\n例句\nThe skilled surgeon has remarkably ==dexterous== hands.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352267","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"diffident","back":"释义\n羞怯的；不自信的\n词根词缀\ndif-=dis-“不、否定”+fid信任（fidere）+-ent形容词后缀\n缺乏自信的、羞怯的——“不(dif-)信任(自己)(fid)的(-ent)”。\n助记\ndif-（dis- 不）+ fid（=fidere 信任，参 confident）+ -ent（…的）→ 不相信自己的→缺乏自信的、羞怯的\n例句\nHe was too ==diffident== to ask for help when he needed it.","fields":{"Front":"diffident","Back":"释义\n羞怯的；不自信的\n词根词缀\ndif-=dis-“不、否定”+fid信任（fidere）+-ent形容词后缀\n缺乏自信的、羞怯的——“不(dif-)信任(自己)(fid)的(-ent)”。\n助记\ndif-（dis- 不）+ fid（=fidere 信任，参 confident）+ -ent（…的）→ 不相信自己的→缺乏自信的、羞怯的\n例句\nHe was too ==diffident== to ask for help when he needed it.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352269","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"discard","back":"释义\n抛弃；丢弃\n词根词缀\ndis-离开、去掉+card纸牌（carte, Lat. charta“纸”）\n丢弃、抛弃——打牌用语“把牌(card)打出(dis-)”。\n助记\ndis-（去掉）+ card（=charta 纸牌、纸片）→ 打牌时把牌打出→丢弃、抛弃\n例句\nPlease ==discard== any food that has gone bad.","fields":{"Front":"discard","Back":"释义\n抛弃；丢弃\n词根词缀\ndis-离开、去掉+card纸牌（carte, Lat. charta“纸”）\n丢弃、抛弃——打牌用语“把牌(card)打出(dis-)”。\n助记\ndis-（去掉）+ card（=charta 纸牌、纸片）→ 打牌时把牌打出→丢弃、抛弃\n例句\nPlease ==discard== any food that has gone bad.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352271","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"disperse","back":"释义\n分散；驱散\n词根词缀\ndi-=dis-“散开”+spers撒、散布（spargere的过去分词spersus）\n分散、驱散——“向各处(di-)撒开(spers)”。\n助记\ndi-（dis- 散开）+ spers（=spargere 撒，参 sparse）→ 向各处撒开→驱散、散布\n例句\nThe crowd began to ==disperse== quietly after the show ended.","fields":{"Front":"disperse","Back":"释义\n分散；驱散\n词根词缀\ndi-=dis-“散开”+spers撒、散布（spargere的过去分词spersus）\n分散、驱散——“向各处(di-)撒开(spers)”。\n助记\ndi-（dis- 散开）+ spers（=spargere 撒，参 sparse）→ 向各处撒开→驱散、散布\n例句\nThe crowd began to ==disperse== quietly after the show ended.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352273","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"egotistical","back":"释义\n自我中心、自负的\n词根词缀\nego我（Lat. ego）+-tist+-ic+-al复合形容词后缀\n自我中心的、自大的——“把我(ego)挂在嘴边的人(-tist)那样的(-ic+-al)”。\n助记\nego（我，参 egoism、egocentric）+ -tistical（…的）→ 把「我」挂在嘴边的→自我中心的、自大的\n例句\nHis ==egotistical== behavior annoyed everyone at the meeting.","fields":{"Front":"egotistical","Back":"释义\n自我中心、自负的\n词根词缀\nego我（Lat. ego）+-tist+-ic+-al复合形容词后缀\n自我中心的、自大的——“把我(ego)挂在嘴边的人(-tist)那样的(-ic+-al)”。\n助记\nego（我，参 egoism、egocentric）+ -tistical（…的）→ 把「我」挂在嘴边的→自我中心的、自大的\n例句\nHis ==egotistical== behavior annoyed everyone at the meeting.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352275","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"enigma","back":"释义\n谜；神秘事物\n词根词缀\nenigm谜语（ainissesthai“用隐喻说话”，ainos“故事”）\n简单词：谜、费解之事——直接借自Gk. enigma。\n助记\n源自希腊 enigma（ainissomai 用隐喻说话，ainos 故事）→ 用隐喻说的话→谜、费解的事物\n例句\nThe true source of the manuscript remains a complete ==enigma==.","fields":{"Front":"enigma","Back":"释义\n谜；神秘事物\n词根词缀\nenigm谜语（ainissesthai“用隐喻说话”，ainos“故事”）\n简单词：谜、费解之事——直接借自Gk. enigma。\n助记\n源自希腊 enigma（ainissomai 用隐喻说话，ainos 故事）→ 用隐喻说的话→谜、费解的事物\n例句\nThe true source of the manuscript remains a complete ==enigma==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352277","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"erudite","back":"释义\n博学的\n词根词缀\ne-=ex-“出、离开”+rud粗野、未经训练（rudis）+-ite形容词/动词后缀\n博学的——“脱离(e-)粗野(rud)状态的(-ite)”。\n助记\ne-（ex- 出）+ rud（=rudis 粗野、未开化，参 rude、rudimentary）+ -ite（…的）→ 脱离粗野状态的→博学的\n例句\nThe professor is an ==erudite== scholar of ancient Greek history.","fields":{"Front":"erudite","Back":"释义\n博学的\n词根词缀\ne-=ex-“出、离开”+rud粗野、未经训练（rudis）+-ite形容词/动词后缀\n博学的——“脱离(e-)粗野(rud)状态的(-ite)”。\n助记\ne-（ex- 出）+ rud（=rudis 粗野、未开化，参 rude、rudimentary）+ -ite（…的）→ 脱离粗野状态的→博学的\n例句\nThe professor is an ==erudite== scholar of ancient Greek history.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352279","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"esoteric","back":"释义\n深奥难懂\n词根词缀\neso-内部的（esō）+-teric比较级形容词后缀（-teros）\n秘传的、深奥的——“对内(eso-)的(-teric)”，仅限入门者知晓。\n助记\neso-（=esō 内部，反义 exo- 外部）+ -teric（…的）→ 仅限内部人知道的→秘传的、深奥的\n例句\nHer interest in ==esoteric== philosophy surprised her friends.","fields":{"Front":"esoteric","Back":"释义\n深奥难懂\n词根词缀\neso-内部的（esō）+-teric比较级形容词后缀（-teros）\n秘传的、深奥的——“对内(eso-)的(-teric)”，仅限入门者知晓。\n助记\neso-（=esō 内部，反义 exo- 外部）+ -teric（…的）→ 仅限内部人知道的→秘传的、深奥的\n例句\nHer interest in ==esoteric== philosophy surprised her friends.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352281","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"exasperation","back":"释义\n愤怒的\n词根词缀\nex-加强、彻底+asper粗糙的（asper）+-ation名词后缀\n恼怒、激怒——“使(ex-)彻底粗糙/刺耳(asper)的状态(-ation)”。\n助记\nex-（彻底）+ asper（=asper 粗糙，参 asperity）+ -ation（名词）→ 被磨得刺耳→恼怒、恼火\n例句\nShe sighed in ==exasperation== at the repeated delays.","fields":{"Front":"exasperation","Back":"释义\n愤怒的\n词根词缀\nex-加强、彻底+asper粗糙的（asper）+-ation名词后缀\n恼怒、激怒——“使(ex-)彻底粗糙/刺耳(asper)的状态(-ation)”。\n助记\nex-（彻底）+ asper（=asper 粗糙，参 asperity）+ -ation（名词）→ 被磨得刺耳→恼怒、恼火\n例句\nShe sighed in ==exasperation== at the repeated delays.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352283","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"exempt","back":"释义\n免除；豁免的\n词根词缀\nex-出、离开+empt拿、买（emere的过去分词emptus）\n豁免的、免除的——“被拿出去(ex-)、脱离(empt)”。\n助记\nex-（出）+ empt（=emere 拿、买，参 example、redeem、preempt）→ 被拿出去、脱离了的→豁免的\n例句\nStudents with special needs are ==exempt== from the additional fee.","fields":{"Front":"exempt","Back":"释义\n免除；豁免的\n词根词缀\nex-出、离开+empt拿、买（emere的过去分词emptus）\n豁免的、免除的——“被拿出去(ex-)、脱离(empt)”。\n助记\nex-（出）+ empt（=emere 拿、买，参 example、redeem、preempt）→ 被拿出去、脱离了的→豁免的\n例句\nStudents with special needs are ==exempt== from the additional fee.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352285","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fabricate","back":"释义\n制造；捏造\n词根词缀\nfabric作坊、工艺（fabrica，faber“工匠”）+-ate动词后缀\n制造、捏造——“在作坊里(fabric)做出来(-ate)”。\n助记\nfabric（=fabrica 作坊，faber 工匠）+ -ate（使…）→ 在作坊里做出来→制造、捏造\n例句\nHe was accused of ==fabricating== evidence to support his claim.","fields":{"Front":"fabricate","Back":"释义\n制造；捏造\n词根词缀\nfabric作坊、工艺（fabrica，faber“工匠”）+-ate动词后缀\n制造、捏造——“在作坊里(fabric)做出来(-ate)”。\n助记\nfabric（=fabrica 作坊，faber 工匠）+ -ate（使…）→ 在作坊里做出来→制造、捏造\n例句\nHe was accused of ==fabricating== evidence to support his claim.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352287","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"feign","back":"释义\n假装；伪装\n词根词缀\nfeign塑造、假装（Lat. fingere“形成、捏塑”）\n简单词：假装、伪造——经法语feindre借自Lat. fingere“捏塑”。\n助记\n拉丁 fingere「捏塑、成形」（参 fiction、figure），经法语 feindre→ 像捏塑一样→假装、佯装\n例句\nThe child ==feigned== illness in order to skip school that day.","fields":{"Front":"feign","Back":"释义\n假装；伪装\n词根词缀\nfeign塑造、假装（Lat. fingere“形成、捏塑”）\n简单词：假装、伪造——经法语feindre借自Lat. fingere“捏塑”。\n助记\n拉丁 fingere「捏塑、成形」（参 fiction、figure），经法语 feindre→ 像捏塑一样→假装、佯装\n例句\nThe child ==feigned== illness in order to skip school that day.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352289","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"foible","back":"释义\n小缺点；弱点\n词根词缀\nfoibl弱的（faible，Lat. flebilis“可泣的”）\n缺点、弱点——借自法语“弱(foible)”。\n助记\n借自法语 faible「弱」（=feeble 虚弱）→ 性格上的小弱点\n例句\nEveryone has a small ==foible== or two that close friends accept.","fields":{"Front":"foible","Back":"释义\n小缺点；弱点\n词根词缀\nfoibl弱的（faible，Lat. flebilis“可泣的”）\n缺点、弱点——借自法语“弱(foible)”。\n助记\n借自法语 faible「弱」（=feeble 虚弱）→ 性格上的小弱点\n例句\nEveryone has a small ==foible== or two that close friends accept.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352291","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"foster","back":"释义\n培养；养育\n词根词缀\nfost食物、养育（fostor“喂养者”，foda“食物”）\n简单词：养育、促进——直接继承OE fostrian“喂养、照料”。\n助记\n古英语 fostrian「喂养」（foda 食物，参 food）→ 喂养照料→养育、培养\n例句\nThe school aims to ==foster== creativity and curiosity in its students.","fields":{"Front":"foster","Back":"释义\n培养；养育\n词根词缀\nfost食物、养育（fostor“喂养者”，foda“食物”）\n简单词：养育、促进——直接继承OE fostrian“喂养、照料”。\n助记\n古英语 fostrian「喂养」（foda 食物，参 food）→ 喂养照料→养育、培养\n例句\nThe school aims to ==foster== creativity and curiosity in its students.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352293","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"genre","back":"释义\n类型；流派\n词根词缀\ngen种类、出生（Lat. genus）\n简单词：类型、流派——借自法语genre“种类”。\n助记\n拉丁 genus（种类、出生，参 genus、generic、genuine），借法语 genre「种类」→ 体裁、流派\n例句\nThe successful novelist works mainly in the mystery ==genre==.","fields":{"Front":"genre","Back":"释义\n类型；流派\n词根词缀\ngen种类、出生（Lat. genus）\n简单词：类型、流派——借自法语genre“种类”。\n助记\n拉丁 genus（种类、出生，参 genus、generic、genuine），借法语 genre「种类」→ 体裁、流派\n例句\nThe successful novelist works mainly in the mystery ==genre==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352295","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"impasse","back":"释义\n僵局；死路\n词根词缀\nim-不、无+passe通过（passer，Lat. passus“步”）\n僵局、死路——“无(im-)通路(passe)”。\n助记\nim-（不）+ passe（=passer 通过，参 pass）→ 无法通过之处→僵局、死胡同\n例句\nThe long negotiations finally reached a complete ==impasse==.","fields":{"Front":"impasse","Back":"释义\n僵局；死路\n词根词缀\nim-不、无+passe通过（passer，Lat. passus“步”）\n僵局、死路——“无(im-)通路(passe)”。\n助记\nim-（不）+ passe（=passer 通过，参 pass）→ 无法通过之处→僵局、死胡同\n例句\nThe long negotiations finally reached a complete ==impasse==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352297","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"impede","back":"释义\n阻止\n词根词缀\nim-=in-“在…中”+ped脚（pes，pedis）\n阻碍、妨碍——“把脚(im-+ped)绊住”。\n助记\nim-（in- 在…中）+ ped（=pes 脚，参 pedal、pedestrian）→ 绊住脚→阻碍、妨碍\n例句\nThe broken bridge will ==impede== our journey to the village.","fields":{"Front":"impede","Back":"释义\n阻止\n词根词缀\nim-=in-“在…中”+ped脚（pes，pedis）\n阻碍、妨碍——“把脚(im-+ped)绊住”。\n助记\nim-（in- 在…中）+ ped（=pes 脚，参 pedal、pedestrian）→ 绊住脚→阻碍、妨碍\n例句\nThe broken bridge will ==impede== our journey to the village.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352299","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inadequate","back":"释义\n不足的；不充分的\n词根词缀\nin-不、非+adequ相等、足够（ad-+aequare“使相等”=aequus“平”）+-ate形容词后缀\n不充分的、不够的——“不(in-)相等/足够(adequ)的(-ate)”。\n助记\nin-（不）+ ad-（向）+ equ（=aequus 平等，参 equal、equate）+ -ate（…的）→ 不够、不相当的→不足的\n例句\nThe funding was ==inadequate== for such an ambitious project.","fields":{"Front":"inadequate","Back":"释义\n不足的；不充分的\n词根词缀\nin-不、非+adequ相等、足够（ad-+aequare“使相等”=aequus“平”）+-ate形容词后缀\n不充分的、不够的——“不(in-)相等/足够(adequ)的(-ate)”。\n助记\nin-（不）+ ad-（向）+ equ（=aequus 平等，参 equal、equate）+ -ate（…的）→ 不够、不相当的→不足的\n例句\nThe funding was ==inadequate== for such an ambitious project.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352301","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inconclusive","back":"释义\n不确定的、无定论的\n词根词缀\nin-不、非+conclus结束、关闭（concludere=con-+claudere“关闭”的过去分词conclusus）+-ive形容词后缀\n无定论的、不确定的——“不(in-)能下结论(conclus)的(-ive)”。\n助记\nin-（不）+ conclus（=concludere 关闭、下结论，参 conclude、conclusion）+ -ive（…的）→ 无法下结论的→无定论的\n例句\nThe results of the laboratory test were ==inconclusive==.","fields":{"Front":"inconclusive","Back":"释义\n不确定的、无定论的\n词根词缀\nin-不、非+conclus结束、关闭（concludere=con-+claudere“关闭”的过去分词conclusus）+-ive形容词后缀\n无定论的、不确定的——“不(in-)能下结论(conclus)的(-ive)”。\n助记\nin-（不）+ conclus（=concludere 关闭、下结论，参 conclude、conclusion）+ -ive（…的）→ 无法下结论的→无定论的\n例句\nThe results of the laboratory test were ==inconclusive==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352303","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"innuendo","back":"释义\n暗讽；影射\n词根词缀\nin-向、朝+nuend点头（nuere的动名词nuendum）+-o拉丁夺格/名词尾\n暗讽、影射——“向(in-)人点头示意(nuend)→暗示”，法律用语原指“（他）暗示说”。\n助记\nin-（向）+ nuend（=nuere 点头，动名词）+ -o（名词尾）→ 朝人点头暗示→暗讽、影射\n例句\nHe made a rude ==innuendo== about her honesty during the meeting.","fields":{"Front":"innuendo","Back":"释义\n暗讽；影射\n词根词缀\nin-向、朝+nuend点头（nuere的动名词nuendum）+-o拉丁夺格/名词尾\n暗讽、影射——“向(in-)人点头示意(nuend)→暗示”，法律用语原指“（他）暗示说”。\n助记\nin-（向）+ nuend（=nuere 点头，动名词）+ -o（名词尾）→ 朝人点头暗示→暗讽、影射\n例句\nHe made a rude ==innuendo== about her honesty during the meeting.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352305","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"intersect","back":"释义\n相交；交叉\n词根词缀\ninter-在…之间+sect切割（secare的过去分词sectus）\n相交、横断——“在中间(inter-)切过(sect)”。\n助记\ninter-（在…之间）+ sect（=secare 切割，参 section、dissect、insect）→ 从中间切开→相交、交叉\n例句\nThe two busy roads ==intersect== right at the town square.","fields":{"Front":"intersect","Back":"释义\n相交；交叉\n词根词缀\ninter-在…之间+sect切割（secare的过去分词sectus）\n相交、横断——“在中间(inter-)切过(sect)”。\n助记\ninter-（在…之间）+ sect（=secare 切割，参 section、dissect、insect）→ 从中间切开→相交、交叉\n例句\nThe two busy roads ==intersect== right at the town square.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352307","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"invoke","back":"释义\n援引；祈求\n词根词缀\nin-对、向+vok呼唤（vocare，vox“声音”）\n诉诸、祈求——“对(in-)…呼唤(vok)”。\n助记\nin-（向）+ vok（=vocare 呼唤，vox 声音，参 voice、revoke、provoke）→ 对…呼唤→祈求、诉诸\n例句\nThe experienced lawyer will ==invoke== an old law in court.","fields":{"Front":"invoke","Back":"释义\n援引；祈求\n词根词缀\nin-对、向+vok呼唤（vocare，vox“声音”）\n诉诸、祈求——“对(in-)…呼唤(vok)”。\n助记\nin-（向）+ vok（=vocare 呼唤，vox 声音，参 voice、revoke、provoke）→ 对…呼唤→祈求、诉诸\n例句\nThe experienced lawyer will ==invoke== an old law in court.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352309","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"isolate","back":"释义\n隔离；孤立\n词根词缀\nisol岛（isola，Lat. insula）+-ate动词后缀\n孤立、隔离——“使(-ate)像一座孤岛(isol)”。\n助记\nisol（=insula 岛，参 isle、insulate、peninsula）+ -ate（使…）→ 使像孤岛一样→隔离、孤立\n例句\nThe infected patient was ==isolated== to prevent further infection.","fields":{"Front":"isolate","Back":"释义\n隔离；孤立\n词根词缀\nisol岛（isola，Lat. insula）+-ate动词后缀\n孤立、隔离——“使(-ate)像一座孤岛(isol)”。\n助记\nisol（=insula 岛，参 isle、insulate、peninsula）+ -ate（使…）→ 使像孤岛一样→隔离、孤立\n例句\nThe infected patient was ==isolated== to prevent further infection.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352311","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"jocular","back":"释义\n诙谐的、逗乐的\n词根词缀\njoc玩笑（jocus）+-ular形容词小称后缀（-ularis）\n爱开玩笑的、诙谐的——“玩笑(joc)般的(-ular)”。\n助记\njoc（=jocus 玩笑，参 joke、jocund）+ -ular（…的）→ 开玩笑般的→爱开玩笑的、诙谐的\n例句\nHe made a ==jocular== remark to lighten the serious mood.","fields":{"Front":"jocular","Back":"释义\n诙谐的、逗乐的\n词根词缀\njoc玩笑（jocus）+-ular形容词小称后缀（-ularis）\n爱开玩笑的、诙谐的——“玩笑(joc)般的(-ular)”。\n助记\njoc（=jocus 玩笑，参 joke、jocund）+ -ular（…的）→ 开玩笑般的→爱开玩笑的、诙谐的\n例句\nHe made a ==jocular== remark to lighten the serious mood.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352313","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"judicious","back":"释义\n明智的、有判断力\n词根词缀\njudic判断、司法（judicium=jus“法”+dicere“说”）+-ious形容词后缀\n明智的、审慎的——“有判断力(judic)的(-ious)”。\n助记\njudic（=jus 法 + dicere 说，参 judge、judicial）+ -ious（…的）→ 有判断力的→明智的、审慎的\n例句\nShe made a ==judicious== decision after careful thought and reflection.","fields":{"Front":"judicious","Back":"释义\n明智的、有判断力\n词根词缀\njudic判断、司法（judicium=jus“法”+dicere“说”）+-ious形容词后缀\n明智的、审慎的——“有判断力(judic)的(-ious)”。\n助记\njudic（=jus 法 + dicere 说，参 judge、judicial）+ -ious（…的）→ 有判断力的→明智的、审慎的\n例句\nShe made a ==judicious== decision after careful thought and reflection.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352315","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lamentable","back":"释义\n可悲的、遗憾的\n词根词缀\nlament哀哭（lamentum）+-able形容词后缀“可…的”\n可悲的、糟糕的——“值得哀叹(lament)的(-able)”。\n助记\nlament（=lamentum 哀哭，参 lament）+ -able（可…的）→ 值得哀叹的→可悲的、令人惋惜的\n例句\nThe loss of the precious manuscript is deeply ==lamentable==.","fields":{"Front":"lamentable","Back":"释义\n可悲的、遗憾的\n词根词缀\nlament哀哭（lamentum）+-able形容词后缀“可…的”\n可悲的、糟糕的——“值得哀叹(lament)的(-able)”。\n助记\nlament（=lamentum 哀哭，参 lament）+ -able（可…的）→ 值得哀叹的→可悲的、令人惋惜的\n例句\nThe loss of the precious manuscript is deeply ==lamentable==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352317","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"leniency","back":"释义\n仁慈 宽容\n词根词缀\nleni柔软、温和（lenis）+-ency名词后缀\n宽大、温和——“柔软/温和(leni)的状态(-ency)”。\n助记\nleni（=lenis 温和，参 lenient）+ -ency（名词后缀）→ 温和的状态→宽大、仁慈\n例句\nThe judge showed ==leniency== to the young first-time offender.","fields":{"Front":"leniency","Back":"释义\n仁慈 宽容\n词根词缀\nleni柔软、温和（lenis）+-ency名词后缀\n宽大、温和——“柔软/温和(leni)的状态(-ency)”。\n助记\nleni（=lenis 温和，参 lenient）+ -ency（名词后缀）→ 温和的状态→宽大、仁慈\n例句\nThe judge showed ==leniency== to the young first-time offender.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352319","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"loquacious","back":"释义\n饶舌的、多话的\n词根词缀\nloqu说话（loqui）+-acious形容词后缀“倾向…的”\n喋喋不休的、饶舌的——“爱说话(loqu)的(-acious)”。\n助记\nloqu（=loqui 说话，参 eloquent、soliloquy）+ -acious（倾向…的）→ 爱说话的→饶舌的、喋喋不休的\n例句\nMy ==loquacious== uncle can talk for hours without stopping.","fields":{"Front":"loquacious","Back":"释义\n饶舌的、多话的\n词根词缀\nloqu说话（loqui）+-acious形容词后缀“倾向…的”\n喋喋不休的、饶舌的——“爱说话(loqu)的(-acious)”。\n助记\nloqu（=loqui 说话，参 eloquent、soliloquy）+ -acious（倾向…的）→ 爱说话的→饶舌的、喋喋不休的\n例句\nMy ==loquacious== uncle can talk for hours without stopping.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352321","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mediocre","back":"释义\n平庸的、普通的\n词根词缀\nmedi中间的（medius）+\n平庸的——Lat. mediocris“中等的”，由medius“中间”+ocris“尖山”构成，原指“半山腰的”，即不高不低。\n助记\nmedi（=medius 中间，参 medium）+ ocris（尖山）→ 停在半山腰、不高不低→平庸的\n例句\nThe movie was only ==mediocre== and quickly forgotten.","fields":{"Front":"mediocre","Back":"释义\n平庸的、普通的\n词根词缀\nmedi中间的（medius）+\n平庸的——Lat. mediocris“中等的”，由medius“中间”+ocris“尖山”构成，原指“半山腰的”，即不高不低。\n助记\nmedi（=medius 中间，参 medium）+ ocris（尖山）→ 停在半山腰、不高不低→平庸的\n例句\nThe movie was only ==mediocre== and quickly forgotten.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352323","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"misnomer","back":"释义\n误称；用词不当\n词根词缀\nmis-错误地、坏地+nomer名字（Lat. nomen）\n误用名称、误称——“错误(mis-)地称呼名字(nomer)”。\n助记\nmis-（错误地）+ nomer（=nomen 名字，参 name、nominate、nomenclature）→ 错叫名字→误称\n例句\nCalling it a library is a ==misnomer== since the place mainly sells books.","fields":{"Front":"misnomer","Back":"释义\n误称；用词不当\n词根词缀\nmis-错误地、坏地+nomer名字（Lat. nomen）\n误用名称、误称——“错误(mis-)地称呼名字(nomer)”。\n助记\nmis-（错误地）+ nomer（=nomen 名字，参 name、nominate、nomenclature）→ 错叫名字→误称\n例句\nCalling it a library is a ==misnomer== since the place mainly sells books.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352325","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mitigate","back":"释义\n减轻；缓和\n词根词缀\nmit温和的（mitis）+-igate动词后缀（-igare）\n减轻、缓和——“使(-igate)温和(mit)”。\n助记\nmit（=mitis 温和）+ -igate（=-igare 使…，参 navigate）→ 使变温和→减轻、缓和\n例句\nWearing a helmet can ==mitigate== the risk of head injury.","fields":{"Front":"mitigate","Back":"释义\n减轻；缓和\n词根词缀\nmit温和的（mitis）+-igate动词后缀（-igare）\n减轻、缓和——“使(-igate)温和(mit)”。\n助记\nmit（=mitis 温和）+ -igate（=-igare 使…，参 navigate）→ 使变温和→减轻、缓和\n例句\nWearing a helmet can ==mitigate== the risk of head injury.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352327","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"moribund","back":"释义\n垂死的、濒死的\n词根词缀\nmori死亡（mori）+-bund形容词后缀“正在…状态”\n垂死的、即将消亡的——“正在死(mori)的(-bund)”。\n助记\nmori（=mori 死亡，参 mortal、mortality）+ -bund（正在…的）→ 正在走向死亡的→垂死的\n例句\nThe once thriving industry is now ==moribund== and slowly dying.","fields":{"Front":"moribund","Back":"释义\n垂死的、濒死的\n词根词缀\nmori死亡（mori）+-bund形容词后缀“正在…状态”\n垂死的、即将消亡的——“正在死(mori)的(-bund)”。\n助记\nmori（=mori 死亡，参 mortal、mortality）+ -bund（正在…的）→ 正在走向死亡的→垂死的\n例句\nThe once thriving industry is now ==moribund== and slowly dying.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352329","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"obsolete","back":"释义\n过时的；废弃的\n词根词缀\nob-离开、相反+solet习惯于（solere）+-e形容词尾\n过时的、废弃的——“不再(ob-)被人惯常使用(solet)的”。\n助记\nob-（离开、相反）+ sol（=solere 习惯，参 insolent 同根）→ 不再被习惯使用的→过时的、废弃的\n例句\nYou are absolute ==obsolete==.","fields":{"Front":"obsolete","Back":"释义\n过时的；废弃的\n词根词缀\nob-离开、相反+solet习惯于（solere）+-e形容词尾\n过时的、废弃的——“不再(ob-)被人惯常使用(solet)的”。\n助记\nob-（离开、相反）+ sol（=solere 习惯，参 insolent 同根）→ 不再被习惯使用的→过时的、废弃的\n例句\nYou are absolute ==obsolete==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352331","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"zealot","back":"释义\n狂热分子\n词根词缀\nzeal热情、嫉妒（zelos）+-ot名词后缀“…者”\n狂热者、热心者——“充满热情(zeal)的人(-ot)”。\n助记\nzeal（=zelos 热情，参 zealous）+ -ot（…者）→ 充满热情的人→狂热者\n例句\nThe religious ==zealot== refused to listen to any opposing views.","fields":{"Front":"zealot","Back":"释义\n狂热分子\n词根词缀\nzeal热情、嫉妒（zelos）+-ot名词后缀“…者”\n狂热者、热心者——“充满热情(zeal)的人(-ot)”。\n助记\nzeal（=zelos 热情，参 zealous）+ -ot（…者）→ 充满热情的人→狂热者\n例句\nThe religious ==zealot== refused to listen to any opposing views.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352333","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"omission","back":"释义\n遗漏；疏忽\n词根词缀\no-=ob-“离开、忽略”+miss送、放出（mittere的过去分词missus）+-ion名词后缀\n遗漏、省略——“放(o-=ob-)出去/放过(miss)的行为(-ion)”。\n助记\no-（ob- 离开、忽略）+ miss（=mittere 放、送，参 omit、mission）+ -ion（名词）→ 放过、漏掉→遗漏、省略\n例句\nThere was a serious ==omission== in the final report.","fields":{"Front":"omission","Back":"释义\n遗漏；疏忽\n词根词缀\no-=ob-“离开、忽略”+miss送、放出（mittere的过去分词missus）+-ion名词后缀\n遗漏、省略——“放(o-=ob-)出去/放过(miss)的行为(-ion)”。\n助记\no-（ob- 离开、忽略）+ miss（=mittere 放、送，参 omit、mission）+ -ion（名词）→ 放过、漏掉→遗漏、省略\n例句\nThere was a serious ==omission== in the final report.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352335","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"admonition","back":"释义\n告诫；警告\n词根词缀\nad-朝向、加强+mon警告（monere）+-ition名词后缀\n告诫、警告——“对(ad-)…警告(mon)的行为(-ition)”。\n助记\nad-（加强）+ mon（=monere 警告，参 monitor、admonish）+ -ition（名词）→ 警告、告诫\n例句\nThe teacher's gentle ==admonition== helped the student correct his behavior.","fields":{"Front":"admonition","Back":"释义\n告诫；警告\n词根词缀\nad-朝向、加强+mon警告（monere）+-ition名词后缀\n告诫、警告——“对(ad-)…警告(mon)的行为(-ition)”。\n助记\nad-（加强）+ mon（=monere 警告，参 monitor、admonish）+ -ition（名词）→ 警告、告诫\n例句\nThe teacher's gentle ==admonition== helped the student correct his behavior.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352337","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"amorphous","back":"释义\n无定形的\n词根词缀\na-无、没有+morph形状、形态（morphe）+-ous形容词后缀\n无定形的、模糊的——“无(a-)形状(morph)的(-ous)”。\n助记\na-（无）+ morph（=morphe 形状，参 morphology、metamorphosis）+ -ous（…的）→ 无形状的、模糊的\n例句\nThe ==amorphous== blob of clay had no definite shape.","fields":{"Front":"amorphous","Back":"释义\n无定形的\n词根词缀\na-无、没有+morph形状、形态（morphe）+-ous形容词后缀\n无定形的、模糊的——“无(a-)形状(morph)的(-ous)”。\n助记\na-（无）+ morph（=morphe 形状，参 morphology、metamorphosis）+ -ous（…的）→ 无形状的、模糊的\n例句\nThe ==amorphous== blob of clay had no definite shape.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352339","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"anachronistic","back":"释义\n时代错误\n词根词缀\nana-向后、颠倒+chron时间（khronos）+-istic复合形容词后缀\n时代错误的——“时间(chron)颠倒(ana-)的性质(-istic)”，把事物放错时代。\n助记\nana-（颠倒、向后）+ chron（=khronos 时间，参 chronic）+ -istic（…的）→ 时间颠倒、放错时代的→不合时代的\n例句\nThe clock in the medieval scene was an ==anachronistic== detail.","fields":{"Front":"anachronistic","Back":"释义\n时代错误\n词根词缀\nana-向后、颠倒+chron时间（khronos）+-istic复合形容词后缀\n时代错误的——“时间(chron)颠倒(ana-)的性质(-istic)”，把事物放错时代。\n助记\nana-（颠倒、向后）+ chron（=khronos 时间，参 chronic）+ -istic（…的）→ 时间颠倒、放错时代的→不合时代的\n例句\nThe clock in the medieval scene was an ==anachronistic== detail.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"sat800-list-04","name":"SAT800 核心 › List 04","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["sat800","imported"],"options":{},"cards":[{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352341","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"straightforward","back":"释义\n直率的；简单的\n词根词缀\nstraight + forward直的 + 向前\n复合词：straight（直接的、笔直的，源自古英语streht，动词streccan'伸展'的过去分词）+ forward（向前，古英语forweard）。字面'径直向前'，引申为'坦率的、简单直接的'。\n助记\nstraight（直）+ forward（向前）→ 径直向前→直率的、简单易懂的\n例句\nThe answer to the question is quite ==straightforward==.","fields":{"Front":"straightforward","Back":"释义\n直率的；简单的\n词根词缀\nstraight + forward直的 + 向前\n复合词：straight（直接的、笔直的，源自古英语streht，动词streccan'伸展'的过去分词）+ forward（向前，古英语forweard）。字面'径直向前'，引申为'坦率的、简单直接的'。\n助记\nstraight（直）+ forward（向前）→ 径直向前→直率的、简单易懂的\n例句\nThe answer to the question is quite ==straightforward==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352343","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"strenuously","back":"释义\n费力地；奋力地\n词根词缀\nstrenu-strenuus 积极的、费力的、精力充沛的+-ous + -ly\n拉丁语形容词strenuus（精力充沛、奋力的）→ strenuous（形容词：费力的、强烈的）+ -ly（副词后缀），意为'强烈地、费力地'。\n助记\nstrenu（=strenuus 奋力的，参 strenuous）+ -ous + -ly（副词后缀）→ 奋力地、费力地\n例句\nShe worked ==strenuously== to finish the project before the deadline.","fields":{"Front":"strenuously","Back":"释义\n费力地；奋力地\n词根词缀\nstrenu-strenuus 积极的、费力的、精力充沛的+-ous + -ly\n拉丁语形容词strenuus（精力充沛、奋力的）→ strenuous（形容词：费力的、强烈的）+ -ly（副词后缀），意为'强烈地、费力地'。\n助记\nstrenu（=strenuus 奋力的，参 strenuous）+ -ous + -ly（副词后缀）→ 奋力地、费力地\n例句\nShe worked ==strenuously== to finish the project before the deadline.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352345","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"subdue","back":"释义\n征服；抑制\n词根词缀\nsub-在……之下；向下+ducere引导、带领（PIE *deuk-）\n拉丁语subducere（sub-向下+ducere引导，'从下面拉开、撤走'），经古法语souduire进入中古英语；词义受拉丁语subdere'置于其下、征服'影响，演变为'制服、使服从'。\n助记\nsub-（在下面）+ due（=ducere 引导，参 duke、produce）→ 拉到下面、置于其下→征服、克制\n例句\nFirefighters worked hard to ==subdue== the raging blaze.","fields":{"Front":"subdue","Back":"释义\n征服；抑制\n词根词缀\nsub-在……之下；向下+ducere引导、带领（PIE *deuk-）\n拉丁语subducere（sub-向下+ducere引导，'从下面拉开、撤走'），经古法语souduire进入中古英语；词义受拉丁语subdere'置于其下、征服'影响，演变为'制服、使服从'。\n助记\nsub-（在下面）+ due（=ducere 引导，参 duke、produce）→ 拉到下面、置于其下→征服、克制\n例句\nFirefighters worked hard to ==subdue== the raging blaze.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352347","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"substitute","back":"释义\n代替；替代物\n词根词缀\nsub-在……下面；替代+statuere设立、放置（stare'站立'的使役形）+-ite\n拉丁语substituere（sub-在下面+statuere设立），原义'放在下面代替'，名词化后指'替代者、替代品'，动词义'代替'。\n助记\nsub-（在下面、替代）+ stitute（=statuere 设立、放，参 constitute、statue）→ 放在下面顶替→替代者、替代品\n例句\nYou can ==substitute== honey for sugar in this recipe.","fields":{"Front":"substitute","Back":"释义\n代替；替代物\n词根词缀\nsub-在……下面；替代+statuere设立、放置（stare'站立'的使役形）+-ite\n拉丁语substituere（sub-在下面+statuere设立），原义'放在下面代替'，名词化后指'替代者、替代品'，动词义'代替'。\n助记\nsub-（在下面、替代）+ stitute（=statuere 设立、放，参 constitute、statue）→ 放在下面顶替→替代者、替代品\n例句\nYou can ==substitute== honey for sugar in this recipe.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352349","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"surrender","back":"释义\n投降；放弃\n词根词缀\nsur-在……之上；向上、完全+render归还、交出（red-回+dare给）\n古法语surrendre（sur-完全+rendre交出），字面'完全交出'，引申为'投降、放弃'。\n助记\nsur-（完全，super-）+ render（=rendre 交出，red- 回 + dare 给）→ 完全交出→投降、放弃\n例句\nAfter a long siege, the soldiers were forced to ==surrender==.","fields":{"Front":"surrender","Back":"释义\n投降；放弃\n词根词缀\nsur-在……之上；向上、完全+render归还、交出（red-回+dare给）\n古法语surrendre（sur-完全+rendre交出），字面'完全交出'，引申为'投降、放弃'。\n助记\nsur-（完全，super-）+ render（=rendre 交出，red- 回 + dare 给）→ 完全交出→投降、放弃\n例句\nAfter a long siege, the soldiers were forced to ==surrender==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352351","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tendentious","back":"释义\n有偏见的、有倾向的\n词根词缀\ntendere伸展、朝向（PIE *ten-）+-ent + -ious\n拉丁语tendere（伸展、朝向）→ tendentia'倾向'（中世纪拉丁语）→ 借德语tendenziös模型造词 tendentious，意为'有倾向性的、带偏见的'。\n助记\ntend（=tendere 伸展、朝向，参 tend、tendency、attend）+ -itious（…的）→ 有朝向的→有倾向的、带偏见的\n例句\nThe article presented a highly ==tendentious== view of the events.","fields":{"Front":"tendentious","Back":"释义\n有偏见的、有倾向的\n词根词缀\ntendere伸展、朝向（PIE *ten-）+-ent + -ious\n拉丁语tendere（伸展、朝向）→ tendentia'倾向'（中世纪拉丁语）→ 借德语tendenziös模型造词 tendentious，意为'有倾向性的、带偏见的'。\n助记\ntend（=tendere 伸展、朝向，参 tend、tendency、attend）+ -itious（…的）→ 有朝向的→有倾向的、带偏见的\n例句\nThe article presented a highly ==tendentious== view of the events.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352353","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"terminate","back":"释义\n终止；结束\n词根词缀\nterminus边界、界限、终点+-ate\n拉丁语terminus（边界、界石）→ terminare'设定边界、结束'→ terminate，意为'使终结、终止'。\n助记\ntermin（=terminus 边界、终点，参 term、terminal、determine）+ -ate（使…）→ 设定边界→终止\n例句\nThe company decided to ==terminate== his contract early.","fields":{"Front":"terminate","Back":"释义\n终止；结束\n词根词缀\nterminus边界、界限、终点+-ate\n拉丁语terminus（边界、界石）→ terminare'设定边界、结束'→ terminate，意为'使终结、终止'。\n助记\ntermin（=terminus 边界、终点，参 term、terminal、determine）+ -ate（使…）→ 设定边界→终止\n例句\nThe company decided to ==terminate== his contract early.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352355","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"texture","back":"释义\n纹理；质地\n词根词缀\ntexere编织、织造（PIE *teks-）+-ure\n拉丁语texere（编织）的过去分词textus→textura'织物结构'，引申为'质地、纹理、结构'。\n助记\ntext（=texere 编织，参 textile、context）+ -ure（名词后缀）→ 编织物的结构→质地、纹理\n例句\nThe fabric has a rough ==texture== that feels unusual.","fields":{"Front":"texture","Back":"释义\n纹理；质地\n词根词缀\ntexere编织、织造（PIE *teks-）+-ure\n拉丁语texere（编织）的过去分词textus→textura'织物结构'，引申为'质地、纹理、结构'。\n助记\ntext（=texere 编织，参 textile、context）+ -ure（名词后缀）→ 编织物的结构→质地、纹理\n例句\nThe fabric has a rough ==texture== that feels unusual.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352357","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"theoretical","back":"释义\n理论上的\n词根词缀\ntheorein观看、思索、审视（theoria=观察）+-etic + -al\n希腊语theorein（观看、沉思）→ theoretikos'爱沉思的'→ 英语theoretical，意为'理论的、理论上的'。\n助记\ntheor（=theorein 观看、思索，theoria，参 theory、theater）+ -etical（…的）→ 沉思所得的→理论上的\n例句\nHis knowledge of the subject is purely ==theoretical==, not practical.","fields":{"Front":"theoretical","Back":"释义\n理论上的\n词根词缀\ntheorein观看、思索、审视（theoria=观察）+-etic + -al\n希腊语theorein（观看、沉思）→ theoretikos'爱沉思的'→ 英语theoretical，意为'理论的、理论上的'。\n助记\ntheor（=theorein 观看、思索，theoria，参 theory、theater）+ -etical（…的）→ 沉思所得的→理论上的\n例句\nHis knowledge of the subject is purely ==theoretical==, not practical.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352359","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"totalitarian","back":"释义\n极权者；极权的\n词根词缀\ntotus全部、整个+-itarian\n英语total（整体，源自拉丁语totus）+ -itarian（仿意大利语fascismo totalitario'极权主义'），指'极权主义的；极权主义者'。\n助记\ntotal（=totus 全部，参 totality）+ -itarian（…政体的）→ 把一切都掌控的→极权主义的\n例句\nThe ==totalitarian== regime controlled every aspect of public life.","fields":{"Front":"totalitarian","Back":"释义\n极权者；极权的\n词根词缀\ntotus全部、整个+-itarian\n英语total（整体，源自拉丁语totus）+ -itarian（仿意大利语fascismo totalitario'极权主义'），指'极权主义的；极权主义者'。\n助记\ntotal（=totus 全部，参 totality）+ -itarian（…政体的）→ 把一切都掌控的→极权主义的\n例句\nThe ==totalitarian== regime controlled every aspect of public life.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352361","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tropical","back":"释义\n热带的\n词根词缀\ntrope旋转、转向（太阳回归线）+-al\n希腊语tropos（旋转）→ tropikos（太阳回归线的）→ 拉丁语tropicalis→英语tropical，指'热带的'（回归线之间的地区）。\n助记\ntrop（=tropos 旋转，太阳回归线，参 tropic）+ -ical（…的）→ 回归线之间的→热带的\n例句\nBananas and mangoes grow well in the ==tropical== climate.","fields":{"Front":"tropical","Back":"释义\n热带的\n词根词缀\ntrope旋转、转向（太阳回归线）+-al\n希腊语tropos（旋转）→ tropikos（太阳回归线的）→ 拉丁语tropicalis→英语tropical，指'热带的'（回归线之间的地区）。\n助记\ntrop（=tropos 旋转，太阳回归线，参 tropic）+ -ical（…的）→ 回归线之间的→热带的\n例句\nBananas and mangoes grow well in the ==tropical== climate.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352363","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"unswerving","back":"释义\n坚定不移\n词根词缀\nun-否定、不+swerve转向、偏离+-ing\nun-（不）+ swerving（偏离的，源自古英语sweorfan'转开'），字面'不偏离的'，引申为'坚定的、始终如一的'。\n助记\nun-（不）+ swerving（=swerve 转向、偏离，古英语 sweorfan 转开）→ 不偏离的→坚定的、始终如一的\n例句\nShe showed ==unswerving== loyalty to her friends through thick and thin.","fields":{"Front":"unswerving","Back":"释义\n坚定不移\n词根词缀\nun-否定、不+swerve转向、偏离+-ing\nun-（不）+ swerving（偏离的，源自古英语sweorfan'转开'），字面'不偏离的'，引申为'坚定的、始终如一的'。\n助记\nun-（不）+ swerving（=swerve 转向、偏离，古英语 sweorfan 转开）→ 不偏离的→坚定的、始终如一的\n例句\nShe showed ==unswerving== loyalty to her friends through thick and thin.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352365","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"usurp","back":"释义\n篡夺；篡位\n词根词缀\nu- (ab-)背离、远离（这里表非法使用）+rapere抓取、夺取（PIE *rep-）\n拉丁语usurpare（usu'使用'+rapere'夺取'，'擅用、侵占'），经古法语usurper进入英语，意为'篡夺、篡位、侵占'。\n助记\nusu（使用）+ surp（=rapere 夺取，参 rapid）→ 擅用、夺取→篡夺、篡位、侵占\n例句\nThe ambitious general tried to ==usurp== the throne from the rightful king.","fields":{"Front":"usurp","Back":"释义\n篡夺；篡位\n词根词缀\nu- (ab-)背离、远离（这里表非法使用）+rapere抓取、夺取（PIE *rep-）\n拉丁语usurpare（usu'使用'+rapere'夺取'，'擅用、侵占'），经古法语usurper进入英语，意为'篡夺、篡位、侵占'。\n助记\nusu（使用）+ surp（=rapere 夺取，参 rapid）→ 擅用、夺取→篡夺、篡位、侵占\n例句\nThe ambitious general tried to ==usurp== the throne from the rightful king.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352367","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"vague","back":"释义\n含糊的；模糊的\n词根词缀\nvag漫游、游离（vagus）+-ue形容词词尾\n游移不定、飘来飘去的→模糊的、含糊的。\n助记\nvag（漫游，参 vagrant 流浪者；音近 VOGUE）→ 思绪到处飘、抓不住的→模糊的、含糊的。\n例句\nHe gave a ==vague== answer that did not satisfy the committee.","fields":{"Front":"vague","Back":"释义\n含糊的；模糊的\n词根词缀\nvag漫游、游离（vagus）+-ue形容词词尾\n游移不定、飘来飘去的→模糊的、含糊的。\n助记\nvag（漫游，参 vagrant 流浪者；音近 VOGUE）→ 思绪到处飘、抓不住的→模糊的、含糊的。\n例句\nHe gave a ==vague== answer that did not satisfy the committee.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352369","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"aversion","back":"释义\n厌恶；反感\n词根词缀\na- (ab-)离开、远离+vertere转（PIE *wer-）+-ion\n拉丁语avertere（ab-离开+vertere转，'转开、回避'）的过去分词versus→aversio，引申为'厌恶、反感'（转开不看）。\n助记\na-（ab- 离开）+ vers（=vertere 转，参 reverse、convert、versus）+ -ion（名词）→ 转开脸不看→厌恶、反感\n例句\nShe has a strong ==aversion== to loud and crowded places.","fields":{"Front":"aversion","Back":"释义\n厌恶；反感\n词根词缀\na- (ab-)离开、远离+vertere转（PIE *wer-）+-ion\n拉丁语avertere（ab-离开+vertere转，'转开、回避'）的过去分词versus→aversio，引申为'厌恶、反感'（转开不看）。\n助记\na-（ab- 离开）+ vers（=vertere 转，参 reverse、convert、versus）+ -ion（名词）→ 转开脸不看→厌恶、反感\n例句\nShe has a strong ==aversion== to loud and crowded places.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352371","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"barter","back":"释义\n以物易物\n词根词缀\nbarater交易、欺骗、讨价还价\n简单词（无可分析的前缀后缀）：中古英语barteren，源自古法语barater'以物易物、欺骗、讨价还价'（12世纪），词源不确定，可能来自凯尔特语（比较爱尔兰语brath'背叛'）。'贸易'与'欺骗'语义在多语言中相通。\n助记\n古法语 barater「以物易物、讨价还价」（贸易与讨价、欺诈义相通）→ 以物易物\n例句\nIn the ancient market, people would ==barter== goods instead of using money.","fields":{"Front":"barter","Back":"释义\n以物易物\n词根词缀\nbarater交易、欺骗、讨价还价\n简单词（无可分析的前缀后缀）：中古英语barteren，源自古法语barater'以物易物、欺骗、讨价还价'（12世纪），词源不确定，可能来自凯尔特语（比较爱尔兰语brath'背叛'）。'贸易'与'欺骗'语义在多语言中相通。\n助记\n古法语 barater「以物易物、讨价还价」（贸易与讨价、欺诈义相通）→ 以物易物\n例句\nIn the ancient market, people would ==barter== goods instead of using money.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352373","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"benefactor","back":"释义\n捐助者；恩人\n词根词缀\nbene-好地、善+facere做、干（PIE *dhe-）+-or\n拉丁语benefactor（bene好+facere做+-or者），字面'做好事的人'，即'捐助者、行善者'。\n助记\nbene-（好）+ fact（=facere 做，参 factory、manufacture）+ -or（…者）→ 做好事的人→恩人、赞助人\n例句\nThe wealthy ==benefactor== donated millions to the new library.","fields":{"Front":"benefactor","Back":"释义\n捐助者；恩人\n词根词缀\nbene-好地、善+facere做、干（PIE *dhe-）+-or\n拉丁语benefactor（bene好+facere做+-or者），字面'做好事的人'，即'捐助者、行善者'。\n助记\nbene-（好）+ fact（=facere 做，参 factory、manufacture）+ -or（…者）→ 做好事的人→恩人、赞助人\n例句\nThe wealthy ==benefactor== donated millions to the new library.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352375","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cataclysmic","back":"释义\n灾难性的；剧变的\n词根词缀\ncata-向下、完全+klyzein冲刷、淹没+-mic (-mic)\n希腊语kataklysmos（cata-完全+klyzein冲刷，'大洪水'）→英语cataclysm（大洪水、大灾难）+ -ic → cataclysmic，意为'灾变的、剧变的'。\n助记\ncata-（向下、完全）+ clysm（=klyzein 冲刷，参 cataclysm、cataract）+ -ic（…的）→ 大洪水般的→灾难性的\n例句\nThe earthquake had ==cataclysmic== effects on the coastal city.","fields":{"Front":"cataclysmic","Back":"释义\n灾难性的；剧变的\n词根词缀\ncata-向下、完全+klyzein冲刷、淹没+-mic (-mic)\n希腊语kataklysmos（cata-完全+klyzein冲刷，'大洪水'）→英语cataclysm（大洪水、大灾难）+ -ic → cataclysmic，意为'灾变的、剧变的'。\n助记\ncata-（向下、完全）+ clysm（=klyzein 冲刷，参 cataclysm、cataract）+ -ic（…的）→ 大洪水般的→灾难性的\n例句\nThe earthquake had ==cataclysmic== effects on the coastal city.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352377","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"catastrophic","back":"释义\n灾难性的\n词根词缀\ncata-向下、完全+strephein转动、翻转+-ic\n希腊语katastrophe（cata-向下+strephein转，'翻转、结局'，原指戏剧结局）→英语catastrophe（灾难）+ -ic → catastrophic，意为'灾难性的'。\n助记\ncata-（向下）+ stroph（=strephein 转，参 apostrophe）+ -ic（…的）→ 急转直下的→灾难性的\n例句\nThe flood had ==catastrophic== consequences for the farming community.","fields":{"Front":"catastrophic","Back":"释义\n灾难性的\n词根词缀\ncata-向下、完全+strephein转动、翻转+-ic\n希腊语katastrophe（cata-向下+strephein转，'翻转、结局'，原指戏剧结局）→英语catastrophe（灾难）+ -ic → catastrophic，意为'灾难性的'。\n助记\ncata-（向下）+ stroph（=strephein 转，参 apostrophe）+ -ic（…的）→ 急转直下的→灾难性的\n例句\nThe flood had ==catastrophic== consequences for the farming community.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352379","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"complacent","back":"释义\n自满的、得意的\n词根词缀\ncom-完全（加强语气）+placere使高兴、取悦（PIE *plak-）+-ent\n拉丁语complacere（com-完全+placere取悦，'非常讨人喜欢'）→ complacens，意为'自满的、得意的'（自我满足）。\n助记\ncom-（完全）+ plac（=placere 取悦，参 please、placid）+ -ent（…的）→ 对自己完全满意的→自满的、得意的\n例句\nThe team became ==complacent== after winning several games in a row.","fields":{"Front":"complacent","Back":"释义\n自满的、得意的\n词根词缀\ncom-完全（加强语气）+placere使高兴、取悦（PIE *plak-）+-ent\n拉丁语complacere（com-完全+placere取悦，'非常讨人喜欢'）→ complacens，意为'自满的、得意的'（自我满足）。\n助记\ncom-（完全）+ plac（=placere 取悦，参 please、placid）+ -ent（…的）→ 对自己完全满意的→自满的、得意的\n例句\nThe team became ==complacent== after winning several games in a row.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352381","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"composer","back":"释义\n作曲家\n词根词缀\ncom-一起+pos放置（ponere的过去分词positus）+-er名词后缀“做…的人”\n作曲家、创作者——“把东西放在一起(com-+pos)的人(-er)”。\n助记\ncom-（一起）+ pos（=ponere 放，参 compose、position）+ -er（…的人）→ 把素材组合起来的人→作曲家；动词义「构成、使平静」\n例句\nShe is a famous ==composer== of modern classical music.","fields":{"Front":"composer","Back":"释义\n作曲家\n词根词缀\ncom-一起+pos放置（ponere的过去分词positus）+-er名词后缀“做…的人”\n作曲家、创作者——“把东西放在一起(com-+pos)的人(-er)”。\n助记\ncom-（一起）+ pos（=ponere 放，参 compose、position）+ -er（…的人）→ 把素材组合起来的人→作曲家；动词义「构成、使平静」\n例句\nShe is a famous ==composer== of modern classical music.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352383","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"counterfeit","back":"释义\n伪造；仿品\n词根词缀\ncounter-对抗、假冒+facere做、制造\n古法语contrefait（contre-相反+fait做，'伪造的'，拉丁语contra+facere的过去分词factus），字面'反着做、照原样伪造'，意为'伪造品；假冒的'。\n助记\ncounter-（反、对着）+ feit（=facere 做，参 fact、manufacture）→ 反着照原样做→伪造的、假冒的\n例句\nThe police seized a large number of ==counterfeit== bills.","fields":{"Front":"counterfeit","Back":"释义\n伪造；仿品\n词根词缀\ncounter-对抗、假冒+facere做、制造\n古法语contrefait（contre-相反+fait做，'伪造的'，拉丁语contra+facere的过去分词factus），字面'反着做、照原样伪造'，意为'伪造品；假冒的'。\n助记\ncounter-（反、对着）+ feit（=facere 做，参 fact、manufacture）→ 反着照原样做→伪造的、假冒的\n例句\nThe police seized a large number of ==counterfeit== bills.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352385","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"critique","back":"释义\n评论；批判\n词根词缀\nkritikos有判断力的（krites=法官，krinein=判断）\n借自法语critique，最终来自希腊语kritikos'能辨别判断的'（krinein'分离、判断'），意为'批评、评论；评论文章'。\n助记\n希腊 kritikos（=krinein 辨别、判断，参 critic、criterion）→ 加以评判的文章→批评、评论\n例句\nThe professor offered a thoughtful ==critique== of the student's essay.","fields":{"Front":"critique","Back":"释义\n评论；批判\n词根词缀\nkritikos有判断力的（krites=法官，krinein=判断）\n借自法语critique，最终来自希腊语kritikos'能辨别判断的'（krinein'分离、判断'），意为'批评、评论；评论文章'。\n助记\n希腊 kritikos（=krinein 辨别、判断，参 critic、criterion）→ 加以评判的文章→批评、评论\n例句\nThe professor offered a thoughtful ==critique== of the student's essay.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352387","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"crystallize","back":"释义\n具体化；结晶\n词根词缀\nkrystallos冰、水晶（kryos=霜、寒）+-ize\n希腊语krystallos'冰、水晶'→拉丁语crystallum→英语crystal+ -ize（动词后缀），意为'结晶；具体化、成形'。\n助记\ncrystal（=krystallos 冰、水晶，kryos 霜寒）+ -ize（使…）→ 使成水晶般→结晶、使想法明确成形\n例句\nHer ideas began to ==crystallize== after the long discussion.","fields":{"Front":"crystallize","Back":"释义\n具体化；结晶\n词根词缀\nkrystallos冰、水晶（kryos=霜、寒）+-ize\n希腊语krystallos'冰、水晶'→拉丁语crystallum→英语crystal+ -ize（动词后缀），意为'结晶；具体化、成形'。\n助记\ncrystal（=krystallos 冰、水晶，kryos 霜寒）+ -ize（使…）→ 使成水晶般→结晶、使想法明确成形\n例句\nHer ideas began to ==crystallize== after the long discussion.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352389","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"demolition","back":"释义\n拆除；破坏\n词根词缀\nde-向下、毁坏+moliri建造、费力行事（moles=大块石）+-ion\n拉丁语demoliri（de-向下+moliri建造，'拆毁所建之物'）→demolitio，意为'拆除、破坏'。\n助记\nde-（向下、毁坏）+ mol（=moliri 建造，moles 巨石）+ -ition（名词）→ 拆掉所建之物→拆除、击溃\n例句\nThe ==demolition== of the old building took only a few days.","fields":{"Front":"demolition","Back":"释义\n拆除；破坏\n词根词缀\nde-向下、毁坏+moliri建造、费力行事（moles=大块石）+-ion\n拉丁语demoliri（de-向下+moliri建造，'拆毁所建之物'）→demolitio，意为'拆除、破坏'。\n助记\nde-（向下、毁坏）+ mol（=moliri 建造，moles 巨石）+ -ition（名词）→ 拆掉所建之物→拆除、击溃\n例句\nThe ==demolition== of the old building took only a few days.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352391","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"disconcerting","back":"释义\n令人不安\n词根词缀\ndis-相反、取消+concert共同协调、一起争斗（certare=争论）+-ing\n古法语disconcerter（dis-取消+concerter协调，'打乱协调'）→英语disconcert+ -ing，意为'令人不安的、令人尴尬的'（打乱节奏使人失态）。\n助记\ndis-（取消）+ concert（=concertare 协调，参 concert）+ -ing（…的）→ 打乱协调、使人失态的→令人不安的\n例句\nIt was slightly ==disconcerting== to be stared at by the whole class.","fields":{"Front":"disconcerting","Back":"释义\n令人不安\n词根词缀\ndis-相反、取消+concert共同协调、一起争斗（certare=争论）+-ing\n古法语disconcerter（dis-取消+concerter协调，'打乱协调'）→英语disconcert+ -ing，意为'令人不安的、令人尴尬的'（打乱节奏使人失态）。\n助记\ndis-（取消）+ concert（=concertare 协调，参 concert）+ -ing（…的）→ 打乱协调、使人失态的→令人不安的\n例句\nIt was slightly ==disconcerting== to be stared at by the whole class.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352393","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"disparage","back":"释义\n贬损；蔑视\n词根词缀\ndis-贬损、降低+par同等、门第相当（par=平等）\n古法语desparagier（dis-不+parage门第相当，'下嫁、贬低门第'，源自拉丁语par'平等'），引申为'贬低、轻视'。\n助记\ndis-（不）+ par（=par 平等、门第，参 pair、disparity）+ -age（动词）→ 贬低门第、拉不到同等→轻视、贬低\n例句\nHe tried to ==disparage== her achievement by calling it luck.","fields":{"Front":"disparage","Back":"释义\n贬损；蔑视\n词根词缀\ndis-贬损、降低+par同等、门第相当（par=平等）\n古法语desparagier（dis-不+parage门第相当，'下嫁、贬低门第'，源自拉丁语par'平等'），引申为'贬低、轻视'。\n助记\ndis-（不）+ par（=par 平等、门第，参 pair、disparity）+ -age（动词）→ 贬低门第、拉不到同等→轻视、贬低\n例句\nHe tried to ==disparage== her achievement by calling it luck.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352395","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dispassionate","back":"释义\n冷静的、客观的\n词根词缀\ndis-去除、否定+pati忍受、感受（passio=激情）+-ate\ndis-（去除）+ passion（激情，拉丁语pati'忍受'的名词passio）+ -ate，字面'不带激情的'，意为'冷静的、客观公正的'。\n助记\ndis-（去除）+ passion（=passio 激情，pass-=pati 感受，参 passive）+ -ate（…的）→ 不带激情的→冷静的、客观的\n例句\nThe scientist gave a ==dispassionate== account of the results.","fields":{"Front":"dispassionate","Back":"释义\n冷静的、客观的\n词根词缀\ndis-去除、否定+pati忍受、感受（passio=激情）+-ate\ndis-（去除）+ passion（激情，拉丁语pati'忍受'的名词passio）+ -ate，字面'不带激情的'，意为'冷静的、客观公正的'。\n助记\ndis-（去除）+ passion（=passio 激情，pass-=pati 感受，参 passive）+ -ate（…的）→ 不带激情的→冷静的、客观的\n例句\nThe scientist gave a ==dispassionate== account of the results.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352397","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"distort","back":"释义\n扭曲；歪曲\n词根词缀\ndis-分开、向不同方向+torquere拧、扭转（PIE *terkw-）\n拉丁语distorquere（dis-分开+torquere拧，'扭歪'）的过去分词distortus→英语distort，意为'扭曲、歪曲'。\n助记\ndis-（分开）+ tort（=torquere 拧，参 torture、retort、contort）→ 向不同方向拧→扭曲、歪曲\n例句\nThe article attempted to ==distort== the facts to prove a point.","fields":{"Front":"distort","Back":"释义\n扭曲；歪曲\n词根词缀\ndis-分开、向不同方向+torquere拧、扭转（PIE *terkw-）\n拉丁语distorquere（dis-分开+torquere拧，'扭歪'）的过去分词distortus→英语distort，意为'扭曲、歪曲'。\n助记\ndis-（分开）+ tort（=torquere 拧，参 torture、retort、contort）→ 向不同方向拧→扭曲、歪曲\n例句\nThe article attempted to ==distort== the facts to prove a point.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352399","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"distraction","back":"释义\n分心；消遣\n词根词缀\ndis-分开、偏离+trahere拉、拖（PIE *tragh-）+-ion\n拉丁语distrahere（dis-分开+trahere拉，'拉走、分心'）的过去分词districtus→distractio，意为'分心、注意力分散；娱乐消遣'。\n助记\ndis-（分开）+ tract（=trahere 拉，参 attract、tractor、extract）+ -ion（名词）→ 把注意力拉走→分心、消遣\n例句\nThe loud music was a constant ==distraction== while I was studying.","fields":{"Front":"distraction","Back":"释义\n分心；消遣\n词根词缀\ndis-分开、偏离+trahere拉、拖（PIE *tragh-）+-ion\n拉丁语distrahere（dis-分开+trahere拉，'拉走、分心'）的过去分词districtus→distractio，意为'分心、注意力分散；娱乐消遣'。\n助记\ndis-（分开）+ tract（=trahere 拉，参 attract、tractor、extract）+ -ion（名词）→ 把注意力拉走→分心、消遣\n例句\nThe loud music was a constant ==distraction== while I was studying.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352401","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"eccentric","back":"释义\n古怪的；n.怪人\n词根词缀\nec-出、脱离+centr中心（kentron）+-ic形容词后缀\n希腊语 ekkentros = ek-（脱离）+ kentron（中心），原指圆周“偏离圆心的”，引申为人“古怪的、不合常规的”。\n助记\nec-（ex- 脱离）+ centr（=kentron 中心，参 center、central）+ -ic（…的）→ 偏离圆心的→古怪的、不合常规的\n例句\nThe ==eccentric== professor wore a different hat every single day.","fields":{"Front":"eccentric","Back":"释义\n古怪的；n.怪人\n词根词缀\nec-出、脱离+centr中心（kentron）+-ic形容词后缀\n希腊语 ekkentros = ek-（脱离）+ kentron（中心），原指圆周“偏离圆心的”，引申为人“古怪的、不合常规的”。\n助记\nec-（ex- 脱离）+ centr（=kentron 中心，参 center、central）+ -ic（…的）→ 偏离圆心的→古怪的、不合常规的\n例句\nThe ==eccentric== professor wore a different hat every single day.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352403","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"edifying","back":"释义\n启迪的\n词根词缀\ne- (ex-)向上、彻底+aedificare建造（aedes神庙+facere做）+-ing\n拉丁语aedificare（建造）→ 中世纪拉丁语引申为'灵魂上的建造、教化'→英语edify+ -ing，意为'有启迪意义的、陶冶情操的'。\n助记\ne-（ex- 向上）+ dify（=aedes 房屋 + facere 建造，edify 原义建房）→ 建造灵魂的→启迪的、陶冶的\n例句\nThe old priest gave an ==edifying== talk about kindness and forgiveness.","fields":{"Front":"edifying","Back":"释义\n启迪的\n词根词缀\ne- (ex-)向上、彻底+aedificare建造（aedes神庙+facere做）+-ing\n拉丁语aedificare（建造）→ 中世纪拉丁语引申为'灵魂上的建造、教化'→英语edify+ -ing，意为'有启迪意义的、陶冶情操的'。\n助记\ne-（ex- 向上）+ dify（=aedes 房屋 + facere 建造，edify 原义建房）→ 建造灵魂的→启迪的、陶冶的\n例句\nThe old priest gave an ==edifying== talk about kindness and forgiveness.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352405","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"elite","back":"释义\nn.精英；杰出的\n词根词缀\neligere选出（e-出+legere选）\n借自法语élite（过去分词作名词，'被选出的'），源自古法语eslire<拉丁语eligere（e-出+legere选），意为'精英、上层人士'。\n助记\ne-（ex- 出）+ lite（=legere 选，参 elect、select、eligible）→ 被挑选出来的（人）→精英、出类拔萃者\n例句\nThe university admits only the academic ==elite== of the country.","fields":{"Front":"elite","Back":"释义\nn.精英；杰出的\n词根词缀\neligere选出（e-出+legere选）\n借自法语élite（过去分词作名词，'被选出的'），源自古法语eslire<拉丁语eligere（e-出+legere选），意为'精英、上层人士'。\n助记\ne-（ex- 出）+ lite（=legere 选，参 elect、select、eligible）→ 被挑选出来的（人）→精英、出类拔萃者\n例句\nThe university admits only the academic ==elite== of the country.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352407","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"embrace","back":"释义\n拥抱；接纳\n词根词缀\nem- (en-)进入、使……+brace手臂（bracchium=前臂）\n古法语embracer（em-进入+brace双臂，'投入双臂中'），拉丁语in+brachia，字面'抱入双臂'，意为'拥抱；接受、采纳'。\n助记\nem-（en- 进入）+ brace（=bracchium 手臂，参 brace、bracelet）→ 投入双臂→拥抱、欣然接受\n例句\nShe was quick to ==embrace== the new technology.","fields":{"Front":"embrace","Back":"释义\n拥抱；接纳\n词根词缀\nem- (en-)进入、使……+brace手臂（bracchium=前臂）\n古法语embracer（em-进入+brace双臂，'投入双臂中'），拉丁语in+brachia，字面'抱入双臂'，意为'拥抱；接受、采纳'。\n助记\nem-（en- 进入）+ brace（=bracchium 手臂，参 brace、bracelet）→ 投入双臂→拥抱、欣然接受\n例句\nShe was quick to ==embrace== the new technology.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352409","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"enthral","back":"释义\n迷住；吸引\n词根词缀\nen-使处于……状态+thrall奴隶、奴仆（斯堪的纳维亚来源）\nen-（使）+ thrall（奴隶，源自古诺斯语þræll），字面'使为奴隶'，引申为'迷住、使陶醉'（被魅力所俘获）。\n助记\nen-（使）+ thrall（古诺斯语「奴隶」）→ 使为奴→被魅力俘获→使入迷、奴役\n例句\nThe audience was ==enthralled== by the magician's performance.","fields":{"Front":"enthral","Back":"释义\n迷住；吸引\n词根词缀\nen-使处于……状态+thrall奴隶、奴仆（斯堪的纳维亚来源）\nen-（使）+ thrall（奴隶，源自古诺斯语þræll），字面'使为奴隶'，引申为'迷住、使陶醉'（被魅力所俘获）。\n助记\nen-（使）+ thrall（古诺斯语「奴隶」）→ 使为奴→被魅力俘获→使入迷、奴役\n例句\nThe audience was ==enthralled== by the magician's performance.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352411","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"equivocal","back":"释义\n模棱两可\n词根词缀\nequi-相等、相同+vox (vocare)声音、词语+-al\nLate Latin aequivocus（equi-相同+vox声音，'同名异义的'）→英语equivocal，字面'同一词语可指两物的'，意为'模棱两可的、含糊的'。\n助记\nequi-（相等）+ voc（=vox 声音、词语，参 voice、vocal）+ -al（…的）→ 同一个词可指两物→模棱两可的\n例句\nThe witness gave an ==equivocal== answer that satisfied no one.","fields":{"Front":"equivocal","Back":"释义\n模棱两可\n词根词缀\nequi-相等、相同+vox (vocare)声音、词语+-al\nLate Latin aequivocus（equi-相同+vox声音，'同名异义的'）→英语equivocal，字面'同一词语可指两物的'，意为'模棱两可的、含糊的'。\n助记\nequi-（相等）+ voc（=vox 声音、词语，参 voice、vocal）+ -al（…的）→ 同一个词可指两物→模棱两可的\n例句\nThe witness gave an ==equivocal== answer that satisfied no one.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352413","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"euphemism","back":"释义\n委婉说法\n词根词缀\neu-好、美+pheme言语、说（phanai=说）+-ism\n希腊语euphemismos（eu-好+pheme言语，'说好话、避讳语'），原指祭祀时避免不吉之言，引申为'委婉语、避讳说法'。\n助记\neu-（好，参 euphony、eulogy）+ phem（=pheme 言语，phanai 说，参 fame）+ -ism（名词）→ 说好话、避讳不吉之言→委婉语\n例句\nHe used a polite ==euphemism== to avoid saying that the man had died.","fields":{"Front":"euphemism","Back":"释义\n委婉说法\n词根词缀\neu-好、美+pheme言语、说（phanai=说）+-ism\n希腊语euphemismos（eu-好+pheme言语，'说好话、避讳语'），原指祭祀时避免不吉之言，引申为'委婉语、避讳说法'。\n助记\neu-（好，参 euphony、eulogy）+ phem（=pheme 言语，phanai 说，参 fame）+ -ism（名词）→ 说好话、避讳不吉之言→委婉语\n例句\nHe used a polite ==euphemism== to avoid saying that the man had died.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352415","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"explicit","back":"释义\n明确的\n词根词缀\nex-出、展开+plicare折叠（PIE *plek-）\n拉丁语explicare（ex-出+plicare折叠，'展开、解开'）的过去分词explicitus→英语explicit，字面'展开不折叠的'，意为'清楚的、明确的'。\n助记\nex-（出）+ plic（=plicare 折叠，参 imply、complex、duplicate）+ -it（…的）→ 展开不折叠的→清楚的、明确的\n例句\nShe gave ==explicit== instructions so that no mistake could be made.","fields":{"Front":"explicit","Back":"释义\n明确的\n词根词缀\nex-出、展开+plicare折叠（PIE *plek-）\n拉丁语explicare（ex-出+plicare折叠，'展开、解开'）的过去分词explicitus→英语explicit，字面'展开不折叠的'，意为'清楚的、明确的'。\n助记\nex-（出）+ plic（=plicare 折叠，参 imply、complex、duplicate）+ -it（…的）→ 展开不折叠的→清楚的、明确的\n例句\nShe gave ==explicit== instructions so that no mistake could be made.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352417","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"extravagant","back":"释义\n奢侈的；挥霍的\n词根词缀\nextra-在……之外+vagari漫游、闲逛（vagus=流浪的）+-ant\n拉丁语extravagari（extra-之外+vagari漫游，'漫游在外、越出常规'）→extravagans，意为'奢侈的、过度的、放肆的'。\n助记\nextra-（在…之外）+ vag（=vagari 漫游，vagus 流浪，参 vague、vagrant）+ -ant（…的）→ 漫游越界的→奢侈的、过分的\n例句\nThey held an ==extravagant== wedding that cost a fortune.","fields":{"Front":"extravagant","Back":"释义\n奢侈的；挥霍的\n词根词缀\nextra-在……之外+vagari漫游、闲逛（vagus=流浪的）+-ant\n拉丁语extravagari（extra-之外+vagari漫游，'漫游在外、越出常规'）→extravagans，意为'奢侈的、过度的、放肆的'。\n助记\nextra-（在…之外）+ vag（=vagari 漫游，vagus 流浪，参 vague、vagrant）+ -ant（…的）→ 漫游越界的→奢侈的、过分的\n例句\nThey held an ==extravagant== wedding that cost a fortune.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352419","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fanatical","back":"释义\n狂热的；入迷的\n词根词缀\nfanum神庙、神殿（fanaticus=神庙里的、狂乱的）+-atic + -al\n拉丁语fanum（神庙）→fanaticus'属于神庙的、被神附身般狂乱的'→英语fanatic+ -al，意为'狂热的、盲信的'。\n助记\nfan（=fanum 神庙，fanaticus 被神附身般狂乱）+ -atical（…的）→ 狂乱的→狂热的、盲信的\n例句\nThe ==fanatical== supporter followed the team to every match.","fields":{"Front":"fanatical","Back":"释义\n狂热的；入迷的\n词根词缀\nfanum神庙、神殿（fanaticus=神庙里的、狂乱的）+-atic + -al\n拉丁语fanum（神庙）→fanaticus'属于神庙的、被神附身般狂乱的'→英语fanatic+ -al，意为'狂热的、盲信的'。\n助记\nfan（=fanum 神庙，fanaticus 被神附身般狂乱）+ -atical（…的）→ 狂乱的→狂热的、盲信的\n例句\nThe ==fanatical== supporter followed the team to every match.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352421","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fervent","back":"释义\n热烈的；热诚的\n词根词缀\nfervere沸腾、灼热（PIE *bhreu-）+-ent\n拉丁语fervere（沸腾）的现在分词fervens→英语fervent，字面'沸腾的'，引申为'热烈的、强烈的'（感情）。\n助记\nferv（=fervere 沸腾，参 fervor、fervid）+ -ent（…的）→ 沸腾的→热情的、强烈的\n例句\nHe made a ==fervent== plea for peace between the two nations.","fields":{"Front":"fervent","Back":"释义\n热烈的；热诚的\n词根词缀\nfervere沸腾、灼热（PIE *bhreu-）+-ent\n拉丁语fervere（沸腾）的现在分词fervens→英语fervent，字面'沸腾的'，引申为'热烈的、强烈的'（感情）。\n助记\nferv（=fervere 沸腾，参 fervor、fervid）+ -ent（…的）→ 沸腾的→热情的、强烈的\n例句\nHe made a ==fervent== plea for peace between the two nations.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352423","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"foresight","back":"释义\n远见；先见之明\n词根词缀\nfore-预先、在前+sight视觉、看见\n古英语复合词fore-（预先）+ sight（看见），字面'预先看见'，意为'先见之明、远见'。\n助记\nfore-（预先）+ sight（看见）→ 预先看见→先见之明、深谋远虑\n例句\nWith great ==foresight==, she bought the house before prices doubled.","fields":{"Front":"foresight","Back":"释义\n远见；先见之明\n词根词缀\nfore-预先、在前+sight视觉、看见\n古英语复合词fore-（预先）+ sight（看见），字面'预先看见'，意为'先见之明、远见'。\n助记\nfore-（预先）+ sight（看见）→ 预先看见→先见之明、深谋远虑\n例句\nWith great ==foresight==, she bought the house before prices doubled.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352425","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"foretell","back":"释义\n预言；预示\n词根词缀\nfore-预先+tell讲述、计算\n古英语复合词fore-（预先）+ tell（讲述），字面'预先说出'，意为'预言、预示'。\n助记\nfore-（预先）+ tell（讲述）→ 预先说出→预言、预示\n例句\nNo one can accurately ==foretell== the outcome of the election.","fields":{"Front":"foretell","Back":"释义\n预言；预示\n词根词缀\nfore-预先+tell讲述、计算\n古英语复合词fore-（预先）+ tell（讲述），字面'预先说出'，意为'预言、预示'。\n助记\nfore-（预先）+ tell（讲述）→ 预先说出→预言、预示\n例句\nNo one can accurately ==foretell== the outcome of the election.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352427","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"forfeit","back":"释义\n丧失；没收\n词根词缀\nfor- (foris)在外、偏离（这里表有罪）+facere做、执行\n古法语forfait（过去分词，'做错事的、犯罪的'，for=在外/越界+faire做，拉丁语foris+factum），引申为'因违规而丧失（权利/财物）；罚金'。\n助记\nfor-（foris 在外、越界）+ feit（=facere 做，factum）→ 越界做错事→因违规而丧失、罚金\n例句\nHe had to ==forfeit== his prize for breaking the rules.","fields":{"Front":"forfeit","Back":"释义\n丧失；没收\n词根词缀\nfor- (foris)在外、偏离（这里表有罪）+facere做、执行\n古法语forfait（过去分词，'做错事的、犯罪的'，for=在外/越界+faire做，拉丁语foris+factum），引申为'因违规而丧失（权利/财物）；罚金'。\n助记\nfor-（foris 在外、越界）+ feit（=facere 做，factum）→ 越界做错事→因违规而丧失、罚金\n例句\nHe had to ==forfeit== his prize for breaking the rules.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352429","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"frivolous","back":"释义\n轻佻的；琐碎的\n词根词缀\nfrivolus琐碎的、无价值的、轻浮的+-ous\n拉丁语frivolus（琐碎的、无价值的）+ -ous（形容词后缀）→英语frivolous，意为'轻浮的、无关紧要的'。\n助记\nfrivol（=frivolus 琐碎的、无价值的）+ -ous（…的）→ 无足轻重的→轻浮的、不严肃的\n例句\nThe committee dismissed the complaint as ==frivolous== and unimportant.","fields":{"Front":"frivolous","Back":"释义\n轻佻的；琐碎的\n词根词缀\nfrivolus琐碎的、无价值的、轻浮的+-ous\n拉丁语frivolus（琐碎的、无价值的）+ -ous（形容词后缀）→英语frivolous，意为'轻浮的、无关紧要的'。\n助记\nfrivol（=frivolus 琐碎的、无价值的）+ -ous（…的）→ 无足轻重的→轻浮的、不严肃的\n例句\nThe committee dismissed the complaint as ==frivolous== and unimportant.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352431","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"generosity","back":"释义\n慷慨；大方\n词根词缀\ngenus出身、种族（generosus=出身高贵的）+-osity (-ity)\n拉丁语genus（种族、出身）→generosus'出身高贵的、品格高尚的'→generositas'高贵、慷慨'→英语generosity，意为'慷慨、宽宏大量'（原指贵族般的气度）。\n助记\ngener（=genus 出身，generosus 出身高贵的）+ -osity（名词）→ 贵族般的气度→慷慨、宽宏大量\n例句\nHer ==generosity== to the poor was well known throughout the town.","fields":{"Front":"generosity","Back":"释义\n慷慨；大方\n词根词缀\ngenus出身、种族（generosus=出身高贵的）+-osity (-ity)\n拉丁语genus（种族、出身）→generosus'出身高贵的、品格高尚的'→generositas'高贵、慷慨'→英语generosity，意为'慷慨、宽宏大量'（原指贵族般的气度）。\n助记\ngener（=genus 出身，generosus 出身高贵的）+ -osity（名词）→ 贵族般的气度→慷慨、宽宏大量\n例句\nHer ==generosity== to the poor was well known throughout the town.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352433","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"grapple","back":"释义\n抓住；搏斗\n词根词缀\ngrappe钩子、葡萄串（日耳曼来源）+-el\n简单派生词：古法语grappil/grappler（grape钩子的频率动词），源自日耳曼语*krappa'钩子'。原义'用钩钩住'，引申为'扭打、搏斗；努力应对'。\n助记\n古法语 grapil「钩子」（日耳曼 *krappa，参 grape、grab）→ 用钩钩住→扭打、设法解决\n例句\nThe two wrestlers began to ==grapple== with each other on the mat.","fields":{"Front":"grapple","Back":"释义\n抓住；搏斗\n词根词缀\ngrappe钩子、葡萄串（日耳曼来源）+-el\n简单派生词：古法语grappil/grappler（grape钩子的频率动词），源自日耳曼语*krappa'钩子'。原义'用钩钩住'，引申为'扭打、搏斗；努力应对'。\n助记\n古法语 grapil「钩子」（日耳曼 *krappa，参 grape、grab）→ 用钩钩住→扭打、设法解决\n例句\nThe two wrestlers began to ==grapple== with each other on the mat.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352435","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"harangue","back":"释义\n长篇大论；怒斥\n词根词缀\nhring圆圈、环形人群\n简单词（无可分析的前缀后缀）：15世纪借自法语harangue，来自古意大利语aringo'公众广场、讲坛'，最终源自日耳曼语古高地德语hring'圆圈'（指围成一圈听演讲的人群），意为'冗长严厉的演说；训斥'。\n助记\n古高地德语 hring「圆圈」（围成一圈的听众，参 ring）→ 对人群发表的长篇演说→训斥、慷慨陈词\n例句\nThe angry coach delivered a long ==harangue== to the players at halftime.","fields":{"Front":"harangue","Back":"释义\n长篇大论；怒斥\n词根词缀\nhring圆圈、环形人群\n简单词（无可分析的前缀后缀）：15世纪借自法语harangue，来自古意大利语aringo'公众广场、讲坛'，最终源自日耳曼语古高地德语hring'圆圈'（指围成一圈听演讲的人群），意为'冗长严厉的演说；训斥'。\n助记\n古高地德语 hring「圆圈」（围成一圈的听众，参 ring）→ 对人群发表的长篇演说→训斥、慷慨陈词\n例句\nThe angry coach delivered a long ==harangue== to the players at halftime.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352437","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"illicit","back":"释义\n违法的；违禁的\n词根词缀\nil- (in-)不、非+licere被允许、合法（PIE *leik-）\n拉丁语illicitus（in-不+licere允许的过去分词licitus），字面'不被允许的'，意为'非法的、违禁的'。\n助记\nil-（in- 不）+ licit（=licere 被允许，参 license）→ 不被允许的→违法的、非法的\n例句\nThe police discovered a large shipment of ==illicit== drugs.","fields":{"Front":"illicit","Back":"释义\n违法的；违禁的\n词根词缀\nil- (in-)不、非+licere被允许、合法（PIE *leik-）\n拉丁语illicitus（in-不+licere允许的过去分词licitus），字面'不被允许的'，意为'非法的、违禁的'。\n助记\nil-（in- 不）+ licit（=licere 被允许，参 license）→ 不被允许的→违法的、非法的\n例句\nThe police discovered a large shipment of ==illicit== drugs.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352439","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"imminent","back":"释义\n迫近的；即将来临\n词根词缀\nim- (in-)在……之上、靠近+minere突出、悬临（minae=威胁）+-ent\n拉丁语imminere（in-在上面+minae突出/威胁，'悬临于上'）的现在分词imminens→英语imminent，意为'即将发生的、迫在眉睫的'（尤指危险）。\n助记\nim-（in- 在上、靠近）+ min（=minere 突出、悬临，参 prominent、eminent）+ -ent（…的）→ 悬临头上的→迫在眉睫的（多指危险）\n例句\nDark clouds signaled that a storm was ==imminent==.","fields":{"Front":"imminent","Back":"释义\n迫近的；即将来临\n词根词缀\nim- (in-)在……之上、靠近+minere突出、悬临（minae=威胁）+-ent\n拉丁语imminere（in-在上面+minae突出/威胁，'悬临于上'）的现在分词imminens→英语imminent，意为'即将发生的、迫在眉睫的'（尤指危险）。\n助记\nim-（in- 在上、靠近）+ min（=minere 突出、悬临，参 prominent、eminent）+ -ent（…的）→ 悬临头上的→迫在眉睫的（多指危险）\n例句\nDark clouds signaled that a storm was ==imminent==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"sat800-list-05","name":"SAT800 核心 › List 05","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["sat800","imported"],"options":{},"cards":[{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352441","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mundane","back":"释义\n平凡的；单调的\n词根词缀\nmundus世界、宇宙（也指干净）+-ane\n拉丁语mundus'世界、宇宙'→mundanus'世俗世界的'→英语mundane，与'天国/精神'相对，意为'世俗的、平凡的、单调的'。\n助记\nmund（=mundus 世界、世俗，也指干净）+ -ane（…的）→ 属此世的（相对天国）→ 世俗的、平凡普通的\n例句\nShe was tired of the ==mundane== routine of her daily life.","fields":{"Front":"mundane","Back":"释义\n平凡的；单调的\n词根词缀\nmundus世界、宇宙（也指干净）+-ane\n拉丁语mundus'世界、宇宙'→mundanus'世俗世界的'→英语mundane，与'天国/精神'相对，意为'世俗的、平凡的、单调的'。\n助记\nmund（=mundus 世界、世俗，也指干净）+ -ane（…的）→ 属此世的（相对天国）→ 世俗的、平凡普通的\n例句\nShe was tired of the ==mundane== routine of her daily life.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352443","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"myopic","back":"释义\n近视的、目光短浅\n词根词缀\nmyop眯眼、短视（myein 闭眼+ops 眼）+-ic…的\n总眯着眼看近处的→近视的；眼界只在眼前的→目光短浅的。\n助记\nmy（我的）+ op（视觉，参 opt-视觉）→ 只看得见自己鼻尖这一点→近视的、目光短浅的。\n例句\nHis ==myopic== view of the problem ignored the long-term consequences.","fields":{"Front":"myopic","Back":"释义\n近视的、目光短浅\n词根词缀\nmyop眯眼、短视（myein 闭眼+ops 眼）+-ic…的\n总眯着眼看近处的→近视的；眼界只在眼前的→目光短浅的。\n助记\nmy（我的）+ op（视觉，参 opt-视觉）→ 只看得见自己鼻尖这一点→近视的、目光短浅的。\n例句\nHis ==myopic== view of the problem ignored the long-term consequences.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352445","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"odd","back":"释义\n古怪的；奇数的\n词根词缀\nodda角、点（oddi=第三角数、单数）\n简单词：中古英语odde，源自古诺斯语odda'角、尖端'，用于oddatala'奇数'（三角形排列中成单的那个），引申为'奇数的→剩余的→奇怪的'。\n助记\n古诺斯语 odda「角、尖端」→ 三角中成单的那一个→奇数的→剩余的→奇怪的\n例句\nThere was something ==odd== about the way the stranger behaved.","fields":{"Front":"odd","Back":"释义\n古怪的；奇数的\n词根词缀\nodda角、点（oddi=第三角数、单数）\n简单词：中古英语odde，源自古诺斯语odda'角、尖端'，用于oddatala'奇数'（三角形排列中成单的那个），引申为'奇数的→剩余的→奇怪的'。\n助记\n古诺斯语 odda「角、尖端」→ 三角中成单的那一个→奇数的→剩余的→奇怪的\n例句\nThere was something ==odd== about the way the stranger behaved.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352447","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"onerous","back":"释义\n繁重的；费力的\n词根词缀\nonus负担、重载+-ous\n拉丁语onus（负担）的形容词形式onerosus'负重的'→英语onerous，意为'繁重的、费力的、麻烦的'。\n助记\noner（=onus 负担，参 exonerate 免除）+ -ous（…的）→ 负重的→繁重的、麻烦的\n例句\nThe new regulations placed an ==onerous== burden on small businesses.","fields":{"Front":"onerous","Back":"释义\n繁重的；费力的\n词根词缀\nonus负担、重载+-ous\n拉丁语onus（负担）的形容词形式onerosus'负重的'→英语onerous，意为'繁重的、费力的、麻烦的'。\n助记\noner（=onus 负担，参 exonerate 免除）+ -ous（…的）→ 负重的→繁重的、麻烦的\n例句\nThe new regulations placed an ==onerous== burden on small businesses.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352449","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"paragon","back":"释义\n模范；典范\n词根词缀\npara-在旁边、对照+akone磨刀石（akon=磨石）\n意大利语paragone'试金石、榜样'，来自希腊语parakone（para-在旁边+akone磨石，'在旁边用来对照试金的磨石'），引申为'完美典范、楷模'。\n助记\npara-（在旁边、对照）+ gon（=akone 磨刀石）→ 旁边用来对照试金的磨石→完美典范、楷模\n例句\nShe is regarded as a ==paragon== of virtue and hard work.","fields":{"Front":"paragon","Back":"释义\n模范；典范\n词根词缀\npara-在旁边、对照+akone磨刀石（akon=磨石）\n意大利语paragone'试金石、榜样'，来自希腊语parakone（para-在旁边+akone磨石，'在旁边用来对照试金的磨石'），引申为'完美典范、楷模'。\n助记\npara-（在旁边、对照）+ gon（=akone 磨刀石）→ 旁边用来对照试金的磨石→完美典范、楷模\n例句\nShe is regarded as a ==paragon== of virtue and hard work.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352451","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pedantic","back":"释义\n迂腐的\n词根词缀\npais (ped-)儿童（pais=儿童，paidagogos=教孩子的人）+-ant + -ic\n希腊语pais（儿童）→paideuein'教孩子'→paidagogos'教师'→法语pédant'学究'→英语pedant+ -ic，意为'学究气的、迂腐的、卖弄学问的'。\n助记\nped（=pais 儿童，paedagogos 教孩子的人，参 pedagogy、pedagogue）+ -antic（…的）→ 像教书匠卖弄学问的→学究气的、迂腐的\n例句\nHis ==pedantic== attention to small rules annoyed his students.","fields":{"Front":"pedantic","Back":"释义\n迂腐的\n词根词缀\npais (ped-)儿童（pais=儿童，paidagogos=教孩子的人）+-ant + -ic\n希腊语pais（儿童）→paideuein'教孩子'→paidagogos'教师'→法语pédant'学究'→英语pedant+ -ic，意为'学究气的、迂腐的、卖弄学问的'。\n助记\nped（=pais 儿童，paedagogos 教孩子的人，参 pedagogy、pedagogue）+ -antic（…的）→ 像教书匠卖弄学问的→学究气的、迂腐的\n例句\nHis ==pedantic== attention to small rules annoyed his students.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352453","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"peripheral","back":"释义\n外围的；边缘的\n词根词缀\nperi-围绕、周围+pherein携带、包围（pi- bher-）+-al\n希腊语periphereia'圆周'（peri-围绕+pherein携带，'环绕一圈的东西'）→英语periphery+ -al→peripheral，意为'外围的、次要的、边缘的'。\n助记\nperi-（围绕，参 perimeter、period）+ pher（=pherein 携带、环绕）+ -al（…的）→ 环绕一圈的外围→边缘的、次要的\n例句\nThe issue is only ==peripheral== to the main topic of the debate.","fields":{"Front":"peripheral","Back":"释义\n外围的；边缘的\n词根词缀\nperi-围绕、周围+pherein携带、包围（pi- bher-）+-al\n希腊语periphereia'圆周'（peri-围绕+pherein携带，'环绕一圈的东西'）→英语periphery+ -al→peripheral，意为'外围的、次要的、边缘的'。\n助记\nperi-（围绕，参 perimeter、period）+ pher（=pherein 携带、环绕）+ -al（…的）→ 环绕一圈的外围→边缘的、次要的\n例句\nThe issue is only ==peripheral== to the main topic of the debate.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352455","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"presume","back":"释义\n假定；推测\n词根词缀\nprae-预先、在前+sumere拿取（emere=买/拿）\n拉丁语praesumere（prae-预先+sumere拿取，'事先拿取、假设'），经古法语presumer进入英语，意为'假定、冒昧、擅自行事'。\n助记\npre-（预先）+ sume（=sumere 拿取，参 assume、consume、resume）→ 事先拿定主意→假定、擅自行动\n例句\nI ==presume== that you have already read the assigned chapter.","fields":{"Front":"presume","Back":"释义\n假定；推测\n词根词缀\nprae-预先、在前+sumere拿取（emere=买/拿）\n拉丁语praesumere（prae-预先+sumere拿取，'事先拿取、假设'），经古法语presumer进入英语，意为'假定、冒昧、擅自行事'。\n助记\npre-（预先）+ sume（=sumere 拿取，参 assume、consume、resume）→ 事先拿定主意→假定、擅自行动\n例句\nI ==presume== that you have already read the assigned chapter.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352457","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prohibit","back":"释义\n禁止；阻止\n词根词缀\npro-在前、面对+habere拥有、持有\n拉丁语prohibere（pro-在前+habere持有，'在前面挡住、阻止'），过去分词prohibitus→英语prohibit，意为'禁止、阻止'。\n助记\npro-（在前挡住）+ hibit（=habere 持有，参 exhibit、inhibit）→ 挡在前面持住→禁止、阻止\n例句\nThe new law will ==prohibit== smoking in all public buildings.","fields":{"Front":"prohibit","Back":"释义\n禁止；阻止\n词根词缀\npro-在前、面对+habere拥有、持有\n拉丁语prohibere（pro-在前+habere持有，'在前面挡住、阻止'），过去分词prohibitus→英语prohibit，意为'禁止、阻止'。\n助记\npro-（在前挡住）+ hibit（=habere 持有，参 exhibit、inhibit）→ 挡在前面持住→禁止、阻止\n例句\nThe new law will ==prohibit== smoking in all public buildings.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352459","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"quarantine","back":"释义\n隔离；检疫\n词根词缀\nquadraginta四十（quattuor四）+-ine\n意大利语quaranta giorni'四十天'（源自拉丁语quadraginta'四十'），指威尼斯规定瘟疫船只离岸停泊40天方可上岸的政策，引申为'隔离期；隔离'。\n助记\nquarant（=quadraginta 四十，参 quarter、quad）+ -ine（名词）→ 威尼斯瘟疫船须停泊四十天→隔离期\n例句\nThe sick passengers were placed in ==quarantine== for two weeks.","fields":{"Front":"quarantine","Back":"释义\n隔离；检疫\n词根词缀\nquadraginta四十（quattuor四）+-ine\n意大利语quaranta giorni'四十天'（源自拉丁语quadraginta'四十'），指威尼斯规定瘟疫船只离岸停泊40天方可上岸的政策，引申为'隔离期；隔离'。\n助记\nquarant（=quadraginta 四十，参 quarter、quad）+ -ine（名词）→ 威尼斯瘟疫船须停泊四十天→隔离期\n例句\nThe sick passengers were placed in ==quarantine== for two weeks.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352461","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"rally","back":"释义\n集会；恢复\n词根词缀\nre-再、重新+aler上升（levare=举起）\n简单派生词：法语rallier（re-重新+allier集合，源自拉丁语ad+ligare捆绑；或与lever'举起'相关），字面'重新集合/振作'，意为'重整旗鼓；集会；反弹'。\n助记\nre-（重新）+ ally（=allier 集合，ad+ligare 绑，参 ally）→ 重新集合、振作→集会、反弹\n例句\nThousands of supporters ==rallied== in the central square.","fields":{"Front":"rally","Back":"释义\n集会；恢复\n词根词缀\nre-再、重新+aler上升（levare=举起）\n简单派生词：法语rallier（re-重新+allier集合，源自拉丁语ad+ligare捆绑；或与lever'举起'相关），字面'重新集合/振作'，意为'重整旗鼓；集会；反弹'。\n助记\nre-（重新）+ ally（=allier 集合，ad+ligare 绑，参 ally）→ 重新集合、振作→集会、反弹\n例句\nThousands of supporters ==rallied== in the central square.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352463","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"reciprocate","back":"释义\n报答；互换\n词根词缀\nreciprocus来回的、交替的（reco-向后+pro-向前）+-ate\n拉丁语reciprocus（reco-向后+pro-向前，'来回交替的'）→reciprocari→英语reciprocate，意为'报答、互换、回报'。\n助记\nreciproc（=reciprocus 来回的，reco 向后 + pro 向前）+ -ate（动词）→ 来回交替→回报、互换\n例句\nShe tried to ==reciprocate== his kindness by helping him in return.","fields":{"Front":"reciprocate","Back":"释义\n报答；互换\n词根词缀\nreciprocus来回的、交替的（reco-向后+pro-向前）+-ate\n拉丁语reciprocus（reco-向后+pro-向前，'来回交替的'）→reciprocari→英语reciprocate，意为'报答、互换、回报'。\n助记\nreciproc（=reciprocus 来回的，reco 向后 + pro 向前）+ -ate（动词）→ 来回交替→回报、互换\n例句\nShe tried to ==reciprocate== his kindness by helping him in return.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352465","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"rehabilitate","back":"释义\n康复；恢复名誉\n词根词缀\nre-重新+habilis能干的、合适的（habere=拥有）+-it + -ate\n中世纪拉丁语rehabilitare（re-重新+habilis合适的，'使重新合适/恢复地位'）→英语rehabilitate，意为'使康复、改造、恢复名誉'。\n助记\nre-（重新）+ habilit（=habilis 合适的，habere 拥有，参 able）+ -ate（使…）→ 使重新合适→使康复、恢复名誉\n例句\nThe program helps injured soldiers ==rehabilitate== and return home.","fields":{"Front":"rehabilitate","Back":"释义\n康复；恢复名誉\n词根词缀\nre-重新+habilis能干的、合适的（habere=拥有）+-it + -ate\n中世纪拉丁语rehabilitare（re-重新+habilis合适的，'使重新合适/恢复地位'）→英语rehabilitate，意为'使康复、改造、恢复名誉'。\n助记\nre-（重新）+ habilit（=habilis 合适的，habere 拥有，参 able）+ -ate（使…）→ 使重新合适→使康复、恢复名誉\n例句\nThe program helps injured soldiers ==rehabilitate== and return home.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352467","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"resilience","back":"释义\n恢复力；韧性\n词根词缀\nre-回、向后+salire跳跃（PIE *sel-）+-ence\n拉丁语resilire（re-回+salire跳，'弹回'）→resiliens→英语resilience，字面'弹回的能力'，引申为'恢复力、韧性、适应力'。\n助记\nre-（回）+ sili（=salire 跳，参 salient、assail）+ -ence（名词）→ 弹回的能力→恢复力、韧性\n例句\nHer ==resilience== helped her recover quickly from the failure.","fields":{"Front":"resilience","Back":"释义\n恢复力；韧性\n词根词缀\nre-回、向后+salire跳跃（PIE *sel-）+-ence\n拉丁语resilire（re-回+salire跳，'弹回'）→resiliens→英语resilience，字面'弹回的能力'，引申为'恢复力、韧性、适应力'。\n助记\nre-（回）+ sili（=salire 跳，参 salient、assail）+ -ence（名词）→ 弹回的能力→恢复力、韧性\n例句\nHer ==resilience== helped her recover quickly from the failure.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352469","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"respite","back":"释义\n暂缓；喘息\n词根词缀\nre-回、重新+spectare看、注视（specere=看）\n古法语respit'延期、暂缓'，源自拉丁语respectus（re-回+specere看，'回顾、顾及'，引申为'延期给予喘息'），意为'暂歇、暂缓、缓刑期'。\n助记\nre-（回）+ spit（=specere 看，respectus 回顾，参 inspect、respect）→ 回头顾及、暂缓→喘息、暂歇\n例句\nThe cool shade provided a brief ==respite== from the afternoon heat.","fields":{"Front":"respite","Back":"释义\n暂缓；喘息\n词根词缀\nre-回、重新+spectare看、注视（specere=看）\n古法语respit'延期、暂缓'，源自拉丁语respectus（re-回+specere看，'回顾、顾及'，引申为'延期给予喘息'），意为'暂歇、暂缓、缓刑期'。\n助记\nre-（回）+ spit（=specere 看，respectus 回顾，参 inspect、respect）→ 回头顾及、暂缓→喘息、暂歇\n例句\nThe cool shade provided a brief ==respite== from the afternoon heat.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352471","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sanction","back":"释义\n批准；制裁\n词根词缀\nsanctus神圣的、不可侵犯的（sancire=颁布神圣法令）+-ion\n拉丁语sanctio（sancire'使神圣、颁布法令'的名词，过去分词sanctus），原指'神圣法令、批准'，后反兼两义：'批准认可'与'制裁惩罚'。\n助记\nsanct（=sanctus 神圣的，sancire 颁布法令，参 sacred、sanctity）+ -ion（名词）→ 神圣法令；一词两义：批准/认可，依法惩处→制裁\n例句\nThe council refused to ==sanction== the building of the new road.","fields":{"Front":"sanction","Back":"释义\n批准；制裁\n词根词缀\nsanctus神圣的、不可侵犯的（sancire=颁布神圣法令）+-ion\n拉丁语sanctio（sancire'使神圣、颁布法令'的名词，过去分词sanctus），原指'神圣法令、批准'，后反兼两义：'批准认可'与'制裁惩罚'。\n助记\nsanct（=sanctus 神圣的，sancire 颁布法令，参 sacred、sanctity）+ -ion（名词）→ 神圣法令；一词两义：批准/认可，依法惩处→制裁\n例句\nThe council refused to ==sanction== the building of the new road.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352473","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sarcasm","back":"释义\n讽刺；挖苦\n词根词缀\nsarkazein撕肉、讥讽（sarx=sarcos肉）+-ism\n希腊语sarkazein（sarx'肉'+-azein，'撕肉、咬牙切齿地讥讽'）→sarkasmos→英语sarcasm，意为'讽刺、挖苦、反话'。\n助记\nsarc（=sarx 肉，sarkazein 撕肉）+ -asm（名词）→ 像撕肉般的话→讽刺、挖苦\n例句\nHis voice was full of ==sarcasm== when he thanked the rude waiter.","fields":{"Front":"sarcasm","Back":"释义\n讽刺；挖苦\n词根词缀\nsarkazein撕肉、讥讽（sarx=sarcos肉）+-ism\n希腊语sarkazein（sarx'肉'+-azein，'撕肉、咬牙切齿地讥讽'）→sarkasmos→英语sarcasm，意为'讽刺、挖苦、反话'。\n助记\nsarc（=sarx 肉，sarkazein 撕肉）+ -asm（名词）→ 像撕肉般的话→讽刺、挖苦\n例句\nHis voice was full of ==sarcasm== when he thanked the rude waiter.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352475","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stature","back":"释义\n身高；声望\n词根词缀\nstare站立（PIE *sta-）+-ure\n拉丁语statura（stare'站立'的名词，'站立的高度'），经古法语stature进入英语，本义'身高、身材'，引申为'声望、地位'。\n助记\nstat（=stare 站立，参 status、statue）+ -ure（名词）→ 站立的高度→身高、身材；引申声望、地位\n例句\nThe great scientist's ==stature== grew after the discovery.","fields":{"Front":"stature","Back":"释义\n身高；声望\n词根词缀\nstare站立（PIE *sta-）+-ure\n拉丁语statura（stare'站立'的名词，'站立的高度'），经古法语stature进入英语，本义'身高、身材'，引申为'声望、地位'。\n助记\nstat（=stare 站立，参 status、statue）+ -ure（名词）→ 站立的高度→身高、身材；引申声望、地位\n例句\nThe great scientist's ==stature== grew after the discovery.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352477","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"substantiate","back":"释义\n证实；证明\n词根词缀\nsub-在下面+stare站立+-ent + -iate\n拉丁语substantia（sub-在下面+stare站，'立于下面的本质、实体'）→substantiare'使具体化、证实'→英语substantiate，意为'证实、证明有根据'。\n助记\nsubstant（=substantia 实体，sub- 在下 + stare 站）+ -iate（使…）→ 使有实体依据→证实\n例句\nThe lawyer needs more evidence to ==substantiate== the claim.","fields":{"Front":"substantiate","Back":"释义\n证实；证明\n词根词缀\nsub-在下面+stare站立+-ent + -iate\n拉丁语substantia（sub-在下面+stare站，'立于下面的本质、实体'）→substantiare'使具体化、证实'→英语substantiate，意为'证实、证明有根据'。\n助记\nsubstant（=substantia 实体，sub- 在下 + stare 站）+ -iate（使…）→ 使有实体依据→证实\n例句\nThe lawyer needs more evidence to ==substantiate== the claim.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352479","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"subtle","back":"释义\n微妙的；敏锐的\n词根词缀\nsub-在下面+tela网、织物（texere编织）\n拉丁语subtilis（sub-在下面+tela'网'，原指'织得极细的网'）→古法语sutil→英语subtle，字面'织得极细的'，引申为'微妙的、精妙的、不易察觉的'。\n助记\nsub-（在下面）+ tle（=tela 网，texere 编织）→ 织得极细的网→精妙的、微妙的、不易察觉的\n例句\nThere was a ==subtle== change in her tone of voice.","fields":{"Front":"subtle","Back":"释义\n微妙的；敏锐的\n词根词缀\nsub-在下面+tela网、织物（texere编织）\n拉丁语subtilis（sub-在下面+tela'网'，原指'织得极细的网'）→古法语sutil→英语subtle，字面'织得极细的'，引申为'微妙的、精妙的、不易察觉的'。\n助记\nsub-（在下面）+ tle（=tela 网，texere 编织）→ 织得极细的网→精妙的、微妙的、不易察觉的\n例句\nThere was a ==subtle== change in her tone of voice.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352481","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"surmise","back":"释义\n推测；猜测\n词根词缀\nsur- (super-)在上面+mittere送、放出（PIE *smeit-）\n古法语sormet/surmise（sur-上面+mettre放，过去mise，'放在上面、指控'），源自拉丁语super+mittere，引申为'推测、臆测'。\n助记\nsur-（super- 在上面）+ mise（=mittere 放，参 promise、admit、mission）→ 放在上面（猜测）→推测、臆测\n例句\nWe can only ==surmise== what really happened that night.","fields":{"Front":"surmise","Back":"释义\n推测；猜测\n词根词缀\nsur- (super-)在上面+mittere送、放出（PIE *smeit-）\n古法语sormet/surmise（sur-上面+mettre放，过去mise，'放在上面、指控'），源自拉丁语super+mittere，引申为'推测、臆测'。\n助记\nsur-（super- 在上面）+ mise（=mittere 放，参 promise、admit、mission）→ 放在上面（猜测）→推测、臆测\n例句\nWe can only ==surmise== what really happened that night.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352483","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"synchronization","back":"释义\n同步化\n词根词缀\nsyn-共同、一起+chronos时间+-ize + -ation\n希腊语synkhronos（syn-一起+chronos时间，'同时的'）→英语synchronize+ -ation→synchronization，意为'同步、同时性'。\n助记\nsyn-（一起）+ chron（=chronos 时间，参 chronic）+ -ization（名词）→ 时间一致→同步\n例句\nThe perfect ==synchronization== of the dancers impressed the judges.","fields":{"Front":"synchronization","Back":"释义\n同步化\n词根词缀\nsyn-共同、一起+chronos时间+-ize + -ation\n希腊语synkhronos（syn-一起+chronos时间，'同时的'）→英语synchronize+ -ation→synchronization，意为'同步、同时性'。\n助记\nsyn-（一起）+ chron（=chronos 时间，参 chronic）+ -ization（名词）→ 时间一致→同步\n例句\nThe perfect ==synchronization== of the dancers impressed the judges.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352485","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"taciturn","back":"释义\n沉默寡言\n词根词缀\ntacere沉默、不说话+-it + -urn\n拉丁语tacere（沉默）→taciturnus'惯于沉默的'→英语taciturn，意为'沉默寡言的、不爱说话的'。\n助记\ntacit（=tacere 沉默，参 tacit、reticent）+ -urn（…的）→ 惯于沉默的→沉默寡言的\n例句\nHe is a quiet, ==taciturn== man who rarely speaks in meetings.","fields":{"Front":"taciturn","Back":"释义\n沉默寡言\n词根词缀\ntacere沉默、不说话+-it + -urn\n拉丁语tacere（沉默）→taciturnus'惯于沉默的'→英语taciturn，意为'沉默寡言的、不爱说话的'。\n助记\ntacit（=tacere 沉默，参 tacit、reticent）+ -urn（…的）→ 惯于沉默的→沉默寡言的\n例句\nHe is a quiet, ==taciturn== man who rarely speaks in meetings.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352487","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tactful","back":"释义\n机智的；老练的\n词根词缀\ntactus触摸、触觉（tangere=触摸）+-ful\n拉丁语tangere（触摸）的过去分词tactus→英语tact（触觉→待人接物的分寸）+ -ful，意为'得体的、圆通的、老练圆滑的'。\n助记\ntact（=tactus 触摸，tangere，参 contact、intact）+ -ful（充满…的）→ 待人接物有分寸的→圆通得体的\n例句\nShe gave a ==tactful== response that avoided offending anyone.","fields":{"Front":"tactful","Back":"释义\n机智的；老练的\n词根词缀\ntactus触摸、触觉（tangere=触摸）+-ful\n拉丁语tangere（触摸）的过去分词tactus→英语tact（触觉→待人接物的分寸）+ -ful，意为'得体的、圆通的、老练圆滑的'。\n助记\ntact（=tactus 触摸，tangere，参 contact、intact）+ -ful（充满…的）→ 待人接物有分寸的→圆通得体的\n例句\nShe gave a ==tactful== response that avoided offending anyone.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352489","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tedious","back":"释义\n沉闷乏味\n词根词缀\ntaedium厌倦、厌烦+-ous\n拉丁语taedium（厌倦）→taediosus'令人厌倦的'→英语tedious，意为'冗长乏味的、令人生厌的'。\n助记\ntedi（=taedium 厌倦）+ -ous（…的）→ 令人生厌的→冗长乏味的\n例句\nThe long lecture was so ==tedious== that many students fell asleep.","fields":{"Front":"tedious","Back":"释义\n沉闷乏味\n词根词缀\ntaedium厌倦、厌烦+-ous\n拉丁语taedium（厌倦）→taediosus'令人厌倦的'→英语tedious，意为'冗长乏味的、令人生厌的'。\n助记\ntedi（=taedium 厌倦）+ -ous（…的）→ 令人生厌的→冗长乏味的\n例句\nThe long lecture was so ==tedious== that many students fell asleep.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352491","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tenable","back":"释义\n站得住脚、合理的\n词根词缀\nten拿住、保持（tenere）+-able可…的\n能守得住、撑得起的→（论点、立场）站得住脚的、合理的。\n助记\nten（拿住、保持，参 maintain、contain、tenant）+ -able（可…的）→ 守得住的→站得住脚的。\n例句\nHis argument is not ==tenable== because it lacks supporting evidence.","fields":{"Front":"tenable","Back":"释义\n站得住脚、合理的\n词根词缀\nten拿住、保持（tenere）+-able可…的\n能守得住、撑得起的→（论点、立场）站得住脚的、合理的。\n助记\nten（拿住、保持，参 maintain、contain、tenant）+ -able（可…的）→ 守得住的→站得住脚的。\n例句\nHis argument is not ==tenable== because it lacks supporting evidence.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352493","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"transient","back":"释义\n短暂的、转瞬即逝\n词根词缀\ntrans-横过、越过+ire走（PIE *ei-）+-ent\n拉丁语transire（trans-越过+ire走，'走过、逝去'）的现在分词transiens→英语transient，意为'短暂的、转瞬即逝的；过客'。\n助记\ntrans-（越过）+ i（=ire 走，参 exit、itinerary）+ -ent（…的）→ 走过、转瞬即逝的→短暂的、过客\n例句\nFame in the entertainment industry can be quite ==transient==.","fields":{"Front":"transient","Back":"释义\n短暂的、转瞬即逝\n词根词缀\ntrans-横过、越过+ire走（PIE *ei-）+-ent\n拉丁语transire（trans-越过+ire走，'走过、逝去'）的现在分词transiens→英语transient，意为'短暂的、转瞬即逝的；过客'。\n助记\ntrans-（越过）+ i（=ire 走，参 exit、itinerary）+ -ent（…的）→ 走过、转瞬即逝的→短暂的、过客\n例句\nFame in the entertainment industry can be quite ==transient==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352495","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"tyrannical","back":"释义\n专制的；残暴的\n词根词缀\ntyrannos僭主、暴君（外来词，可能来自小亚细亚）+-ic + -al\n希腊语tyrannos'僭主、独裁者'→拉丁语tyrannus→英语tyrant+ -ic + -al→tyrannical，意为'暴君的、残暴专制的'。\n助记\ntyrann（=tyrannos 僭主、暴君，参 tyrant）+ -ical（…的）→ 暴君的→专制的、残暴的\n例句\nThe ==tyrannical== ruler punished anyone who disagreed with him.","fields":{"Front":"tyrannical","Back":"释义\n专制的；残暴的\n词根词缀\ntyrannos僭主、暴君（外来词，可能来自小亚细亚）+-ic + -al\n希腊语tyrannos'僭主、独裁者'→拉丁语tyrannus→英语tyrant+ -ic + -al→tyrannical，意为'暴君的、残暴专制的'。\n助记\ntyrann（=tyrannos 僭主、暴君，参 tyrant）+ -ical（…的）→ 暴君的→专制的、残暴的\n例句\nThe ==tyrannical== ruler punished anyone who disagreed with him.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352497","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ubiquitous","back":"释义\n无处不在\n词根词缀\nubique到处（ubi哪里+-que和/遍）+-itous\n拉丁语ubique'到处'（ubi'哪里'+-que'遍'）→近代拉丁语ubiquitas'普遍存在'→英语ubiquity+ -ous→ubiquitous，意为'无处不在的、普遍存在的'。\n助记\nubique（=ubi 哪里 + -que 遍，到处）+ -it + -ous（…的）→ 无处不在的、普遍存在的\n例句\nMobile phones have become almost ==ubiquitous== in modern society.","fields":{"Front":"ubiquitous","Back":"释义\n无处不在\n词根词缀\nubique到处（ubi哪里+-que和/遍）+-itous\n拉丁语ubique'到处'（ubi'哪里'+-que'遍'）→近代拉丁语ubiquitas'普遍存在'→英语ubiquity+ -ous→ubiquitous，意为'无处不在的、普遍存在的'。\n助记\nubique（=ubi 哪里 + -que 遍，到处）+ -it + -ous（…的）→ 无处不在的、普遍存在的\n例句\nMobile phones have become almost ==ubiquitous== in modern society.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352499","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"unadorned","back":"释义\n朴素的；未装饰的\n词根词缀\nun-不、未+adorn装饰（ad-+ornare整理）+-ed\nun-（未）+ adorned（装饰的，拉丁语adornare'ad-去+ornare整理装饰'），字面'未加装饰的'，意为'朴素的、不加渲染的'。\n助记\nun-（未）+ adorn（ad- 去 + ornare 装饰，参 ornament）+ -ed（…的）→ 未加装饰的→朴素的\n例句\nThe room was simple and ==unadorned==, with no decorations at all.","fields":{"Front":"unadorned","Back":"释义\n朴素的；未装饰的\n词根词缀\nun-不、未+adorn装饰（ad-+ornare整理）+-ed\nun-（未）+ adorned（装饰的，拉丁语adornare'ad-去+ornare整理装饰'），字面'未加装饰的'，意为'朴素的、不加渲染的'。\n助记\nun-（未）+ adorn（ad- 去 + ornare 装饰，参 ornament）+ -ed（…的）→ 未加装饰的→朴素的\n例句\nThe room was simple and ==unadorned==, with no decorations at all.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352501","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"undercut","back":"释义\n削价；削弱\n词根词缀\nunder-在下面、低于+cut切、割\n复合词：under-（在下面）+ cut（切），字面'从下面切'，引申为'削价竞争；削弱；底切'。\n助记\nunder-（在下面）+ cut（切）→ 从下面切→削价竞争、削弱\n例句\nThe new store tried to ==undercut== its competitors' prices.","fields":{"Front":"undercut","Back":"释义\n削价；削弱\n词根词缀\nunder-在下面、低于+cut切、割\n复合词：under-（在下面）+ cut（切），字面'从下面切'，引申为'削价竞争；削弱；底切'。\n助记\nunder-（在下面）+ cut（切）→ 从下面切→削价竞争、削弱\n例句\nThe new store tried to ==undercut== its competitors' prices.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352503","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"underscore","back":"释义\n强调\n词根词缀\nunder-在下面+score刻痕、画线（古英语scoru'二十、刻痕计数'）\n复合词：under-（在下面）+ score（画线、刻痕），字面'在下面画线'，引申为'强调、着重说明'。\n助记\nunder-（在下面）+ score（画线、刻痕，参 score）→ 在下面画线→强调、着重说明\n例句\nThe report serves to ==underscore== the need for urgent action.","fields":{"Front":"underscore","Back":"释义\n强调\n词根词缀\nunder-在下面+score刻痕、画线（古英语scoru'二十、刻痕计数'）\n复合词：under-（在下面）+ score（画线、刻痕），字面'在下面画线'，引申为'强调、着重说明'。\n助记\nunder-（在下面）+ score（画线、刻痕，参 score）→ 在下面画线→强调、着重说明\n例句\nThe report serves to ==underscore== the need for urgent action.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352505","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"unnerve","back":"释义\n使紧张\n词根词缀\nun-去除、夺去+nerve神经、筋腱（希腊语neuron）\nun-（夺去）+ nerve（神经、勇气，拉丁语nervus），字面'夺去神经/勇气'，意为'使气馁、使紧张不安'。\n助记\nun-（夺去）+ nerve（神经、勇气，参 nervous）→ 夺去神经/勇气→使气馁、使紧张不安\n例句\nThe eerie silence in the empty house began to ==unnerve== us.","fields":{"Front":"unnerve","Back":"释义\n使紧张\n词根词缀\nun-去除、夺去+nerve神经、筋腱（希腊语neuron）\nun-（夺去）+ nerve（神经、勇气，拉丁语nervus），字面'夺去神经/勇气'，意为'使气馁、使紧张不安'。\n助记\nun-（夺去）+ nerve（神经、勇气，参 nervous）→ 夺去神经/勇气→使气馁、使紧张不安\n例句\nThe eerie silence in the empty house began to ==unnerve== us.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352507","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"aberration","back":"释义\n反常；异常\n词根词缀\nab-离开、偏离+errare漫游、迷路（PIE *ers-）+-ation\n拉丁语aberrare（ab-离开+errare漫游，'偏离正途'）的过去分词aberratus→aberratio，意为'脱离常轨、偏差；失常行为'。\n助记\nab-（离开）+ err（=errare 漫游、迷路，参 error、erratic）+ -ation（名词）→ 偏离正途→异常、偏差\n例句\nThe unusual result was an ==aberration==, not a sign of a real trend.","fields":{"Front":"aberration","Back":"释义\n反常；异常\n词根词缀\nab-离开、偏离+errare漫游、迷路（PIE *ers-）+-ation\n拉丁语aberrare（ab-离开+errare漫游，'偏离正途'）的过去分词aberratus→aberratio，意为'脱离常轨、偏差；失常行为'。\n助记\nab-（离开）+ err（=errare 漫游、迷路，参 error、erratic）+ -ation（名词）→ 偏离正途→异常、偏差\n例句\nThe unusual result was an ==aberration==, not a sign of a real trend.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352509","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"abstruse","back":"释义\n深奥的；难懂的\n词根词缀\nabs- (ab-)离开、避开+trudere推、挤（PIE *treud-）\n拉丁语abstrudere（abs-离开+trudere推，'推开、藏起'）的过去分词abstrusus→英语abstruse，字面'被推开藏起来的'，引申为'深奥的、难懂的'。\n助记\nabs-（ab- 离开）+ truse（=trudere 推，参 intrude、protrude、extrude）→ 被推开藏起的→深奥难懂的\n例句\nThe philosophy book was too ==abstruse== for a general reader.","fields":{"Front":"abstruse","Back":"释义\n深奥的；难懂的\n词根词缀\nabs- (ab-)离开、避开+trudere推、挤（PIE *treud-）\n拉丁语abstrudere（abs-离开+trudere推，'推开、藏起'）的过去分词abstrusus→英语abstruse，字面'被推开藏起来的'，引申为'深奥的、难懂的'。\n助记\nabs-（ab- 离开）+ truse（=trudere 推，参 intrude、protrude、extrude）→ 被推开藏起的→深奥难懂的\n例句\nThe philosophy book was too ==abstruse== for a general reader.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352511","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"acrimonious","back":"释义\n尖刻的；刻薄的\n词根词缀\nacer尖锐的、苦的（PIE *ak-尖）+-mon + -ious\n拉丁语acer（尖锐的、酸苦的）→acrimonia'尖锐、辛辣'→acrimonius'辛辣的'→英语acrimonious，形容（言辞/争吵）'刻薄的、激烈的'。\n助记\nacri（=acer 尖锐、苦，参 acrid、acrimony）+ -monious（…的）→ 尖锐辛辣的→（言辞）尖酸刻薄的\n例句\nThe argument became increasingly ==acrimonious== as the night went on.","fields":{"Front":"acrimonious","Back":"释义\n尖刻的；刻薄的\n词根词缀\nacer尖锐的、苦的（PIE *ak-尖）+-mon + -ious\n拉丁语acer（尖锐的、酸苦的）→acrimonia'尖锐、辛辣'→acrimonius'辛辣的'→英语acrimonious，形容（言辞/争吵）'刻薄的、激烈的'。\n助记\nacri（=acer 尖锐、苦，参 acrid、acrimony）+ -monious（…的）→ 尖锐辛辣的→（言辞）尖酸刻薄的\n例句\nThe argument became increasingly ==acrimonious== as the night went on.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352513","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ambivalence","back":"释义\n矛盾心理\n词根词缀\nambi-两者、双方+valere强壮、有价值+-ence\n德语Ambivalenz（1910年由心理学家Bleuler造词，ambi-双方+valere'价值'），字面'两种并存的价值/情感'，意为'矛盾心理、爱恨交织'。\n助记\nambi-（两者，参 ambiguous）+ val（=valere 有价值、强壮，参 valid、value）+ -ence（名词）→ 两种并存的价值/情感→矛盾心理\n例句\nShe felt a deep ==ambivalence== about accepting the new job.","fields":{"Front":"ambivalence","Back":"释义\n矛盾心理\n词根词缀\nambi-两者、双方+valere强壮、有价值+-ence\n德语Ambivalenz（1910年由心理学家Bleuler造词，ambi-双方+valere'价值'），字面'两种并存的价值/情感'，意为'矛盾心理、爱恨交织'。\n助记\nambi-（两者，参 ambiguous）+ val（=valere 有价值、强壮，参 valid、value）+ -ence（名词）→ 两种并存的价值/情感→矛盾心理\n例句\nShe felt a deep ==ambivalence== about accepting the new job.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352515","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"amiable","back":"释义\n和蔼的、亲切的\n词根词缀\namare爱（PIE *am-）+-able\n拉丁语amare（爱）→amabilis'可爱的、可亲的'→古法语amiable→英语amiable，意为'和蔼可亲的、友善的'。\n助记\nami（=amare 爱，参 amicable、amity、amateur）+ -able（…的）→ 可爱的→和蔼可亲的、友善的\n例句\nThe ==amiable== old man greeted every neighbor with a warm smile.","fields":{"Front":"amiable","Back":"释义\n和蔼的、亲切的\n词根词缀\namare爱（PIE *am-）+-able\n拉丁语amare（爱）→amabilis'可爱的、可亲的'→古法语amiable→英语amiable，意为'和蔼可亲的、友善的'。\n助记\nami（=amare 爱，参 amicable、amity、amateur）+ -able（…的）→ 可爱的→和蔼可亲的、友善的\n例句\nThe ==amiable== old man greeted every neighbor with a warm smile.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352517","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"appease","back":"释义\n安抚；平息\n词根词缀\nap- (ad-)向、使+pax (pacare)和平、平静（pax=和平）\n古法语apaisier（a-使+pais和平，拉丁语ad+pacare'使平静'），字面'使和平'，意为'安抚、姑息、绥靖'。\n助记\nap-（ad- 使）+ peas（=pax 和平、pacare，参 peace、pacify）→ 使和平→安抚、姑息、绥靖\n例句\nThe manager tried to ==appease== the angry customers with discounts.","fields":{"Front":"appease","Back":"释义\n安抚；平息\n词根词缀\nap- (ad-)向、使+pax (pacare)和平、平静（pax=和平）\n古法语apaisier（a-使+pais和平，拉丁语ad+pacare'使平静'），字面'使和平'，意为'安抚、姑息、绥靖'。\n助记\nap-（ad- 使）+ peas（=pax 和平、pacare，参 peace、pacify）→ 使和平→安抚、姑息、绥靖\n例句\nThe manager tried to ==appease== the angry customers with discounts.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352519","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"arduous","back":"释义\n艰巨的；费力的\n词根词缀\narduus高耸的、陡峭的（PIE *eredh-升高）+-ous\n拉丁语arduus'高耸的、陡峭的'→英语arduous，字面'像爬陡坡般的'，引申为'艰巨的、费力的'。\n助记\nardu（=arduus 高耸、陡峭）+ -ous（…的）→ 像爬陡坡般的→艰巨的、费力的\n例句\nClimbing the mountain was an ==arduous== task.","fields":{"Front":"arduous","Back":"释义\n艰巨的；费力的\n词根词缀\narduus高耸的、陡峭的（PIE *eredh-升高）+-ous\n拉丁语arduus'高耸的、陡峭的'→英语arduous，字面'像爬陡坡般的'，引申为'艰巨的、费力的'。\n助记\nardu（=arduus 高耸、陡峭）+ -ous（…的）→ 像爬陡坡般的→艰巨的、费力的\n例句\nClimbing the mountain was an ==arduous== task.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352521","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"barrage","back":"释义\n火力网； 接二连三的一大堆（质问或指责等）；\n水坝\n词根词缀\nbarra栅栏、障碍（可能来自高卢语）+-age\n法语barrage'拦河坝、障碍'（barre'栅栏'+-age），源自晚期拉丁语barra'栅栏'，原指'障碍物/堤坝'，军事上指'弹幕/火力网'，引申为'连珠炮似的问题/批评'。\n助记\nbarr（=barra 栅栏，参 bar、barrier）+ -age（名词）→ 栅栏、堤坝→拦阻的火力网→连珠炮似的（问题/批评）\n例句\nThe politician faced a ==barrage== of difficult questions from reporters.","fields":{"Front":"barrage","Back":"释义\n火力网； 接二连三的一大堆（质问或指责等）；\n水坝\n词根词缀\nbarra栅栏、障碍（可能来自高卢语）+-age\n法语barrage'拦河坝、障碍'（barre'栅栏'+-age），源自晚期拉丁语barra'栅栏'，原指'障碍物/堤坝'，军事上指'弹幕/火力网'，引申为'连珠炮似的问题/批评'。\n助记\nbarr（=barra 栅栏，参 bar、barrier）+ -age（名词）→ 栅栏、堤坝→拦阻的火力网→连珠炮似的（问题/批评）\n例句\nThe politician faced a ==barrage== of difficult questions from reporters.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352523","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"buttress","back":"释义\n支持；拱壁\n词根词缀\nboter推、顶（日耳曼来源，比较boter'用头/角顶'）+-ess\n古法语bouterez'拱壁、扶壁'（bouter'推/顶'的派生词），指建筑中从外侧顶住墙体的斜撑，引申为'支撑物；支持、加强'。\n助记\n古法语 bouter「推、顶」（日耳曼语，参 butt 顶撞）→ 从外侧顶住墙的斜撑→扶壁、支撑（物）\n例句\nThe new evidence will ==buttress== the scientist's theory.","fields":{"Front":"buttress","Back":"释义\n支持；拱壁\n词根词缀\nboter推、顶（日耳曼来源，比较boter'用头/角顶'）+-ess\n古法语bouterez'拱壁、扶壁'（bouter'推/顶'的派生词），指建筑中从外侧顶住墙体的斜撑，引申为'支撑物；支持、加强'。\n助记\n古法语 bouter「推、顶」（日耳曼语，参 butt 顶撞）→ 从外侧顶住墙的斜撑→扶壁、支撑（物）\n例句\nThe new evidence will ==buttress== the scientist's theory.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352525","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"candidate","back":"释义\n候选人\n词根词缀\ncandidus洁白的、光亮的（candere=发光）+-ate\n拉丁语candidus'洁白的'→candidatus（古罗马竞选人身穿白色托加candida toga以显清白）→英语candidate，意为'候选人、应征者'。\n助记\ncandid（=candidus 洁白，candere 发光，参 candle、incandescent）+ -ate（指人）→ 古罗马穿白衣竞选者→候选人\n例句\nShe is a strong ==candidate== for the position of department head.","fields":{"Front":"candidate","Back":"释义\n候选人\n词根词缀\ncandidus洁白的、光亮的（candere=发光）+-ate\n拉丁语candidus'洁白的'→candidatus（古罗马竞选人身穿白色托加candida toga以显清白）→英语candidate，意为'候选人、应征者'。\n助记\ncandid（=candidus 洁白，candere 发光，参 candle、incandescent）+ -ate（指人）→ 古罗马穿白衣竞选者→候选人\n例句\nShe is a strong ==candidate== for the position of department head.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352527","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"castigate","back":"释义\n严厉批评\n词根词缀\ncasti-纯洁的、贞洁的（castus）+agere做、驱动（PIE *ag-）+-ate\n拉丁语castigare（castus'纯洁的'+agere'驱使/使'，'使纯洁、纠正'）→castigatus→英语castigate，字面'使归于纯正'，引申为'严惩、严厉批评'。\n助记\ncasti（=castus 纯洁，参 chaste）+ gate（=agere 驱使、使）→ 使归于纯正→严惩、严厉批评\n例句\nThe critic did not hesitate to ==castigate== the poorly made film.","fields":{"Front":"castigate","Back":"释义\n严厉批评\n词根词缀\ncasti-纯洁的、贞洁的（castus）+agere做、驱动（PIE *ag-）+-ate\n拉丁语castigare（castus'纯洁的'+agere'驱使/使'，'使纯洁、纠正'）→castigatus→英语castigate，字面'使归于纯正'，引申为'严惩、严厉批评'。\n助记\ncasti（=castus 纯洁，参 chaste）+ gate（=agere 驱使、使）→ 使归于纯正→严惩、严厉批评\n例句\nThe critic did not hesitate to ==castigate== the poorly made film.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352529","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"comical","back":"释义\n滑稽的、可笑的\n词根词缀\nkomos狂欢游行、酒宴（喜剧起源）+-ic + -al\n希腊语komos'狂欢队列、狂欢节'→komoidia'喜剧'→拉丁语comicus→英语comic+ -al→comical，意为'滑稽的、好笑的'。\n助记\ncom（=komos 狂欢游行，komoidia 喜剧，参 comedy、comic）+ -ical（…的）→ 喜剧般的→滑稽的、好笑的\n例句\nIt was ==comical== to see the cat try to catch its own tail.","fields":{"Front":"comical","Back":"释义\n滑稽的、可笑的\n词根词缀\nkomos狂欢游行、酒宴（喜剧起源）+-ic + -al\n希腊语komos'狂欢队列、狂欢节'→komoidia'喜剧'→拉丁语comicus→英语comic+ -al→comical，意为'滑稽的、好笑的'。\n助记\ncom（=komos 狂欢游行，komoidia 喜剧，参 comedy、comic）+ -ical（…的）→ 喜剧般的→滑稽的、好笑的\n例句\nIt was ==comical== to see the cat try to catch its own tail.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352531","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"commiseration","back":"释义\n怜悯；同情\n词根词缀\ncom-共同、一起+miser可怜的、不幸的+-ation\n拉丁语commiserari（com-共同+miserari'怜悯'，miser可怜的）→commiseratio→英语commiseration，意为'同情、怜悯、吊慰'。\n助记\ncom-（共同）+ miser（=miser 可怜的，参 misery、miserable）+ -ation（名词）→ 与人同感其可怜→同情、怜悯\n例句\nShe offered her sincere ==commiseration== to the grieving family.","fields":{"Front":"commiseration","Back":"释义\n怜悯；同情\n词根词缀\ncom-共同、一起+miser可怜的、不幸的+-ation\n拉丁语commiserari（com-共同+miserari'怜悯'，miser可怜的）→commiseratio→英语commiseration，意为'同情、怜悯、吊慰'。\n助记\ncom-（共同）+ miser（=miser 可怜的，参 misery、miserable）+ -ation（名词）→ 与人同感其可怜→同情、怜悯\n例句\nShe offered her sincere ==commiseration== to the grieving family.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352533","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"comprehensive","back":"释义\n全面的；综合的\n词根词缀\ncom-完全、一起+prehendere抓住、掌握（prae-前+hendere抓）+-ive\n拉丁语comprehendere（com-完全+prehendere抓住，'全部抓住、理解'）的过去分词comprehensus→comprehensivus→英语comprehensive，意为'全面的、综合的、包罗万象的'。\n助记\ncom-（完全）+ prehens（=prehendere 抓住，参 comprehend、apprehend）+ -ive（…的）→ 全部抓住的→全面的、综合的\n例句\nThe book provides a ==comprehensive== overview of world history.","fields":{"Front":"comprehensive","Back":"释义\n全面的；综合的\n词根词缀\ncom-完全、一起+prehendere抓住、掌握（prae-前+hendere抓）+-ive\n拉丁语comprehendere（com-完全+prehendere抓住，'全部抓住、理解'）的过去分词comprehensus→comprehensivus→英语comprehensive，意为'全面的、综合的、包罗万象的'。\n助记\ncom-（完全）+ prehens（=prehendere 抓住，参 comprehend、apprehend）+ -ive（…的）→ 全部抓住的→全面的、综合的\n例句\nThe book provides a ==comprehensive== overview of world history.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352535","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"consummate","back":"释义\n完美的；完成\n词根词缀\ncon- (com-)完全、一起+summa总数、顶峰（sumus=最高）+-ate\n拉丁语consummare（con-完全+summa'总数/顶峰'，'凑满总数、完成至顶点'）→consummatus→英语consummate，形容词意为'完美的、登峰造极的'，动词意为'完成、使圆满'。\n助记\ncon-（完全）+ summ（=summa 顶峰、总数，参 sum、summit）+ -ate（使…/…的）→ 到顶点的→完美的、登峰造极的；使圆满\n例句\nThe pianist gave a ==consummate== performance of the difficult piece.","fields":{"Front":"consummate","Back":"释义\n完美的；完成\n词根词缀\ncon- (com-)完全、一起+summa总数、顶峰（sumus=最高）+-ate\n拉丁语consummare（con-完全+summa'总数/顶峰'，'凑满总数、完成至顶点'）→consummatus→英语consummate，形容词意为'完美的、登峰造极的'，动词意为'完成、使圆满'。\n助记\ncon-（完全）+ summ（=summa 顶峰、总数，参 sum、summit）+ -ate（使…/…的）→ 到顶点的→完美的、登峰造极的；使圆满\n例句\nThe pianist gave a ==consummate== performance of the difficult piece.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352537","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"controversial","back":"释义\n有争议的\n词根词缀\ncontro- (contra-)相反、对抗+vertere转（PIE *wer-）+-ial\n拉丁语controversia（contro-相反+vertere转，'转向相反方向、争论'）→英语controversy+ -ial→controversial，意为'有争议的、引起争论的'。\n助记\ncontro-（contra- 相反，参 contrary）+ vers（=vertere 转，参 convert）+ -ial（…的）→ 转向相反方向去争论的→有争议的\n例句\nThe new policy has proved highly ==controversial== among voters.","fields":{"Front":"controversial","Back":"释义\n有争议的\n词根词缀\ncontro- (contra-)相反、对抗+vertere转（PIE *wer-）+-ial\n拉丁语controversia（contro-相反+vertere转，'转向相反方向、争论'）→英语controversy+ -ial→controversial，意为'有争议的、引起争论的'。\n助记\ncontro-（contra- 相反，参 contrary）+ vers（=vertere 转，参 convert）+ -ial（…的）→ 转向相反方向去争论的→有争议的\n例句\nThe new policy has proved highly ==controversial== among voters.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352539","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cosmopolitan","back":"释义\n世界性的；见多识广的\n词根词缀\nkosmopolites世界公民（kosmos世界+polites公民）+-an\n希腊语kosmopolites（kosmos'世界'+polites'公民'，源自polis'城邦'）→英语cosmopolis（世界性都市）→cosmopolitan，意为'世界主义的、见多识广的；世界主义者'。\n助记\ncosm（=kosmos 世界，参 cosmic）+ polit（=polites 公民，polis 城邦，参 politics、metropolis）+ -an（…的）→ 世界公民→世界性的、见多识广的\n例句\nShe has a ==cosmopolitan== outlook shaped by years of travel.","fields":{"Front":"cosmopolitan","Back":"释义\n世界性的；见多识广的\n词根词缀\nkosmopolites世界公民（kosmos世界+polites公民）+-an\n希腊语kosmopolites（kosmos'世界'+polites'公民'，源自polis'城邦'）→英语cosmopolis（世界性都市）→cosmopolitan，意为'世界主义的、见多识广的；世界主义者'。\n助记\ncosm（=kosmos 世界，参 cosmic）+ polit（=polites 公民，polis 城邦，参 politics、metropolis）+ -an（…的）→ 世界公民→世界性的、见多识广的\n例句\nShe has a ==cosmopolitan== outlook shaped by years of travel.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"sat800-list-06","name":"SAT800 核心 › List 06","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["sat800","imported"],"options":{},"cards":[{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352541","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"daunting","back":"释义\n令人畏惧\n词根词缀\nde-intensive/down, 加强或向下+domitare / domareto tame, 驯服+-ing现在分词/形容词后缀\nde-(加强)+domare(驯服)→使驯服、威慑；现在分词 daunting 指令人生畏、使人气馁的。\n助记\ndaunt（=domitare 驯服，domare，参 tame、indomitable）+ -ing（…的）→ 使人被驯服、慑住的→令人望而生畏的\n例句\nThe task of writing a novel seemed ==daunting== at first.","fields":{"Front":"daunting","Back":"释义\n令人畏惧\n词根词缀\nde-intensive/down, 加强或向下+domitare / domareto tame, 驯服+-ing现在分词/形容词后缀\nde-(加强)+domare(驯服)→使驯服、威慑；现在分词 daunting 指令人生畏、使人气馁的。\n助记\ndaunt（=domitare 驯服，domare，参 tame、indomitable）+ -ing（…的）→ 使人被驯服、慑住的→令人望而生畏的\n例句\nThe task of writing a novel seemed ==daunting== at first.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352543","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"demeanor","back":"释义\n举止；风度\n词根词缀\nde-completely, 完全地+mener to lead / to threaten, 引领/威胁(驱赶牲畜)+-or名词后缀, 表状态/行为\nde-(完全)+mener(引领、驱赶)→举止行为、行事方式, 引申为人的仪态、风度。\n助记\nde-（完全）+ mean（=minare 引领、驱赶，参 demean）+ -or（名词）→ 被引导出的行为方式→举止、风度\n例句\nHis calm ==demeanor== hid the fact that he was extremely nervous.","fields":{"Front":"demeanor","Back":"释义\n举止；风度\n词根词缀\nde-completely, 完全地+mener to lead / to threaten, 引领/威胁(驱赶牲畜)+-or名词后缀, 表状态/行为\nde-(完全)+mener(引领、驱赶)→举止行为、行事方式, 引申为人的仪态、风度。\n助记\nde-（完全）+ mean（=minare 引领、驱赶，参 demean）+ -or（名词）→ 被引导出的行为方式→举止、风度\n例句\nHis calm ==demeanor== hid the fact that he was extremely nervous.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352545","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"detractor","back":"释义\n诋毁者\n词根词缀\nde-down/away, 向下、离开+trahereto draw/pull, 拉、拖+-oragent noun 施事者\nde-(向下/离开)+trahere(拉)→拉下来、贬低；-or 施事者指贬低他人者、诽谤者。\n助记\nde-（向下）+ tract（=trahere 拉，参 attract、tractor）+ -or（…者）→ 把人往下拉的人→诋毁者、贬低者\n例句\nEven his harshest ==detractor== had to admit the plan had merit.","fields":{"Front":"detractor","Back":"释义\n诋毁者\n词根词缀\nde-down/away, 向下、离开+trahereto draw/pull, 拉、拖+-oragent noun 施事者\nde-(向下/离开)+trahere(拉)→拉下来、贬低；-or 施事者指贬低他人者、诽谤者。\n助记\nde-（向下）+ tract（=trahere 拉，参 attract、tractor）+ -or（…者）→ 把人往下拉的人→诋毁者、贬低者\n例句\nEven his harshest ==detractor== had to admit the plan had merit.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352547","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"diatribe","back":"释义\n指责；抨击\n词根词缀\ndia-彻底、贯穿+trib摩擦（tribein）+-e名词词尾\n反复摩擦、狠狠撕扯→连珠炮般的痛骂、猛烈抨击。\n助记\ndia-（彻底）+ trib（摩擦，参 tribulation 磨难）→ 把人往死里摩擦→痛骂、猛烈抨击。\n例句\nThe article was a bitter ==diatribe== against the popular new law.","fields":{"Front":"diatribe","Back":"释义\n指责；抨击\n词根词缀\ndia-彻底、贯穿+trib摩擦（tribein）+-e名词词尾\n反复摩擦、狠狠撕扯→连珠炮般的痛骂、猛烈抨击。\n助记\ndia-（彻底）+ trib（摩擦，参 tribulation 磨难）→ 把人往死里摩擦→痛骂、猛烈抨击。\n例句\nThe article was a bitter ==diatribe== against the popular new law.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352549","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"eclipse","back":"释义\nn.日食；遮蔽\n词根词缀\nec- (ex-)out/off, 出、离开+leipeinto leave, 离开、遗弃\nec-(离开)+leipein(留下/离开)→(天体)离开视线、隐而不见→日食/月食; 引申为黯然失色。\n助记\nec-（ex- 离开）+ lipse（=leipein 离开、留下）→ 天体离开视线→日食/月食；引申使黯然失色\n例句\nHis fame was soon to ==eclipse== that of his former teacher.","fields":{"Front":"eclipse","Back":"释义\nn.日食；遮蔽\n词根词缀\nec- (ex-)out/off, 出、离开+leipeinto leave, 离开、遗弃\nec-(离开)+leipein(留下/离开)→(天体)离开视线、隐而不见→日食/月食; 引申为黯然失色。\n助记\nec-（ex- 离开）+ lipse（=leipein 离开、留下）→ 天体离开视线→日食/月食；引申使黯然失色\n例句\nHis fame was soon to ==eclipse== that of his former teacher.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352551","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"enmity","back":"释义\n敌意；憎恨\n词根词缀\nin-not, 不、非+amicusfriend, 朋友(inimicus=仇敌)+-ity (-itia)名词后缀, 表状态\nin-(不)+amicus(朋友)→仇敌；名词后缀 enmity 指敌意、仇恨。\n助记\nen-（in- 不）+ em（=amicus 朋友，inimicus 仇敌，参 enemy、amicable）+ -ity（名词）→ 不是朋友→敌意、仇恨\n例句\nThere was deep ==enmity== between the two rival families.","fields":{"Front":"enmity","Back":"释义\n敌意；憎恨\n词根词缀\nin-not, 不、非+amicusfriend, 朋友(inimicus=仇敌)+-ity (-itia)名词后缀, 表状态\nin-(不)+amicus(朋友)→仇敌；名词后缀 enmity 指敌意、仇恨。\n助记\nen-（in- 不）+ em（=amicus 朋友，inimicus 仇敌，参 enemy、amicable）+ -ity（名词）→ 不是朋友→敌意、仇恨\n例句\nThere was deep ==enmity== between the two rival families.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352553","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"eradicate","back":"释义\n根除；消灭\n词根词缀\ne- (ex-)out, 出、彻底+radix (radicis)root, 根+-ate动词后缀\ne-(出)+radix(根)+-ate→连根拔出→根除、消灭。\n助记\ne-（ex- 出）+ radic（=radix 根，参 radish、radical）+ -ate（使…）→ 连根拔出→根除、消灭\n例句\nThe campaign aims to ==eradicate== malaria in the region.","fields":{"Front":"eradicate","Back":"释义\n根除；消灭\n词根词缀\ne- (ex-)out, 出、彻底+radix (radicis)root, 根+-ate动词后缀\ne-(出)+radix(根)+-ate→连根拔出→根除、消灭。\n助记\ne-（ex- 出）+ radic（=radix 根，参 radish、radical）+ -ate（使…）→ 连根拔出→根除、消灭\n例句\nThe campaign aims to ==eradicate== malaria in the region.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352555","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"escalate","back":"释义\n升级；恶化\n词根词缀\nscala ladder / to climb, 梯子/攀爬+-ate动词后缀(由 escalation 逆生)\n源自 scala(梯子, 本义攻城云梯), 由 escalation 逆生而成→像爬梯一样逐步升级、加剧。\n助记\ne-（scala 梯子，scandere 爬，参 scale、escalator）+ -ate（动词）→ 像爬梯般逐步上升→升级、加剧\n例句\nThe small dispute threatened to ==escalate== into a full-scale war.","fields":{"Front":"escalate","Back":"释义\n升级；恶化\n词根词缀\nscala ladder / to climb, 梯子/攀爬+-ate动词后缀(由 escalation 逆生)\n源自 scala(梯子, 本义攻城云梯), 由 escalation 逆生而成→像爬梯一样逐步升级、加剧。\n助记\ne-（scala 梯子，scandere 爬，参 scale、escalator）+ -ate（动词）→ 像爬梯般逐步上升→升级、加剧\n例句\nThe small dispute threatened to ==escalate== into a full-scale war.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352557","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"exonerate","back":"释义\n免罪；昭雪\n词根词缀\nex-out/from, 出、卸下+onus (oneris)burden, 重担、罪名+-ate动词后缀\nex-(卸下)+onus(重担/罪名)+-ate→卸掉罪责→免罪、昭雪。\n助记\nex-（卸下）+ oner（=onus 重担、罪责，参 onerous）+ -ate（动词）→ 卸掉罪责→免除责任、证明无罪\n例句\nThe new evidence helped ==exonerate== the innocent man.","fields":{"Front":"exonerate","Back":"释义\n免罪；昭雪\n词根词缀\nex-out/from, 出、卸下+onus (oneris)burden, 重担、罪名+-ate动词后缀\nex-(卸下)+onus(重担/罪名)+-ate→卸掉罪责→免罪、昭雪。\n助记\nex-（卸下）+ oner（=onus 重担、罪责，参 onerous）+ -ate（动词）→ 卸掉罪责→免除责任、证明无罪\n例句\nThe new evidence helped ==exonerate== the innocent man.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352559","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"expedient","back":"释义\n权宜之计；方便的\n词根词缀\nex-out, 出+pes (pedis)foot, 脚(原义解开脚绊)+-ent形容词/名词后缀\nex-(出)+ped(脚)→解开脚上的束缚、使顺畅→便利的; 名词指权宜之计。\n助记\nex-（出）+ ped（=pes 脚，参 pedestrian、impede）+ -ient（…的）→ 解开脚绊使顺畅→权宜的、图方便的；权宜之计\n例句\nIt was an ==expedient== solution, though not a permanent one.","fields":{"Front":"expedient","Back":"释义\n权宜之计；方便的\n词根词缀\nex-out, 出+pes (pedis)foot, 脚(原义解开脚绊)+-ent形容词/名词后缀\nex-(出)+ped(脚)→解开脚上的束缚、使顺畅→便利的; 名词指权宜之计。\n助记\nex-（出）+ ped（=pes 脚，参 pedestrian、impede）+ -ient（…的）→ 解开脚绊使顺畅→权宜的、图方便的；权宜之计\n例句\nIt was an ==expedient== solution, though not a permanent one.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352561","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"expertise","back":"释义\n专业知识\n词根词缀\nexpertus tried / to try, 经检验的/尝试+-ise (-ise)名词后缀, 表性质/技能\nexpertus(经试验验证的, expert)+-ise(法语名词后缀)→专长、专门知识。\n助记\nexpert（=expertus 经试验验证的，experiri 尝试，参 experience、experiment）+ -ise（名词）→ 经检验的本领→专长、专业知识\n例句\nHis technical ==expertise== made him invaluable to the team.","fields":{"Front":"expertise","Back":"释义\n专业知识\n词根词缀\nexpertus tried / to try, 经检验的/尝试+-ise (-ise)名词后缀, 表性质/技能\nexpertus(经试验验证的, expert)+-ise(法语名词后缀)→专长、专门知识。\n助记\nexpert（=expertus 经试验验证的，experiri 尝试，参 experience、experiment）+ -ise（名词）→ 经检验的本领→专长、专业知识\n例句\nHis technical ==expertise== made him invaluable to the team.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352563","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"feasible","back":"释义\n可行的\n词根词缀\nfacereto do/make, 做、制作+-ibleable to be, 可…的\n源自法语 faire(做, <拉丁 facere)+-ible(可…的)→可做的、行得通的。\n助记\nfeas（=facere 做，参 fact、feature）+ -ible（可…的）→ 可做的→可行的、行得通的\n例句\nIs it really ==feasible== to finish the work in one week?","fields":{"Front":"feasible","Back":"释义\n可行的\n词根词缀\nfacereto do/make, 做、制作+-ibleable to be, 可…的\n源自法语 faire(做, <拉丁 facere)+-ible(可…的)→可做的、行得通的。\n助记\nfeas（=facere 做，参 fact、feature）+ -ible（可…的）→ 可做的→可行的、行得通的\n例句\nIs it really ==feasible== to finish the work in one week?","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352565","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"feasibility","back":"释义\n可行性\n词根词缀\nfacereto do/make, 做+-ibility复合名词后缀 feasibility=feasible+ity\nfeasible(可行的)+-ity(名词后缀)→可行性、可行性研究。\n助记\nfeasible（可行的）+ -ity（名词后缀）→ 可行性\n例句\nThe committee will study the ==feasibility== of the proposed project.","fields":{"Front":"feasibility","Back":"释义\n可行性\n词根词缀\nfacereto do/make, 做+-ibility复合名词后缀 feasibility=feasible+ity\nfeasible(可行的)+-ity(名词后缀)→可行性、可行性研究。\n助记\nfeasible（可行的）+ -ity（名词后缀）→ 可行性\n例句\nThe committee will study the ==feasibility== of the proposed project.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352567","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"futile","back":"释义\n无用的；徒劳的\n词根词缀\nfutilis leaky / to pour, 漏的/倾倒+-ile形容词后缀, 表倾向/性质\nfutilis(漏的, 水倒进去就漏掉→不可靠、徒劳)→无用的、徒劳的。\n助记\nfut（=futilis 漏的，fundere 倾倒，参 fuse、refuse）+ -ile（…的）→ 像漏器般留不住的→徒劳的、无用的\n例句\nAll their efforts to save the sinking company proved ==futile==.","fields":{"Front":"futile","Back":"释义\n无用的；徒劳的\n词根词缀\nfutilis leaky / to pour, 漏的/倾倒+-ile形容词后缀, 表倾向/性质\nfutilis(漏的, 水倒进去就漏掉→不可靠、徒劳)→无用的、徒劳的。\n助记\nfut（=futilis 漏的，fundere 倾倒，参 fuse、refuse）+ -ile（…的）→ 像漏器般留不住的→徒劳的、无用的\n例句\nAll their efforts to save the sinking company proved ==futile==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352569","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"haughty","back":"释义\n傲慢的\n词根词缀\naltushigh, 高(受法兰克语 hoh 影响加 h)+-y形容词后缀\nhaut(高, <拉丁 altus)+-y→高高在上的→傲慢的、目中无人的。\n助记\nhaut（=altus 高，受法兰克语 hoh 影响加 h，参 exalt、altitude）+ -y（…的）→ 高高在上的→傲慢的、目中无人的\n例句\nThe ==haughty== official looked down on everyone in the village.","fields":{"Front":"haughty","Back":"释义\n傲慢的\n词根词缀\naltushigh, 高(受法兰克语 hoh 影响加 h)+-y形容词后缀\nhaut(高, <拉丁 altus)+-y→高高在上的→傲慢的、目中无人的。\n助记\nhaut（=altus 高，受法兰克语 hoh 影响加 h，参 exalt、altitude）+ -y（…的）→ 高高在上的→傲慢的、目中无人的\n例句\nThe ==haughty== official looked down on everyone in the village.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352571","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"imperceptible","back":"释义\n察觉不到\n词根词缀\nin-not, 不+percipere (per-+capere)to seize/perceive, 捕捉/察觉+-ibleable to be perceived, 可察觉的\nim-(不, in-在 p 前同化)+percipere(察觉)+-ible→察觉不到的、极细微的。\n助记\nim-（不）+ percept（=percipere 察觉，per- + capere 抓住，参 perceive、concept）+ -ible（可…的）→ 察觉不到的、细微的\n例句\nThe change in temperature was almost ==imperceptible==.","fields":{"Front":"imperceptible","Back":"释义\n察觉不到\n词根词缀\nin-not, 不+percipere (per-+capere)to seize/perceive, 捕捉/察觉+-ibleable to be perceived, 可察觉的\nim-(不, in-在 p 前同化)+percipere(察觉)+-ible→察觉不到的、极细微的。\n助记\nim-（不）+ percept（=percipere 察觉，per- + capere 抓住，参 perceive、concept）+ -ible（可…的）→ 察觉不到的、细微的\n例句\nThe change in temperature was almost ==imperceptible==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352573","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inapt","back":"释义\n不适当的；不合适的\n词根词缀\nin-不+apt合适（aptus\"贴合\"）\nin(不)+apt(合适)→不恰当的、不适合的（与inept近义）。\n助记\nin-（不）+ apt（=aptus 贴合、合适，参 apt、adapt）→ 不恰当的、不适合的（与 inept 近义）\n例句\nJane was socially ==inapt== and uncomfortable in the presence of men.","fields":{"Front":"inapt","Back":"释义\n不适当的；不合适的\n词根词缀\nin-不+apt合适（aptus\"贴合\"）\nin(不)+apt(合适)→不恰当的、不适合的（与inept近义）。\n助记\nin-（不）+ apt（=aptus 贴合、合适，参 apt、adapt）→ 不恰当的、不适合的（与 inept 近义）\n例句\nJane was socially ==inapt== and uncomfortable in the presence of men.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352575","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"appropriation","back":"释义\n拨款；挪用\n词根词缀\nad-to, 向、归+propriusone's own, 自己的、特有的+-ation名词后缀\nad-(归向)+proprius(自己的)+-ation→据为己有→挪用、拨款、占用。\n助记\nap-（ad- 向）+ propri（=proprius 自己的，参 proper、property）+ -ation（名词）→ 归向自己→据为己有→拨款、挪用\n例句\nCongress approved the ==appropriation== of funds for new schools.","fields":{"Front":"appropriation","Back":"释义\n拨款；挪用\n词根词缀\nad-to, 向、归+propriusone's own, 自己的、特有的+-ation名词后缀\nad-(归向)+proprius(自己的)+-ation→据为己有→挪用、拨款、占用。\n助记\nap-（ad- 向）+ propri（=proprius 自己的，参 proper、property）+ -ation（名词）→ 归向自己→据为己有→拨款、挪用\n例句\nCongress approved the ==appropriation== of funds for new schools.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352577","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"incompetent","back":"释义\n不称职的\n词根词缀\nin-not, 不+competere (com-+petere)to meet/be suitable, 汇合/胜任+-ent形容词后缀\nin-(不)+competere(胜任, 本义汇合、相当)+-ent→不胜任的、无能力的。\n助记\nin-（不）+ competent（=competere 胜任，com- + petere 寻求，参 compete、competent）→ 不胜任的、无能的\n例句\nThe ==incompetent== manager was replaced after only six months.","fields":{"Front":"incompetent","Back":"释义\n不称职的\n词根词缀\nin-not, 不+competere (com-+petere)to meet/be suitable, 汇合/胜任+-ent形容词后缀\nin-(不)+competere(胜任, 本义汇合、相当)+-ent→不胜任的、无能力的。\n助记\nin-（不）+ competent（=competere 胜任，com- + petere 寻求，参 compete、competent）→ 不胜任的、无能的\n例句\nThe ==incompetent== manager was replaced after only six months.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352579","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inspect","back":"释义\n检查；审查\n词根词缀\nin-into, 向内+specereto look, 看\nin-(向内)+specere(看)→向里看、仔细察看→检查、视察。\n助记\nin-（向内）+ spect（=specere 看，参 spectator、expect、aspect）→ 向里仔细看→检查、视察\n例句\nThe engineer came to ==inspect== the bridge for structural damage.","fields":{"Front":"inspect","Back":"释义\n检查；审查\n词根词缀\nin-into, 向内+specereto look, 看\nin-(向内)+specere(看)→向里看、仔细察看→检查、视察。\n助记\nin-（向内）+ spect（=specere 看，参 spectator、expect、aspect）→ 向里仔细看→检查、视察\n例句\nThe engineer came to ==inspect== the bridge for structural damage.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352581","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"intemperate","back":"释义\n放纵的；无节制的\n词根词缀\nin-not, 不+temperareto moderate, 调节、节制+-ate形容词后缀\nin-(不)+temperare(节制)+-ate→无节制的、过度的(尤指饮食/饮酒)。\n助记\nin-（不）+ temper（=temperare 节制，参 temperate）+ -ate（…的）→ 无节制的、过度的（尤指饮食饮酒）\n例句\nHis ==intemperate== drinking eventually destroyed his health.","fields":{"Front":"intemperate","Back":"释义\n放纵的；无节制的\n词根词缀\nin-not, 不+temperareto moderate, 调节、节制+-ate形容词后缀\nin-(不)+temperare(节制)+-ate→无节制的、过度的(尤指饮食/饮酒)。\n助记\nin-（不）+ temper（=temperare 节制，参 temperate）+ -ate（…的）→ 无节制的、过度的（尤指饮食饮酒）\n例句\nHis ==intemperate== drinking eventually destroyed his health.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352583","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"invalidate","back":"释义\n使无效\n词根词缀\nin-not, 不+validus strong / to be strong, 强壮的/有价值+-ate动词后缀\nin-(不)+validus(有效的)+-ate→使失效、使无效; 也指使(论据)站不住脚。\n助记\nin-（不）+ valid（=validus 有效的，valere 强壮，参 valid、value）+ -ate（使…）→ 使无效、作废\n例句\nA single error could ==invalidate== the entire experiment.","fields":{"Front":"invalidate","Back":"释义\n使无效\n词根词缀\nin-not, 不+validus strong / to be strong, 强壮的/有价值+-ate动词后缀\nin-(不)+validus(有效的)+-ate→使失效、使无效; 也指使(论据)站不住脚。\n助记\nin-（不）+ valid（=validus 有效的，valere 强壮，参 valid、value）+ -ate（使…）→ 使无效、作废\n例句\nA single error could ==invalidate== the entire experiment.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352585","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lethargy","back":"释义\n昏睡；无精打采\n词根词缀\nlethe + argos (a-+ergon)oblivion + without work, 遗忘+不活动+-y (-ia)名词后缀\nlethe(遗忘)+argos(不活动的, a-无+ergon功)→昏沉遗忘、懒怠→嗜睡、无精打采。\n助记\nlethe（=Lethe 遗忘之河，lethe 遗忘）+ arg（=argos 不活动，a- 无 + ergon 工作，参 energy）+ -y（名词）→ 又遗忘又不动→昏沉倦怠、无精打采\n例句\nAfter the long flight, she was overcome by a strange ==lethargy==.","fields":{"Front":"lethargy","Back":"释义\n昏睡；无精打采\n词根词缀\nlethe + argos (a-+ergon)oblivion + without work, 遗忘+不活动+-y (-ia)名词后缀\nlethe(遗忘)+argos(不活动的, a-无+ergon功)→昏沉遗忘、懒怠→嗜睡、无精打采。\n助记\nlethe（=Lethe 遗忘之河，lethe 遗忘）+ arg（=argos 不活动，a- 无 + ergon 工作，参 energy）+ -y（名词）→ 又遗忘又不动→昏沉倦怠、无精打采\n例句\nAfter the long flight, she was overcome by a strange ==lethargy==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352587","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"melodrama","back":"释义\n情节剧\n词根词缀\nmelos + dramasong + drama, 歌曲+戏剧\nmelos(歌)+drama(戏剧)→早期配音乐的情节剧; 引申为夸张煽情的戏剧性场面。\n助记\nmelo（=melos 歌、音乐）+ drama（戏剧，参 drama、drastic）→ 配乐的戏剧→情节剧、夸张煽情\n例句\nThe film was an exaggerated ==melodrama== full of tears and shouting.","fields":{"Front":"melodrama","Back":"释义\n情节剧\n词根词缀\nmelos + dramasong + drama, 歌曲+戏剧\nmelos(歌)+drama(戏剧)→早期配音乐的情节剧; 引申为夸张煽情的戏剧性场面。\n助记\nmelo（=melos 歌、音乐）+ drama（戏剧，参 drama、drastic）→ 配乐的戏剧→情节剧、夸张煽情\n例句\nThe film was an exaggerated ==melodrama== full of tears and shouting.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352589","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"moderation","back":"释义\n适度；节制\n词根词缀\nmodusmeasure, 尺度、适度+-ation名词后缀\nmodus(尺度)+-ation→把握尺度→节制、适度、中庸。\n助记\nmod（=modus 尺度，参 moderate、modest）+ -eration（名词）→ 把握尺度→节制、适度、中庸\n例句\nThe doctor told him to eat everything in ==moderation==.","fields":{"Front":"moderation","Back":"释义\n适度；节制\n词根词缀\nmodusmeasure, 尺度、适度+-ation名词后缀\nmodus(尺度)+-ation→把握尺度→节制、适度、中庸。\n助记\nmod（=modus 尺度，参 moderate、modest）+ -eration（名词）→ 把握尺度→节制、适度、中庸\n例句\nThe doctor told him to eat everything in ==moderation==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352591","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"neutral","back":"释义\n中立的\n词根词缀\nneuter (ne-+uter)neither, 两者都不+-al形容词后缀\nne-(不)+uter(二者之一)→两者都不偏→中立的、中性的。\n助记\nne-（不）+ uter（=uter 二者之一，neuter 两者都不）+ -al（…的）→ 两边都不偏→中立的、中性的\n例句\nSwitzerland remained ==neutral== throughout the long conflict.","fields":{"Front":"neutral","Back":"释义\n中立的\n词根词缀\nneuter (ne-+uter)neither, 两者都不+-al形容词后缀\nne-(不)+uter(二者之一)→两者都不偏→中立的、中性的。\n助记\nne-（不）+ uter（=uter 二者之一，neuter 两者都不）+ -al（…的）→ 两边都不偏→中立的、中性的\n例句\nSwitzerland remained ==neutral== throughout the long conflict.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352593","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"observant","back":"释义\n善于观察\n词根词缀\nob-to/toward, 朝向+servareto keep/watch, 保持/守望+-ant现在分词/形容词后缀\nob-(朝向)+servare(守望)+-ant→留心守望的→善于观察的、严守(规则)的。\n助记\nob-（朝向）+ serv（=servare 守望、保持，参 observe、preserve、conserve）+ -ant（…的）→ 留心守望的→善于观察的、严守规则的\n例句\nThe ==observant== detective noticed a clue everyone else had missed.","fields":{"Front":"observant","Back":"释义\n善于观察\n词根词缀\nob-to/toward, 朝向+servareto keep/watch, 保持/守望+-ant现在分词/形容词后缀\nob-(朝向)+servare(守望)+-ant→留心守望的→善于观察的、严守(规则)的。\n助记\nob-（朝向）+ serv（=servare 守望、保持，参 observe、preserve、conserve）+ -ant（…的）→ 留心守望的→善于观察的、严守规则的\n例句\nThe ==observant== detective noticed a clue everyone else had missed.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352595","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"perceptible","back":"释义\n可察觉的\n词根词缀\nper-thoroughly, 彻底+capereto seize/take, 抓取(percipere=彻底抓住)+-ibleable to be, 可…的\nper-(彻底)+capere(抓取)+-ible→能被(感官)抓取到的→可察觉的、看得出的。\n助记\nper-（彻底）+ cept（=capere 抓取，percipere，参 perceive、concept、accept）+ -ible（可…的）→ 能被感官抓住的→可察觉的、看得出的\n例句\nThere was a ==perceptible== improvement in her English after the course.","fields":{"Front":"perceptible","Back":"释义\n可察觉的\n词根词缀\nper-thoroughly, 彻底+capereto seize/take, 抓取(percipere=彻底抓住)+-ibleable to be, 可…的\nper-(彻底)+capere(抓取)+-ible→能被(感官)抓取到的→可察觉的、看得出的。\n助记\nper-（彻底）+ cept（=capere 抓取，percipere，参 perceive、concept、accept）+ -ible（可…的）→ 能被感官抓住的→可察觉的、看得出的\n例句\nThere was a ==perceptible== improvement in her English after the course.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352597","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"peremptory","back":"释义\n专横的；强制的\n词根词缀\nper-entirely, 完全、彻底+emereto take/buy, 拿取(perimere=完全拿走、摧毁)+-ory形容词后缀\nper-(完全)+emere(拿走)→(法律)最终裁断的、不容置辩的→专横的、强制的。\n助记\nper-（完全）+ empt（=emere 拿取，perimere 完全拿走，参 exempt、prompt）+ -ory（…的）→ 最终裁断、不可反驳的→专横的、强制的\n例句\nThe captain gave a ==peremptory== order that allowed no argument.","fields":{"Front":"peremptory","Back":"释义\n专横的；强制的\n词根词缀\nper-entirely, 完全、彻底+emereto take/buy, 拿取(perimere=完全拿走、摧毁)+-ory形容词后缀\nper-(完全)+emere(拿走)→(法律)最终裁断的、不容置辩的→专横的、强制的。\n助记\nper-（完全）+ empt（=emere 拿取，perimere 完全拿走，参 exempt、prompt）+ -ory（…的）→ 最终裁断、不可反驳的→专横的、强制的\n例句\nThe captain gave a ==peremptory== order that allowed no argument.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352599","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"perpetuate","back":"释义\n使永存；使不朽\n词根词缀\nper-through, 贯穿、始终+pes (petis)going through / continuous, 持续不断(perpes)+-ate动词后缀\nper-(贯穿)+pes(持续行进)+-ate→使持续下去→使永久、使长存。\n助记\nper-（贯穿）+ petu（=pes/petis 持续，perpes）+ -ate（使…）→ 使持续到底→使永恒、使不朽\n例句\nThe myth continues to ==perpetuate== harmful stereotypes.","fields":{"Front":"perpetuate","Back":"释义\n使永存；使不朽\n词根词缀\nper-through, 贯穿、始终+pes (petis)going through / continuous, 持续不断(perpes)+-ate动词后缀\nper-(贯穿)+pes(持续行进)+-ate→使持续下去→使永久、使长存。\n助记\nper-（贯穿）+ petu（=pes/petis 持续，perpes）+ -ate（使…）→ 使持续到底→使永恒、使不朽\n例句\nThe myth continues to ==perpetuate== harmful stereotypes.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352601","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"plausible","back":"释义\n似乎有理\n词根词缀\nplaudereto clap/applaud, 鼓掌、称赞+-ibleworthy of, 值得…的\nplaudere(鼓掌)+-ible→值得鼓掌的(表面上)→貌似合理的、花言巧语的(常含不实之意)。\n助记\nplaus（=plaudere 鼓掌，参 applaud、applause、explode）+ -ible（值得…的）→ 表面值得鼓掌的→貌似合理的、似是而非的\n例句\nHis explanation sounded ==plausible==, but we still had doubts.","fields":{"Front":"plausible","Back":"释义\n似乎有理\n词根词缀\nplaudereto clap/applaud, 鼓掌、称赞+-ibleworthy of, 值得…的\nplaudere(鼓掌)+-ible→值得鼓掌的(表面上)→貌似合理的、花言巧语的(常含不实之意)。\n助记\nplaus（=plaudere 鼓掌，参 applaud、applause、explode）+ -ible（值得…的）→ 表面值得鼓掌的→貌似合理的、似是而非的\n例句\nHis explanation sounded ==plausible==, but we still had doubts.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352603","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pliable","back":"释义\n柔韧的、易受影响\n词根词缀\nplicareto fold/bend, 折叠、弯曲+-ableable to be, 可…的\nplicare(折叠)+-able→可折叠弯曲的→柔韧的; 引申为易受影响、柔顺的。\n助记\npli（=plicare 折叠、弯曲，参 ply、reply、complicate）+ -able（可…的）→ 可弯曲的→柔韧的、顺从的\n例句\nThe warm clay was soft and ==pliable== in the sculptor's hands.","fields":{"Front":"pliable","Back":"释义\n柔韧的、易受影响\n词根词缀\nplicareto fold/bend, 折叠、弯曲+-ableable to be, 可…的\nplicare(折叠)+-able→可折叠弯曲的→柔韧的; 引申为易受影响、柔顺的。\n助记\npli（=plicare 折叠、弯曲，参 ply、reply、complicate）+ -able（可…的）→ 可弯曲的→柔韧的、顺从的\n例句\nThe warm clay was soft and ==pliable== in the sculptor's hands.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352605","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"preeminence","back":"释义\n杰出\n词根词缀\nprae-before, 在前、优先+eminereto stand out, 突出、耸立+-ence名词后缀\nprae-(在前)+eminere(突出)+-ence→(在众人之前)突出→卓越、显赫、杰出地位。\n助记\npre-（在前）+ emin（=eminere 突出，参 eminent、prominent）+ -ence（名词）→ 在众人之前突出→卓越、杰出\n例句\nHer ==preeminence== in the field of medicine is widely recognized.","fields":{"Front":"preeminence","Back":"释义\n杰出\n词根词缀\nprae-before, 在前、优先+eminereto stand out, 突出、耸立+-ence名词后缀\nprae-(在前)+eminere(突出)+-ence→(在众人之前)突出→卓越、显赫、杰出地位。\n助记\npre-（在前）+ emin（=eminere 突出，参 eminent、prominent）+ -ence（名词）→ 在众人之前突出→卓越、杰出\n例句\nHer ==preeminence== in the field of medicine is widely recognized.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352607","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prodigal","back":"释义\n挥霍的；n.浪子\n词根词缀\npro- (prod-)forth/away, 向前/散去+agereto drive, 驱赶(prodigere=驱走、挥霍)+-al形容词后缀\nprod-(散去)+agere(驱赶)→(把钱财)驱散去→挥霍的; 名词指浪子、挥霍者。\n助记\nprod-（pro- 向前、散去）+ ig（=agere 驱赶，prodigere 驱走、挥霍）+ -al（…的）→ 把钱财驱散去的→挥霍的；浪子\n例句\nThe ==prodigal== son spent all his inheritance in a single year.","fields":{"Front":"prodigal","Back":"释义\n挥霍的；n.浪子\n词根词缀\npro- (prod-)forth/away, 向前/散去+agereto drive, 驱赶(prodigere=驱走、挥霍)+-al形容词后缀\nprod-(散去)+agere(驱赶)→(把钱财)驱散去→挥霍的; 名词指浪子、挥霍者。\n助记\nprod-（pro- 向前、散去）+ ig（=agere 驱赶，prodigere 驱走、挥霍）+ -al（…的）→ 把钱财驱散去的→挥霍的；浪子\n例句\nThe ==prodigal== son spent all his inheritance in a single year.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352609","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"profundity","back":"释义\n深奥；深刻\n词根词缀\npro-down, 向下+fundusbottom, 底部+-ity名词后缀\npro-(向下)+fundus(底)+-ity→直达底部→深度; 引申为(思想的)深刻、深奥。\n助记\npro-（向下）+ fund（=fundus 底部，参 profound、fundamental）+ -ity（名词）→ 直达底部→深度、深刻\n例句\nThe poem was admired for the ==profundity== of its ideas.","fields":{"Front":"profundity","Back":"释义\n深奥；深刻\n词根词缀\npro-down, 向下+fundusbottom, 底部+-ity名词后缀\npro-(向下)+fundus(底)+-ity→直达底部→深度; 引申为(思想的)深刻、深奥。\n助记\npro-（向下）+ fund（=fundus 底部，参 profound、fundamental）+ -ity（名词）→ 直达底部→深度、深刻\n例句\nThe poem was admired for the ==profundity== of its ideas.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352611","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"propensity","back":"释义\n倾向；习性\n词根词缀\npro-forth, 向前+pendereto hang, 悬挂(propendere=向前倾)+-ity名词后缀\npro-(向前)+pendere(悬挂/倾斜)+-ity→心向前倾→倾向、习性、癖好。\n助记\npro-（向前）+ pens（=pendere 悬挂，propendere 前倾，参 depend、suspend、pendulum）+ -ity（名词）→ 心向前倾→倾向、习性\n例句\nHe has a ==propensity== for arriving late to every meeting.","fields":{"Front":"propensity","Back":"释义\n倾向；习性\n词根词缀\npro-forth, 向前+pendereto hang, 悬挂(propendere=向前倾)+-ity名词后缀\npro-(向前)+pendere(悬挂/倾斜)+-ity→心向前倾→倾向、习性、癖好。\n助记\npro-（向前）+ pens（=pendere 悬挂，propendere 前倾，参 depend、suspend、pendulum）+ -ity（名词）→ 心向前倾→倾向、习性\n例句\nHe has a ==propensity== for arriving late to every meeting.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352613","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"protean","back":"释义\n变化多端\n词根词缀\nProteus普罗透斯(可随意变形的海神)+-an形容词后缀, 表…式的\n源自希腊海神 Proteus(能千变万化)+-an→变化多端的、多才多艺的、变幻无常的。\n助记\n希腊海神 Proteus（能随意变形）+ -an（…式的）→ 千变万化的、多才多艺的、变幻无常的\n例句\nThe actress displayed her ==protean== talent in a range of roles.","fields":{"Front":"protean","Back":"释义\n变化多端\n词根词缀\nProteus普罗透斯(可随意变形的海神)+-an形容词后缀, 表…式的\n源自希腊海神 Proteus(能千变万化)+-an→变化多端的、多才多艺的、变幻无常的。\n助记\n希腊海神 Proteus（能随意变形）+ -an（…式的）→ 千变万化的、多才多艺的、变幻无常的\n例句\nThe actress displayed her ==protean== talent in a range of roles.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352615","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pugnacious","back":"释义\n好斗的\n词根词缀\npugnare to fight / fist, 打斗/拳头+-acious形容词后缀, 表倾向\npugnus(拳头)→pugnare(打斗)+-acious→好斗的、爱争吵的。\n助记\npugn（=pugnus 拳头，pugnare 打，参 repugnant、pugilist）+ -acious（倾向…的）→ 爱动拳的→好斗的、爱吵架的\n例句\nThe ==pugnacious== boxer was always ready for a fight.","fields":{"Front":"pugnacious","Back":"释义\n好斗的\n词根词缀\npugnare to fight / fist, 打斗/拳头+-acious形容词后缀, 表倾向\npugnus(拳头)→pugnare(打斗)+-acious→好斗的、爱争吵的。\n助记\npugn（=pugnus 拳头，pugnare 打，参 repugnant、pugilist）+ -acious（倾向…的）→ 爱动拳的→好斗的、爱吵架的\n例句\nThe ==pugnacious== boxer was always ready for a fight.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352617","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"punctilious","back":"释义\n一丝不苟\n词根词缀\npunctum point / to prick, 点/刺+-ous形容词后缀(经 puntiglio 细节)\npunctum(细小的点, <pungere刺)+-ous→连细小的点都讲究→一丝不苟的、拘泥细节的。\n助记\npunct（=punctum 小点，pungere 刺，参 point、punctual、puncture）+ -ilious（…的）→ 连细小的点都讲究→一丝不苟的、拘泥细节的\n例句\nShe is ==punctilious== about following every rule correctly.","fields":{"Front":"punctilious","Back":"释义\n一丝不苟\n词根词缀\npunctum point / to prick, 点/刺+-ous形容词后缀(经 puntiglio 细节)\npunctum(细小的点, <pungere刺)+-ous→连细小的点都讲究→一丝不苟的、拘泥细节的。\n助记\npunct（=punctum 小点，pungere 刺，参 point、punctual、puncture）+ -ilious（…的）→ 连细小的点都讲究→一丝不苟的、拘泥细节的\n例句\nShe is ==punctilious== about following every rule correctly.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352619","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"radical","back":"释义\n根本的；激进的\n词根词缀\nradix (radicis)root, 根+-al形容词后缀\nradix(根)+-al→根本的、彻底的; 引申为激进的、根本变革的。\n助记\nradic（=radix 根，参 radish、eradicate）+ -al（…的）→ 根本的、彻底的；引申为激进的\n例句\nThe proposal called for a ==radical== change in the education system.","fields":{"Front":"radical","Back":"释义\n根本的；激进的\n词根词缀\nradix (radicis)root, 根+-al形容词后缀\nradix(根)+-al→根本的、彻底的; 引申为激进的、根本变革的。\n助记\nradic（=radix 根，参 radish、eradicate）+ -al（…的）→ 根本的、彻底的；引申为激进的\n例句\nThe proposal called for a ==radical== change in the education system.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352621","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"reinforce","back":"释义\n加强；增援\n词根词缀\nre-again/intensive, 再/加强+fortisstrong, 强壮的\nre-(加强)+en-(使)+fort(强)→使更强→增援、加固、强化。\n助记\nre-（再、加强）+ in-（使）+ force（=fortis 强，参 fort、effort）→ 使更强→加强、加固、增援\n例句\nThe new evidence will ==reinforce== our earlier conclusion.","fields":{"Front":"reinforce","Back":"释义\n加强；增援\n词根词缀\nre-again/intensive, 再/加强+fortisstrong, 强壮的\nre-(加强)+en-(使)+fort(强)→使更强→增援、加固、强化。\n助记\nre-（再、加强）+ in-（使）+ force（=fortis 强，参 fort、effort）→ 使更强→加强、加固、增援\n例句\nThe new evidence will ==reinforce== our earlier conclusion.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352623","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"remunerative","back":"释义\n有报酬的\n词根词缀\nre-back, 回、回报+munus (muneris)gift/service/duty, 礼物/职责+-ative形容词后缀\nre-(回报)+munus(礼物/服务)+-ative→给予报酬的→有报酬的、有利可图的。\n助记\nre-（回报）+ muner（=munus 礼物、服务，参 community、municipal）+ -ative（…的）→ 给予回报的→有报酬的、有利可图的\n例句\nConsulting work can be highly ==remunerative== for skilled professionals.","fields":{"Front":"remunerative","Back":"释义\n有报酬的\n词根词缀\nre-back, 回、回报+munus (muneris)gift/service/duty, 礼物/职责+-ative形容词后缀\nre-(回报)+munus(礼物/服务)+-ative→给予报酬的→有报酬的、有利可图的。\n助记\nre-（回报）+ muner（=munus 礼物、服务，参 community、municipal）+ -ative（…的）→ 给予回报的→有报酬的、有利可图的\n例句\nConsulting work can be highly ==remunerative== for skilled professionals.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352625","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"reparation","back":"释义\n补偿；赔偿\n词根词缀\nre-again, 重新+parareto prepare, 准备(重新备好=修复)+-ation名词后缀\nre-(重新)+parare(备办)+-ation→重新办好→修复; 引申为赔偿、赔款。\n助记\nre-（重新）+ par（=parare 备办，参 prepare、repair）+ -ation（名词）→ 重新办好→修缮、赔偿\n例句\nThe country paid ==reparation== to the families of the victims.","fields":{"Front":"reparation","Back":"释义\n补偿；赔偿\n词根词缀\nre-again, 重新+parareto prepare, 准备(重新备好=修复)+-ation名词后缀\nre-(重新)+parare(备办)+-ation→重新办好→修复; 引申为赔偿、赔款。\n助记\nre-（重新）+ par（=parare 备办，参 prepare、repair）+ -ation（名词）→ 重新办好→修缮、赔偿\n例句\nThe country paid ==reparation== to the families of the victims.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352627","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"replicable","back":"释义\n可复制的\n词根词缀\nre-back, 回+plicareto fold, 折叠+-ableable to be, 可…的\nre-(回)+plicare(折叠)+-able→可折回重做的→可复制的、可重复验证的(尤指实验)。\n助记\nre-（重复）+ plic（=plicare 折叠，参 reply、replicate、duplicate）+ -able（可…的）→ 可折回重做的→可复制的、可重复验证的\n例句\nFor a study to be scientific, its results must be ==replicable==.","fields":{"Front":"replicable","Back":"释义\n可复制的\n词根词缀\nre-back, 回+plicareto fold, 折叠+-ableable to be, 可…的\nre-(回)+plicare(折叠)+-able→可折回重做的→可复制的、可重复验证的(尤指实验)。\n助记\nre-（重复）+ plic（=plicare 折叠，参 reply、replicate、duplicate）+ -able（可…的）→ 可折回重做的→可复制的、可重复验证的\n例句\nFor a study to be scientific, its results must be ==replicable==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352629","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"resurgence","back":"释义\n复苏；复兴\n词根词缀\nre-again, 再次+surgere (sub-+regere)to rise / to direct, 升起/拉直+-ence名词后缀\nre-(再次)+surgere(升起, sub-下+regere直起)+-ence→再度兴起、复苏、回潮。\n助记\nre-（再次）+ surg（=surgere 升起，sub- + regere，参 surge、insurgent）+ -ence（名词）→ 再度升起→复兴、复苏\n例句\nThere has been a ==resurgence== of interest in traditional crafts.","fields":{"Front":"resurgence","Back":"释义\n复苏；复兴\n词根词缀\nre-again, 再次+surgere (sub-+regere)to rise / to direct, 升起/拉直+-ence名词后缀\nre-(再次)+surgere(升起, sub-下+regere直起)+-ence→再度兴起、复苏、回潮。\n助记\nre-（再次）+ surg（=surgere 升起，sub- + regere，参 surge、insurgent）+ -ence（名词）→ 再度升起→复兴、复苏\n例句\nThere has been a ==resurgence== of interest in traditional crafts.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352631","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"rigidity","back":"释义\n僵硬；刻板\n词根词缀\nrigereto be stiff, 僵硬+-ity名词后缀\nrigere(僵硬)+-ity→坚硬、刚性; 引申为(态度/制度)僵化、刻板。\n助记\nrigid（=rigere 僵硬，参 rigid）+ -ity（名词后缀）→ 坚硬、刚性；引申为（态度/制度）僵化、刻板\n例句\nThe ==rigidity== of the rules made it hard to handle special cases.","fields":{"Front":"rigidity","Back":"释义\n僵硬；刻板\n词根词缀\nrigereto be stiff, 僵硬+-ity名词后缀\nrigere(僵硬)+-ity→坚硬、刚性; 引申为(态度/制度)僵化、刻板。\n助记\nrigid（=rigere 僵硬，参 rigid）+ -ity（名词后缀）→ 坚硬、刚性；引申为（态度/制度）僵化、刻板\n例句\nThe ==rigidity== of the rules made it hard to handle special cases.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352633","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"rudimentary","back":"释义\n基本的；初步的\n词根词缀\nrudisraw/rough, 粗糙的、未加工的+-ary (-mentum)形容词/名词后缀\nrudis(粗糙、生手)+-mentum(起步)+-ary→初步的、基本的; 也指未充分发育的。\n助记\nrud（=rudis 粗糙、未经训练，参 rude、erudite）+ -iment + -ary（…的）→ 处于起步粗糙阶段的→初步的、基础的\n例句\nHe has only a ==rudimentary== knowledge of computer programming.","fields":{"Front":"rudimentary","Back":"释义\n基本的；初步的\n词根词缀\nrudisraw/rough, 粗糙的、未加工的+-ary (-mentum)形容词/名词后缀\nrudis(粗糙、生手)+-mentum(起步)+-ary→初步的、基本的; 也指未充分发育的。\n助记\nrud（=rudis 粗糙、未经训练，参 rude、erudite）+ -iment + -ary（…的）→ 处于起步粗糙阶段的→初步的、基础的\n例句\nHe has only a ==rudimentary== knowledge of computer programming.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352635","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"scrupulous","back":"释义\n审慎的、严谨的\n词根词缀\nscrupulussmall sharp stone, 小尖石(鞋中硌脚→良心不安)+-ous形容词后缀\nscrupulus(小尖石, 比喻良心上的不安)+-ous→受良心约束的→严谨审慎的、一丝不苟的。\n助记\nscrup（=scrupulus 小尖石，鞋中硌脚喻良心不安，参 scruple）+ -ulous（…的）→ 受良心约束的→严谨审慎的、一丝不苟的\n例句\nThe accountant is ==scrupulous== in checking every tiny figure.","fields":{"Front":"scrupulous","Back":"释义\n审慎的、严谨的\n词根词缀\nscrupulussmall sharp stone, 小尖石(鞋中硌脚→良心不安)+-ous形容词后缀\nscrupulus(小尖石, 比喻良心上的不安)+-ous→受良心约束的→严谨审慎的、一丝不苟的。\n助记\nscrup（=scrupulus 小尖石，鞋中硌脚喻良心不安，参 scruple）+ -ulous（…的）→ 受良心约束的→严谨审慎的、一丝不苟的\n例句\nThe accountant is ==scrupulous== in checking every tiny figure.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352637","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sedate","back":"释义\n沉着的；镇静的\n词根词缀\nsedereto sit, 坐(sedare=使坐下、使平静)+-ate形容词/动词后缀\nsedere(坐, 使安定坐下)→沉稳安坐的→沉着的、庄重的。\n助记\nsed（=sedere 坐，sedare 使平静，参 sit、sediment）+ -ate（…的）→ 安坐沉稳的→镇静的、稳重的\n例句\nThe wedding was a quiet and ==sedate== affair with close family only.","fields":{"Front":"sedate","Back":"释义\n沉着的；镇静的\n词根词缀\nsedereto sit, 坐(sedare=使坐下、使平静)+-ate形容词/动词后缀\nsedere(坐, 使安定坐下)→沉稳安坐的→沉着的、庄重的。\n助记\nsed（=sedere 坐，sedare 使平静，参 sit、sediment）+ -ate（…的）→ 安坐沉稳的→镇静的、稳重的\n例句\nThe wedding was a quiet and ==sedate== affair with close family only.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352639","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"solicitous","back":"释义\n关切的\n词根词缀\nsollus + citus (ciere)whole + set in motion, 全部+被牵动+-ous形容词后缀\nsollus(全部)+citus(被牵动, <ciere激动)→心神全部被牵动的→焦虑关切的、殷切关怀的。\n助记\nsollus（全部）+ cit（=citus 被牵动，ciere 激动，参 solicit）+ -ous（…的）→ 心神全被牵动的→关切的、挂念的\n例句\nThe nurse was ==solicitous== about the comfort of her patients.","fields":{"Front":"solicitous","Back":"释义\n关切的\n词根词缀\nsollus + citus (ciere)whole + set in motion, 全部+被牵动+-ous形容词后缀\nsollus(全部)+citus(被牵动, <ciere激动)→心神全部被牵动的→焦虑关切的、殷切关怀的。\n助记\nsollus（全部）+ cit（=citus 被牵动，ciere 激动，参 solicit）+ -ous（…的）→ 心神全被牵动的→关切的、挂念的\n例句\nThe nurse was ==solicitous== about the comfort of her patients.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352641","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stark","back":"释义\n完全的；荒凉的\n词根词缀\nstearc (*ster-)stiff, 僵硬、坚固\n【简单日耳曼语词】古英语 stearc(僵硬、严厉), 源自 PIE *ster-(僵硬)→生硬的、荒凉的、赤裸分明的。\n助记\n古英语 stearc「僵硬、严厉」（PIE 词根 *ster- 僵硬）→ 生硬的、荒凉的、赤裸分明的\n例句\nThe ==stark== contrast between the two paintings was immediately obvious.","fields":{"Front":"stark","Back":"释义\n完全的；荒凉的\n词根词缀\nstearc (*ster-)stiff, 僵硬、坚固\n【简单日耳曼语词】古英语 stearc(僵硬、严厉), 源自 PIE *ster-(僵硬)→生硬的、荒凉的、赤裸分明的。\n助记\n古英语 stearc「僵硬、严厉」（PIE 词根 *ster- 僵硬）→ 生硬的、荒凉的、赤裸分明的\n例句\nThe ==stark== contrast between the two paintings was immediately obvious.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"sat800-list-07","name":"SAT800 核心 › List 07","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["sat800","imported"],"options":{},"cards":[{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352643","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"vacillate","back":"释义\n犹豫；摇摆\n词根词缀\nvacillareto sway/waver, 摇摆、踉跄+-ate动词后缀\nvacillare(摇摇晃晃)+-ate→(立场)摇摆不定、犹豫不决。\n助记\nvacill（=vacillare 摇晃、踉跄）+ -ate（动词）→ 摇摇晃晃→犹豫、摇摆不定\n例句\nHe continues to ==vacillate== between the two attractive offers.","fields":{"Front":"vacillate","Back":"释义\n犹豫；摇摆\n词根词缀\nvacillareto sway/waver, 摇摆、踉跄+-ate动词后缀\nvacillare(摇摇晃晃)+-ate→(立场)摇摆不定、犹豫不决。\n助记\nvacill（=vacillare 摇晃、踉跄）+ -ate（动词）→ 摇摇晃晃→犹豫、摇摆不定\n例句\nHe continues to ==vacillate== between the two attractive offers.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352645","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"vacuous","back":"释义\n空虚的；空洞的\n词根词缀\nvacuus empty / to be empty, 空的/空着+-ous形容词后缀\nvacuus(空的)+-ous→空泛的、无内容的; 引申为(表情)茫然的、(话语)空洞的。\n助记\nvacu（=vacuus 空的，vacare 空，参 vacant、vacuum、vacation）+ -ous（…的）→ 空泛的、（表情）茫然的、（话语）空洞的\n例句\nHer speech was full of ==vacuous== slogans with no real meaning.","fields":{"Front":"vacuous","Back":"释义\n空虚的；空洞的\n词根词缀\nvacuus empty / to be empty, 空的/空着+-ous形容词后缀\nvacuus(空的)+-ous→空泛的、无内容的; 引申为(表情)茫然的、(话语)空洞的。\n助记\nvacu（=vacuus 空的，vacare 空，参 vacant、vacuum、vacation）+ -ous（…的）→ 空泛的、（表情）茫然的、（话语）空洞的\n例句\nHer speech was full of ==vacuous== slogans with no real meaning.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352647","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"validate","back":"释义\n证实；使生效\n词根词缀\nvalidus strong / to be worth, 强壮/有价值+-ate动词后缀\nvalidus(强壮、有效)+-ate→使有效、批准; 引申为证实(观点)、认可。\n助记\nvalid（=validus 有效的，valere 强壮，参 valid、value）+ -ate（使…）→ 使有效→证实、验证、认可\n例句\nThe experiments were repeated to ==validate== the original findings.","fields":{"Front":"validate","Back":"释义\n证实；使生效\n词根词缀\nvalidus strong / to be worth, 强壮/有价值+-ate动词后缀\nvalidus(强壮、有效)+-ate→使有效、批准; 引申为证实(观点)、认可。\n助记\nvalid（=validus 有效的，valere 强壮，参 valid、value）+ -ate（使…）→ 使有效→证实、验证、认可\n例句\nThe experiments were repeated to ==validate== the original findings.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352649","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"vindication","back":"释义\n辩护；昭雪\n词根词缀\nvindex (vim+dicare)force + to proclaim, 力量+宣告+-ation名词后缀\nvis(力量)+dicare(宣告)→以力量主张权利→证明无罪、辩护、证实有理。\n助记\nvindic（=vindex 主张者、复仇者，vim 力 + dicare 宣告，参 vindicate、vindictive）+ -ation（名词）→ 以力主张权利→证明无罪、辩白、证实有理\n例句\nThe acquittal was a complete ==vindication== of his innocence.","fields":{"Front":"vindication","Back":"释义\n辩护；昭雪\n词根词缀\nvindex (vim+dicare)force + to proclaim, 力量+宣告+-ation名词后缀\nvis(力量)+dicare(宣告)→以力量主张权利→证明无罪、辩护、证实有理。\n助记\nvindic（=vindex 主张者、复仇者，vim 力 + dicare 宣告，参 vindicate、vindictive）+ -ation（名词）→ 以力主张权利→证明无罪、辩白、证实有理\n例句\nThe acquittal was a complete ==vindication== of his innocence.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352651","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"whim","back":"释义\n心血来潮；奇想\n词根词缀\nwhim-wham (uncertain)fanciful object, 奇想小物(或与北欧语 hvima 张望有关)\n【简单词, 来源不明】1690s 由 whim-wham(古怪小玩意儿)缩短而来, 指突发奇想、一时兴致、怪念头。\n助记\n由 whim-wham「古怪小玩意儿」缩短而来（来源不明）→ 突发奇想、一时兴致、怪念头\n例句\nOn a sudden ==whim==, she bought a ticket to Paris.","fields":{"Front":"whim","Back":"释义\n心血来潮；奇想\n词根词缀\nwhim-wham (uncertain)fanciful object, 奇想小物(或与北欧语 hvima 张望有关)\n【简单词, 来源不明】1690s 由 whim-wham(古怪小玩意儿)缩短而来, 指突发奇想、一时兴致、怪念头。\n助记\n由 whim-wham「古怪小玩意儿」缩短而来（来源不明）→ 突发奇想、一时兴致、怪念头\n例句\nOn a sudden ==whim==, she bought a ticket to Paris.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352653","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"adhere","back":"释义\n黏附；遵守\n词根词缀\nad-to, 附着于+haerereto stick, 粘、黏着\nad-(附着于)+haerere(粘)→黏附; 引申为坚持(观点/协议)、遵从。\n助记\nad-（附着于）+ here（=haerere 粘，参 cohere、hesitate、adhesive）→ 黏附→坚持（观点）、遵守（协议）\n例句\nThe wet paint will ==adhere== to any surface it touches.","fields":{"Front":"adhere","Back":"释义\n黏附；遵守\n词根词缀\nad-to, 附着于+haerereto stick, 粘、黏着\nad-(附着于)+haerere(粘)→黏附; 引申为坚持(观点/协议)、遵从。\n助记\nad-（附着于）+ here（=haerere 粘，参 cohere、hesitate、adhesive）→ 黏附→坚持（观点）、遵守（协议）\n例句\nThe wet paint will ==adhere== to any surface it touches.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352655","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"amateur","back":"释义\n业余的；外行\n词根词缀\namareto love, 热爱+-ateur (-ator)one who, …者(amator=爱好者)\namare(热爱)+-ator(者)→因爱好而非职业从事者→业余爱好者; 常含不熟练之意。\n助记\nam（=amare 爱，参 amiable、amorous）+ -ateur（…者，amator 爱好者）→ 因爱好而非职业从事者→业余爱好者\n例句\nAlthough he is an ==amateur==, he plays the piano very well.","fields":{"Front":"amateur","Back":"释义\n业余的；外行\n词根词缀\namareto love, 热爱+-ateur (-ator)one who, …者(amator=爱好者)\namare(热爱)+-ator(者)→因爱好而非职业从事者→业余爱好者; 常含不熟练之意。\n助记\nam（=amare 爱，参 amiable、amorous）+ -ateur（…者，amator 爱好者）→ 因爱好而非职业从事者→业余爱好者\n例句\nAlthough he is an ==amateur==, he plays the piano very well.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352657","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ameliorate","back":"释义\n改善；改良\n词根词缀\nmeliorbetter, 更好(bonus 的比较级)+-ate动词后缀(ameliorare=使更好)\nmelior(更好)+-ate→使更好、改善、改良。\n助记\na-（向）+ melior（=melior 更好，bonus 的比较级）+ -ate（使…）→ 使更好→改善、改进\n例句\nThe new policy should ==ameliorate== conditions for the poor.","fields":{"Front":"ameliorate","Back":"释义\n改善；改良\n词根词缀\nmeliorbetter, 更好(bonus 的比较级)+-ate动词后缀(ameliorare=使更好)\nmelior(更好)+-ate→使更好、改善、改良。\n助记\na-（向）+ melior（=melior 更好，bonus 的比较级）+ -ate（使…）→ 使更好→改善、改进\n例句\nThe new policy should ==ameliorate== conditions for the poor.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352659","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"anecdotal","back":"释义\n逸事的；趣闻的\n词根词缀\nan-not, 未、不+ekdotos (ek-+didonai)given out / to give, 发表/给予+-al形容词后缀\nan-(未)+ekdotos(发表的)→未公开的轶事、逸闻→轶事的; 引申为道听途说、非系统证据的。\n助记\nan-（未）+ ecdot（=ekdotos 发表的，ek- 出 + didonai 给，参 anecdote、dose）+ -al（…的）→ 未公开的轶事→轶事的、道听途说的\n例句\nHis evidence was merely ==anecdotal== and not scientifically reliable.","fields":{"Front":"anecdotal","Back":"释义\n逸事的；趣闻的\n词根词缀\nan-not, 未、不+ekdotos (ek-+didonai)given out / to give, 发表/给予+-al形容词后缀\nan-(未)+ekdotos(发表的)→未公开的轶事、逸闻→轶事的; 引申为道听途说、非系统证据的。\n助记\nan-（未）+ ecdot（=ekdotos 发表的，ek- 出 + didonai 给，参 anecdote、dose）+ -al（…的）→ 未公开的轶事→轶事的、道听途说的\n例句\nHis evidence was merely ==anecdotal== and not scientifically reliable.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352661","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"anomalous","back":"释义\n反常的；不规则的\n词根词缀\nan-not, 无、不+homalos (homos)even / same, 均匀/相同+-ous形容词后缀\nan-(无)+homalos(均匀的, <homos相同)+-ous→不均匀、不寻常→反常的、异常的。\n助记\nan-（无、不）+ omal（=homalos 均匀的，homos 相同，参 anomaly）+ -ous（…的）→ 不均匀、不寻常→反常的\n例句\nOne ==anomalous== result did not fit the rest of the data.","fields":{"Front":"anomalous","Back":"释义\n反常的；不规则的\n词根词缀\nan-not, 无、不+homalos (homos)even / same, 均匀/相同+-ous形容词后缀\nan-(无)+homalos(均匀的, <homos相同)+-ous→不均匀、不寻常→反常的、异常的。\n助记\nan-（无、不）+ omal（=homalos 均匀的，homos 相同，参 anomaly）+ -ous（…的）→ 不均匀、不寻常→反常的\n例句\nOne ==anomalous== result did not fit the rest of the data.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352663","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"aspersion","back":"释义\n诽谤；中伤\n词根词缀\na-向（ad-）+spers撒、洒（spargere）+-ion名词后缀\n朝人身上泼洒脏水→诽谤、中伤。\n助记\na-（向）+ spers（洒，参 sprinkle 撒、disperse 散开）+ -ion → 泼脏水→诽谤、中伤。\n例句\nHe cast ==aspersion== on her character without any proof.","fields":{"Front":"aspersion","Back":"释义\n诽谤；中伤\n词根词缀\na-向（ad-）+spers撒、洒（spargere）+-ion名词后缀\n朝人身上泼洒脏水→诽谤、中伤。\n助记\na-（向）+ spers（洒，参 sprinkle 撒、disperse 散开）+ -ion → 泼脏水→诽谤、中伤。\n例句\nHe cast ==aspersion== on her character without any proof.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352665","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"augment","back":"释义\n增加；增大\n词根词缀\naugereto increase, 增加+-ment动词/名词后缀(augmentare)\naugere(增加)+-ment→增大、增加、扩充。\n助记\naug（=augere 增加，参 auction、august、author）+ -ment（动词/名词后缀）→ 增大、增加、扩充\n例句\nShe took a second job to ==augment== her family's income.","fields":{"Front":"augment","Back":"释义\n增加；增大\n词根词缀\naugereto increase, 增加+-ment动词/名词后缀(augmentare)\naugere(增加)+-ment→增大、增加、扩充。\n助记\naug（=augere 增加，参 auction、august、author）+ -ment（动词/名词后缀）→ 增大、增加、扩充\n例句\nShe took a second job to ==augment== her family's income.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352667","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"austerity","back":"释义\n紧缩；节俭\n词根词缀\nausterusdry/harsh, 干燥、严酷+-ity名词后缀\nausteros(干燥、辛辣严酷)+-ity→严厉、朴素节制; 经济紧缩。\n助记\nauster（=austerus 干燥、严酷）+ -ity（名词）→ 严酷、朴素节制→节俭、严厉；（经济）紧缩\n例句\nThe government introduced ==austerity== measures to reduce debt.","fields":{"Front":"austerity","Back":"释义\n紧缩；节俭\n词根词缀\nausterusdry/harsh, 干燥、严酷+-ity名词后缀\nausteros(干燥、辛辣严酷)+-ity→严厉、朴素节制; 经济紧缩。\n助记\nauster（=austerus 干燥、严酷）+ -ity（名词）→ 严酷、朴素节制→节俭、严厉；（经济）紧缩\n例句\nThe government introduced ==austerity== measures to reduce debt.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352669","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"autocratic","back":"释义\n独裁的；专制的\n词根词缀\nautos + kratosself + power, 自我+权力+-ic形容词后缀\nautos(自己)+kratos(权力)→自己独揽大权→独裁的、专横的。\n助记\nauto（=autos 自己）+ crat（=kratos 权力，参 democrat、aristocrat、bureaucrat）+ -ic（…的）→ 自己独揽大权→独裁的、专制的\n例句\nThe ==autocratic== manager made all decisions without consulting anyone.","fields":{"Front":"autocratic","Back":"释义\n独裁的；专制的\n词根词缀\nautos + kratosself + power, 自我+权力+-ic形容词后缀\nautos(自己)+kratos(权力)→自己独揽大权→独裁的、专横的。\n助记\nauto（=autos 自己）+ crat（=kratos 权力，参 democrat、aristocrat、bureaucrat）+ -ic（…的）→ 自己独揽大权→独裁的、专制的\n例句\nThe ==autocratic== manager made all decisions without consulting anyone.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352671","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"banal","back":"释义\n陈腐的；平庸的\n词根词缀\nbanproclamation/feudal summons, 公告/封建征召(全体佃户公用的)+-al形容词后缀\nban(封建主公告、全体佃户共用的)+-al→人人可得、平庸无奇→陈腐的、乏味的。\n助记\nban（封建公告、全体佃户共用之物）+ -al（…的）→ 人人共用、随处可见的→平庸的、陈腐乏味的\n例句\nThe movie's dialogue was dull and ==banal==.","fields":{"Front":"banal","Back":"释义\n陈腐的；平庸的\n词根词缀\nbanproclamation/feudal summons, 公告/封建征召(全体佃户公用的)+-al形容词后缀\nban(封建主公告、全体佃户共用的)+-al→人人可得、平庸无奇→陈腐的、乏味的。\n助记\nban（封建公告、全体佃户共用之物）+ -al（…的）→ 人人共用、随处可见的→平庸的、陈腐乏味的\n例句\nThe movie's dialogue was dull and ==banal==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352673","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"bombastic","back":"释义\n夸大的；浮夸的\n词根词缀\nbombax cotton/silk, 棉絮/丝(衬垫物)+-ic形容词后缀(由 bombast 衬垫引申)\nbombax(棉絮衬垫)→像棉絮一样把话语填得鼓胀→言过其实的、夸大浮夸的。\n助记\nbombast（=bombax 棉絮、bombyx 丝，衬垫）+ -ic（…的）→ 像棉絮把话填得鼓胀→夸大浮夸的、华而不实的\n例句\nHis ==bombastic== speech was full of empty and exaggerated claims.","fields":{"Front":"bombastic","Back":"释义\n夸大的；浮夸的\n词根词缀\nbombax cotton/silk, 棉絮/丝(衬垫物)+-ic形容词后缀(由 bombast 衬垫引申)\nbombax(棉絮衬垫)→像棉絮一样把话语填得鼓胀→言过其实的、夸大浮夸的。\n助记\nbombast（=bombax 棉絮、bombyx 丝，衬垫）+ -ic（…的）→ 像棉絮把话填得鼓胀→夸大浮夸的、华而不实的\n例句\nHis ==bombastic== speech was full of empty and exaggerated claims.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352675","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cathartic","back":"释义\n宣泄的；n.泻药\n词根词缀\nkathairein to cleanse / pure, 净化/纯净+-ic形容词/名词后缀\nkatharos(纯净)+-ic→净化的; 医学上指泻药, 文艺/心理上指情感宣泄的。\n助记\ncathar（=katharos 纯净，kathairein 净化）+ -tic（…的）→ 起净化作用的→（情感）宣泄的、导泻的\n例句\nWriting about her problems had a ==cathartic== effect on her.","fields":{"Front":"cathartic","Back":"释义\n宣泄的；n.泻药\n词根词缀\nkathairein to cleanse / pure, 净化/纯净+-ic形容词/名词后缀\nkatharos(纯净)+-ic→净化的; 医学上指泻药, 文艺/心理上指情感宣泄的。\n助记\ncathar（=katharos 纯净，kathairein 净化）+ -tic（…的）→ 起净化作用的→（情感）宣泄的、导泻的\n例句\nWriting about her problems had a ==cathartic== effect on her.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352677","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"censure","back":"释义\n斥，谴责\n词根词缀\ncensereto assess/opinion, 评估、评判(古罗马监察官之责)+-ure名词后缀(censura)\ncensere(评判、评定)+-ure→严厉批评、公开谴责。\n助记\ncens（=censere 评判，古罗马监察官，参 censor、census）+ -ure（名词）→ 公开评判指责→谴责、严厉批评\n例句\nThe committee voted to ==censure== the dishonest official.","fields":{"Front":"censure","Back":"释义\n斥，谴责\n词根词缀\ncensereto assess/opinion, 评估、评判(古罗马监察官之责)+-ure名词后缀(censura)\ncensere(评判、评定)+-ure→严厉批评、公开谴责。\n助记\ncens（=censere 评判，古罗马监察官，参 censor、census）+ -ure（名词）→ 公开评判指责→谴责、严厉批评\n例句\nThe committee voted to ==censure== the dishonest official.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352679","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"chicanery","back":"释义\n诡计；欺诈\n词根词缀\nchicanerto quibble/pettifog, 诡辩、玩花招+-ery名词后缀, 表行为/手段\n【法语借入, 词源不确定】chicaner(诡辩、在法律细节上耍花招)+-ery→诡计、狡辩、钻营。\n助记\n法语 chicaner「诡辩、在法律细节上耍花招」+ -ery（名词）→ 诡计、狡辩、诈骗\n例句\nThe contract was full of legal ==chicanery== designed to trick buyers.","fields":{"Front":"chicanery","Back":"释义\n诡计；欺诈\n词根词缀\nchicanerto quibble/pettifog, 诡辩、玩花招+-ery名词后缀, 表行为/手段\n【法语借入, 词源不确定】chicaner(诡辩、在法律细节上耍花招)+-ery→诡计、狡辩、钻营。\n助记\n法语 chicaner「诡辩、在法律细节上耍花招」+ -ery（名词）→ 诡计、狡辩、诈骗\n例句\nThe contract was full of legal ==chicanery== designed to trick buyers.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352681","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"chimera","back":"释义\n妄想；嵌合体\n词根词缀\nchimairashe-goat, 母山羊(狮头羊身蛇尾的怪兽)\n源自希腊神话中吐火怪兽 Chimaira(狮头羊身蛇尾)→虚幻妄想、不可能实现的梦想。\n助记\n希腊神话吐火怪兽 Chimaira（狮头羊身蛇尾）→ 怪物；引申为不切实际的幻想\n例句\nHis dream of a perfect society was a mere ==chimera==.","fields":{"Front":"chimera","Back":"释义\n妄想；嵌合体\n词根词缀\nchimairashe-goat, 母山羊(狮头羊身蛇尾的怪兽)\n源自希腊神话中吐火怪兽 Chimaira(狮头羊身蛇尾)→虚幻妄想、不可能实现的梦想。\n助记\n希腊神话吐火怪兽 Chimaira（狮头羊身蛇尾）→ 怪物；引申为不切实际的幻想\n例句\nHis dream of a perfect society was a mere ==chimera==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352683","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"clandestine","back":"释义\n秘密的；暗中的\n词根词缀\nclamsecretly, 秘密地+-estine形容词后缀( clandestinus)\nclam(秘密地)+-estine→秘密的、暗中策划的(尤指违法/秘密行动)。\n助记\nclam（=clam 秘密地，注意与 clamare「呼喊」相反）+ -destine（…的）→ 秘密进行的、暗中的（多指违法）\n例句\nThey planned a ==clandestine== meeting in a quiet cafe.","fields":{"Front":"clandestine","Back":"释义\n秘密的；暗中的\n词根词缀\nclamsecretly, 秘密地+-estine形容词后缀( clandestinus)\nclam(秘密地)+-estine→秘密的、暗中策划的(尤指违法/秘密行动)。\n助记\nclam（=clam 秘密地，注意与 clamare「呼喊」相反）+ -destine（…的）→ 秘密进行的、暗中的（多指违法）\n例句\nThey planned a ==clandestine== meeting in a quiet cafe.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352685","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cohesive","back":"释义\n团结的、有凝聚力\n词根词缀\nco- (com-)together, 共同、一起+haerereto stick, 粘、黏着+-ive形容词后缀\nco-(一起)+haerere(粘)+-ive→粘在一起的→凝聚的、有内聚力的。\n助记\nco-（一起）+ hes（=haerere 粘，参 adhere、cohere、hesitate）+ -ive（…的）→ 粘在一起的→有凝聚力的、团结的\n例句\nThe team worked together as a ==cohesive== unit during the project.","fields":{"Front":"cohesive","Back":"释义\n团结的、有凝聚力\n词根词缀\nco- (com-)together, 共同、一起+haerereto stick, 粘、黏着+-ive形容词后缀\nco-(一起)+haerere(粘)+-ive→粘在一起的→凝聚的、有内聚力的。\n助记\nco-（一起）+ hes（=haerere 粘，参 adhere、cohere、hesitate）+ -ive（…的）→ 粘在一起的→有凝聚力的、团结的\n例句\nThe team worked together as a ==cohesive== unit during the project.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352687","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"commemorate","back":"释义\n纪念；庆祝\n词根词缀\ncom-intensive/together, 加强/共同+memormindful, 记得的+-ate动词后缀\ncom-(共同)+memor(记得)+-ate→共同铭记→纪念、缅怀。\n助记\ncom-（共同、加强）+ memor（=memor 记得的，参 memory、memorial、memorize）+ -ate（动词）→ 共同铭记→纪念、缅怀\n例句\nA statue was built to ==commemorate== the brave soldiers.","fields":{"Front":"commemorate","Back":"释义\n纪念；庆祝\n词根词缀\ncom-intensive/together, 加强/共同+memormindful, 记得的+-ate动词后缀\ncom-(共同)+memor(记得)+-ate→共同铭记→纪念、缅怀。\n助记\ncom-（共同、加强）+ memor（=memor 记得的，参 memory、memorial、memorize）+ -ate（动词）→ 共同铭记→纪念、缅怀\n例句\nA statue was built to ==commemorate== the brave soldiers.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352689","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"commonplace","back":"释义\n平常的；常见的\n词根词缀\ncommon + placecommon + place, 普通+处所(通用论题)\n【复合词】译自拉丁 locus communis(亚里士多德'通用论题')→common+place→平常事、老生常谈; 形容词指平淡无奇的。\n助记\ncommon（普通）+ place（处所，译自拉丁 locus communis「通用论题」）→ 处处皆有的→平常的、老生常谈的\n例句\nSuch accidents were once ==commonplace== on this dangerous road.","fields":{"Front":"commonplace","Back":"释义\n平常的；常见的\n词根词缀\ncommon + placecommon + place, 普通+处所(通用论题)\n【复合词】译自拉丁 locus communis(亚里士多德'通用论题')→common+place→平常事、老生常谈; 形容词指平淡无奇的。\n助记\ncommon（普通）+ place（处所，译自拉丁 locus communis「通用论题」）→ 处处皆有的→平常的、老生常谈的\n例句\nSuch accidents were once ==commonplace== on this dangerous road.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352691","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"concession","back":"释义\n让步；特许权\n词根词缀\ncon- (com-)completely, 完全、退让+cedereto go/yield, 走/退让(concedere=让步)+-ion名词后缀\ncon-(完全)+cedere(退让)+-ion→让步、妥协; 也指(政府授予的)特许权。\n助记\ncon-（完全）+ cess（=cedere 退让，参 concede、recede、access）+ -ion（名词）→ 退让→让步；特许权\n例句\nAfter long talks, the union won a small ==concession== from management.","fields":{"Front":"concession","Back":"释义\n让步；特许权\n词根词缀\ncon- (com-)completely, 完全、退让+cedereto go/yield, 走/退让(concedere=让步)+-ion名词后缀\ncon-(完全)+cedere(退让)+-ion→让步、妥协; 也指(政府授予的)特许权。\n助记\ncon-（完全）+ cess（=cedere 退让，参 concede、recede、access）+ -ion（名词）→ 退让→让步；特许权\n例句\nAfter long talks, the union won a small ==concession== from management.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352693","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"connoisseur","back":"释义\n鉴赏家；行家\n词根词缀\ncon- (com-)intensive, 加强+noscere (gnoscere)to know, 认识(cognoscere=熟知)+-euragent 者\ncon-(加强)+noscere(认识)+-eur→(对艺术/品味)深知者→鉴赏家、行家。\n助记\ncon-（加强）+ nois（=noscere 认识、cognoscere，参 recognize、cognition）+ -seur（…者）→ 深知其味者→鉴赏家、行家\n例句\nAs a ==connoisseur== of fine wine, he could identify any vintage by taste.","fields":{"Front":"connoisseur","Back":"释义\n鉴赏家；行家\n词根词缀\ncon- (com-)intensive, 加强+noscere (gnoscere)to know, 认识(cognoscere=熟知)+-euragent 者\ncon-(加强)+noscere(认识)+-eur→(对艺术/品味)深知者→鉴赏家、行家。\n助记\ncon-（加强）+ nois（=noscere 认识、cognoscere，参 recognize、cognition）+ -seur（…者）→ 深知其味者→鉴赏家、行家\n例句\nAs a ==connoisseur== of fine wine, he could identify any vintage by taste.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352695","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"corroborate","back":"释义\n证实；确证\n词根词缀\ncom-intensive, 加强+robur (roboris)oak/strength, 橡木/力量+-ate动词后缀\ncom-(加强)+robur(橡木般坚固)+-ate→使坚固→(以证据)证实、确证。\n助记\ncor-（com- 加强）+ robor（=robur 橡木、力量，参 robust、robot）+ -ate（动词）→ 使如橡木般坚固→（以证据）证实、确证\n例句\nNew evidence was found to ==corroborate== the witness's account.","fields":{"Front":"corroborate","Back":"释义\n证实；确证\n词根词缀\ncom-intensive, 加强+robur (roboris)oak/strength, 橡木/力量+-ate动词后缀\ncom-(加强)+robur(橡木般坚固)+-ate→使坚固→(以证据)证实、确证。\n助记\ncor-（com- 加强）+ robor（=robur 橡木、力量，参 robust、robot）+ -ate（动词）→ 使如橡木般坚固→（以证据）证实、确证\n例句\nNew evidence was found to ==corroborate== the witness's account.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352697","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"deferential","back":"释义\n恭敬的\n词根词缀\nde-down, 向下+ferreto carry, 携带(deferre=带下、呈交、退让)+-ential形容词后缀\nde-(向下)+ferre(带)+-ential→把(自己姿态)放低、呈交→恭顺的、恭敬的。\n助记\nde-（向下）+ fer（=ferre 携带，deferre 呈交、退让，参 differ、refer）+ -ential（…的）→ 把姿态放低→恭敬的、顺从的\n例句\nThe young assistant spoke in a ==deferential== manner to the senior partner.","fields":{"Front":"deferential","Back":"释义\n恭敬的\n词根词缀\nde-down, 向下+ferreto carry, 携带(deferre=带下、呈交、退让)+-ential形容词后缀\nde-(向下)+ferre(带)+-ential→把(自己姿态)放低、呈交→恭顺的、恭敬的。\n助记\nde-（向下）+ fer（=ferre 携带，deferre 呈交、退让，参 differ、refer）+ -ential（…的）→ 把姿态放低→恭敬的、顺从的\n例句\nThe young assistant spoke in a ==deferential== manner to the senior partner.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352699","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dilatory","back":"释义\n拖拉的；拖延的\n词根词缀\ndis- (di-)apart, 分开、拖延+ferreto carry, 携带(differre=带开、拖延)+-ory形容词后缀\ndi-(分开)+ferre(带)→把事情拖开不办→拖延的、迟缓的。\n助记\ndi-（dis- 分开）+ lat（=ferre 携带，differre 带开、拖延，参 relate、translate）+ -ory（…的）→ 把事拖开不办→拖延的、迟缓的\n例句\nHis ==dilatory== habits meant the work was always submitted late.","fields":{"Front":"dilatory","Back":"释义\n拖拉的；拖延的\n词根词缀\ndis- (di-)apart, 分开、拖延+ferreto carry, 携带(differre=带开、拖延)+-ory形容词后缀\ndi-(分开)+ferre(带)→把事情拖开不办→拖延的、迟缓的。\n助记\ndi-（dis- 分开）+ lat（=ferre 携带，differre 带开、拖延，参 relate、translate）+ -ory（…的）→ 把事拖开不办→拖延的、迟缓的\n例句\nHis ==dilatory== habits meant the work was always submitted late.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352701","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"discrete","back":"释义\n分离的；不连续的\n词根词缀\ndis-apart, 分开+cernereto sift/separate, 筛选、辨别\ndis-(分开)+cernere(筛选)→筛分开的→各自独立的、离散的(注意与 discreet 谨慎的区分)。\n助记\ndis-（分开）+ crete（=cernere 筛选、辨别，参 discern、secret、certain）→ 筛分开的→各自独立的、离散的（区别 discreet 谨慎）\n例句\nThe two issues are quite ==discrete== and should be handled separately.","fields":{"Front":"discrete","Back":"释义\n分离的；不连续的\n词根词缀\ndis-apart, 分开+cernereto sift/separate, 筛选、辨别\ndis-(分开)+cernere(筛选)→筛分开的→各自独立的、离散的(注意与 discreet 谨慎的区分)。\n助记\ndis-（分开）+ crete（=cernere 筛选、辨别，参 discern、secret、certain）→ 筛分开的→各自独立的、离散的（区别 discreet 谨慎）\n例句\nThe two issues are quite ==discrete== and should be handled separately.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352703","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"disorient","back":"释义\n使迷惑；使迷失\n词根词缀\ndis-away, 离开、失去+oriens (orient)rising sun/east, 日出/东方(原义辨认方向)+-ate/-er动词后缀(désorienter)\ndis-(失去)+orient(东方、方位)→失去方向感→使迷失方向、使困惑。\n助记\ndis-（失去）+ orient（=oriens 日出、东方，参 orient、origin）→ 失去东方方位→使迷失方向、使困惑\n例句\nThe strange dream began to ==disorient== her when she woke up.","fields":{"Front":"disorient","Back":"释义\n使迷惑；使迷失\n词根词缀\ndis-away, 离开、失去+oriens (orient)rising sun/east, 日出/东方(原义辨认方向)+-ate/-er动词后缀(désorienter)\ndis-(失去)+orient(东方、方位)→失去方向感→使迷失方向、使困惑。\n助记\ndis-（失去）+ orient（=oriens 日出、东方，参 orient、origin）→ 失去东方方位→使迷失方向、使困惑\n例句\nThe strange dream began to ==disorient== her when she woke up.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352705","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"elusive","back":"释义\n难懂的；难捉摸的\n词根词缀\ne- (ex-)out/away, 逃出+ludereto play, 玩耍(eludere=戏弄、逃脱)+-ive形容词后缀\ne-(逃出)+ludere(戏耍)+-ive→像戏耍般躲开的→难以捉摸的、易逃逸的。\n助记\ne-（ex- 出）+ lus（=ludere 戏耍，eludere 逃脱，参 elude、delude、ludicrous）+ -ive（…的）→ 像戏耍般躲开的→难以捉摸的、逃避的\n例句\nThe meaning of the old poem remains strangely ==elusive==.","fields":{"Front":"elusive","Back":"释义\n难懂的；难捉摸的\n词根词缀\ne- (ex-)out/away, 逃出+ludereto play, 玩耍(eludere=戏弄、逃脱)+-ive形容词后缀\ne-(逃出)+ludere(戏耍)+-ive→像戏耍般躲开的→难以捉摸的、易逃逸的。\n助记\ne-（ex- 出）+ lus（=ludere 戏耍，eludere 逃脱，参 elude、delude、ludicrous）+ -ive（…的）→ 像戏耍般躲开的→难以捉摸的、逃避的\n例句\nThe meaning of the old poem remains strangely ==elusive==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352707","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"enhance","back":"释义\n提高；增强\n词根词缀\nin- (en-)in/up, 向上+altushigh, 高\nen-(向上)+haut(高, <altus)→抬高→提高、增强、美化。\n助记\nen-（向上）+ hance（=haut/altus 高，参 exalt、altitude）→ 抬高→提高、增强、美化\n例句\nA little seasoning will ==enhance== the flavor of the soup.","fields":{"Front":"enhance","Back":"释义\n提高；增强\n词根词缀\nin- (en-)in/up, 向上+altushigh, 高\nen-(向上)+haut(高, <altus)→抬高→提高、增强、美化。\n助记\nen-（向上）+ hance（=haut/altus 高，参 exalt、altitude）→ 抬高→提高、增强、美化\n例句\nA little seasoning will ==enhance== the flavor of the soup.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352709","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"evoke","back":"释义\n唤起；引起\n词根词缀\ne- (ex-)out, 出+vocareto call, 呼叫\ne-(出)+vocare(召唤)→(把情感/记忆)唤出来→唤起、勾起。\n助记\ne-（ex- 出）+ vok（=vocare 呼唤，参 invoke、provoke、revoke）→ 唤出来→唤起、勾起（记忆/情感）\n例句\nThe old photograph ==evoked== happy memories of her childhood.","fields":{"Front":"evoke","Back":"释义\n唤起；引起\n词根词缀\ne- (ex-)out, 出+vocareto call, 呼叫\ne-(出)+vocare(召唤)→(把情感/记忆)唤出来→唤起、勾起。\n助记\ne-（ex- 出）+ vok（=vocare 呼唤，参 invoke、provoke、revoke）→ 唤出来→唤起、勾起（记忆/情感）\n例句\nThe old photograph ==evoked== happy memories of her childhood.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352711","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"aloof","back":"释义\n冷漠的；疏远的\n词根词缀\na-在…状态+loof背风处、受风面（loef）\n冷淡的、疏远的——航海用语“逆风(a-loof)”→避开、保持距离。\n助记\na-（在…状态）+ loof（=loef 迎风面，航海口令 luff）→ 逆风避开、保持距离→冷淡疏远的\n例句\nHe remained ==aloof== from his coworkers at the office party.","fields":{"Front":"aloof","Back":"释义\n冷漠的；疏远的\n词根词缀\na-在…状态+loof背风处、受风面（loef）\n冷淡的、疏远的——航海用语“逆风(a-loof)”→避开、保持距离。\n助记\na-（在…状态）+ loof（=loef 迎风面，航海口令 luff）→ 逆风避开、保持距离→冷淡疏远的\n例句\nHe remained ==aloof== from his coworkers at the office party.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352713","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"impartial","back":"释义\n公正的、不偏不倚\n词根词缀\nin- (im-)not, 不+pars (partis)part, 部分(偏护某一方)+-ial形容词后缀\nim-(不)+pars(部分、一方)+-ial→不偏袒任何一方→公正的、不偏不倚的。\n助记\nim-（不）+ part（=pars 部分、一方，参 part、partial）+ -ial（…的）→ 不偏袒任何一方→公正的、不偏不倚的\n例句\nA good judge must remain ==impartial== in every case.","fields":{"Front":"impartial","Back":"释义\n公正的、不偏不倚\n词根词缀\nin- (im-)not, 不+pars (partis)part, 部分(偏护某一方)+-ial形容词后缀\nim-(不)+pars(部分、一方)+-ial→不偏袒任何一方→公正的、不偏不倚的。\n助记\nim-（不）+ part（=pars 部分、一方，参 part、partial）+ -ial（…的）→ 不偏袒任何一方→公正的、不偏不倚的\n例句\nA good judge must remain ==impartial== in every case.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352715","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"imperious","back":"释义\n专横的；傲慢的\n词根词缀\nin- (im-)upon, 命令于+parareto prepare/order, 准备/命令(imperare=命令)+-ous形容词后缀(imperium 命令)\nim-(于…之上)+parare(命令)+-ous→像发号施令一样→专横的、傲慢的、迫切的。\n助记\nim-（in- 在上）+ per（=parare 命令，imperare，参 empire、imperative）+ -ious（…的）→ 发号施令的→专横的、傲慢的\n例句\nHer ==imperious== tone made it clear that she expected immediate obedience.","fields":{"Front":"imperious","Back":"释义\n专横的；傲慢的\n词根词缀\nin- (im-)upon, 命令于+parareto prepare/order, 准备/命令(imperare=命令)+-ous形容词后缀(imperium 命令)\nim-(于…之上)+parare(命令)+-ous→像发号施令一样→专横的、傲慢的、迫切的。\n助记\nim-（in- 在上）+ per（=parare 命令，imperare，参 empire、imperative）+ -ious（…的）→ 发号施令的→专横的、傲慢的\n例句\nHer ==imperious== tone made it clear that she expected immediate obedience.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352717","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"imperturbable","back":"释义\n冷静的；沉着的\n词根词缀\nin- (im-)not, 不+turbareto disturb, 搅动(per-加强+ turba 骚乱)+-ableable to be disturbed, 可被扰动的\nim-(不)+turbare(扰动)+-able→不受扰动的→沉着的、泰然自若的。\n助记\nim-（不）+ perturb（=turbare 扰动，per- 加强 + turba 骚乱，参 disturb、turbulent）+ -able（可…的）→ 无法被扰动的→沉着的、泰然自若的\n例句\nThe calm captain remained ==imperturbable== even during the fierce storm.","fields":{"Front":"imperturbable","Back":"释义\n冷静的；沉着的\n词根词缀\nin- (im-)not, 不+turbareto disturb, 搅动(per-加强+ turba 骚乱)+-ableable to be disturbed, 可被扰动的\nim-(不)+turbare(扰动)+-able→不受扰动的→沉着的、泰然自若的。\n助记\nim-（不）+ perturb（=turbare 扰动，per- 加强 + turba 骚乱，参 disturb、turbulent）+ -able（可…的）→ 无法被扰动的→沉着的、泰然自若的\n例句\nThe calm captain remained ==imperturbable== even during the fierce storm.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352719","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"impetuous","back":"释义\n冲动的；鲁莽的\n词根词缀\nin- (im-)toward, 冲向+petereto seek/rush at, 寻求/冲向(impetere=冲击)+-ous形容词后缀(impetus 冲动)\nim-(冲向)+petere(追求、撞击)+-ous→冲动撞击般的→鲁莽的、急躁冲动的。\n助记\nim-（in- 冲向）+ pet（=petere 冲向、寻求，impetus，参 compete、appetite、repeat）+ -uous（…的）→ 冲动撞击般的→鲁莽的、急躁的\n例句\nHis ==impetuous== decision to quit was regretted the very next day.","fields":{"Front":"impetuous","Back":"释义\n冲动的；鲁莽的\n词根词缀\nin- (im-)toward, 冲向+petereto seek/rush at, 寻求/冲向(impetere=冲击)+-ous形容词后缀(impetus 冲动)\nim-(冲向)+petere(追求、撞击)+-ous→冲动撞击般的→鲁莽的、急躁冲动的。\n助记\nim-（in- 冲向）+ pet（=petere 冲向、寻求，impetus，参 compete、appetite、repeat）+ -uous（…的）→ 冲动撞击般的→鲁莽的、急躁的\n例句\nHis ==impetuous== decision to quit was regretted the very next day.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352721","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inclusive","back":"释义\n包含的；包容的\n词根词缀\nin-in, 在内+claudereto shut, 关闭(includere=关在里面)+-ive形容词后缀\nin-(在内)+claudere(关闭)+-ive→把…都包含在内的→包容的、包括的。\n助记\nin-（在内）+ clus（=claudere 关闭，includere 关在里面，参 include、exclusive）+ -ive（…的）→ 都关在里面的→包容的、包括的\n例句\nThe club prides itself on being ==inclusive== to people of all backgrounds.","fields":{"Front":"inclusive","Back":"释义\n包含的；包容的\n词根词缀\nin-in, 在内+claudereto shut, 关闭(includere=关在里面)+-ive形容词后缀\nin-(在内)+claudere(关闭)+-ive→把…都包含在内的→包容的、包括的。\n助记\nin-（在内）+ clus（=claudere 关闭，includere 关在里面，参 include、exclusive）+ -ive（…的）→ 都关在里面的→包容的、包括的\n例句\nThe club prides itself on being ==inclusive== to people of all backgrounds.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352723","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"indelible","back":"释义\n不可磨灭\n词根词缀\nin-not, 不、不可+delereto blot out/destroy, 擦除、毁灭+-ibleable to be erased, 可擦去的\nin-(不可)+delere(擦除)+-ible→擦不掉的→无法抹去的、刻骨铭心的。\n助记\nin-（不）+ del（=delere 擦除、毁灭，参 delete）+ -ible（可…的）→ 擦不掉的→无法抹去的、刻骨铭心的\n例句\nThe trip left an ==indelible== impression on her young mind.","fields":{"Front":"indelible","Back":"释义\n不可磨灭\n词根词缀\nin-not, 不、不可+delereto blot out/destroy, 擦除、毁灭+-ibleable to be erased, 可擦去的\nin-(不可)+delere(擦除)+-ible→擦不掉的→无法抹去的、刻骨铭心的。\n助记\nin-（不）+ del（=delere 擦除、毁灭，参 delete）+ -ible（可…的）→ 擦不掉的→无法抹去的、刻骨铭心的\n例句\nThe trip left an ==indelible== impression on her young mind.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352725","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inducement","back":"释义\n诱因；动机\n词根词缀\nin-in/on, 引入+ducereto lead, 引导+-ment名词后缀\nin-(引入)+ducere(引导)+-ment→引导(人做某事)之物→诱因、动机、刺激。\n助记\nin-（引入）+ duce（=ducere 引导，参 induce、produce、deduce）+ -ment（名词）→ 引导人去做之物→诱因、动机、刺激\n例句\nThe company offered a bonus as an ==inducement== to attract new staff.","fields":{"Front":"inducement","Back":"释义\n诱因；动机\n词根词缀\nin-in/on, 引入+ducereto lead, 引导+-ment名词后缀\nin-(引入)+ducere(引导)+-ment→引导(人做某事)之物→诱因、动机、刺激。\n助记\nin-（引入）+ duce（=ducere 引导，参 induce、produce、deduce）+ -ment（名词）→ 引导人去做之物→诱因、动机、刺激\n例句\nThe company offered a bonus as an ==inducement== to attract new staff.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352727","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"intricate","back":"释义\n错综复杂\n词根词缀\nin-in, 在其中+tricaetrifles/perplexities, 琐碎麻烦、纠缠+-ate形容词/动词后缀\nin-(其中)+tricae(纠缠琐事)+-ate→缠在琐碎纠葛中的→错综复杂的、难懂的。\n助记\nin-（在其中）+ tric（=tricae 琐碎、纠缠，参 extricate、intrigue）+ -ate（…的）→ 缠在纠葛中的→错综复杂的、难懂的\n例句\nThe watch has an ==intricate== mechanism of hundreds of tiny parts.","fields":{"Front":"intricate","Back":"释义\n错综复杂\n词根词缀\nin-in, 在其中+tricaetrifles/perplexities, 琐碎麻烦、纠缠+-ate形容词/动词后缀\nin-(其中)+tricae(纠缠琐事)+-ate→缠在琐碎纠葛中的→错综复杂的、难懂的。\n助记\nin-（在其中）+ tric（=tricae 琐碎、纠缠，参 extricate、intrigue）+ -ate（…的）→ 缠在纠葛中的→错综复杂的、难懂的\n例句\nThe watch has an ==intricate== mechanism of hundreds of tiny parts.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352729","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lackluster","back":"释义\n无光泽的；平庸的\n词根词缀\nlack + lusterabsence + shine, 缺少+光泽\n【复合词】lack(缺乏)+luster(光泽, <拉丁 lustare 照亮)→没有光泽的; 引申为平淡乏味、不出色的。\n助记\nlack（缺乏）+ luster（光泽，lustare 照亮，参 luster、illustrate）→ 没有光泽的→平淡乏味的、不出色的\n例句\nThe second half of the movie was ==lackluster== and dull.","fields":{"Front":"lackluster","Back":"释义\n无光泽的；平庸的\n词根词缀\nlack + lusterabsence + shine, 缺少+光泽\n【复合词】lack(缺乏)+luster(光泽, <拉丁 lustare 照亮)→没有光泽的; 引申为平淡乏味、不出色的。\n助记\nlack（缺乏）+ luster（光泽，lustare 照亮，参 luster、illustrate）→ 没有光泽的→平淡乏味的、不出色的\n例句\nThe second half of the movie was ==lackluster== and dull.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352731","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lavish","back":"释义\n奢华的；挥霍的\n词根词缀\nlavareto wash, 冲洗(大雨倾盆)+-ish形容词/动词后缀\n源自古法语 lavache(倾盆大雨, <拉丁 lavare 冲洗)→像大雨倾泻般→慷慨挥霍的、大量的。\n助记\n古法语 lavache「倾盆大雨」（lavare 冲洗，参 lavatory、lava）+ -ish → 像大雨倾泻般→大量的、挥霍的；慷慨给予\n例句\nThe king held a ==lavish== feast for all his guests.","fields":{"Front":"lavish","Back":"释义\n奢华的；挥霍的\n词根词缀\nlavareto wash, 冲洗(大雨倾盆)+-ish形容词/动词后缀\n源自古法语 lavache(倾盆大雨, <拉丁 lavare 冲洗)→像大雨倾泻般→慷慨挥霍的、大量的。\n助记\n古法语 lavache「倾盆大雨」（lavare 冲洗，参 lavatory、lava）+ -ish → 像大雨倾泻般→大量的、挥霍的；慷慨给予\n例句\nThe king held a ==lavish== feast for all his guests.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352733","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lucrative","back":"释义\n有利可图\n词根词缀\nlucrumgain/profit, 利益、赚钱+-ative形容词后缀\nlucrum(利润)+-ative→能获利的→赚钱的、有利可图的。\n助记\nlucr（=lucrum 利润、利益）+ -ative（…的）→ 能获利的→赚钱的、有利可图的\n例句\nThe new business proved to be a highly ==lucrative== venture.","fields":{"Front":"lucrative","Back":"释义\n有利可图\n词根词缀\nlucrumgain/profit, 利益、赚钱+-ative形容词后缀\nlucrum(利润)+-ative→能获利的→赚钱的、有利可图的。\n助记\nlucr（=lucrum 利润、利益）+ -ative（…的）→ 能获利的→赚钱的、有利可图的\n例句\nThe new business proved to be a highly ==lucrative== venture.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352735","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mar","back":"释义\n毁坏；玷污\n词根词缀\nmearranto spoil/hurt, 损坏、破坏\n【简单日耳曼语词】古英语 merran(损坏、阻碍), 原始日耳曼语 *marzjan→破坏、损毁(有损完美)。\n助记\n古英语 merran「损坏、阻碍」（日耳曼 *marzjan）→ 破坏、损毁、玷污（有损完美）\n例句\nThe rain did not ==mar== the beauty of the garden.","fields":{"Front":"mar","Back":"释义\n毁坏；玷污\n词根词缀\nmearranto spoil/hurt, 损坏、破坏\n【简单日耳曼语词】古英语 merran(损坏、阻碍), 原始日耳曼语 *marzjan→破坏、损毁(有损完美)。\n助记\n古英语 merran「损坏、阻碍」（日耳曼 *marzjan）→ 破坏、损毁、玷污（有损完美）\n例句\nThe rain did not ==mar== the beauty of the garden.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352737","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mercy","back":"释义\n仁慈；宽恕\n词根词缀\nmercesreward/pity, 报酬/怜悯+-y (-eit)名词后缀\nmerces(报酬→引申为施予怜悯的恩赐)→怜悯、仁慈、宽恕。\n助记\nmerc（=merces 报酬、恩赐，引申为怜悯，参 mercenary）+ -y（名词）→ 施予的恩赐→怜悯、仁慈、宽恕\n例句\nThe prisoner begged the king for ==mercy==.","fields":{"Front":"mercy","Back":"释义\n仁慈；宽恕\n词根词缀\nmercesreward/pity, 报酬/怜悯+-y (-eit)名词后缀\nmerces(报酬→引申为施予怜悯的恩赐)→怜悯、仁慈、宽恕。\n助记\nmerc（=merces 报酬、恩赐，引申为怜悯，参 mercenary）+ -y（名词）→ 施予的恩赐→怜悯、仁慈、宽恕\n例句\nThe prisoner begged the king for ==mercy==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352739","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"momentous","back":"释义\n重大的；重要的\n词根词缀\nmomentum movement/instant / to move, 运动/顷刻/移动+-ous形容词后缀\nmomentum(移动的一瞬、重要时刻, <movere动)+-ous→关乎重要时刻的→重大的、意义深远的。\n助记\nmoment（=momentum 顷刻、重要时刻，movere 移动，参 moment、movement）+ -ous（…的）→ 关乎重要时刻的→重大的、意义深远的\n例句\nIt was a ==momentous== day in the history of the nation.","fields":{"Front":"momentous","Back":"释义\n重大的；重要的\n词根词缀\nmomentum movement/instant / to move, 运动/顷刻/移动+-ous形容词后缀\nmomentum(移动的一瞬、重要时刻, <movere动)+-ous→关乎重要时刻的→重大的、意义深远的。\n助记\nmoment（=momentum 顷刻、重要时刻，movere 移动，参 moment、movement）+ -ous（…的）→ 关乎重要时刻的→重大的、意义深远的\n例句\nIt was a ==momentous== day in the history of the nation.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352741","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"multifarious","back":"释义\n多种多样\n词根词缀\nmultus + farimany + to speak, 多+言说(方式)+-ous形容词后缀(-farius)\nmultus(多)+-farius(多种多样地, <fari说)→多种多样的、五花八门的。\n助记\nmulti（=multus 多，参 multiply、multitude）+ farious（=fari 说、方式，-farius 多种多样）→ 多种多样的、五花八门的\n例句\nThe market offers a ==multifarious== selection of goods.","fields":{"Front":"multifarious","Back":"释义\n多种多样\n词根词缀\nmultus + farimany + to speak, 多+言说(方式)+-ous形容词后缀(-farius)\nmultus(多)+-farius(多种多样地, <fari说)→多种多样的、五花八门的。\n助记\nmulti（=multus 多，参 multiply、multitude）+ farious（=fari 说、方式，-farius 多种多样）→ 多种多样的、五花八门的\n例句\nThe market offers a ==multifarious== selection of goods.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"sat800-list-08","name":"SAT800 核心 › List 08","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["sat800","imported"],"options":{},"cards":[{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352743","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"waive","back":"释义\n放弃；免除\n词根词缀\nwaive放弃、让出（源自斯堪的纳维亚语*waifbjadha，与waif\"被弃物\"同源）\n简单词。源自古诺斯语/盎格鲁法语，本义指将某物弃置、不再主张权利，后专指\"放弃（权利、要求）\"。\n助记\n古诺斯语 *waifbjadha「弃置、让出」（与 waif 被弃物同源）→ 不再主张权利→放弃（要求/权利）、免除\n例句\nThe school agreed to ==waive== the fee for low-income students.","fields":{"Front":"waive","Back":"释义\n放弃；免除\n词根词缀\nwaive放弃、让出（源自斯堪的纳维亚语*waifbjadha，与waif\"被弃物\"同源）\n简单词。源自古诺斯语/盎格鲁法语，本义指将某物弃置、不再主张权利，后专指\"放弃（权利、要求）\"。\n助记\n古诺斯语 *waifbjadha「弃置、让出」（与 waif 被弃物同源）→ 不再主张权利→放弃（要求/权利）、免除\n例句\nThe school agreed to ==waive== the fee for low-income students.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352745","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"weary","back":"释义\n疲倦的；厌倦的\n词根词缀\nwear-疲倦、厌烦（werig）\n简单词。古英语werig\"疲惫的\"，日耳曼语族固有词，表身心耗竭、不耐烦。\n助记\n古英语 werig「疲惫」（日耳曼固有词，与 wear 磨损义近）→ 累到像被磨损般→疲倦的、厌烦的；使疲倦\n例句\nAfter the long journey, the travelers were ==weary== and hungry.","fields":{"Front":"weary","Back":"释义\n疲倦的；厌倦的\n词根词缀\nwear-疲倦、厌烦（werig）\n简单词。古英语werig\"疲惫的\"，日耳曼语族固有词，表身心耗竭、不耐烦。\n助记\n古英语 werig「疲惫」（日耳曼固有词，与 wear 磨损义近）→ 累到像被磨损般→疲倦的、厌烦的；使疲倦\n例句\nAfter the long journey, the travelers were ==weary== and hungry.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352747","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"absolutist","back":"释义\n专制者；专制的\n词根词缀\nab-离开、偏离（ab）+solut松开、解开（solvere, solutus）+-ist主张…者、…主义者\nab(离开)+solut(松开)=absolvere\"松开→不受约束→绝对\"，再加-ist\"主张者\"→主张绝对权力/绝对真理的人，专制主义者。\n助记\nab-（离开）+ solut（=solvere 松开，参 solve、absolute、dissolve）+ -ist（…者）→ 主张松开一切约束、绝对权力的人→专制主义者、绝对论者\n例句\nThe ==absolutist== ruler allowed no opposition to his decisions.","fields":{"Front":"absolutist","Back":"释义\n专制者；专制的\n词根词缀\nab-离开、偏离（ab）+solut松开、解开（solvere, solutus）+-ist主张…者、…主义者\nab(离开)+solut(松开)=absolvere\"松开→不受约束→绝对\"，再加-ist\"主张者\"→主张绝对权力/绝对真理的人，专制主义者。\n助记\nab-（离开）+ solut（=solvere 松开，参 solve、absolute、dissolve）+ -ist（…者）→ 主张松开一切约束、绝对权力的人→专制主义者、绝对论者\n例句\nThe ==absolutist== ruler allowed no opposition to his decisions.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352749","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"affluence","back":"释义\n富裕；丰富\n词根词缀\naf-向、朝（ad-在f前同化为af-）+flu流（fluere）+-ence名词后缀，表状态\naf(向)+flu(流)=affluere\"流向、涌入\"，+ -ence→财富如水流汇聚而来，富裕、丰裕。\n助记\naf-（ad- 向）+ flu（=fluere 流，参 fluid、fluent、influence）+ -ence（名词）→ 财富如水流汇聚而来→富裕、丰裕\n例句\nThe town grew wealthy through years of trade and ==affluence==.","fields":{"Front":"affluence","Back":"释义\n富裕；丰富\n词根词缀\naf-向、朝（ad-在f前同化为af-）+flu流（fluere）+-ence名词后缀，表状态\naf(向)+flu(流)=affluere\"流向、涌入\"，+ -ence→财富如水流汇聚而来，富裕、丰裕。\n助记\naf-（ad- 向）+ flu（=fluere 流，参 fluid、fluent、influence）+ -ence（名词）→ 财富如水流汇聚而来→富裕、丰裕\n例句\nThe town grew wealthy through years of trade and ==affluence==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352751","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"alacrity","back":"释义\n敏捷；欣然\n词根词缀\nalacr轻快、热心（alacer）+-ity名词后缀，表性质\n拉丁形容词alacer\"活泼踊跃的\"加-ity→欣然、敏捷的乐意。\n助记\nalacr（=alacer 轻快、踊跃）+ -ity（名词）→ 轻快踊跃的状态→欣然、敏捷乐意\n例句\nThe children respond to the teacher's question with ==alacrity==.","fields":{"Front":"alacrity","Back":"释义\n敏捷；欣然\n词根词缀\nalacr轻快、热心（alacer）+-ity名词后缀，表性质\n拉丁形容词alacer\"活泼踊跃的\"加-ity→欣然、敏捷的乐意。\n助记\nalacr（=alacer 轻快、踊跃）+ -ity（名词）→ 轻快踊跃的状态→欣然、敏捷乐意\n例句\nThe children respond to the teacher's question with ==alacrity==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352753","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ambiguous","back":"释义\n含糊不清\n词根词缀\nambi-二者、周围（amb-）+ag驱动、走（agere）+-ous形容词后缀\nambi(两)+ag(走/驱)→在两边游走、可作两种解释，+ -ous→模棱两可的。\n助记\nambi-（二者、周围）+ ag（=agere 走、驱动，参 agent、agile）+ -uous（…的）→ 在两边游走、可作两种解释→模棱两可的\n例句\nThe contract was ==ambiguous== about who was responsible.","fields":{"Front":"ambiguous","Back":"释义\n含糊不清\n词根词缀\nambi-二者、周围（amb-）+ag驱动、走（agere）+-ous形容词后缀\nambi(两)+ag(走/驱)→在两边游走、可作两种解释，+ -ous→模棱两可的。\n助记\nambi-（二者、周围）+ ag（=agere 走、驱动，参 agent、agile）+ -uous（…的）→ 在两边游走、可作两种解释→模棱两可的\n例句\nThe contract was ==ambiguous== about who was responsible.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352755","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"antipathy","back":"释义\n反感；憎恶\n词根词缀\nanti-反对、相反（anti）+path感情、感受（patheia）+-y名词后缀\nanti(反)+path(感情)→相反的情感→反感、憎恶。\n助记\nanti-（相反）+ path（=patheia 感情，参 sympathy、empathy、pathos）+ -y（名词）→ 相反的情感→反感、憎恶\n例句\nfeeling of intense dislike","fields":{"Front":"antipathy","Back":"释义\n反感；憎恶\n词根词缀\nanti-反对、相反（anti）+path感情、感受（patheia）+-y名词后缀\nanti(反)+path(感情)→相反的情感→反感、憎恶。\n助记\nanti-（相反）+ path（=patheia 感情，参 sympathy、empathy、pathos）+ -y（名词）→ 相反的情感→反感、憎恶\n例句\nfeeling of intense dislike","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352757","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"apprehend","back":"释义\n逮捕；理解\n词根词缀\nap-向、朝+prehend抓住（prehendere, prehens-）\nap(向)+prehend(抓)→伸手抓住，引申为\"拘捕\"，又指头脑\"领会、理解\"，并派生出对未来\"忧虑、惴惴不安\"。\n助记\nap-（ad- 向）+ prehend（=prehendere 抓住，参 comprehend）→ 伸手抓住→拘捕；头脑抓住→领会；心被未来抓住→忧虑\n例句\nIt is hard to ==apprehend== the full meaning of that poem.","fields":{"Front":"apprehend","Back":"释义\n逮捕；理解\n词根词缀\nap-向、朝+prehend抓住（prehendere, prehens-）\nap(向)+prehend(抓)→伸手抓住，引申为\"拘捕\"，又指头脑\"领会、理解\"，并派生出对未来\"忧虑、惴惴不安\"。\n助记\nap-（ad- 向）+ prehend（=prehendere 抓住，参 comprehend）→ 伸手抓住→拘捕；头脑抓住→领会；心被未来抓住→忧虑\n例句\nIt is hard to ==apprehend== the full meaning of that poem.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352759","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"archaic","back":"释义\n古老的；过时的\n词根词缀\narch古老、开端（archaios）+-ic形容词后缀\n希腊archaios\"属于远古的\"(arche\"开端、古老\")+ -ic→古旧的、已不通用的。\n助记\narch（=archaios 古老的，arche 开端，参 archaeology、archive）+ -aic（…的）→ 属于远古的→古旧的、已不通用的\n例句\nThe poem uses many ==archaic== words no longer found in modern English.","fields":{"Front":"archaic","Back":"释义\n古老的；过时的\n词根词缀\narch古老、开端（archaios）+-ic形容词后缀\n希腊archaios\"属于远古的\"(arche\"开端、古老\")+ -ic→古旧的、已不通用的。\n助记\narch（=archaios 古老的，arche 开端，参 archaeology、archive）+ -aic（…的）→ 属于远古的→古旧的、已不通用的\n例句\nThe poem uses many ==archaic== words no longer found in modern English.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352761","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"articulate","back":"释义\n善于表达、明确说出\n词根词缀\nartic关节、连接点（artus\"关节\", articulus\"小关节/音节\"）+-ate动词/形容词后缀\n拉丁articulus\"小关节→清晰的音节\"，+ -ate→像关节一样把话语清楚连接，发音清晰、表达有条理。\n助记\narticul（=articulus 小关节、音节，artus 关节，参 article）+ -ate（…的）→ 像关节把音节清楚连接→口齿清楚的、表达有条理的\n例句\nYou are a real ==articulate== fellow.","fields":{"Front":"articulate","Back":"释义\n善于表达、明确说出\n词根词缀\nartic关节、连接点（artus\"关节\", articulus\"小关节/音节\"）+-ate动词/形容词后缀\n拉丁articulus\"小关节→清晰的音节\"，+ -ate→像关节一样把话语清楚连接，发音清晰、表达有条理。\n助记\narticul（=articulus 小关节、音节，artus 关节，参 article）+ -ate（…的）→ 像关节把音节清楚连接→口齿清楚的、表达有条理的\n例句\nYou are a real ==articulate== fellow.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352763","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"assuage","back":"释义\n减轻\n词根词缀\nas-向、使+suav甜、温和（suavis）+-age动词后缀\nas(使)+suav(甜/温和)→使变温和、变甜，引申为\"减轻、缓和（痛苦）\"。\n助记\nas-（ad- 使）+ suav（=suavis 甜、温和，参 sweet、suave）+ -age（动词）→ 使变温和、变甜→减轻、舒缓（痛苦）\n例句\nto make something less severe","fields":{"Front":"assuage","Back":"释义\n减轻\n词根词缀\nas-向、使+suav甜、温和（suavis）+-age动词后缀\nas(使)+suav(甜/温和)→使变温和、变甜，引申为\"减轻、缓和（痛苦）\"。\n助记\nas-（ad- 使）+ suav（=suavis 甜、温和，参 sweet、suave）+ -age（动词）→ 使变温和、变甜→减轻、舒缓（痛苦）\n例句\nto make something less severe","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352765","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"byzantine","back":"释义\n错综复杂\n词根词缀\nByzant拜占庭（君士坦丁堡古城名Byzantion）+-ine形容词后缀，表\"…的\"\n源自拜占庭帝国，因其宫廷政治复杂、密谋权谋多，引申为\"错综复杂的、尔虞我诈的\"。\n助记\nByzant（拜占庭，君士坦丁堡）+ -ine（…的）→ 拜占庭宫廷政治复杂密谋→错综复杂的、尔虞我诈的\n例句\nThe company's ==byzantine== rules confused even its own employees.","fields":{"Front":"byzantine","Back":"释义\n错综复杂\n词根词缀\nByzant拜占庭（君士坦丁堡古城名Byzantion）+-ine形容词后缀，表\"…的\"\n源自拜占庭帝国，因其宫廷政治复杂、密谋权谋多，引申为\"错综复杂的、尔虞我诈的\"。\n助记\nByzant（拜占庭，君士坦丁堡）+ -ine（…的）→ 拜占庭宫廷政治复杂密谋→错综复杂的、尔虞我诈的\n例句\nThe company's ==byzantine== rules confused even its own employees.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352767","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"camouflage","back":"释义\n伪装；掩饰\n词根词缀\ncamoufl伪装、装假（camuffare\"掩饰\", 或借自 Flemish kamouf\"街头演戏者\"）+-age名词后缀\n法语借词，本义\"乔装、伪装\"，军事用语指用色彩/物体遮蔽，泛指掩饰。\n助记\n法语 camoufler「掩饰」（camuffare 乔装，或源于街头演戏者）→ 乔装遮蔽→伪装、掩饰\n例句\nAnimal ==camouflage==","fields":{"Front":"camouflage","Back":"释义\n伪装；掩饰\n词根词缀\ncamoufl伪装、装假（camuffare\"掩饰\", 或借自 Flemish kamouf\"街头演戏者\"）+-age名词后缀\n法语借词，本义\"乔装、伪装\"，军事用语指用色彩/物体遮蔽，泛指掩饰。\n助记\n法语 camoufler「掩饰」（camuffare 乔装，或源于街头演戏者）→ 乔装遮蔽→伪装、掩饰\n例句\nAnimal ==camouflage==","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352769","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cantankerous","back":"释义\n脾气坏的\n词根词缀\ncantanker-争吵、不和（contek\"纷争\"，来源不确定）+-ous形容词后缀\n来源存疑的方言词，约1772年出现，推测来自中古英语contek\"争吵\"，受rancorous/cankerous影响变形；+ -ous→爱争吵、脾气坏的。\n助记\n方言词，可能源于中古英语 contek「争吵」（受 rancorous、cankerous 影响）→ 爱争吵、极易动怒的\n例句\nquickly aroused to anger","fields":{"Front":"cantankerous","Back":"释义\n脾气坏的\n词根词缀\ncantanker-争吵、不和（contek\"纷争\"，来源不确定）+-ous形容词后缀\n来源存疑的方言词，约1772年出现，推测来自中古英语contek\"争吵\"，受rancorous/cankerous影响变形；+ -ous→爱争吵、脾气坏的。\n助记\n方言词，可能源于中古英语 contek「争吵」（受 rancorous、cankerous 影响）→ 爱争吵、极易动怒的\n例句\nquickly aroused to anger","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352771","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"chaotic","back":"释义\n混乱的\n词根词缀\nchaos混沌、未分化的虚空（khaos）+-tic形容词后缀\n希腊khaos\"混沌\"+ -tic→混乱无序的。\n助记\nchaos（=khaos 开天辟地前的混沌虚空）+ -tic（…的）→ 混沌般的→混乱无序的\n例句\nThe scene at the crowded station was completely ==chaotic==.","fields":{"Front":"chaotic","Back":"释义\n混乱的\n词根词缀\nchaos混沌、未分化的虚空（khaos）+-tic形容词后缀\n希腊khaos\"混沌\"+ -tic→混乱无序的。\n助记\nchaos（=khaos 开天辟地前的混沌虚空）+ -tic（…的）→ 混沌般的→混乱无序的\n例句\nThe scene at the crowded station was completely ==chaotic==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352773","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"charismatic","back":"释义\n有魅力的\n词根词缀\ncharism神赐的恩惠、魅力（kharisma, 来自kharis\"恩典/喜悦\"）+-atic形容词后缀\n希腊kharis\"恩典/可爱\"派生kharisma\"天赋神恩\"，+ -atic→具有超凡感召力、人格魅力的。\n助记\ncharism（=kharisma 神赐的恩惠，kharis 恩典，参 charisma）+ -atic（…的）→ 具有天赋感召力的→有魅力的\n例句\nThe ==charismatic== leader drew huge crowds to every rally.","fields":{"Front":"charismatic","Back":"释义\n有魅力的\n词根词缀\ncharism神赐的恩惠、魅力（kharisma, 来自kharis\"恩典/喜悦\"）+-atic形容词后缀\n希腊kharis\"恩典/可爱\"派生kharisma\"天赋神恩\"，+ -atic→具有超凡感召力、人格魅力的。\n助记\ncharism（=kharisma 神赐的恩惠，kharis 恩典，参 charisma）+ -atic（…的）→ 具有天赋感召力的→有魅力的\n例句\nThe ==charismatic== leader drew huge crowds to every rally.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352775","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"circumvent","back":"释义\n规避；绕行\n词根词缀\ncircum-围绕（circum）+vent来（venire, vent-）\ncircum(绕圈)+vent(来)→绕着走过去→规避、智胜（规则/人）。\n助记\ncircum-（围绕）+ vent（=venire 来，参 convene、event、prevent）→ 绕着圈过来→规避、绕过（规则）\n例句\nThe clever lawyer found a way to ==circumvent== the strict rule.","fields":{"Front":"circumvent","Back":"释义\n规避；绕行\n词根词缀\ncircum-围绕（circum）+vent来（venire, vent-）\ncircum(绕圈)+vent(来)→绕着走过去→规避、智胜（规则/人）。\n助记\ncircum-（围绕）+ vent（=venire 来，参 convene、event、prevent）→ 绕着圈过来→规避、绕过（规则）\n例句\nThe clever lawyer found a way to ==circumvent== the strict rule.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352777","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"compunction","back":"释义\n懊悔；良心不安\n词根词缀\ncom-加强/一起+punction刺、扎（pungere, punctus）\ncom(加强)+punct(刺)→像被刺痛一样良心不安→内疚、悔恨。\n助记\ncom-（加强）+ punct（=pungere 刺，参 puncture、pungent）+ -ion（名词）→ 像被刺痛般良心不安→内疚、悔恨\n例句\nfeeling of uneasiness/anxiety caused by regret for doing wrong","fields":{"Front":"compunction","Back":"释义\n懊悔；良心不安\n词根词缀\ncom-加强/一起+punction刺、扎（pungere, punctus）\ncom(加强)+punct(刺)→像被刺痛一样良心不安→内疚、悔恨。\n助记\ncom-（加强）+ punct（=pungere 刺，参 puncture、pungent）+ -ion（名词）→ 像被刺痛般良心不安→内疚、悔恨\n例句\nfeeling of uneasiness/anxiety caused by regret for doing wrong","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352779","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cursory","back":"释义\n草率的；粗略的\n词根词缀\ncurs跑（currere, cursus）+-ory形容词后缀\ncurs(跑)+ -ory→跑着过的、不细看的→草率粗略的。\n助记\ncurs（=currere 跑，参 course、current、excursion）+ -ory（…的）→ 跑着过、不细看的→草率粗略的\n例句\nShe gave the report only a ==cursory== glance before signing it.","fields":{"Front":"cursory","Back":"释义\n草率的；粗略的\n词根词缀\ncurs跑（currere, cursus）+-ory形容词后缀\ncurs(跑)+ -ory→跑着过的、不细看的→草率粗略的。\n助记\ncurs（=currere 跑，参 course、current、excursion）+ -ory（…的）→ 跑着过、不细看的→草率粗略的\n例句\nShe gave the report only a ==cursory== glance before signing it.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352781","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"deleterious","back":"释义\n有害的\n词根词缀\ndeleter有害的、杀人药（deleterios, 来自deleter\"凶手\"）+-ious形容词后缀\n希腊deleter\"造成毁灭者\"派生deleterios\"致命的\"，+ -ious→有害的、造成伤害的。\n助记\n希腊 deleter「凶手」（deleterios 致命的）+ -ious（…的）→ 造成毁灭的→有害的\n例句\ncausing harm or damage, often in a subtle or unexpected way","fields":{"Front":"deleterious","Back":"释义\n有害的\n词根词缀\ndeleter有害的、杀人药（deleterios, 来自deleter\"凶手\"）+-ious形容词后缀\n希腊deleter\"造成毁灭者\"派生deleterios\"致命的\"，+ -ious→有害的、造成伤害的。\n助记\n希腊 deleter「凶手」（deleterios 致命的）+ -ious（…的）→ 造成毁灭的→有害的\n例句\ncausing harm or damage, often in a subtle or unexpected way","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352783","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"diminutive","back":"释义\n微小的；小型的\n词根词缀\ndi-向下、减少+minu变小（minuere, minus\"小\"）+-ive形容词后缀\nde(向下)+minu(小)+ -ive→使变小的→微小的；语法上指\"指小词\"。\n助记\ndi-（de- 向下）+ minu（=minuere 变小，minus，参 minute、diminish）+ -tive（…的）→ 使变小的→微小的、指小的\n例句\nThe tiny village looked ==diminutive== beside the towering mountains.","fields":{"Front":"diminutive","Back":"释义\n微小的；小型的\n词根词缀\ndi-向下、减少+minu变小（minuere, minus\"小\"）+-ive形容词后缀\nde(向下)+minu(小)+ -ive→使变小的→微小的；语法上指\"指小词\"。\n助记\ndi-（de- 向下）+ minu（=minuere 变小，minus，参 minute、diminish）+ -tive（…的）→ 使变小的→微小的、指小的\n例句\nThe tiny village looked ==diminutive== beside the towering mountains.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352785","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"disposable","back":"释义\n一次性的\n词根词缀\ndis-分开、去除+pos放置（ponere, positus）+-able可…的\ndis(分开/出)+pos(放)+ -able→可随手丢掉的→一次性的、可自由支配的。\n助记\ndis-（去除）+ pos（=ponere 放置，参 position、dispose）+ -able（可…的）→ 可随手放下丢掉的→一次性的、可自由支配的\n例句\nThe hospital uses ==disposable== gloves for every examination.","fields":{"Front":"disposable","Back":"释义\n一次性的\n词根词缀\ndis-分开、去除+pos放置（ponere, positus）+-able可…的\ndis(分开/出)+pos(放)+ -able→可随手丢掉的→一次性的、可自由支配的。\n助记\ndis-（去除）+ pos（=ponere 放置，参 position、dispose）+ -able（可…的）→ 可随手放下丢掉的→一次性的、可自由支配的\n例句\nThe hospital uses ==disposable== gloves for every examination.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352787","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"disposition","back":"释义\n性情；倾向\n词根词缀\ndis-分开+posit放置（ponere, positus）+-ion名词后缀\ndis(分开)+posit(放)+ -ion→事物被摆放的方式，引申为心性的\"安排\"→性情、倾向；也指处置、部署。\n助记\ndis-（分开）+ posit（=ponere 放置，参 position、pose）+ -ion（名词）→ 事物被摆放的方式→安排、部署；心性的排列→性情\n例句\nShe has a cheerful ==disposition== that brightens any room.","fields":{"Front":"disposition","Back":"释义\n性情；倾向\n词根词缀\ndis-分开+posit放置（ponere, positus）+-ion名词后缀\ndis(分开)+posit(放)+ -ion→事物被摆放的方式，引申为心性的\"安排\"→性情、倾向；也指处置、部署。\n助记\ndis-（分开）+ posit（=ponere 放置，参 position、pose）+ -ion（名词）→ 事物被摆放的方式→安排、部署；心性的排列→性情\n例句\nShe has a cheerful ==disposition== that brightens any room.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352789","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"disseminate","back":"释义\n散布；传播\n词根词缀\ndis-散开+semin种子（semen, seminis）+-ate动词后缀\ndis(散开)+semin(种子)+ -ate→像播种一样撒开→传播、散布（思想）。\n助记\ndis-（散开）+ semin（=semen 种子，参 seed、seminar、seminal）+ -ate（动词）→ 像播种般撒开→散播、传播\n例句\nspread as far and wide as possible","fields":{"Front":"disseminate","Back":"释义\n散布；传播\n词根词缀\ndis-散开+semin种子（semen, seminis）+-ate动词后缀\ndis(散开)+semin(种子)+ -ate→像播种一样撒开→传播、散布（思想）。\n助记\ndis-（散开）+ semin（=semen 种子，参 seed、seminar、seminal）+ -ate（动词）→ 像播种般撒开→散播、传播\n例句\nspread as far and wide as possible","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352791","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dosage","back":"释义\n剂量\n词根词缀\ndos一份、给予（dosis\"一服\", didonai\"给\"）+-age名词后缀，表量/行为\n希腊dosis\"一剂、一次给出的量\"，+ -age→（药的）剂量、用量。\n助记\ndos（=dosis 一份、一剂，didonai 给，参 dose、donate）+ -age（名词）→ 一次给出的量→（药的）剂量\n例句\nThe doctor carefully measured the correct ==dosage== of the medicine.","fields":{"Front":"dosage","Back":"释义\n剂量\n词根词缀\ndos一份、给予（dosis\"一服\", didonai\"给\"）+-age名词后缀，表量/行为\n希腊dosis\"一剂、一次给出的量\"，+ -age→（药的）剂量、用量。\n助记\ndos（=dosis 一份、一剂，didonai 给，参 dose、donate）+ -age（名词）→ 一次给出的量→（药的）剂量\n例句\nThe doctor carefully measured the correct ==dosage== of the medicine.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352793","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"duplicitous","back":"释义\n两面派的；奸诈的\n词根词缀\nduplic双重（duplex, duplicis \"两层\"）+-itous形容词后缀\nduplic(双)+ -itous→两面三刀的、口是心非的、欺诈的。\n助记\nduplic（=duplex 双重，du- 二 + plicare 折叠，参 duplicate、duplicity）+ -itous（…的）→ 有两层、两面的→口是心非的、欺诈的\n例句\nHis ==duplicitous== behavior made it hard to trust anything he said.","fields":{"Front":"duplicitous","Back":"释义\n两面派的；奸诈的\n词根词缀\nduplic双重（duplex, duplicis \"两层\"）+-itous形容词后缀\nduplic(双)+ -itous→两面三刀的、口是心非的、欺诈的。\n助记\nduplic（=duplex 双重，du- 二 + plicare 折叠，参 duplicate、duplicity）+ -itous（…的）→ 有两层、两面的→口是心非的、欺诈的\n例句\nHis ==duplicitous== behavior made it hard to trust anything he said.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352795","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dynamic","back":"释义\n有活力的；动态的\n词根词缀\ndynam力量（dynamis）+-ic形容词后缀\n希腊dynamis\"力量\"+ -ic→有活力的、动态的、充满力量的。\n助记\ndynam（=dynamis 力量，参 dynasty、dynamite、dynamo）+ -ic（…的）→ 有力量的→有活力的、动态的\n例句\nThe startup has a fast-paced and ==dynamic== work environment.","fields":{"Front":"dynamic","Back":"释义\n有活力的；动态的\n词根词缀\ndynam力量（dynamis）+-ic形容词后缀\n希腊dynamis\"力量\"+ -ic→有活力的、动态的、充满力量的。\n助记\ndynam（=dynamis 力量，参 dynasty、dynamite、dynamo）+ -ic（…的）→ 有力量的→有活力的、动态的\n例句\nThe startup has a fast-paced and ==dynamic== work environment.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352797","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"elaborate","back":"释义\n精心的；复杂的\n词根词缀\ne-出、彻底+labor劳作（laborare）+-ate动词/形容词后缀\ne(出/尽)+labor(劳作)+ -ate→花大力气做出的→详尽复杂的；动词义\"精心制作、详述\"。\n助记\ne-（ex- 出、彻底）+ labor（=labor 劳作，参 labor、laboratory）+ -ate（…的）→ 花大力气做出的→详尽的、精心制作的；详述\n例句\nShe wore an ==elaborate== gown to the formal royal wedding.","fields":{"Front":"elaborate","Back":"释义\n精心的；复杂的\n词根词缀\ne-出、彻底+labor劳作（laborare）+-ate动词/形容词后缀\ne(出/尽)+labor(劳作)+ -ate→花大力气做出的→详尽复杂的；动词义\"精心制作、详述\"。\n助记\ne-（ex- 出、彻底）+ labor（=labor 劳作，参 labor、laboratory）+ -ate（…的）→ 花大力气做出的→详尽的、精心制作的；详述\n例句\nShe wore an ==elaborate== gown to the formal royal wedding.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352799","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"expedite","back":"释义\n加快；促进\n词根词缀\nex-出、离开+ped脚（pes, pedis）+-ite动词后缀\nex(出)+ped(脚)→把脚从羁绊中解放→加快、促进（与impede\"缠住脚\"相对）。\n助记\nex-（出）+ ped（=pes 脚，参 pedestrian、impede）+ -ite（动词）→ 把脚从羁绊中解放→加快、促进（与 impede 缠住脚相反）\n例句\nWe hope the new system will ==expedite== the slow approval process.","fields":{"Front":"expedite","Back":"释义\n加快；促进\n词根词缀\nex-出、离开+ped脚（pes, pedis）+-ite动词后缀\nex(出)+ped(脚)→把脚从羁绊中解放→加快、促进（与impede\"缠住脚\"相对）。\n助记\nex-（出）+ ped（=pes 脚，参 pedestrian、impede）+ -ite（动词）→ 把脚从羁绊中解放→加快、促进（与 impede 缠住脚相反）\n例句\nWe hope the new system will ==expedite== the slow approval process.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352801","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"expeditious","back":"释义\n迅速高效\n词根词缀\nex-出+ped脚+-itious形容词后缀\n同expedite词根(脚解放)，+ -itious→迅速高效的、利落的。\n助记\nex-（出）+ ped（=pes 脚）+ -itious（…的）→ 脚被解放、走得快的→迅速高效的\n例句\nThe team found an ==expeditious== solution to the urgent problem.","fields":{"Front":"expeditious","Back":"释义\n迅速高效\n词根词缀\nex-出+ped脚+-itious形容词后缀\n同expedite词根(脚解放)，+ -itious→迅速高效的、利落的。\n助记\nex-（出）+ ped（=pes 脚）+ -itious（…的）→ 脚被解放、走得快的→迅速高效的\n例句\nThe team found an ==expeditious== solution to the urgent problem.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352803","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"expedient","back":"释义\n权宜之计；方便的\n词根词缀\nex-out, 出+pes (pedis)foot, 脚(原义解开脚绊)+-ent形容词/名词后缀\nex-(出)+ped(脚)→解开脚上的束缚、使顺畅→便利的; 名词指权宜之计。\n助记\nex-（出）+ ped（=pes 脚）+ -ient（…的）→ 解开脚绊使顺畅→权宜实用的、图方便的；权宜之计\n例句\nIn this situation it would be ==expedient== to compromise and find a middle ground.","fields":{"Front":"expedient","Back":"释义\n权宜之计；方便的\n词根词缀\nex-out, 出+pes (pedis)foot, 脚(原义解开脚绊)+-ent形容词/名词后缀\nex-(出)+ped(脚)→解开脚上的束缚、使顺畅→便利的; 名词指权宜之计。\n助记\nex-（出）+ ped（=pes 脚）+ -ient（…的）→ 解开脚绊使顺畅→权宜实用的、图方便的；权宜之计\n例句\nIn this situation it would be ==expedient== to compromise and find a middle ground.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352805","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"extemporaneous","back":"释义\n即兴的；临时的\n词根词缀\nex-出+tempor时间（tempus, temporis）+-aneous形容词后缀\nex(出)+tempor(时间/当下)+ -aneous→就在此刻、不预先准备→即席的、即兴的。\n助记\nex-（出）+ tempor（=tempus 时间、当下，参 temporary、temple）+ -aneous（…的）→ 就在此刻、不预先准备→即席的、即兴的\n例句\nHis ==extemporaneous== remarks delighted the whole audience.","fields":{"Front":"extemporaneous","Back":"释义\n即兴的；临时的\n词根词缀\nex-出+tempor时间（tempus, temporis）+-aneous形容词后缀\nex(出)+tempor(时间/当下)+ -aneous→就在此刻、不预先准备→即席的、即兴的。\n助记\nex-（出）+ tempor（=tempus 时间、当下，参 temporary、temple）+ -aneous（…的）→ 就在此刻、不预先准备→即席的、即兴的\n例句\nHis ==extemporaneous== remarks delighted the whole audience.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352807","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fastidious","back":"释义\n挑剔的；难讨好的\n词根词缀\nfastidi嫌恶、挑剔（fastidium\"反感、傲慢\"）+-ous形容词后缀\n拉丁fastidium\"厌恶、不屑\"+ -ous→吹毛求疵的、难以取悦的、讲究的。\n助记\nfastidi（=fastidium 嫌恶、挑剔）+ -ous（…的）→ 难以取悦的→一丝不苟的、挑剔的、讲究的\n例句\nHe is very ==fastidious== about keeping his desk perfectly clean.","fields":{"Front":"fastidious","Back":"释义\n挑剔的；难讨好的\n词根词缀\nfastidi嫌恶、挑剔（fastidium\"反感、傲慢\"）+-ous形容词后缀\n拉丁fastidium\"厌恶、不屑\"+ -ous→吹毛求疵的、难以取悦的、讲究的。\n助记\nfastidi（=fastidium 嫌恶、挑剔）+ -ous（…的）→ 难以取悦的→一丝不苟的、挑剔的、讲究的\n例句\nHe is very ==fastidious== about keeping his desk perfectly clean.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352809","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"furious","back":"释义\n狂怒的；猛烈的\n词根词缀\nfur狂怒、发疯（furere\"发狂\", furia\"狂怒\"）+-ious形容词后缀\n拉丁furia\"狂怒\"+ -ious→暴怒的、猛烈的。\n助记\nfur（=furere 发狂，furia 狂怒，参 fury）+ -ious（…的）→ 狂怒的、猛烈的\n例句\nShe was ==furious== when she learned that her idea had been stolen.","fields":{"Front":"furious","Back":"释义\n狂怒的；猛烈的\n词根词缀\nfur狂怒、发疯（furere\"发狂\", furia\"狂怒\"）+-ious形容词后缀\n拉丁furia\"狂怒\"+ -ious→暴怒的、猛烈的。\n助记\nfur（=furere 发狂，furia 狂怒，参 fury）+ -ious（…的）→ 狂怒的、猛烈的\n例句\nShe was ==furious== when she learned that her idea had been stolen.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352811","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"hail","back":"释义\n冰雹；欢呼\n词根词缀\nhail致敬/冰雹（同源多义：heill\"健康、吉祥\"与hagol\"冰雹\"）\n简单词。古英语/诺斯语双源：一为\"问候、欢呼致意\"(原义\"祝健康\")，一为\"冰雹\"；引申\"来自某处\"(hail from)。\n助记\n古英语/诺斯语双源：heill「健康吉祥」→ 欢呼致敬；hagol「冰雹」→ 冰雹；hail from 来自\n例句\nA sudden ==hail== storm damaged the crops in the field.","fields":{"Front":"hail","Back":"释义\n冰雹；欢呼\n词根词缀\nhail致敬/冰雹（同源多义：heill\"健康、吉祥\"与hagol\"冰雹\"）\n简单词。古英语/诺斯语双源：一为\"问候、欢呼致意\"(原义\"祝健康\")，一为\"冰雹\"；引申\"来自某处\"(hail from)。\n助记\n古英语/诺斯语双源：heill「健康吉祥」→ 欢呼致敬；hagol「冰雹」→ 冰雹；hail from 来自\n例句\nA sudden ==hail== storm damaged the crops in the field.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352813","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"halcyon","back":"释义\n平静的；幸福的\n词根词缀\nhalcyon翠鸟（alkyon, 神话中的太平鸟）\n希腊alkyon\"翠鸟\"，神话中此鸟冬至在海上筑巢、平息风浪，故halcyon days指\"平静幸福的时光\"。\n助记\n希腊神话 alkyon「翠鸟」，冬至在海上筑巢平息风浪（halcyon days）→ 平静幸福的、美好的\n例句\nThey remembered the summer as a ==halcyon== time of peace and joy.","fields":{"Front":"halcyon","Back":"释义\n平静的；幸福的\n词根词缀\nhalcyon翠鸟（alkyon, 神话中的太平鸟）\n希腊alkyon\"翠鸟\"，神话中此鸟冬至在海上筑巢、平息风浪，故halcyon days指\"平静幸福的时光\"。\n助记\n希腊神话 alkyon「翠鸟」，冬至在海上筑巢平息风浪（halcyon days）→ 平静幸福的、美好的\n例句\nThey remembered the summer as a ==halcyon== time of peace and joy.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352815","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"illusory","back":"释义\n虚幻的；错觉的\n词根词缀\nil-进入、向+lus嬉戏、嘲弄（ludere, lusus）+-ory形容词后缀\nil(in-,向)+lus(戏耍)+ -ory→戏弄人、制造假象→虚幻的、错觉的。\n助记\nil-（in- 向）+ lus（=ludere 戏耍，lusus，参 illusion、delude、elusive）+ -ory（…的）→ 戏弄人制造假象的→虚幻的、迷惑人的\n例句\nThe promise of easy wealth proved to be ==illusory==.","fields":{"Front":"illusory","Back":"释义\n虚幻的；错觉的\n词根词缀\nil-进入、向+lus嬉戏、嘲弄（ludere, lusus）+-ory形容词后缀\nil(in-,向)+lus(戏耍)+ -ory→戏弄人、制造假象→虚幻的、错觉的。\n助记\nil-（in- 向）+ lus（=ludere 戏耍，lusus，参 illusion、delude、elusive）+ -ory（…的）→ 戏弄人制造假象的→虚幻的、迷惑人的\n例句\nThe promise of easy wealth proved to be ==illusory==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352817","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"impugn","back":"释义\n指责；质疑\n词根词缀\nim-对着、朝+pugn打斗（pugnare）\nim(对着)+pugn(打)→当面攻击→驳斥、质疑（言辞上抨击）。\n助记\nim-（in- 对着）+ pugn（=pugnare 打斗，参 pugnacious、repugnant）→ 当面攻击→驳斥、质疑\n例句\nThe lawyer tried to ==impugn== the honesty of the witness.","fields":{"Front":"impugn","Back":"释义\n指责；质疑\n词根词缀\nim-对着、朝+pugn打斗（pugnare）\nim(对着)+pugn(打)→当面攻击→驳斥、质疑（言辞上抨击）。\n助记\nim-（in- 对着）+ pugn（=pugnare 打斗，参 pugnacious、repugnant）→ 当面攻击→驳斥、质疑\n例句\nThe lawyer tried to ==impugn== the honesty of the witness.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352819","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"indecipherable","back":"释义\n无法辨认\n词根词缀\nde-除去、解开+cipher密码、零（sifr\"空\"）+-able可…的\nin(不)+de(解开)+cipher(密码)+ -able→无法破译的、难以辨认的。\n助记\nin-（不）+ de-（解开）+ cipher（=sifr 空、密码，参 cipher、decipher）+ -able（可…的）→ 无法解开密码的→无法破译的、难以辨认的\n例句\nThe old handwriting was quite ==indecipherable== to us.","fields":{"Front":"indecipherable","Back":"释义\n无法辨认\n词根词缀\nde-除去、解开+cipher密码、零（sifr\"空\"）+-able可…的\nin(不)+de(解开)+cipher(密码)+ -able→无法破译的、难以辨认的。\n助记\nin-（不）+ de-（解开）+ cipher（=sifr 空、密码，参 cipher、decipher）+ -able（可…的）→ 无法解开密码的→无法破译的、难以辨认的\n例句\nThe old handwriting was quite ==indecipherable== to us.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352821","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"indigenous","back":"释义\n本土的、土生土长\n词根词缀\nindi-在内、本土（indu- \"在内\"）+gen出生、产生（gignere, gen-）+-ous形容词后缀\nindi(在内)+gen(出生)+ -ous→本地生出来的→土生土长的、原产的。\n助记\nindi-（在内、本土）+ gen（=gignere 出生，参 genus、genuine、native）+ -ous（…的）→ 本地生出来的→土生土长的、原产的\n例句\n==indigenous== people","fields":{"Front":"indigenous","Back":"释义\n本土的、土生土长\n词根词缀\nindi-在内、本土（indu- \"在内\"）+gen出生、产生（gignere, gen-）+-ous形容词后缀\nindi(在内)+gen(出生)+ -ous→本地生出来的→土生土长的、原产的。\n助记\nindi-（在内、本土）+ gen（=gignere 出生，参 genus、genuine、native）+ -ous（…的）→ 本地生出来的→土生土长的、原产的\n例句\n==indigenous== people","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352823","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"infallible","back":"释义\n绝无错误、可靠的\n词根词缀\nin-不、无+fall犯错、欺骗（fallere）+-ible可…的\nin(不)+fall(犯错)+ -ible→不会犯错的、绝对可靠的。\n助记\nin-（不）+ fall（=fallere 犯错、欺骗，参 fail、fallacy、false）+ -ible（可…的）→ 不会犯错的、绝对可靠的\n例句\nNo human being is ==infallible==, so we all make mistakes sometimes.","fields":{"Front":"infallible","Back":"释义\n绝无错误、可靠的\n词根词缀\nin-不、无+fall犯错、欺骗（fallere）+-ible可…的\nin(不)+fall(犯错)+ -ible→不会犯错的、绝对可靠的。\n助记\nin-（不）+ fall（=fallere 犯错、欺骗，参 fail、fallacy、false）+ -ible（可…的）→ 不会犯错的、绝对可靠的\n例句\nNo human being is ==infallible==, so we all make mistakes sometimes.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352825","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"insipid","back":"释义\n乏味的；平淡的\n词根词缀\nin-无、不+sip味道（sapor\"味道\", sapere\"尝\"）\nin(无)+sip(味道)→没有味道的→乏味的、平淡无趣的。\n助记\nin-（无）+ sip（=sapor 味道，sapere 尝，参 savor、sapient）→ 没有味道的→乏味的、平淡无趣的\n例句\nAlthough his children liked the movie, Bill found it ==insipid==.","fields":{"Front":"insipid","Back":"释义\n乏味的；平淡的\n词根词缀\nin-无、不+sip味道（sapor\"味道\", sapere\"尝\"）\nin(无)+sip(味道)→没有味道的→乏味的、平淡无趣的。\n助记\nin-（无）+ sip（=sapor 味道，sapere 尝，参 savor、sapient）→ 没有味道的→乏味的、平淡无趣的\n例句\nAlthough his children liked the movie, Bill found it ==insipid==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352827","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"interchangeable","back":"释义\n可互换的\n词根词缀\ninter-相互、之间+change交换（changier）+-able可…的\ninter(相互)+change(交换)+ -able→可互相替换的。\n助记\ninter-（相互）+ change（交换）+ -able（可…的）→ 可互相替换的\n例句\nThese two batteries are completely ==interchangeable==.","fields":{"Front":"interchangeable","Back":"释义\n可互换的\n词根词缀\ninter-相互、之间+change交换（changier）+-able可…的\ninter(相互)+change(交换)+ -able→可互相替换的。\n助记\ninter-（相互）+ change（交换）+ -able（可…的）→ 可互相替换的\n例句\nThese two batteries are completely ==interchangeable==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352829","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"irksome","back":"释义\n令人厌烦\n词根词缀\nirk使厌烦（irken，来源不明）+-some引起…的（-sum）\nirk(使厌烦，中古英语来源不明)+ -some→令人厌烦的、讨厌的。\n助记\nirk（使厌烦，中古英语来源不明）+ -some（引起…的，参 troublesome、wearisome）→ 令人厌烦的、讨厌的\n例句\n==irksome== tasks","fields":{"Front":"irksome","Back":"释义\n令人厌烦\n词根词缀\nirk使厌烦（irken，来源不明）+-some引起…的（-sum）\nirk(使厌烦，中古英语来源不明)+ -some→令人厌烦的、讨厌的。\n助记\nirk（使厌烦，中古英语来源不明）+ -some（引起…的，参 troublesome、wearisome）→ 令人厌烦的、讨厌的\n例句\n==irksome== tasks","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352831","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"jaded","back":"释义\n疲惫的；厌倦的\n词根词缀\njade疲马、劣马（jade\"疲老马\"）+-ed过去分词作形容词\njade原指\"被用垮的疲老马\"，+ -ed→像被耗尽的老马一样疲惫厌倦的、（因过度而）腻烦的。\n助记\njade（疲老马）+ -ed（…的）→ 像被用垮的老马般→疲惫厌倦的、（因过度而）腻烦的\n例句\nAfter years of travel, he felt ==jaded== by the same tourist sights.","fields":{"Front":"jaded","Back":"释义\n疲惫的；厌倦的\n词根词缀\njade疲马、劣马（jade\"疲老马\"）+-ed过去分词作形容词\njade原指\"被用垮的疲老马\"，+ -ed→像被耗尽的老马一样疲惫厌倦的、（因过度而）腻烦的。\n助记\njade（疲老马）+ -ed（…的）→ 像被用垮的老马般→疲惫厌倦的、（因过度而）腻烦的\n例句\nAfter years of travel, he felt ==jaded== by the same tourist sights.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352833","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"languid","back":"释义\n倦怠的、没精打采\n词根词缀\nlangu虚弱、松弛（languere）+-id形容词后缀\n拉丁languere\"衰弱、松弛\"+ -id→倦怠无力的、无精打采的。\n助记\nlangu（=languere 虚弱、松弛，参 languish、languor）+ -id（…的）→ 倦怠无力的、无精打采的\n例句\nThe hot afternoon left everyone feeling ==languid== and slow.","fields":{"Front":"languid","Back":"释义\n倦怠的、没精打采\n词根词缀\nlangu虚弱、松弛（languere）+-id形容词后缀\n拉丁languere\"衰弱、松弛\"+ -id→倦怠无力的、无精打采的。\n助记\nlangu（=languere 虚弱、松弛，参 languish、languor）+ -id（…的）→ 倦怠无力的、无精打采的\n例句\nThe hot afternoon left everyone feeling ==languid== and slow.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352835","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ludicrous","back":"释义\n荒谬的、可笑的\n词根词缀\nlud玩耍、戏弄（ludere）+-icr-ous-icus+-us复合形容词后缀\n荒唐可笑的——“像演戏/玩笑(lud)一样的”。\n助记\nlud（=ludere 玩耍、戏弄，参 delude、elude）+ -icrous（…的）→ 像演戏开玩笑般的→荒唐可笑的\n例句\nThe idea of riding a horse to the moon is utterly ==ludicrous==.","fields":{"Front":"ludicrous","Back":"释义\n荒谬的、可笑的\n词根词缀\nlud玩耍、戏弄（ludere）+-icr-ous-icus+-us复合形容词后缀\n荒唐可笑的——“像演戏/玩笑(lud)一样的”。\n助记\nlud（=ludere 玩耍、戏弄，参 delude、elude）+ -icrous（…的）→ 像演戏开玩笑般的→荒唐可笑的\n例句\nThe idea of riding a horse to the moon is utterly ==ludicrous==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352837","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"meticulous","back":"释义\n谨小慎微\n词根词缀\nmet恐惧（metus\"害怕\"）+-iculous形容词后缀\n拉丁metus\"恐惧\"派生meticulosus\"胆怯的\"，词义转为\"因怕出错而细看\"→一丝不苟的、极注意细节的。\n助记\nmet（=metus 恐惧）+ -iculous（…的）→ 因怕出错而仔细看→一丝不苟的、极注意细节的\n例句\nHe is very ==meticulous== about keeping the laboratory clean.","fields":{"Front":"meticulous","Back":"释义\n谨小慎微\n词根词缀\nmet恐惧（metus\"害怕\"）+-iculous形容词后缀\n拉丁metus\"恐惧\"派生meticulosus\"胆怯的\"，词义转为\"因怕出错而细看\"→一丝不苟的、极注意细节的。\n助记\nmet（=metus 恐惧）+ -iculous（…的）→ 因怕出错而仔细看→一丝不苟的、极注意细节的\n例句\nHe is very ==meticulous== about keeping the laboratory clean.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352839","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"miser","back":"释义\n守财奴；吝啬鬼\n词根词缀\nmiser可怜的、不幸的（miser）\n拉丁miser\"可怜、悲惨\"，派生miserable；英语miser特指吝啬到自苦的\"守财奴\"。\n助记\n拉丁 miser「可怜的、悲惨的」→ 吝啬到自苦的人→守财奴、吝啬鬼\n例句\nThe greedy ==miser== never spent a coin on anything he enjoyed.","fields":{"Front":"miser","Back":"释义\n守财奴；吝啬鬼\n词根词缀\nmiser可怜的、不幸的（miser）\n拉丁miser\"可怜、悲惨\"，派生miserable；英语miser