 magnificent）+ -ent（…的）→ 慷慨赠礼的→非常慷慨的\n例句\nThe ==munificent== donor built an entire hospital for the poor.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352845","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"nemesis","back":"释义\n报应；强敌\n词根词缀\nnemesis报应女神（Nemesis, 来自nemein\"分配、惩罚\"）\n希腊神话中主持公正报应的女神，引申为\"天罚、克星、不可避免的宿敌\"。\n助记\n希腊神话报应女神 Nemesis（nemein 分配、惩罚）→ 天罚、克星、不可避免的宿敌\n例句\nThe brilliant rival proved to be his greatest ==nemesis==.","fields":{"Front":"nemesis","Back":"释义\n报应；强敌\n词根词缀\nnemesis报应女神（Nemesis, 来自nemein\"分配、惩罚\"）\n希腊神话中主持公正报应的女神，引申为\"天罚、克星、不可避免的宿敌\"。\n助记\n希腊神话报应女神 Nemesis（nemein 分配、惩罚）→ 天罚、克星、不可避免的宿敌\n例句\nThe brilliant rival proved to be his greatest ==nemesis==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352847","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"obdurate","back":"释义\n固执的；冷酷的\n词根词缀\nob-对着、加强+dur坚硬（durus）+-ate形容词后缀\nob(加强)+dur(硬)+ -ate→心肠硬的→顽固不化的、冷酷无情的。\n助记\nob-（对着、加强）+ dur（=durus 坚硬，参 durable、during、endure）+ -ate（…的）→ 心肠坚硬的→顽固不化的、冷酷的\n例句\nHe remained ==obdurate== and refused to change his mind.","fields":{"Front":"obdurate","Back":"释义\n固执的；冷酷的\n词根词缀\nob-对着、加强+dur坚硬（durus）+-ate形容词后缀\nob(加强)+dur(硬)+ -ate→心肠硬的→顽固不化的、冷酷无情的。\n助记\nob-（对着、加强）+ dur（=durus 坚硬，参 durable、during、endure）+ -ate（…的）→ 心肠坚硬的→顽固不化的、冷酷的\n例句\nHe remained ==obdurate== and refused to change his mind.","Extra":"","S