tReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352857","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pilgrim","back":"释义\n朝圣者；香客\n词根词缀\npilagr外国人、旅人（peregrinus, 来自per\"穿过\"+ager\"田野\"）+-im名词后缀\n拉丁peregrinus\"来自异乡的、旅行者\"，经古法语借入→（去圣地的）朝圣者。\n助记\n拉丁 peregrinus（per- 穿过 + ager 田野，外地旅人，参 peregrine）→ 来自异乡的旅人→朝圣者\n例句\nEvery year, thousands of pilgrims visit the holy site as a ==pilgrim== would.","fields":{"Front":"pilgrim","Back":"释义\n朝圣者；香客\n词根词缀\npilagr外国人、旅人（peregrinus, 来自per\"穿过\"+ager\"田野\"）+-im名词后缀\n拉丁peregrinus\"来自异乡的、旅行者\"，经古法语借入→（去圣地的）朝圣者。\n助记\n拉丁 peregrinus（per- 穿过 + ager 田野，外地旅人，参 peregrine）→ 来自异乡的旅人→朝圣者\n例句\nEvery year, thousands of pilgrims visit the holy site as a ==pilgrim== would.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352859","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"plague","back":"释义\n瘟疫；折磨\n词根词缀\nplag打击、天灾（plaga\"中风/灾害\", plessein\"击打\"）+-ue名词后缀\n希腊plaga\"打击、灾害\"→拉丁plaga\"瘟疫\"→黑死病→引申\"烦扰、折磨\"。\n助记\n希腊 plaga（=plessein 击打、灾害）→ 瘟疫（如黑死病）→ 烦扰、折磨\n例句\nThe black ==plague== killed millions of people in medieval Europe.","fields":{"Front":"plague","Back":"释义\n瘟疫；折磨\n词根词缀\nplag打击、天灾（plaga\"中风/灾害\", plessein\"击打\"）+-ue名词后缀\n希腊plaga\"打击、灾害\"→拉丁plaga\"瘟疫\"→黑死病→引申\"烦扰、折磨\"。\n助记\n希腊 plaga（=plessein 击打、灾害）→ 瘟疫（如黑死病）→ 烦扰、折磨\n例句\nThe black ==plague== killed millions of people in medieval Europe.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352861","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"portent","back":"释义\n征兆；预兆\n词根词缀\npor-向前、预示+tent出示、预兆（tendere\"伸展\", portendere\"预示\"）\npor(向前)+tent(伸展/出示)→预先展示的征兆→凶兆、预兆。\n助记\npor-（pro- 向前）+ tent（=tendere 伸展、出示，portendere 预示，参 extend、tend）→ 预先展示的征兆→预兆、凶兆\n例句\nThe dark clouds were seen as a ==portent== of coming disaster.","fields":{"Front":"portent","Back":"释义\n征兆；预兆\n词根词缀\npor-向前、预示+tent出示、预兆（tendere\"伸展\", portendere\"预示\"）\npor(向前)+tent(伸展/出示)→预先展示的征兆→凶兆、预兆。\n助记\npor-（pro- 向前）+ tent（=tendere 伸展、出示，portendere 预示，参 extend、tend）→ 预先展示的征兆→预兆、凶兆\n例句\nThe dark clouds were seen as a ==portent== of coming disaster.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352863","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prolific","back":"释义\n多产的；丰富的\n词根词缀\nproli后代、子孙（proles\"子嗣\"）+-fic产生、做（facere）\nproli(后代)+ -fic(产生)→多产的、多子的；引申创作丰富的。\n助记\nproli（=proles 后代、子孙）+ fic（=facere 产生，参 -fic）→ 多产后代的→多产的、丰富的\n例句\nbetter ==prolific== than perfect","fields":{"Front":"prolific","Back":"释义\n多产的；丰富的\n词根词缀\nproli后代、子孙（proles\"子嗣\"）+-fic产生、做（facere）\nproli(后代)+ -fic(产生)→多产的、多子的；引申创作丰富的。\n助记\nproli（=proles 后代、子孙）+ fic（=facere 产生，参 -fic）→ 多产后代的→多产的、丰富的\n例句\nbetter ==prolific== than perfect","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352865","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"proponent","back":"释义\n支持者；拥护者\n词根词缀\npro-向前+pon放置（ponere, positus）+-ent名词后缀，表…者\npro(向前)+pon(放)+ -ent→把某主张摆到前面的人→支持者、提议者。\n助记\npro-（向前）+ pon（=ponere 放置，参 propose、postpone）+ -ent（…者）→ 把主张摆到前面的人→支持者、提倡者\n例句\ncivil rights ==proponent==","fields":{"Front":"proponent","Back":"释义\n支持者；拥护者\n词根词缀\npro-向前+pon放置（ponere, positus）+-ent名词后缀，表…者\npro(向前)+pon(放)+ -ent→把某主张摆到前面的人→支持者、提议者。\n助记\npro-（向前）+ pon（=ponere 放置，参 propose、postpone）+ -ent（…者）→ 把主张摆到前面的人→支持者、提倡者\n例句\ncivil rights ==proponent==","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352867","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prosaic","back":"释义\n平凡的；乏味的\n词根词缀\npros散文（prosa\"平直的话\", prorsus\"笔直\"）+-aic形容词后缀\n拉丁prosa\"散文\"（与poetry\"诗\"相对）+ -aic→像散文一样平淡无奇的、乏味的。\n助记\nprosa（=prosa 散文，prorsus 笔直，相对诗歌）+ -aic（…的）→ 像散文般平淡的→乏味的、缺乏想象力的\n例句\nThe poet turned a ==prosaic== daily chore into something beautiful.","fields":{"Front":"prosaic","Back":"释义\n平凡的；乏味的\n词根词缀\npros散文（prosa\"平直的话\", prorsus\"笔直\"）+-aic形容词后缀\n拉丁prosa\"散文\"（与poetry\"诗\"相对）+ -aic→像散文一样平淡无奇的、乏味的。\n助记\nprosa（=prosa 散文，prorsus 笔直，相对诗歌）+ -aic（…的）→ 像散文般平淡的→乏味的、缺乏想象力的\n例句\nThe poet turned a ==prosaic== daily chore into something beautiful.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352869","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"provincial","back":"释义\n地方性的；偏狭的\n词根词缀\npro-前面/代+vinc征服（vincere, provincia\"被征服的行省\"）+-ial形容词后缀\nprovincia\"罗马行省\"，+ -ial→外省的→见识狭隘的、乡土气的。\n助记\nprovincia（罗马行省，源自 vincere 征服）+ -ial（…的）→ 外省的→地方性的、眼界狭隘守旧的\n例句\nHis ==provincial== attitude revealed that he had rarely left his village.","fields":{"Front":"provincial","Back":"释义\n地方性的；偏狭的\n词根词缀\npro-前面/代+vinc征服（vincere, provincia\"被征服的行省\"）+-ial形容词后缀\nprovincia\"罗马行省\"，+ -ial→外省的→见识狭隘的、乡土气的。\n助记\nprovincia（罗马行省，源自 vincere 征服）+ -ial（…的）→ 外省的→地方性的、眼界狭隘守旧的\n例句\nHis ==provincial== attitude revealed that he had rarely left his village.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352871","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"redress","back":"释义\n纠正；赔偿\n词根词缀\nre-再、回+dress整理、安排（directiare, 来自dirigere\"使正直\"）\nre(回/重新)+dress(整理/使正)→把被颠倒的改正过来→纠正、补偿（冤屈）。\n助记\nre-（重新）+ dress（=directiare 使正，dirigere 指引，参 direct）→ 把被颠倒的改正过来→纠正、补偿（冤屈）\n例句\nThe court ordered the company to ==redress== the wrong it had done.","fields":{"Front":"redress","Back":"释义\n纠正；赔偿\n词根词缀\nre-再、回+dress整理、安排（directiare, 来自dirigere\"使正直\"）\nre(回/重新)+dress(整理/使正)→把被颠倒的改正过来→纠正、补偿（冤屈）。\n助记\nre-（重新）+ dress（=directiare 使正，dirigere 指引，参 direct）→ 把被颠倒的改正过来→纠正、补偿（冤屈）\n例句\nThe court ordered the company to ==redress== the wrong it had done.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352873","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"repressive","back":"释义\n压制的；镇压的\n词根词缀\nre-回、压下+press压（premere, pressus）+-ive形容词后缀\nre(回)+press(压)+ -ive→压制的、镇压的。\n助记\nre-（回、压下）+ press（=premere 压，参 press、impress、oppress）+ -ive（…的）→ 用力压回去的→压制的、镇压的\n例句\nThe ==repressive== government jailed anyone who spoke against it.","fields":{"Front":"repressive","Back":"释义\n压制的；镇压的\n词根词缀\nre-回、压下+press压（premere, pressus）+-ive形容词后缀\nre(回)+press(压)+ -ive→压制的、镇压的。\n助记\nre-（回、压下）+ press（=premere 压，参 press、impress、oppress）+ -ive（…的）→ 用力压回去的→压制的、镇压的\n例句\nThe ==repressive== government jailed anyone who spoke against it.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352875","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"renegade","back":"释义\n叛徒；变节者\n词根词缀\nre-回、相反+neg否认、放弃（negare）+-ade名词后缀，表人\nre(相反)+neg(否认)→背弃信仰的人→变节者、叛徒。\n助记\nre-（相反）+ neg（=negare 否认，参 deny、negative、renege）+ -ade（指人）→ 背弃（信仰）的人→变节者、叛徒\n例句\nThe spy infiltrated their group by posing as a ==renegade== soldier.","fields":{"Front":"renegade","Back":"释义\n叛徒；变节者\n词根词缀\nre-回、相反+neg否认、放弃（negare）+-ade名词后缀，表人\nre(相反)+neg(否认)→背弃信仰的人→变节者、叛徒。\n助记\nre-（相反）+ neg（=negare 否认，参 deny、negative、renege）+ -ade（指人）→ 背弃（信仰）的人→变节者、叛徒\n例句\nThe spy infiltrated their group by posing as a ==renegade== soldier.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352877","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"repudiate","back":"释义\n拒绝；（公开）否认\n词根词缀\nrepud休妻、拒绝（repudium\"离婚\", 来自repudiare\"抛弃\"）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁repudiare\"休掉、抛弃\"，+ -ate→断绝关系、公开否认、拒绝接受。\n助记\nrepud（=repudium 离婚、休妻，repudiare 抛弃）+ -ate（动词）→ 休掉、断绝关系→公开否认、拒绝接受\n例句\nThe writer was forced to ==repudiate== the false statement.","fields":{"Front":"repudiate","Back":"释义\n拒绝；（公开）否认\n词根词缀\nrepud休妻、拒绝（repudium\"离婚\", 来自repudiare\"抛弃\"）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁repudiare\"休掉、抛弃\"，+ -ate→断绝关系、公开否认、拒绝接受。\n助记\nrepud（=repudium 离婚、休妻，repudiare 抛弃）+ -ate（动词）→ 休掉、断绝关系→公开否认、拒绝接受\n例句\nThe writer was forced to ==repudiate== the false statement.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352879","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"resilient","back":"释义\n有弹性的；能复原的\n词根词缀\nre-回+sili跳跃、弹回（salire, resilire\"跳回\"）+-ent形容词后缀\nre(回)+sili(跳/弹)+ -ent→能弹回来的→有弹性的；引申抗压恢复力强的。\n助记\nre-（回）+ sili（=salire 跳，resilire 弹回，参 salient、resilience）+ -ent（…的）→ 能弹回来的→有弹性的、抗压恢复力强的\n例句\nChildren are often more ==resilient== than adults give them credit for.","fields":{"Front":"resilient","Back":"释义\n有弹性的；能复原的\n词根词缀\nre-回+sili跳跃、弹回（salire, resilire\"跳回\"）+-ent形容词后缀\nre(回)+sili(跳/弹)+ -ent→能弹回来的→有弹性的；引申抗压恢复力强的。\n助记\nre-（回）+ sili（=salire 跳，resilire 弹回，参 salient、resilience）+ -ent（…的）→ 能弹回来的→有弹性的、抗压恢复力强的\n例句\nChildren are often more ==resilient== than adults give them credit for.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352881","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"revolutionary","back":"释义\n革命者；革命性的\n词根词缀\nre-再、回+volut滚动（volvere, volutus）+-ary形容词后缀\nre(回)+volut(滚)→旋转一圈，引申\"改朝换代\"→革命的、颠覆性变革的。\n助记\nre-（再、回）+ volut（=volvere 滚，参 revolve、revolution、evolve）+ -ary（…的）→ 旋转一圈、改朝换代的→革命的、颠覆性的\n例句\nThe invention of the printing press was a ==revolutionary== event.","fields":{"Front":"revolutionary","Back":"释义\n革命者；革命性的\n词根词缀\nre-再、回+volut滚动（volvere, volutus）+-ary形容词后缀\nre(回)+volut(滚)→旋转一圈，引申\"改朝换代\"→革命的、颠覆性变革的。\n助记\nre-（再、回）+ volut（=volvere 滚，参 revolve、revolution、evolve）+ -ary（…的）→ 旋转一圈、改朝换代的→革命的、颠覆性的\n例句\nThe invention of the printing press was a ==revolutionary== event.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352883","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"salutary","back":"释义\n有益的、有益健康\n词根词缀\nsalut健康、问候（salus\"健康\", salutare\"问候\"）+-ary形容词后缀\n拉丁salus\"健康\"+ -ary→有益健康的、有矫正益处的（教训）。\n助记\nsalut（=salus 健康，salutare 问候，参 salute、salutation）+ -ary（…的）→ 有益健康的、有矫正益处的\n例句\nThe failure had a ==salutary== effect, teaching him to plan ahead.","fields":{"Front":"salutary","Back":"释义\n有益的、有益健康\n词根词缀\nsalut健康、问候（salus\"健康\", salutare\"问候\"）+-ary形容词后缀\n拉丁salus\"健康\"+ -ary→有益健康的、有矫正益处的（教训）。\n助记\nsalut（=salus 健康，salutare 问候，参 salute、salutation）+ -ary（…的）→ 有益健康的、有矫正益处的\n例句\nThe failure had a ==salutary== effect, teaching him to plan ahead.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352885","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"simulation","back":"释义\n模拟；仿真\n词根词缀\nsimul相似、一样（similis\"相似\"）+-ation名词后缀\nsimul(相似)+ -ation→造得相像以模拟→仿真、假装。\n助记\nsimul（=similis 相似，参 similar、simulate）+ -ation（名词）→ 造得相像→仿真、假装、模拟\n例句\nThe pilots trained in a flight ==simulation== before flying the real plane.","fields":{"Front":"simulation","Back":"释义\n模拟；仿真\n词根词缀\nsimul相似、一样（similis\"相似\"）+-ation名词后缀\nsimul(相似)+ -ation→造得相像以模拟→仿真、假装。\n助记\nsimul（=similis 相似，参 similar、simulate）+ -ation（名词）→ 造得相像→仿真、假装、模拟\n例句\nThe pilots trained in a flight ==simulation== before flying the real plane.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352887","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"spontaneously","back":"释义\n自发地；自然地\n词根词缀\nspont自愿、自发（sponte\"出于自愿\"）+-ly副词后缀\n拉丁sponte\"自愿地\"+ -aneous + -ly→自发地、不由自主地。\n助记\nspont（=sponte 出于自愿）+ -aneous + -ly（副词）→ 自发地、不由自主地\n例句\nThe crowd ==spontaneously== began to sing the national anthem.","fields":{"Front":"spontaneously","Back":"释义\n自发地；自然地\n词根词缀\nspont自愿、自发（sponte\"出于自愿\"）+-ly副词后缀\n拉丁sponte\"自愿地\"+ -aneous + -ly→自发地、不由自主地。\n助记\nspont（=sponte 出于自愿）+ -aneous + -ly（副词）→ 自发地、不由自主地\n例句\nThe crowd ==spontaneously== began to sing the national anthem.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352889","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stringent","back":"释义\n严厉的；严格的\n词根词缀\nstring拉紧、束缚（stringere, strictus）+-ent形容词后缀\n拉丁stringere\"拉紧\"+ -ent→（规则）严格的、紧缩的。\n助记\nstring（=stringere 拉紧，strictus，参 strict、strain、string）+ -ent（…的）→ 被拉紧的→（规则）严格的、紧缩的\n例句\nThe lab follows ==stringent== safety rules to prevent any accidents.","fields":{"Front":"stringent","Back":"释义\n严厉的；严格的\n词根词缀\nstring拉紧、束缚（stringere, strictus）+-ent形容词后缀\n拉丁stringere\"拉紧\"+ -ent→（规则）严格的、紧缩的。\n助记\nstring（=stringere 拉紧，strictus，参 strict、strain、string）+ -ent（…的）→ 被拉紧的→（规则）严格的、紧缩的\n例句\nThe lab follows ==stringent== safety rules to prevent any accidents.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352891","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"strive","back":"释义\n努力；奋斗\n词根词缀\nstrive冲撞、搏斗（estriver, 来源不明，或与strife相关）\n简单词。自古法语estriver\"争斗、较量\"借入→努力奋斗、力求。\n助记\n古法语 estriver「争斗、较量」（与 strife 相关）→ 努力奋斗、力求\n例句\n==strive== for something","fields":{"Front":"strive","Back":"释义\n努力；奋斗\n词根词缀\nstrive冲撞、搏斗（estriver, 来源不明，或与strife相关）\n简单词。自古法语estriver\"争斗、较量\"借入→努力奋斗、力求。\n助记\n古法语 estriver「争斗、较量」（与 strife 相关）→ 努力奋斗、力求\n例句\n==strive== for something","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352893","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"substantial","back":"释义\n大量的；实质的\n词根词缀\nsub-在下面、实质+stant站立（stare, stans, substantia\"本体\"）+-ial形容词后缀\nsub(下面)+stant(站立)→立于下面的本体→实质的、大量可观的。\n助记\nsub-（在下面）+ stant（=stare 站立，substantia 本体，参 stand、substance）+ -ial（…的）→ 立于下面的本体→实质的、大量可观的、坚固的\n例句\nThe charity received a ==substantial== donation from a wealthy family.","fields":{"Front":"substantial","Back":"释义\n大量的；实质的\n词根词缀\nsub-在下面、实质+stant站立（stare, stans, substantia\"本体\"）+-ial形容词后缀\nsub(下面)+stant(站立)→立于下面的本体→实质的、大量可观的。\n助记\nsub-（在下面）+ stant（=stare 站立，substantia 本体，参 stand、substance）+ -ial（…的）→ 立于下面的本体→实质的、大量可观的、坚固的\n例句\nThe charity received a ==substantial== donation from a wealthy family.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352895","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"subversive","back":"释义\n颠覆性的；破坏的\n词根词缀\nsub-从下面+vers转、翻转（vertere, versus）+-ive形容词后缀\nsub(下)+vers(翻转)→从底下翻倒→颠覆的、破坏性的。\n助记\nsub-（从下面）+ vers（=vertere 翻转，参 reverse、convert、diverse）+ -ive（…的）→ 从底下翻倒→颠覆性的、暗中破坏的\n例句\nThe government considered the underground magazine ==subversive==.","fields":{"Front":"subversive","Back":"释义\n颠覆性的；破坏的\n词根词缀\nsub-从下面+vers转、翻转（vertere, versus）+-ive形容词后缀\nsub(下)+vers(翻转)→从底下翻倒→颠覆的、破坏性的。\n助记\nsub-（从下面）+ vers（=vertere 翻转，参 reverse、convert、diverse）+ -ive（…的）→ 从底下翻倒→颠覆性的、暗中破坏的\n例句\nThe government considered the underground magazine ==subversive==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteI