"modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352917","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"franchise","back":"释义\n特许经营；选举权\n词根词缀\nfranch自由（francus\"自由的/法兰克人\"）+-ise名词后缀\n古法语franc\"自由的\"（原指法兰克人、自由民）+ -ise→授予的特权/自由，引申选举权、特许经营。\n助记\nfranch（=francus 自由的、法兰克人/自由民，参 frank）+ -ise（名词）→ 授予的自由/特权→特许经营权、选举权\n例句\nThe company sold the ==franchise== to run restaurants in the region.","fields":{"Front":"franchise","Back":"释义\n特许经营；选举权\n词根词缀\nfranch自由（francus\"自由的/法兰克人\"）+-ise名词后缀\n古法语franc\"自由的\"（原指法兰克人、自由民）+ -ise→授予的特权/自由，引申选举权、特许经营。\n助记\nfranch（=francus 自由的、法兰克人/自由民，参 frank）+ -ise（名词）→ 授予的自由/特权→特许经营权、选举权\n例句\nThe company sold the ==franchise== to run restaurants in the region.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352919","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fraudulent","back":"释义\n欺诈的；欺骗性的\n词根词缀\nfraud欺骗、诡计（fraus, fraudis）+-ulent多…的、充满…的\nfraud(欺诈)+ -ulent→欺诈性的、骗人的。\n助记\nfraud（=fraus 欺骗、诡计，参 fraud、defraud）+ -ulent（多…的，参 opulent、corpulent）→ 充满欺诈的→欺骗的、欺诈的\n例句\nThe police uncovered a ==fraudulent== scheme to cheat investors.","fields":{"Front":"fraudulent","Back":"释义\n欺诈的；欺骗性的\n词根词缀\nfraud欺骗、诡计（fraus, fraudis）+-ulent多…的、充满…的\nfraud(欺诈)+ -ulent→欺诈性的、骗人的。\n助记\nfraud（=fraus 欺骗、诡计，参 fraud、defraud）+ -ulent（多…的，参 opulent、corpulent）→ 充满欺诈的→欺骗的、欺诈的\n例句\nThe police uncovered a ==fraudulent== scheme to cheat investors.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352921","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"improvise","back":"释义\n即兴创作；临时凑成\n词根词缀\nim-不、非+provis预见、准备（providere, provisus\"预见\"）+-ise动词后缀\nim(不)+provis(预先看见/准备)→未预先准备而临时做→即兴创作、临时凑合。\n助记\nim-（不）+ provis（=providere 预见、准备，provisus，参 provide、provision）→ 未预先准备而临时做→即兴创作、临时凑合\n例句\nWhen the musician forgot the notes, she had to ==improvise==.","fields":{"Front":"improvise","Back":"释义\n即兴创作；临时凑成\n词根词缀\nim-不、非+provis预见、准备（providere, provisus\"预见\"）+-ise动词后缀\nim(不)+provis(预先看见/准备)→未预先准备而临时做→即兴创作、临时凑合。\n助记\nim-（不）+ provis（=providere 预见、准备，provisus，参 provide、provision）→ 未预先准备而临时做→即兴创作、临时凑合\n例句\nWhen the musician forgot the notes, she had to ==improvise==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352923","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"impulsive","back":"释义\n冲动的\n词根词缀\nim-向、冲+puls推（pellere, pulsus）+-ive形容词后缀\nim(向内冲)+puls(推)+ -ive→被冲动推着走的→冲动的、鲁莽的。\n助记\nim-（in- 向、冲）+ puls（=pellere 推，pulsus，参 pulse、compel、propel、push）+ -ive（…的）→ 被冲动推着走的→冲动的、鲁莽的\n例句\nHis ==impulsive== purchase of the car turned out to be a mistake.","fields":{"Front":"impulsive","Back":"释义\n冲动的\n词根词缀\nim-向、冲+puls推（pellere, pulsus）+-ive形容词后缀\nim(向内冲)+puls(推)+ -ive→被冲动推着走的→冲动的、鲁莽的。\n助记\nim-（in- 向、冲）+ puls（=pellere 推，pulsus，参 pulse、compel、propel、push）+ -ive（…的）→ 被冲动推着走的→冲动的、鲁莽的\n例句\nHis ==impulsive== purchase of the car turned out to be a mistake.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352925","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"indignation","back":"释义\n愤慨\n词根词缀\nin-不、非+dign尊严、价值（dignus\"值得\"）+-ation名词后缀\nin(不)+dign(尊严/配得上)+ -ation→因感到受辱、不公而愤怒→义愤。\n助记\nin-（不）+ dign（=dignus 有尊严、配得上，参 dignity、dignify、indignant）+ -ation（名词）→ 因感到不配、受辱而愤怒→义愤\n例句\nShe expressed her ==indignation== at the unfair treatment of the staff.","fields":{"Front":"indignation","Back":"释义\n愤慨\n词根词缀\nin-不、非+dign尊严、价值（dignus\"值得\"）+-ation名词后缀\nin(不)+dign(尊严/配得上)+ -ation→因感到受辱、不公而愤怒→义愤。\n助记\nin-（不）+ dign（=dignus 有尊严、配得上，参 dignity、dignify、indignant）+ -ation（名词）→ 因感到不配、受辱而愤怒→义愤\n例句\nShe expressed her ==indignation== at the unfair treatment of the staff.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352927","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inept","back":"释义\n笨拙的；不称职的\n词根词缀\nin-not, 不+aptusfitted, 恰当的、适合的\nin-(不)+aptus(适合的)→不适合的→无能的、笨拙的、不得体的。\n助记\nin-（不）+ ept（=aptus 适合的，参 apt、adapt）→ 不适合的→无能的、笨拙的、不得体的\n例句\nThe ==inept== waiter broke three glasses in ten minutes.","fields":{"Front":"inept","Back":"释义\n笨拙的；不称职的\n词根词缀\nin-not, 不+aptusfitted, 恰当的、适合的\nin-(不)+aptus(适合的)→不适合的→无能的、笨拙的、不得体的。\n助记\nin-（不）+ ept（=aptus 适合的，参 apt、adapt）→ 不适合的→无能的、笨拙的、不得体的\n例句\nThe ==inept== waiter broke three glasses in ten minutes.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352929","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inapt","back":"释义\n不适当的；不合适的\n词根词缀\nin-不+apt合适（aptus\"贴合\"）\nin(不)+apt(合适)→不恰当的、不适合的（与inept近义）。\n助记\nin-（不）+ apt（=aptus 贴合、合适，参 apt、adapt）→ 不恰当的、不适合的（与 inept 近义）\n例句\nJane was socially ==inapt== and uncomfortable in the presence of men.","fields":{"Front":"inapt","Back":"释义\n不适当的；不合适的\n词根词缀\nin-不+apt合适（aptus\"贴合\"）\nin(不)+apt(合适)→不恰当的、不适合的（与inept近义）。\n助记\nin-（不）+ apt（=aptus 贴合、合适，参 apt、adapt）→ 不恰当的、不适合的（与 inept 近义）\n例句\nJane was socially ==inapt== and uncomfortable in the presence of men.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352931","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ineptitude","back":"释义\n愚笨；不称职\n词根词缀\nin-不+ept合适（aptus）+-itude名词后缀，表状态\nin(不)+ept(合适)+ -itude→无能、笨拙的状态。\n助记\nin-（不）+ ept（=aptus 合适）+ -itude（名词，状态）→ 无能、笨拙的状态\n例句\nThe minister's ==ineptitude== was clear from the failed policy.","fields":{"Front":"ineptitude","Back":"释义\n愚笨；不称职\n词根词缀\nin-不+ept合适（aptus）+-itude名词后缀，表状态\nin(不)+ept(合适)+ -itude→无能、笨拙的状态。\n助记\nin-（不）+ ept（=aptus 合适）+ -itude（名词，状态）→ 无能、笨拙的状态\n例句\nThe minister's ==ineptitude== was clear from the failed policy.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352933","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"infectious","back":"释义\n传染的、有感染力\n词根词缀\nin-进入+fect做、注入（facere, infectus\"注入/染色\"）+-ious形容词后缀\nin(进入)+fect(做/注入)→注入病菌→传染的；引申情绪有感染力的。\n助记\nin-（进入）+ fect（=facere 做、注入，infectus 注入/染色，参 fact、infect、perfect）+ -ious（…的）→ 病菌被注入的→传染的、有感染力的\n例句\nHer laughter was so ==infectious== that soon everyone was smiling.","fields":{"Front":"infectious","Back":"释义\n传染的、有感染力\n词根词缀\nin-进入+fect做、注入（facere, infectus\"注入/染色\"）+-ious形容词后缀\nin(进入)+fect(做/注入)→注入病菌→传染的；引申情绪有感染力的。\n助记\nin-（进入）+ fect（=facere 做、注入，infectus 注入/染色，参 fact、infect、perfect）+ -ious（…的）→ 病菌被注入的→传染的、有感染力的\n例句\nHer laughter was so ==infectious== that soon everyone was smiling.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352935","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"inscrutable","back":"释义\n高深莫测\n词根词缀\nin-不+scrut仔细检查（scrutari\"翻查\", scruta\"碎布/搜检\"）+-able可…的\nin(不)+scrut(细查)+ -able→无法看透、难以理解的→神秘莫测的。\n助记\nin-（不）+ scrut（=scrutari 细查、翻检，scruta 碎布，参 scrutinize）+ -able（可…的）→ 无法细看、看不透的→神秘莫测的\n例句\nan ==inscrutable== design or event","fields":{"Front":"inscrutable","Back":"释义\n高深莫测\n词根词缀\nin-不+scrut仔细检查（scrutari\"翻查\", scruta\"碎布/搜检\"）+-able可…的\nin(不)+scrut(细查)+ -able→无法看透、难以理解的→神秘莫测的。\n助记\nin-（不）+ scrut（=scrutari 细查、翻检，scruta 碎布，参 scrutinize）+ -able（可…的）→ 无法细看、看不透的→神秘莫测的\n例句\nan ==inscrutable== design or event","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"d