00_c_1791885352941","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"intermittent","back":"释义\n间歇的、断断续续\n词根词缀\ninter-在…之间+mitt送、放（mittere, missus）+-ent形容词后缀\ninter(中间)+mitt(送)→在中间插入停顿→时断时续的、间歇的。\n助记\ninter-（在…之间）+ mitt（=mittere 送、放，参 mission、admit、permit）+ -ent（…的）→ 在中间插入停顿→时断时续的、间歇的\n例句\nThere was ==intermittent== rain throughout the long afternoon.","fields":{"Front":"intermittent","Back":"释义\n间歇的、断断续续\n词根词缀\ninter-在…之间+mitt送、放（mittere, missus）+-ent形容词后缀\ninter(中间)+mitt(送)→在中间插入停顿→时断时续的、间歇的。\n助记\ninter-（在…之间）+ mitt（=mittere 送、放，参 mission、admit、permit）+ -ent（…的）→ 在中间插入停顿→时断时续的、间歇的\n例句\nThere was ==intermittent== rain throughout the long afternoon.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352943","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"intimidate","back":"释义\n恐吓；威胁\n词根词缀\nin-使、进入+timid害怕（timere\"怕\", timidus\"胆怯\"）+-ate动词后缀\nin(使)+timid(害怕)+ -ate→使人害怕→恐吓、胁迫。\n助记\nin-（使）+ timid（=timidus 胆怯的，timere 怕，参 timid、timidity）+ -ate（动词）→ 使人胆怯→恐吓、胁迫\n例句\nThe bully tried to ==intimidate== the smaller children at school.","fields":{"Front":"intimidate","Back":"释义\n恐吓；威胁\n词根词缀\nin-使、进入+timid害怕（timere\"怕\", timidus\"胆怯\"）+-ate动词后缀\nin(使)+timid(害怕)+ -ate→使人害怕→恐吓、胁迫。\n助记\nin-（使）+ timid（=timidus 胆怯的，timere 怕，参 timid、timidity）+ -ate（动词）→ 使人胆怯→恐吓、胁迫\n例句\nThe bully tried to ==intimidate== the smaller children at school.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352945","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"intractable","back":"释义\n难管教的；棘手的\n词根词缀\nin-不+tract拉、引导（trahere, tractus）+-able可…的\nin(不)+tract(拉/引导)+ -able→拉不动、难以驾驭的→难对付的、执拗的。\n助记\nin-（不）+ tract（=trahere 拉、引导，参 tractor、attract、tractable）+ -able（可…的）→ 拉不动、难驾驭的→难对付的、执拗的\n例句\nThe problem proved too ==intractable== for the young engineer to solve.","fields":{"Front":"intractable","Back":"释义\n难管教的；棘手的\n词根词缀\nin-不+tract拉、引导（trahere, tractus）+-able可…的\nin(不)+tract(拉/引导)+ -able→拉不动、难以驾驭的→难对付的、执拗的。\n助记\nin-（不）+ tract（=trahere 拉、引导，参 tractor、attract、tractable）+ -able（可…的）→ 拉不动、难驾驭的→难对付的、执拗的\n例句\nThe problem proved too ==intractable== for the young engineer to solve.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352947","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"jeopardize","back":"释义\n危及；损害\n词根词缀\njeo-一盘游戏（jeu\"游戏\", parti\"分出的一份\"=jeu parti\"未定的棋局\"）+-ize动词后缀\n古法语jeu parti\"一局结果未定的棋\"→风险、险境，+ -ize→使处于危险之中、危及。\n助记\n古法语 jeu parti「结果未定的棋局」（jeu 游戏 + parti 分出的一份）→ 风险、险境→ 使处于危险之中、危及\n例句\nLying on the application could ==jeopardize== your entire career.","fields":{"Front":"jeopardize","Back":"释义\n危及；损害\n词根词缀\njeo-一盘游戏（jeu\"游戏\", parti\"分出的一份\"=jeu parti\"未定的棋局\"）+-ize动词后缀\n古法语jeu parti\"一局结果未定的棋\"→风险、险境，+ -ize→使处于危险之中、危及。\n助记\n古法语 jeu parti「结果未定的棋局」（jeu 游戏 + parti 分出的一份）→ 风险、险境→ 使处于危险之中、危及\n例句\nLying on the application could ==jeopardize== your entire career.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352949","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"jubilation","back":"释义\n喜悦；欢呼\n词根词缀\njubil欢呼、大声欢呼（jubilare, 源自希伯来yabal\"扬声\"）+-ation名词后缀\n拉丁jubilare\"欢呼\"（与犹太赎罪年yobel有关）+ -ation→欢腾、狂喜。\n助记\njubil（=jubilare 欢呼，或与希伯来 yobel 号角/禧年有关）+ -ation（名词）→ 欢呼→欢腾、狂喜\n例句\nThere was great ==jubilation== when the long war finally ended.","fields":{"Front":"jubilation","Back":"释义\n喜悦；欢呼\n词根词缀\njubil欢呼、大声欢呼（jubilare, 源自希伯来yabal\"扬声\"）+-ation名词后缀\n拉丁jubilare\"欢呼\"（与犹太赎罪年yobel有关）+ -ation→欢腾、狂喜。\n助记\njubil（=jubilare 欢呼，或与希伯来 yobel 号角/禧年有关）+ -ation（名词）→ 欢呼→欢腾、狂喜\n例句\nThere was great ==jubilation== when the long war finally ended.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352951","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"juxtaposition","back":"释义\n并列；并置\n词根词缀\nposit放置（ponere, positus）+-ion名词后缀\njuxta(靠近)+posit(放)+ -ion→并置、并列（以形成对比）。\n助记\njuxta（=靠近）+ posit（=ponere 放置，参 position、pose）+ -ion（名词）→ 靠近放在一起→并置、并列\n例句\nputting two separate items next to each other","fields":{"Front":"juxtaposition","Back":"释义\n并列；并置\n词根词缀\nposit放置（ponere, positus）+-ion名词后缀\njuxta(靠近)+posit(放)+ -ion→并置、并列（以形成对比）。\n助记\njuxta（=靠近）+ posit（=ponere 放置，参 position、pose）+ -ion（名词）→ 靠近放在一起→并置、并列\n例句\nputting two separate items next to each other","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352953","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"laud","back":"释义\n赞美；称赞\n词根词缀\nlaud赞美、颂词（laus, laudis）\n简单词。拉丁laus/laudis\"赞美\"借入→赞扬、称赞。\n助记\n拉丁 laus/laudis「赞美」→ 赞扬、称赞（参 laudatory、applaud）\n例句\nThe whole town came to ==laud== the brave young firefighter.","fields":{"Front":"laud","Back":"释义\n赞美；称赞\n词根词缀\nlaud赞美、颂词（laus, laudis）\n简单词。拉丁laus/laudis\"赞美\"借入→赞扬、称赞。\n助记\n拉丁 laus/laudis「赞美」→ 赞扬、称赞（参 laudatory、applaud）\n例句\nThe whole town came to ==laud== the brave young firefighter.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352955","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"levity","back":"释义\n轻率；轻浮\n词根词缀\nlev轻（levis\"轻\"）+-ity名词后缀\nlev(轻)+ -ity→轻浮、不庄重（在严肃场合举止轻佻）。\n助记\nlev（=levis 轻，参 lever、levitate、relieve）+ -ity（名词）→ 轻浮、不庄重（严肃场合的诙谐）\n例句\nAfter fighting, some soldiers add ==levity== by telling jokes and singing songs.","fields":{"Front":"levity","Back":"释义\n轻率；轻浮\n词根词缀\nlev轻（levis\"轻\"）+-ity名词后缀\nlev(轻)+ -ity→轻浮、不庄重（在严肃场合举止轻佻）。\n助记\nlev（=levis 轻，参 lever、levitate、relieve）+ -ity（名词）→ 轻浮、不庄重（严肃场合的诙谐）\n例句\nAfter fighting, some soldiers add ==levity== by telling jokes and singing songs.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352957","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"libelous","back":"释义\n诽谤的；中伤的\n词根词缀\nlibel小册子、小书（libellus, 是liber\"书\"的指小词）+-ous形容词后缀\n拉丁libellus\"小书、诉状\"，后指诽谤性文字→libelous诽谤性的。\n助记\nlibel（=libellus 小书、诉状，liber 书的指小词，参 library）+ -ous（…的）→ 写在小册子里诽谤的→书面诽谤的\n例句\nThe article contained several ==libelous== statements about the actor.","fields":{"Front":"libelous","Back":"释义\n诽谤的；中伤的\n词根词缀\nlibel小册子、小书（libellus, 是liber\"书\"的指小词）+-ous形容词后缀\n拉丁libellus\"小书、诉状\"，后指诽谤性文字→libelous诽谤性的。\n助记\nlibel（=libellus 小书、诉状，liber 书的指小词，参 library）+ -ous（…的）→ 写在小册子里诽谤的→书面诽谤的\n例句\nThe article contained several ==libelous== statements about the actor.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352959","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"magnanimity","back":"释义\n宽宏大量；雅量\n词根词缀\nanim心灵、灵魂（animus\"心/精神\"）+-ity名词后缀\nmagn(大)+anim(心胸)+ -ity→心胸宽大→宽宏大量。\n助记\nmagn（=magnus 大，参 magnify、magnificent）+ anim（=animus 心胸、灵魂）+ -ity（名词）→ 心胸宽大→宽宏大量、精神高贵\n例句\nHe showed great ==magnanimity== by forgiving his bitter enemy.","fields":{"Front":"magnanimity","Back":"释义\n宽宏大量；雅量\n词根词缀\nanim心灵、灵魂（animus\"心/精神\"）+-ity名词后缀\nmagn(大)+anim(心胸)+ -ity→心胸宽大→宽宏大量。\n助记\nmagn（=magnus 大，参 magnify、magnificent）+ anim（=animus 心胸、灵魂）+ -ity（名词）→ 心胸宽大→宽宏大量、精神高贵\n例句\nHe showed great ==magnanimity== by forgiving his bitter enemy.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352961","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"magnitude","back":"释义\n巨大；重要性\n词根词缀\nmagn大（magnus）+-itude名词后缀，表程度/状态\nmagn(大)+ -itude→巨大、重要性、量级。\n助记\nmagn（=magnus 大，参 magnify、magnificent）+ -itude（名词，程度）→ 巨大、量级\n例句\nThe earthquake was of a ==magnitude== rarely seen in the region.","fields":{"Front":"magnitude","Back":"释义\n巨大；重要性\n词根词缀\nmagn大（magnus）+-itude名词后缀，表程度/状态\nmagn(大)+ -itude→巨大、重要性、量级。\n助记\nmagn（=magnus 大，参 magnify、magnificent）+ -itude（名词，程度）→ 巨大、量级\n例句\nThe earthquake was of a ==magnitude== rarely seen in the region.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352963","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mandatory","back":"释义\n强制的；法定的\n词根词缀\nmand命令、委托（mandare\"吩咐\", manus\"手\"+dare\"给\"）+-atory形容词后缀，表强制\nmand(命令)+ -atory→强制的、义务性的。\n助记\nmand（=mandare 命令、委托，manus 手 + dare 给，参 command、demand）+ -atory（…的）→ 有命令的→强制的、义务的\n例句\nAttendance at the safety meeting is ==mandatory== for all staff.","fields":{"Front":"mandatory","Back":"释义\n强制的；法定的\n词根词缀\nmand命令、委托（mandare\"吩咐\", manus\"手\"+dare\"给\"）+-atory形容词后缀，表强制\nmand(命令)+ -atory→强制的、义务性的。\n助记\nmand（=mandare 命令、委托，manus 手 + dare 给，参 command、demand）+ -atory（…的）→ 有命令的→强制的、义务的\n例句\nAttendance at the safety meeting is ==mandatory== for all staff.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352965","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mediate","back":"释义\n调解；调停\n词根词缀\nmedi中间（medius\"居中\"）+-ate动词后缀\nmedi(中间)+ -ate→居于中间调解、斡旋。\n助记\nmedi（=medius 中间，参 medium、medieval、intermediate）+ -ate（动词）→ 居于中间→调解、斡旋\n例句\nThe teacher agreed to ==mediate== the fight between the two students.","fields":{"Front":"mediate","Back":"释义\n调解；调停\n词根词缀\nmedi中间（medius\"居中\"）+-ate动词后缀\nmedi(中间)+ -ate→居于中间调解、斡旋。\n助记\nmedi（=medius 中间，参 medium、medieval、intermediate）+ -ate（动词）→ 居于中间→调解、斡旋\n例句\nThe teacher agreed to ==mediate== the fight between the two students.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352967","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"memento","back":"释义\n纪念品\n词根词缀\nmemin记住（meminisse\"记得\", memento\"记住！\"祈使词）\n拉丁memento\"记住吧！\"（是meminisse\"记得\"的命令式）→纪念物、信物。\n助记\n拉丁 memento「记住吧！」（meminisse 记得的命令式，参 remember、memo、commemorate）→ 用来记住的东西→纪念品、信物\n例句\nShe kept the old ticket as a ==memento== of their first trip.","fields":{"Front":"memento","Back":"释义\n纪念品\n词根词缀\nmemin记住（meminisse\"记得\", memento\"记住！\"祈使词）\n拉丁memento\"记住吧！\"（是meminisse\"记得\"的命令式）→纪念物、信物。\n助记\n拉丁 memento「记住吧！」（meminisse 记得的命令式，参 remember、memo、commemorate）→ 用来记住的东西→纪念品、信物\n例句\nShe kept the old ticket as a ==memento== of their first trip.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352969","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"modicum","back":"释义\n少量；一点点\n词根词缀\nmod尺度、限量（modus\"量/方式\"）+-icum名词后缀，指小\n拉丁modus\"适量\"的指小形式→少量、一点点。\n助记\nmod（=modus 尺度、适量，参 moderate、mode）+ -icum（指小后缀）→ 一点点的量→少量、一点点\n例句\na small or limited quantity of something desirable or valuable","fields":{"Front":"modicum","Back":"释义\n少量；一点点\n词根词缀\nmod尺度、限量（modus\"量/方式\"）+-icum名词后缀，指小\n拉丁modus\"适量\"的指小形式→少量、一点点。\n助记\nmod（=modus 尺度、适量，参 moderate、mode）+ -icum（指小后缀）→ 一点点的量→少量、一点点\n例句\na small or limited quantity of something desirable or valuable","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352971","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"perfunctory","back":"释义\n敷衍的；草率的\n词根词缀\nper-彻底、走过场+funct执行、履行（fungi, functus\"尽义务\"）+-ory形容词后缀\nper(完全/走过场)+funct(履行)+ -ory→只做表面差事的→敷衍的、草率的。\n助记\nper-（彻底/走过场）+ funct（=fungi 履行、尽义务，functus，参 function、defunct）+ -ory（…的）→ 只把差事走完的→敷衍的、草率的\n例句\nHe gave the visitor only a ==perfunctory== nod and kept working.","fields":{"Front":"perfunctory","Back":"释义\n敷衍的；草率的\n词根词缀\nper-彻底、走过场+funct执行、履行（fungi, functus\"尽义务\"）+-ory形容词后缀\nper(完全/走过场)+funct(履行)+ -ory→只做表面差事的→敷衍的、草率的。\n助记\nper-（彻底/走过场）+ funct（=fungi 履行、尽义务，functus，参 function、defunct）+ -ory（…的）→ 只把差事走完的→敷衍的、草率的\n例句\nHe gave the visitor only a ==perfunctory== nod and kept working.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352973","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pigment","back":"释义\n色素；颜料\n词根词缀\npig染色（pingere, pictus\"涂绘\"）+-ment名词后缀，表物\n拉丁pingere\"涂、画\"的分词pigmentum→颜料、色素。\n助记\npig（=pingere 涂、画，pictus，参 paint、picture、depict）+ -ment（指物）→ 用于涂绘之物→颜料、色素\n例句\nThe artist mixed a rare blue ==pigment== to paint the sky.","fields":{"Front":"pigment","Back":"释义\n色素；颜料\n词根词缀\npig染色（pingere, pictus\"涂绘\"）+-ment名词后缀，表物\n拉丁pingere\"涂、画\"的分词pigmentum→颜料、色素。\n助记\npig（=pingere 涂、画，pictus，参 paint、picture、depict）+ -ment（指物）→ 用于涂绘之物→颜料、色素\n例句\nThe artist mixed a rare blue ==pigment== to paint the sky.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352975","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"platitude","back":"释义\n陈词滥调\n词根词缀\nplat平（platy\"宽、平\", 经法语plat\"平的\"）+-itude名词后缀\nplat(平)+ -itude→平平无奇的话→陈词滥调、老生常谈。\n助记\nplat（=platy 宽、平，法语 plat 平的，参 plate、plateau、plaza）+ -itude（名词）→ 平平无奇的话→陈词滥调、老生常谈\n例句\nThe speech was full of tired ==platitude== instead of fresh ideas.","fields":{"Front":"platitude","Back":"释义\n陈词滥调\n词根词缀\nplat平（platy\"宽、平\", 经法语plat\"平的\"）+-itude名词后缀\nplat(平)+ -itude→平平无奇的话→陈词滥调、老生常谈。\n助记\nplat（=platy 宽、平，法语 plat 平的，参 plate、plateau、plaza）+ -itude（名词）→ 平平无奇的话→陈词滥调、老生常谈\n例句\nThe speech was full of tired ==platitude== instead of fresh ideas.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352977","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"precocious","back":"释义\n早熟的；早慧的\n词根词缀\npre-提前+coc煮熟、成熟（coquere, coctus\"煮\"）+-ious形容词后缀\npre(提前)+coc(熟，coquere\"煮\")+ -ious→提前成熟的→（儿童）早熟的。\n助记\npre-（提前）+ coc（=coquere 煮、成熟，coctus，参 cook、concoct、kitchen）+ -ious（…的）→ 提前煮熟/成熟的→早熟的\n例句\nThe ==precocious== child was reading advanced books by age six.","fields":{"Front":"precocious","Back":"释义\n早熟的；早慧的\n词根词缀\npre-提前+coc煮熟、成熟（coquere, coctus\"煮\"）+-ious形容词后缀\npre(提前)+coc(熟，coquere\"煮\")+ -ious→提前成熟的→（儿童）早熟的。\n助记\npre-（提前）+ coc（=coquere 煮、成熟，coctus，参 cook、concoct、kitchen）+ -ious（…的）→ 提前煮熟/成熟的→早熟的\n例句\nThe ==precocious== child was reading advanced books by age six.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352979","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"protege","back":"释义\n门生；被保护人\n词根词缀\npro-在前面+teg遮盖（tegere\"盖\"）+-e法语过去分词后缀\n法语protégé（动词protéger\"保护\"的过去分词）→被（某人）庇护、提携的人→门生、受提携者。\n助记\n法语 protégé（protéger「保护」的过去分词，pro- 前 + teg=tegere 遮盖，参 protect）→ 被人庇护提携的人→门生、受提携者\n例句\nThe famous painter took the talented girl under his wing as his ==protege==.","fields":{"Front":"protege","Back":"释义\n门生；被保护人\n词根词缀\npro-在前面+teg遮盖（tegere\"盖\"）+-e法语过去分词后缀\n法语protégé（动词protéger\"保护\"的过去分词）→被（某人）庇护、提携的人→门生、受提携者。\n助记\n法语 protégé（protéger「保护」的过去分词，pro- 前 + teg=tegere 遮盖，参 protect）→ 被人庇护提携的人→门生、受提携者\n例句\nThe famous painter took the talented girl under his wing as his ==protege==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352981","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pundit","b