（=rapere 抢夺，rapax 贪婪，参 rapid、rape、rapt）+ -acious（倾向…的）→ 掠夺成性的→贪婪的、攫取无度的\n例句\nInstead of reducing their bonus, the ==rapacious== executives voted to lay off 500 workers.","fields":{"Front":"rapacious","Back":"释义\n贪婪的；掠夺的\n词根词缀\nrap抢夺（rapere\"抓、夺\", rapax\"贪婪\"）+-acious倾向于…的\nrap(抢夺)+ -acious→掠夺成性的、贪婪的。\n助记\nrap（=rapere 抢夺，rapax 贪婪，参 rapid、rape、rapt）+ -acious（倾向…的）→ 掠夺成性的→贪婪的、攫取无度的\n例句\nInstead of reducing their bonus, the ==rapacious== executives voted to lay off 500 workers.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352987","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"remedy","back":"释义\n补救；治疗\n词根词缀\nre-再、回+med医治、 measure（mederi\"医治\"）\nre(再)+med(医治)→使恢复健康之物→药物、补救办法。\n助记\nre-（再）+ med（=mederi 医治，参 medicine、medical）→ 使恢复健康之物→药物、补救办法\n例句\nThere is no simple ==remedy== for such a difficult social problem.","fields":{"Front":"remedy","Back":"释义\n补救；治疗\n词根词缀\nre-再、回+med医治、 measure（mederi\"医治\"）\nre(再)+med(医治)→使恢复健康之物→药物、补救办法。\n助记\nre-（再）+ med（=mederi 医治，参 medicine、medical）→ 使恢复健康之物→药物、补救办法\n例句\nThere is no simple ==remedy== for such a difficult social problem.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352989","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"solace","back":"释义\n安慰；慰藉\n词根词缀\nsol安慰、舒适（solari\"安慰\", solacium）\n拉丁solari\"安慰\"（与solidus\"坚实\"相关）→慰藉、安慰（物）。\n助记\n拉丁 solari「安慰」（solacium，与 solidus 坚实相关）→ 慰藉、安慰（物）\n例句\nShe found ==solace== in music after the loss of her dear friend.","fields":{"Front":"solace","Back":"释义\n安慰；慰藉\n词根词缀\nsol安慰、舒适（solari\"安慰\", solacium）\n拉丁solari\"安慰\"（与solidus\"坚实\"相关）→慰藉、安慰（物）。\n助记\n拉丁 solari「安慰」（solacium，与 solidus 坚实相关）→ 慰藉、安慰（物）\n例句\nShe found ==solace== in music after the loss of her dear friend.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352991","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"soporific","back":"释义\n催眠的；安眠药\n词根词缀\nsopor深睡（sopor\"酣睡\"）+-fic产生、使（facere\"做\"）\nsopor(酣睡)+ -fic(使产生)→催眠的；引申令人昏昏欲睡的。\n助记\nsopor（=sopor 酣睡）+ -fic（=facere 使产生，参 -fic）→ 使人酣睡的→催眠的、令人昏昏欲睡的\n例句\nThe long and boring lecture had a ==soporific== effect on the class.","fields":{"Front":"soporific","Back":"释义\n催眠的；安眠药\n词根词缀\nsopor深睡（sopor\"酣睡\"）+-fic产生、使（facere\"做\"）\nsopor(酣睡)+ -fic(使产生)→催眠的；引申令人昏昏欲睡的。\n助记\nsopor（=sopor 酣睡）+ -fic（=facere 使产生，参 -fic）→ 使人酣睡的→催眠的、令人昏昏欲睡的\n例句\nThe long and boring lecture had a ==soporific== effect on the class.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352993","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stimulate","back":"释义\n刺激；激励\n词根词缀\nstimul刺棒、驱策（stimulus\"刺/鞭策\"）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁stimulus\"赶牲畜的刺棒\"+ -ate→刺激、激发、激励。\n助记\nstimul（=stimulus 赶牲畜的刺棒，参 stake、stick）+ -ate（动词）→ 用刺棒驱赶→刺激、激发、激励\n例句\nGood questions can ==stimulate== lively discussion among students.","fields":{"Front":"stimulate","Back":"释义\n刺激；激励\n词根词缀\nstimul刺棒、驱策（stimulus\"刺/鞭策\"）+-ate动词后缀\n拉丁stimulus\"赶牲畜的刺棒\"+ -ate→刺激、激发、激励。\n助记\nstimul（=stimulus 赶牲畜的刺棒，参 stake、stick）+ -ate（动词）→ 用刺棒驱赶→刺激、激发、激励\n例句\nGood questions can ==stimulate== lively discussion among students.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352995","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"strident","back":"释义\n刺耳的；尖锐的\n词根词缀\nstrid刺耳尖叫（stridere\"发出刺耳声\"）+-ent形容词后缀\n拉丁stridere\"发吱吱声\"+ -ent→（声音）尖锐刺耳的；引申强硬、咄咄逼人的。\n助记\nstrid（=stridere 发刺耳声）+ -ent（…的）→ 声音尖锐刺耳的；引申强硬、咄咄逼人的\n例句\nHer ==strident== voice could be heard above all the others.","fields":{"Front":"strident","Back":"释义\n刺耳的；尖锐的\n词根词缀\nstrid刺耳尖叫（stridere\"发出刺耳声\"）+-ent形容词后缀\n拉丁stridere\"发吱吱声\"+ -ent→（声音）尖锐刺耳的；引申强硬、咄咄逼人的。\n助记\nstrid（=stridere 发刺耳声）+ -ent（…的）→ 声音尖锐刺耳的；引申强硬、咄咄逼人的\n例句\nHer ==strident== voice could be heard above all the others.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885352997","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"suppress","back":"释义\n抑制；压制\n词根词缀\nsup-在下、压下+press压（premere, pressus）\nsup(在下压)+press(压)→镇压、压制；又指抑制（感情）、查禁。\n助记\nsup-（sub- 在下压）+ press（=premere 压，参 press、oppress、impress）→ 往下压→镇压、压制；抑制（感情）\n例句\nThe government tried to ==suppress== the news of the disaster.","fields":{"Front":"suppress","Back":"释义\n抑制；压制\n词根词缀\nsup-