吹捧（以招揽）\"。\n助记\n古英语 tūtian「伸头窥探」→ 伸头招徕、竭力吹捧→标榜吹嘘、兜售\n例句\nSalesmen stood outside ==touting== their products to every passerby.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353003","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"trivial","back":"释义\n微不足道\n词根词缀\ntri-三（tres）+vi道路（via）\ntri(三)+via(路)→三岔路口，行人随便谈论的琐事→trivialis\"平常的\"→琐碎的、微不足道的。\n助记\ntri-（三，tres）+ vi（=via 道路，参 via、previous、voyage）→ 三岔路口，行人闲聊之地→平常的→琐碎的、微不足道的\n例句\nvery little worth or important","fields":{"Front":"trivial","Back":"释义\n微不足道\n词根词缀\ntri-三（tres）+vi道路（via）\ntri(三)+via(路)→三岔路口，行人随便谈论的琐事→trivialis\"平常的\"→琐碎的、微不足道的。\n助记\ntri-（三，tres）+ vi（=via 道路，参 via、previous、voyage）→ 三岔路口，行人闲聊之地→平常的→琐碎的、微不足道的\n例句\nvery little worth or important","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353005","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"unparalleled","back":"释义\n无比的；空前的\n词根词缀\nun-不、无+-llel彼此（allelon\"互相\", parallelos\"肩并肩\"）+-ed过去分词形容词\nun(无)+par(相等)+allel(彼此，parallel\"平行/可比\")→没有可与之相比的→无比的、空前的。\n助记\nun-（无）+ parallel（=parallelos 肩并肩、平行，para 旁 + allelon 彼此）+ -ed（…的）→ 没有可平行相比的→无比的、空前的\n例句\nThe city offers ==unparalleled== opportunities for young artists.","fields":{"Front":"unparalleled","Back":"释义\n无比的；空前的\n词根词缀\nun-不、无+-llel彼此（allelon\"互相\", parallelos\"肩并肩\"）+-ed过去分词形容词\nun(无)+par(相等)+allel(彼此，parallel\"平行/可比\")→没有可与之相比的→无比的、空前的。\n助记\nun-（无）+ parallel（=parallelos 肩并肩、平行，para 旁 + allelon 彼此）+ -ed（…的）→ 没有可平行相比的→无比的、空前的\n例句\nThe city offers ==unparalleled== opportunities for young artists.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353007","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"vigilance","back":"释义\n警惕；警戒\n词根词缀\nvigil醒着、警戒（vigil\"守夜者\", vigilare\"守夜\"）+-ance名词后缀\n拉丁vigil\"醒着守夜\"+ -ance→警觉、警戒、警惕。\n助记\nvigil（=vigil 醒着守夜，vigilare，参 vigilant、invigilate）+ -ance（名词）→ 守夜的状态→警觉、警惕、谨慎\n例句\nConstant ==vigilance== is needed to keep the children safe.","fields":{"Front":"vigilance","Back":"释义\n警惕；警戒\n词根词缀\nvigil醒着、警戒（vigil\"守夜者\", vigilare\"守夜\"）+-ance名词后缀\n拉丁vigil\"醒着守夜\"+ -ance→警觉、警戒、警惕。\n助记\nvigil（=vigil 醒着守夜，vigilare，参 vigilant、invigilate）+ -ance（名词）→ 守夜的状态→警觉、警惕、谨慎\n例句\nConstant ==vigilance== is needed to keep the children safe.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"sat800-list-10","name":"SAT800 核心 › List 10","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["sat800","imported"],"options":{},"cards":[{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353009","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"supplant","back":"释义\n取代；排挤\n词根词缀\nsub-在…下（sub）+plant脚掌（planta），plantare 踩\n在脚下踩、绊倒→推翻、取而代之\n助记\nsub-（在下面）+ plant（=planta 脚掌，plantare 踩）→ 在脚下绊倒、踩下去→推翻、取而代之\n例句\nOnline stores have begun to ==supplant== small local shops.","fields":{"Front":"supplant","Back":"释义\n取代；排挤\n词根词缀\nsub-在…下（sub）+plant脚掌（planta），plantare 踩\n在脚下踩、绊倒→推翻、取而代之\n助记\nsub-（在下面）+ plant（=planta 脚掌，plantare 踩）→ 在脚下绊倒、踩下去→推翻、取而代之\n例句\nOnline stores have begun to ==supplant== small local shops.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353011","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"toxic","back":"释义\n有毒的；n.毒物\n词根词缀\ntox弓（toxon），原指涂箭头的毒药+-ic形容词后缀 -ikos\n简单词。原指涂在箭头上的毒药→有毒的\n助记\ntox（=toxon 弓，指涂在箭头上的毒药，参 toxin、intoxicate）+ -ic（…的）→ 涂箭毒的→有毒的\n例句\nThe factory released ==toxic== waste into the nearby river.","fields":{"Front":"toxic","Back":"释义\n有毒的；n.毒物\n词根词缀\ntox弓（toxon），原指涂箭头的毒药+-ic形容词后缀 -ikos\n简单词。原指涂在箭头上的毒药→有毒的\n助记\ntox（=toxon 弓，指涂在箭头上的毒药，参 toxin、intoxicate）+ -ic（…的）→ 涂箭毒的→有毒的\n例句\nThe factory released ==toxic== waste into the nearby river.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353013","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"transitory","back":"释义\n短暂的；暂时的\n词根词缀\ntrans-穿过、横越（trans）+it走（ire, itus）+-ory形容词后缀 -orius\n走过去、转瞬即逝→短暂的、昙花一现的\n助记\ntrans-（穿过）+ it（=ire 走，itus，参 exit、itinerary、transition）+ -ory（…的）→ 走过去的→短暂的、转瞬即逝的\n例句\nFashion trends are often ==transitory== and quickly forgotten.","fields":{"Front":"transitory","Back":"释义\n短暂的；暂时的\n词根词缀\ntrans-穿过、横越（trans）+it走（ire, itus）+-ory形容词后缀 -orius\n走过去、转瞬即逝→短暂的、昙花一现的\n助记\ntrans-（穿过）+ it（=ire 走，itus，参 exit、itinerary、transition）+ -ory（…的）→ 走过去的→短暂的、转瞬即逝的\n例句\nFashion trends are often ==transitory== and quickly forgotten.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353015","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"trenchant","back":"释义\n犀利的、一针见血\n词根词缀\ntrench切（trenchier +-ant现在分词后缀 -antem\n锋利切割的→（言辞）犀利的、尖锐的\n助记\ntrench（=trenchier 切，truncare 砍，参 trench、truncate）+ -ant（…的）→ 锋利切割的→（言辞）犀利的、一针见血的\n例句\nThe critic wrote a ==trenchant== analysis of the flawed new policy.","fields":{"Front":"trenchant","Back":"释义\n犀利的、一针见血\n词根词缀\ntrench切（trenchier +-ant现在分词后缀 -antem\n锋利切割的→（言辞）犀利的、尖锐的\n助记\ntrench（=trenchier 切，truncare 砍，参 trench、truncate）+ -ant（…的）→ 锋利切割的→（言辞）犀利的、一针见血的\n例句\nThe critic wrote a ==trenchant== analysis of the flawed new policy.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353017","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"truncate","back":"释义\n截短；删节\n词根词缀\ntrunc树干、砍截（truncus, truncare）+-ate动词后缀 -atus\n像砍树干一样→截短、删节\n助记\ntrunc（=truncus 树干、残干，truncare 砍，参 trunk）+ -ate（动词）→ 像砍树干般截去顶端→截短、删节\n例句\nThe editor had to ==truncate== the long article to fit the page.","fields":{"Front":"truncate","Back":"释义\n截短；删节\n词根词缀\ntrunc树干、砍截（truncus, truncare）+-ate动词后缀 -atus\n像砍树干一样→截短、删节\n助记\ntrunc（=truncus 树干、残干，truncare 砍，参 trunk）+ -ate（动词）→ 像砍树干般截去顶端→截短、删节\n例句\nThe editor had to ==truncate== the long article to fit the page.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353019","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"unanimous","back":"释义\n全体一致\n词根词缀\nun-一（unus）+anim心智、气息（animus/anima）+-ous形容词后缀 -osus\n同一个心思→全体一致的、意见一致的\n助记\nun-（unus 一，参 unite、uniform、union）+ anim（=animus 心智、气息）+ -ous（…的）→ 同一个心思→全体一致的\n例句\nThe committee reached a ==unanimous== decision after a short discussion.","fields":{"Front":"unanimous","Back":"释义\n全体一致\n词根词缀\nun-一（unus）+anim心智、气息（animus/anima）+-ous形容词后缀 -osus\n同一个心思→全体一致的、意见一致的\n助记\nun-（unus 一，参 unite、uniform、union）+ anim（=animus 心智、气息）+ -ous（…的）→ 同一个心思→全体一致的\n例句\nThe committee reached a ==unanimous== decision after a short discussion.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353021","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ungainly","back":"释义\n笨拙的；不雅的\n词根词缀\nun-不、否定+gain合适、直接（gegn）+-ly形容词/副词后缀\n不合适、不顺手→笨拙的、不雅的\n助记\nun-（不）+ gain（=gegn 合适、直接，与 gainsay 相关）+ -ly（…的）→ 不合适、不顺手的→笨拙的、不雅的\n例句\nThe young giraffe looked ==ungainly== as it tried to walk.","fields":{"Front":"ungainly","Back":"释义\n笨拙的；不雅的\n词根词缀\nun-不、否定+gain合适、直接（gegn）+-ly形容词/副词后缀\n不合适、不顺手→笨拙的、不雅的\n助记\nun-（不）+ gain（=gegn 合适、直接，与 gainsay 相关）+ -ly（…的）→ 不合适、不顺手的→笨拙的、不雅的\n例句\nThe young giraffe looked ==ungainly== as it tried to walk.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353023","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"verbose","back":"释义\n冗长的；啰嗦的\n词根词缀\nverb词（verbum）+-ose/-ous充满…的（-osus）\n充满词语的→冗长的、啰嗦的\n助记\nverb（=verbum 词，参 verb、adverb、verbal、proverb）+ -ose（充满…的）→ 充满词语的→冗长的、啰嗦的\n例句\nThe ==verbose== report could have been half as long and twice as clear.","fields":{"Front":"verbose","Back":"释义\n冗长的；啰嗦的\n词根词缀\nverb词（verbum）+-ose/-ous充满…的（-osus）\n充满词语的→冗长的、啰嗦的\n助记\nverb（=verbum 词，参 verb、adverb、verbal、proverb）+ -ose（充满…的）→ 充满词语的→冗长的、啰嗦的\n例句\nThe ==verbose== report could have been half as long and twice as clear.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353025","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"verdict","back":"释义\n裁决；定论\n词根词缀\nver真实（verus）+dict说（dicere, dictum）\n说真话→（陪审团）裁决、定论\n助记\nver（=verus 真实，参 verify、very）+ dict（=dicere 说，dictum，参 predict、dictionary）→ 说出真话→（陪审团）裁决、定论\n例句\nThe jury returned a ==verdict== of not guilty after two days.","fields":{"Front":"verdict","Back":"释义\n裁决；定论\n词根词缀\nver真实（verus）+dict说（dicere, dictum）\n说真话→（陪审团）裁决、定论\n助记\nver（=verus 真实，参 verify、very）+ dict（=dicere 说，dictum，参 predict、dictionary）→ 说出真话→（陪审团）裁决、定论\n例句\nThe jury returned a ==verdict== of not guilty after two days.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353027","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"versatile","back":"释义\n多才多艺\n词根词缀\nvers转（vertere, versus）+-ile形容词后缀 -ilis\n能左右转换的→多才多艺的、多用途的\n助记\nvers（=vertere 转，参 reverse、convert、diverse、version）+ -atile（…的）→ 能左右转换的→多才多艺的、多用途的\n例句\nShe is a ==versatile== actress who can play comic and tragic roles.","fields":{"Front":"versatile","Back":"释义\n多才多艺\n词根词缀\nvers转（vertere, versus）+-ile形容词后缀 -ilis\n能左右转换的→多才多艺的、多用途的\n助记\nvers（=vertere 转，参 reverse、convert、diverse、version）+ -atile（…的）→ 能左右转换的→多才多艺的、多用途的\n例句\nShe is a ==versatile== actress who can play comic and tragic roles.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353029","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"wistful","back":"释义\n伤感的；渴望的\n词根词缀\nwist凝神地（wistly，来源不明）+-ful充满…的\n简单词。似源于古英语 wistly『凝神地』→渴望沉思的、怅惘的\n助记\n源自古英语 wistly「凝神地」（来源不明）→ 凝神渴望、若有所思→惆怅的、伤感的\n例句\nHe felt a ==wistful== sadness as he looked at his childhood home.","fields":{"Front":"wistful","Back":"释义\n伤感的；渴望的\n词根词缀\nwist凝神地（wistly，来源不明）+-ful充满…的\n简单词。似源于古英语 wistly『凝神地』→渴望沉思的、怅惘的\n助记\n源自古英语 wistly「凝神地」（来源不明）→ 凝神渴望、若有所思→惆怅的、伤感的\n例句\nHe felt a ==wistful== sadness as he looked at his childhood home.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353031","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"visionary","back":"释义\n有远见的、爱幻想的\n词根词缀\nvis看（videre, visus）+-ary名词/形容词后缀 -arius\n能看到异象者→有远见的；空想家\n助记\nvis（=videre 看，visus，参 vision、visible、visual、revise）+ -ion + -ary（…的人/…的）→ 能看到未来异象者→有远见的；空想家\n例句\nThe ==visionary== architect designed a city that was decades ahead of its time.","fields":{"Front":"visionary","Back":"释义\n有远见的、爱幻想的\n词根词缀\nvis看（videre, visus）+-ary名词/形容词后缀 -arius\n能看到异象者→有远见的；空想家\n助记\nvis（=videre 看，visus，参 vision、visible、visual、revise）+ -ion + -ary（…的人/…的）→ 能看到未来异象者→有远见的；空想家\n例句\nThe ==visionary== architect designed a city that was decades ahead of its time.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353033","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"whimsical","back":"释义\n异想天开、古怪的\n词根词缀\nwhims怪念头（whim/whimsy，来源不明）+-ical形容词后缀 -icalis\n简单词。怪念头+形容词后缀→异想天开的、古怪的\n助记\nwhim（=whim-wham 怪念头，参 whimsy）+ -sical（…的）→ 满脑子怪念头的→异想天开的、古怪多变的\n例句\nThe story has a ==whimsical== charm that delights both children and adults.","fields":{"Front":"whimsical","Back":"释义\n异想天开、古怪的\n词根词缀\nwhims怪念头（whim/whimsy，来源不明）+-ical形容词后缀 -icalis\n简单词。怪念头+形容词后缀→异想天开的、古怪的\n助记\nwhim（=whim-wham 怪念头，参 whimsy）+ -sical（…的）→ 满脑子怪念头的→异想天开的、古怪多变的\n例句\nThe story has a ==whimsical== charm that delights both children and adults.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353035","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"abate","back":"释义\n减轻；减弱\n词根词缀\na-去、向（ad-在 b 前）+bat打（battuere/battere）\n打下去→减弱、减轻\n助记\na-（ad- 去、向）+ bate（=battuere 打，参 batter、battle、debate）→ 打下去→减弱、减轻\n例句\nThe storm began to ==abate== after midnight, and the winds grew calm.","fields":{"Front":"abate","Back":"释义\n减轻；减弱\n词根词缀\na-去、向（ad-在 b 前）+bat打（battuere/battere）\n打下去→减弱、减轻\n助记\na-（ad- 去、向）+ bate（=battuere 打，参 batter、battle、debate）→ 打下去→减弱、减轻\n例句\nThe storm began to ==abate== after midnight, and the winds grew calm.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353037","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"abstemious","back":"释义\n有节制的；节俭的\n词根词缀\nabs-离开、节制+stem烈酒（temetum）+-ious形容词后缀\n远离烈酒→有节制的、节俭的\n助记\nabs-（ab- 离开、节制）+ tem（=temetum 烈酒）+ -ious（…的）→ 远离烈酒的→有节制的、饮食有度的、节俭的\n例句\nThe monk leads an ==abstemious== life with simple food and no luxuries.","fields":{"Front":"abstemious","Back":"释义\n有节制的；节俭的\n词根词缀\nabs-离开、节制+stem烈酒（temetum）+-ious形容词后缀\n远离烈酒→有节制的、节俭的\n助记\nabs-（ab- 离开、节制）+ tem（=temetum 烈酒）+ -ious（…的）→ 远离烈酒的→有节制的、饮食有度的、节俭的\n例句\nThe monk leads an ==abstemious== life with simple food and no luxuries.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353039","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"accentuate","back"