稳定→沉着、镇定\n助记\na-（=ad 按照）+ plomb（=plumbum 铅，铅垂线，参 plumb、plumber）→ 像铅垂线般垂直稳定→沉着、镇定\n例句\nShe handled the difficult situation with remarkable ==aplomb==.","fields":{"Front":"aplomb","Back":"释义\n沉着；镇静\n词根词缀\na-按照、垂直（ad）+plomb铅（plumbum），铅垂线\n像铅垂线一样垂直稳定→沉着、镇定\n助记\na-（=ad 按照）+ plomb（=plumbum 铅，铅垂线，参 plumb、plumber）→ 像铅垂线般垂直稳定→沉着、镇定\n例句\nShe handled the difficult situation with remarkable ==aplomb==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353045","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"assiduous","back":"释义\n勤勉的；刻苦的\n词根词缀\nas-在旁（ad-在 s 前同化）+sid坐（sedere）+-uous形容词后缀 -uus\n坐在旁边不离岗位→勤勉的、刻苦的\n助记\nas-（ad- 在旁）+ sid（=sedere 坐，参 sit、president、reside）+ -uous（…的）→ 一直坐在岗位旁→勤勉的、刻苦的\n例句\nHe is an ==assiduous== student who studies every single evening.","fields":{"Front":"assiduous","Back":"释义\n勤勉的；刻苦的\n词根词缀\nas-在旁（ad-在 s 前同化）+sid坐（sedere）+-uous形容词后缀 -uus\n坐在旁边不离岗位→勤勉的、刻苦的\n助记\nas-（ad- 在旁）+ sid（=sedere 坐，参 sit、president、reside）+ -uous（…的）→ 一直坐在岗位旁→勤勉的、刻苦的\n例句\nHe is an ==assiduous== student who studies every single evening.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353047","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"astronomical","back":"释义\n天文学的；庞大的\n词根词缀\nastro-星（astron）+nom规律、法（nomos）+-ical形容词后缀\n研究星体规律的→天文学的；引申为巨大的\n助记\nastro（=astron 星，参 astronomy、astronaut、disaster）+ nom（=nomos 规律，参 economy）+ -ical（…