ry.","fields":{"Front":"beguile","Back":"释义\n欺骗；迷住\n词根词缀\nbe-加强、使+guile欺诈、诡计（guile）\n用诡计欺骗→蛊惑、迷住\n助记\nbe-（加强、使）+ guile（=guile 欺诈、诡计，与 wile 同源）→ 用诡计→欺骗、蛊惑、迷住\n例句\nThe smooth talker tried to ==beguile== the tourists into buying fake jewelry.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353053","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"benevolent","back":"释义\n仁慈的；慈善的\n词根词缀\nbene-好（bene）+vol意愿（velle, volens）+-ent形容词后缀 -entem\n心怀善意→仁慈的、慈善的\n助记\nbene-（好）+ vol（=velle 意愿，volens 愿意，参 voluntary、volition、malevolent）+ -ent（…的）→ 心怀善意的→仁慈的、慈善的\n例句\nThe ==benevolent== stranger paid for the poor family's groceries.","fields":{"Front":"benevolent","Back":"释义\n仁慈的；慈善的\n词根词缀\nbene-好（bene）+vol意愿（velle, volens）+-ent形容词后缀 -entem\n心怀善意→仁慈的、慈善的\n助记\nbene-（好）+ vol（=velle 意愿，volens 愿意，参 voluntary、volition、malevolent）+ -ent（…的）→ 心怀善意的→仁慈的、慈善的\n例句\nThe ==benevolent== stranger paid for the poor family's groceries.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353055","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"commend","back":"释义\n称赞；推荐\n词根词缀\ncom-加强（com-）+mand托付、命令（mandare）\n托付（给他人）→称赞、推荐\n助记\ncom-（加强）+ mand（=mandare 托付、命令，参 command、demand、recommend）→ 托付给他人→称赞、推荐\n例句\nThe manager was quick to ==commend== her for the excellent work.","fields":{"Front":"commend","Back":"释义\n称赞；推荐\n词根词缀\ncom-加强（com-）+mand托付、命令（mandare）\n托付（给他人）→称赞、推荐\n助记\ncom-（加强）+ mand（=mandare 托付、命令，参 command、demand、recommend）→ 托付给他人→称赞、推荐\n例句\nThe manager was quick to ==commend== her for the excellent work.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353057","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"conciliatory","back":"释义\n安抚的；调和的\n词根词缀\ncon-一起+cili召集、会议（concilium, calare）+-atory形容词后缀 -atorius\n召集到一起→安抚的、调和的\n助记\ncon-（一起）+ cili（=concilium 会议，calare 召集，参 council、reconcile）+ -atory（…的）→ 把人召集到一起→安抚的、意在和解的\n例句\nHe made a ==conciliatory== gesture to end the bitter argument.","fields":{"Front":"conciliatory","Back":"释义\n安抚的；调和的\n词根词缀\ncon-一起+cili召集、会议（concilium, calare）+-atory形容词后缀 -atorius\n召集到一起→安抚的、调和的\n助记\ncon-（一起）+ cili（=concilium 会议，calare 召集，参 council、reconcile）+ -atory（…的）→ 把人召集到一起→安抚的、意在和解的\n例句\nHe made a ==conciliatory== gesture to end the bitter argument.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353059","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"condone","back":"释义\n宽恕；赦免\n词根词缀\ncon-完全、加强+don给予、赦免（donare）\n完全给予宽恕→宽恕、赦免\n助记\ncon-（完全、加强）+ don（=donare 给予、赦免，参 donate、pardon、donor）→ 完全给予宽恕→宽恕、赦免（过错）\n例句\nSociety should not ==condone== such cruel behavior toward animals.","fields":{"Front":"condone","Back":"释义\n宽恕；赦免\n词根词缀\ncon-完全、加强+don给予、赦免（donare）\n完全给予宽恕→宽恕、赦免\n助记\ncon-（完全、加强）+ don（=donare 给予、赦免，参 donate、pardon、donor）→ 完全给予宽恕→宽恕、赦免（过错）\n例句\nSociety should not ==condone== such cruel behavior toward animals.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353061","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"condemn","back":"释义\n谴责；定罪\n词根词缀\ncon-加强+demn损害、损失（damnum）\n判定造成损害→谴责、定罪\n助记\ncon-（加强）+ demn（=damnum 损害、损失，参 damn、damage、indemnity）→ 判定造成损害→谴责、定罪\n例句\nThe whole world agreed to ==condemn== the brutal attack on civilians.","fields":{"Front":"condemn","Back":"释义\n谴责；定罪\n词根词缀\ncon-加强+demn损害、损失（damnum）\n判定造成损害→谴责、定罪\n助记\ncon-（加强）+ demn（=damnum 损害、损失，参 damn、damage、indemnity）→ 判定造成损害→谴责、定罪\n例句\nThe whole world agreed to ==condemn== the brutal attack on civilians.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353063","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"contentious","back":"释义\n好争论的；有争议的\n词根词缀\ncon-相互、对抗+tent伸展、争取（tendere）+-ious形容词后缀\n相互较劲争论→好争论的、有争议的\n助记\ncon-（相互、对抗）+ tent（=tendere 伸展、争取，参 tend、contend、tension）+ -ious（…的）→ 相互较劲的→好争论的、有争议的\n例句\nSame-sex marriage is still a ==contentious== topic in many countries.","fields":{"Front":"contentious","Back":"释义\n好争论的；有争议的\n词根词缀\ncon-相互、对抗+tent伸展、争取（tendere）+-ious形容词后缀\n相互较劲争论→好争论的、有争议的\n助记\ncon-（相互、对抗）+ tent（=tendere 伸展、争取，参 tend、contend、tension）+ -ious（…的）→ 相互较劲的→好争论的、有争议的\n例句\nSame-sex marriage is still a ==contentious== topic in many countries.","Extra":"","Source":""},"ex