T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353091","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"discreet","back":"释义\n谨慎的；慎重的\n词根词缀\ndis-分开+creet筛选、区别（cernere, cretus）\n能分清分寸→谨慎的、审慎的\n助记\ndis-（分开）+ creet（=cernere 筛选、辨别，cretus，参 discern、secret；注意 discrete 是离散的）→ 能分清分寸的→谨慎的、审慎的\n例句\nShe was very ==discreet== about her friend's private problems.","fields":{"Front":"discreet","Back":"释义\n谨慎的；慎重的\n词根词缀\ndis-分开+creet筛选、区别（cernere, cretus）\n能分清分寸→谨慎的、审慎的\n助记\ndis-（分开）+ creet（=cernere 筛选、辨别，cretus，参 discern、secret；注意 discrete 是离散的）→ 能分清分寸的→谨慎的、审慎的\n例句\nShe was very ==discreet== about her friend's private problems.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353093","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"disdain","back":"释义\n蔑视；鄙视\n词根词缀\ndis-不、否定+dain值得（dignus）\n认为不值得→鄙视、轻视\n助记\ndis-（不）+ dain（=dignus 值得，dign，参 dignity、deign、dignify）→ 认为不值得→鄙视、轻视\n例句\nHe looked at the cheap jewelry with obvious ==disdain==.","fields":{"Front":"disdain","Back":"释义\n蔑视；鄙视\n词根词缀\ndis-不、否定+dain值得（dignus）\n认为不值得→鄙视、轻视\n助记\ndis-（不）+ dain（=dignus 值得，dign，参 dignity、deign、dignify）→ 认为不值得→鄙视、轻视\n例句\nHe looked at the cheap jewelry with obvious ==disdain==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353095","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"disintegration","back":"释义\n瓦解；崩溃\n词根词缀\ndis-分开+integr完整（integer = in-不 + tangere 触摸）+-ation名词后缀 -ationem\n使完整状态分崩离析→瓦解、崩溃\n助记\ndis-（分开）+ integr（=integer 完整，in- 不 + tangere 触摸，参 intact、integral、integrate）+ -ation（名词）→ 使完整状态分崩离析→瓦解、崩溃\n例句\nThe slow ==disintegration== of the empire took over a century.","fields":{"Front":"disintegration","Back":"释义\n瓦解；崩溃\n词根词缀\ndis-分开+integr完整（integer = in-不 + tangere 触摸）+-ation名词后缀 -ationem\n使完整状态分崩离析→瓦解、崩溃\n助记\ndis-（分开）+ integr（=integer 完整，in- 不 + tangere 触摸，参 intact、integral、integrate）+ -ation（名词）→ 使完整状态分崩离析→瓦解、崩溃\n例句\nThe slow ==disintegration== of the empire took over a century.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353097","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dismantle","back":"释义\n拆除；拆开\n词根词缀\ndis-除去+mantle斗篷（mantellum）\n脱去…的斗篷→拆卸、拆除\n助记\ndis-（除去）+ mantle（=mantellum 斗篷，参 mantle）→ 脱去斗篷→拆除、拆开（成部件）\n例句\nThe workers came to ==dismantle== the old machine piece by piece.","fields":{"Front":"dismantle","Back":"释义\n拆除；拆开\n词根词缀\ndis-除去+mantle斗篷（mantellum）\n脱去…的斗篷→拆卸、拆除\n助记\ndis-（除去）+ mantle（=mantellum 斗篷，参 mantle）→ 脱去斗篷→拆除、拆开（成部件）\n例句\nThe workers came to ==dismantle== the old machine piece by piece.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"review