own-向下+fall落下（feallan）\n复合词。向下落→垮台、败落\n助记\ndown（向下）+ fall（落下）→ 向下落→垮台、败落、失势\n例句\nHis greed eventually led to the ==downfall== of the whole company.","fields":{"Front":"downfall","Back":"释义\n垮台；衰落\n词根词缀\ndown-向下+fall落下（feallan）\n复合词。向下落→垮台、败落\n助记\ndown（向下）+ fall（落下）→ 向下落→垮台、败落、失势\n例句\nHis greed eventually led to the ==downfall== of the whole company.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353105","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dubious","back":"释义\n可疑的；怀疑的\n词根词缀\ndub摇摆于两者间（dubius, duo 二）+-ious形容词后缀\n摇摆不定→怀疑的、不确定的\n助记\ndub（=dubius 摇摆于两者间，duo 二，参 doubt、dual）+ -ious（…的）→ 摇摆不定的→怀疑的、不确定的、可疑的\n例句\nShe was ==dubious== about the strange offer from the stranger.","fields":{"Front":"dubious","Back":"释义\n可疑的；怀疑的\n词根词缀\ndub摇摆于两者间（dubius, duo 二）+-ious形容词后缀\n摇摆不定→怀疑的、不确定的\n助记\ndub（=dubius 摇摆于两者间，duo 二，参 doubt、dual）+ -ious（…的）→ 摇摆不定的→怀疑的、不确定的、可疑的\n例句\nShe was ==dubious== about the strange offer from the stranger.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353107","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"edible","back":"释义\n可食用的\n词根词缀\ned吃（edere）+-ible可…的（-bilis）\n简单词。可以吃的→可食用的\n助记\ned（=edere 吃，参 comestible）+ -ible（可…的）→ 可以吃的→可食用的\n例句\nOnly the bright red berries are ==edible==; the others are poisonous.","fields":{"Front":"edible","Back":"释义\n可食用的\n词根词缀\ned吃（edere）+-ible可…的（-bilis）\n简单词。可以吃的→可食用的\n助记\ned（=edere 吃，参 comestible）+ -ible（可…的）→ 可以吃的→可食用的\n例句\nOnly the bright red berries are ==edible==; the others are poisonous.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"sat800-list-11","name":"SAT800 核心 › List 11","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["sat800","imported"],"options":{},"cards":[{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353109","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"concur","back":"释义\n同意；一致\n词根词缀\ncon-一起+cur跑（currere）\n一起跑同向→同时发生；同意\n助记\ncon-（一起）+ cur（=currere 跑，参 current、occur、recur）→ 一起跑向同一处→同时发生；同意\n例句\nI entirely ==concur== with your assessment of the situation.","fields":{"Front":"concur","Back":"释义\n同意；一致\n词根词缀\ncon-一起+cur跑（currere）\n一起跑同向→同时发生；同意\n助记\ncon-（一起）+ cur（=currere 跑，参 current、occur、recur）→ 一起跑向同一处→同时发生；同意\n例句\nI entirely ==concur== with your assessment of the situation.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353111","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"courteous","back":"释义\n礼貌的\n词根词缀\ncourt宫廷、庭院（cohors）+-eous形容词后缀 -eus\n像宫廷侍臣那样→彬彬有礼的\n助记\ncourt（=cohors 宫廷、庭院，参 court、courtier）+ -eous（…的）→ 像宫廷侍臣那样的→彬彬有礼的\n例句\nThe waiter was polite and ==courteous== to every customer.","fields":{"Front":"courteous","Back":"释义\n礼貌的\n词根词缀\ncourt宫廷、庭院（cohors）+-eous形容词后缀 -eus\n像宫廷侍臣那样→彬彬有礼的\n助记\ncourt（=cohors 宫廷、庭院，参 court、courtier）+ -eous（…的）→ 像宫廷侍臣那样的→彬彬有礼的\n例句\nThe waiter was polite and ==courteous== to every customer.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353113","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cryptic","back":"释义\n含义隐晦的\n词根词缀\ncrypt隐藏（kryptos）+-ic形容词后缀 -ikos\n隐藏起来的→神秘的、含义隐晦的\n助记\ncrypt（=kryptos 隐藏，参 crypt、encrypt、cryptography）+ -ic（…的）→ 隐藏起来的→神秘的、含义隐晦的\n例句\nThe message was so ==cryptic== that no one could decode it.","fields":{"Front":"cryptic","Back":"释义\n含义隐晦的\n词根词缀\ncrypt隐藏（kryptos）+-ic形容词后缀 -ikos\n隐藏起来的→神秘的、含义隐晦的\n助记\ncrypt（=kryptos 隐藏，参 crypt、encrypt、cryptography）+ -ic（…的）→ 隐藏起来的→神秘的、含义隐晦的\n例句\nThe message was so ==cryptic== that no one could decode it.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353115","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"culpable","back":"释义\n有罪的、应受责备\n词根词缀\nculp过失、罪（culpa）+-able可…的（-bilis）\n有过失的→该受谴责的、有罪的\n助记\nculp（=culpa 过失、罪，参 culprit、exculpate）+ -able（可…的）→ 有过失的→该受责备的、有罪的\n例句\nThe careless driver was found ==culpable== for the accident.","fields":{"Front":"culpable","Back":"释义\n有罪的、应受责备\n词根词缀\nculp过失、罪（culpa）+-able可…的（-bilis）\n有过失的→该受谴责的、有罪的\n助记\nculp（=culpa 过失、罪，参 culprit、exculpate）+ -able（可…的）→ 有过失的→该受责备的、有罪的\n例句\nThe careless driver was found ==culpable== for the accident.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353117","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cultivate","back":"释义\n耕作；培养\n词根词缀\ncultiv耕作（colere, cultura）+-ate动词后缀 -atus\n耕作土地→培养、栽培\n助记\ncultiv（=colere 耕作，cultura，参 culture、agriculture、colony）+ -ate（动词）→ 耕作土地→培养、栽培（人才）\n例句\nFarmers ==cultivate== the land carefully to grow healthy crops.","fields":{"Front":"cultivate","Back":"释义\n耕作；培养\n词根词缀\ncultiv耕作（colere, cultura）+-ate动词后缀 -atus\n耕作土地→培养、栽培\n助记\ncultiv（=colere 耕作，cultura，参 culture、agriculture、colony）+ -ate（动词）→ 耕作土地→培养、栽培（人才）\n例句\nFarmers ==cultivate== the land carefully to grow healthy crops.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353119","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"cynical","back":"释义\n愤世嫉俗\n词根词缀\ncyn狗（kyon），犬儒学派+-ical形容词后缀\n犬儒学派的→愤世嫉俗的\n助记\ncyn（=kyon 狗，犬儒学派 Cynic，像狗般鄙弃世俗）+ -ical（…的）→ 犬儒学派的→愤世嫉俗的\n例句\nHe has a ==cynical== view of human nature and politics.","fields":{"Front":"cynical","Back":"释义\n愤世嫉俗\n词根词缀\ncyn狗（kyon），犬儒学派+-ical形容词后缀\n犬儒学派的→愤世嫉俗的\n助记\ncyn（=kyon 狗，犬儒学派 Cynic，像狗般鄙弃世俗）+ -ical（…的）→ 犬儒学派的→愤世嫉俗的\n例句\nHe has a ==cynical== view of human nature and politics.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"ela