欺骗；哄骗\n词根词缀\nde-偏离+lud玩、戏弄（ludere）\n玩弄欺骗→欺骗、哄骗\n助记\nde-（偏离）+ lud（=ludere 玩耍、戏弄，参 delusion、elude、ludicrous、allude）→ 玩弄、戏耍→欺骗、哄骗\n例句\nDo not ==delude== yourself into thinking the task will be easy.","fields":{"Front":"delude","Back":"释义\n欺骗；哄骗\n词根词缀\nde-偏离+lud玩、戏弄（ludere）\n玩弄欺骗→欺骗、哄骗\n助记\nde-（偏离）+ lud（=ludere 玩耍、戏弄，参 delusion、elude、ludicrous、allude）→ 玩弄、戏耍→欺骗、哄骗\n例句\nDo not ==delude== yourself into thinking the task will be easy.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353127","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"demanding","back":"释义\n要求高的；费力的\n词根词缀\nde-加强+mand命令（mandare）+-ing现在分词形容词后缀\n不断要求的→苛刻的、要求高的\n助记\nde-（加强）+ mand（=mandare 命令，参 command、demand）+ -ing（…的）→ 不断要求的→苛刻的、要求高的\n例句\nTeaching young children can be a very ==demanding== job.","fields":{"Front":"demanding","Back":"释义\n要求高的；费力的\n词根词缀\nde-加强+mand命令（mandare）+-ing现在分词形容词后缀\n不断要求的→苛刻的、要求高的\n助记\nde-（加强）+ mand（=mandare 命令，参 command、demand）+ -ing（…的）→ 不断要求的→苛刻的、要求高的\n例句\nTeaching young children can be a very ==demanding== job.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353129","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"deride","back":"释义\n嘲弄；嘲笑\n词根词缀\nde-向下、轻视+rid笑（ridere）\n低头嘲笑→嘲笑、愚弄\n助记\nde-（向下、轻视）+ rid（=ridere 笑，参 ridiculous、risible、derision）→ 低头嘲笑→嘲笑、讥讽\n例句\nThe cruel students would ==deride== anyone who was different.","fi