ma（=lemma 前提、假设，lambanein 取）→ 两个相互矛盾的前提→进退两难的境地\n例句\nShe faced a difficult ==dilemma== about whether to tell the truth.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353135","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"disparate","back":"释义\n迥然不同\n词根词缀\ndis-不+par相等（par）+-ate形容词后缀 -atus\n不相等的→迥然不同的、无联系的\n助记\ndis-（不）+ par（=par 相等，参 pair、disparity、compare）+ -ate（…的）→ 不相等的→迥然不同的、无法比较的\n例句\nThe two brothers have ==disparate== interests and completely different friends.","fields":{"Front":"disparate","Back":"释义\n迥然不同\n词根词缀\ndis-不+par相等（par）+-ate形容词后缀 -atus\n不相等的→迥然不同的、无联系的\n助记\ndis-（不）+ par（=par 相等，参 pair、disparity、compare）+ -ate（…的）→ 不相等的→迥然不同的、无法比较的\n例句\nThe two brothers have ==disparate== interests and completely different friends.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353137","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"dogmatic","back":"释义\n教条的；自以为是的\n词根词缀\ndogmat意见、信条（dokein, dogma）+-tic形容词后缀 -tikos\n固守信条的→教条的、武断的\n助记\ndogmat（=dogma 意见、信条，dokein 认为，参 dogma、paradox）+ -tic（…的）→ 固守自己信条的→教条的、武断的\n例句\nHis ==dogmatic== approach left no space for fresh ideas.","fields":{"Front":"dogmatic","Back":"释义\n教条的；自以为是的\n词根词缀\ndogmat意见、信条（dokein, dogma）+-tic形容词后缀 -tikos\n固守信条的→教条的、武断的\n助记\ndogmat（=dogma 意见、信条，dokein 认为，参 dogma、paradox）+ -tic（…的）→ 固守自己信条的→教条的、武断的\n例句\nHis ==dogmatic== approach left no space for fresh ideas.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353139","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"elude","back":"释义\n逃避；躲避\n词根词缀\ne-离开（ex-）+lud玩、耍弄（ludere）\n躲开耍弄→躲避、使困惑\n助记\ne-（ex- 离开）+ lud（=ludere 玩耍、耍弄，参 delude、ludicrous、elusive、allude）→ 躲开耍弄→躲避、避开；使困惑\n例句\nThe clever thief managed to ==elude== the police for months.","fields":{"Front":"elude","Back":"释义\n逃避；躲避\n词根词缀\ne-离开（ex-）+lud玩、耍弄（ludere）\n躲开耍弄→躲避、使困惑\n助记\ne-（ex- 离开）+ lud（=ludere 玩耍、耍弄，参 delude、ludicrous、elusive、allude）→ 躲开耍弄→躲避、避开；使困惑\n例句\nThe clever thief managed to ==elude== the police for months.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353141","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"equanimity","back":"释义\n镇定\n词根词缀\nequ-平（aequus）+anim心智（animus）+-ity名词后缀 -itas\n心智平稳→镇定、平静\n助记\nequ（=aequus 平，参 equal、equity）+ anim（=animus 心智，参 animal、magnanimous）+ -ity（名词）→ 心智平稳→镇定、心态平和\n例句\nShe accepted the bad news with remarkable ==equanimity==.","fields":{"Front":"equanimity","Back":"释义\n镇定\n词根词缀\nequ-平（aequus）+anim心智（animus）+-ity名词后缀 -itas\n心智平稳→镇定、平静\n助记\nequ（=aequus 平，参 equal、equity）+ anim（=animus 心智，参 animal、magnanimous）+ -ity（名词）→ 心智平稳→镇定、心态平和\n例句\nShe accepted the bad news with remarkable ==equanimity==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"