00_c_1791885353151","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"facetious","back":"释义\n滑稽的、诙谐的\n词根词缀\nfacet诙谐、文雅（facetus）+-ious形容词后缀\n简单词。爱开玩笑的→滑稽的、好打趣的\n助记\nfacet（=facetus 诙谐、文雅）+ -ious（…的）→ 不分场合爱开玩笑的→滑稽的、好打趣的\n例句\nDo not be fooled by his ==facetious== comments about serious matters.","fields":{"Front":"facetious","Back":"释义\n滑稽的、诙谐的\n词根词缀\nfacet诙谐、文雅（facetus）+-ious形容词后缀\n简单词。爱开玩笑的→滑稽的、好打趣的\n助记\nfacet（=facetus 诙谐、文雅）+ -ious（…的）→ 不分场合爱开玩笑的→滑稽的、好打趣的\n例句\nDo not be fooled by his ==facetious== comments about serious matters.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353153","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"forbearance","back":"释义\n自制；忍耐\n词根词缀\nfor-完全、过度+bear忍受、承担（beran）+-ance名词后缀 -antia\n完全忍受→克制、宽容\n助记\nfor-（完全、过度）+ bear（=beran 忍受、承担，参 bear、forbear）+ -ance（名词）→ 完全忍受→忍耐、克制、包容\n例句\nShe showed great ==forbearance== while listening to the long complaint.","fields":{"Front":"forbearance","Back":"释义\n自制；忍耐\n词根词缀\nfor-完全、过度+bear忍受、承担（beran）+-ance名词后缀 -antia\n完全忍受→克制、宽容\n助记\nfor-（完全、过度）+ bear（=beran 忍受、承担，参 bear、forbear）+ -ance（名词）→ 完全忍受→忍耐、克制、包容\n例句\nShe showed great ==forbearance== while listening to the long complaint.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353155","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"forestall","back":"释义\n先发制人；阻止\n词根词缀\nfore-预先+stall位置、摊位（steall）\n预先占好摊位→预先阻止、先发制人\n助记\nfore-（预先）+ stall（=steall 位置、摊位，参 stall、install）→ 预先占好摊位拦截→预先阻止、先发制人\n例句\nThe team scored early to ==forestall== any comeback by their rivals.","fields":{"Front":"forestall","Back":"释义\n先发制人；阻止\n词根词缀\nfore-预先+stall位置、摊位（steall）\n预先占好摊位→预先阻止、先发制人\n助记\nfore-（预先）+ stall（=steall 位置、摊位，参 stall、install）→ 预先占好摊位拦截→预先阻止、先发制人\n例句\nThe team scored early to ==forestall== any comeback by their rivals.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353157","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fortify","back":"释义\n加强；设防\n词根词缀\nfort强（fortis）+-ify使…化（-ificare）\n使强大→加强、筑防御工事\n助记\nfort（=fortis 强，参 force、fort、effort、comfort）+ -ify（使…化）→ 使强大→加强、筑防御工事\n例句\nThe soldiers worked to ==fortify== the town before the attack.","fields":{"Front":"fortify","Back":"释义\n加强；设防\n词根词缀\nfort强（fortis）+-ify使…化（-ificare）\n使强大→加强、筑防御工事\n助记\nfort（=fortis 强，参 force、fort、effort、comfort）+ -ify（使…化）→ 使强大→加强、筑防御工事\n例句\nThe soldiers worked to ==fortify== the town before the attack.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353159","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"fortuitous","back":"释义\n偶然的；幸运的\n词根词缀\nfort运气、偶然（fors, forte）+-uitous形容词后缀 -uitus\n靠运气的→偶然的、巧合的\n助记\nfortu（=fors、forte 运气、偶然，参 fortune、fortunate）+ -itous（…的）→ 靠运气的→偶然的、巧合的\n例句\nIt was a ==fortuitous== meeting that led to their lifelong friendship.","fields":