uling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353169","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"indoctrinate","back":"释义\n灌输；教导\n词根词缀\nin-进入+doctrin教导（doctrina, docere）+-ate动词后缀 -atus\n把思想灌输给→灌输、洗脑\n助记\nin-（进入）+ doctrin（=doctrina 教导，docere 教，参 doctor、document、doctrine）+ -ate（动词）→ 把思想灌进去→灌输、洗脑\n例句\nThe regime tried to ==indoctrinate== the young with its ideas.","fields":{"Front":"indoctrinate","Back":"释义\n灌输；教导\n词根词缀\nin-进入+doctrin教导（doctrina, docere）+-ate动词后缀 -atus\n把思想灌输给→灌输、洗脑\n助记\nin-（进入）+ doctrin（=doctrina 教导，docere 教，参 doctor、document、doctrine）+ -ate（动词）→ 把思想灌进去→灌输、洗脑\n例句\nThe regime tried to ==indoctrinate== the young with its ideas.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353171","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"ineffable","back":"释义\n不可言喻\n词根词缀\nin-不，无法+effab可言说的（effari=ex-“出”+fari“说话”）+-le形容词后缀（-bilis/-ilis变体）\n言语无法形容的、不可言喻的——“不(in)能说出(effab)的”。\n助记\nin-（不）+ ef-/ex-（出）+ fa（=fari 说话，参 fable、fame）+ -ble（可…的）→ 说不出口的→美好得难以言喻的\n例句\nThe beauty of the sunrise was quite ==ineffable== in words.","fields":{"Front":"ineffable","Back":"释义\n不可言喻\n词根词缀\nin-不，无法+effab可言说的（effari=ex-“出”+fari“说话”）+-le形容词后缀（-bilis/-ilis变体）\n言语无法形容的、不可言喻的——“不(in)能说出(effab)的”。\n助记\nin-（不）+ ef-/ex-（出）+ fa（=fari 说话，参 fable、fame）+ -ble（可…的）→ 说不出口的→美好得难以言喻的\n例句\nThe beauty of the sunrise was quite ==ineffable== in words.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:0