 carefully.","fields":{"Front":"methodical","Back":"释义\n有条理的、系统的\n词根词缀\nmeth-追随（meta-）+od路（hodos）+-ical形容词后缀\n循路而行→有条理的、系统化的\n助记\nmeth-（meta- 追随）+ od（=hodos 路，参 method、odometer、exodus、period）+ -ical（…的）→ 沿路而行→有条理的、系统化的\n例句\nShe is a ==methodical== researcher who checks every detail carefully.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353187","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mischievous","back":"释义\n调皮的；恶作剧的\n词根词缀\nmis-错误+chief头、结果（chief）+-ous形容词后缀\n造成坏结果的→恶作剧的、有害的\n助记\nmis-（错误、坏）+ chief（=chief 头、结果，caput，参 mischief、achievement）+ -ous（…的）→ 造成坏结果的→恶作剧的、调皮的、有害的\n例句\nThe ==mischievous== boy hid his sister's shoes as a joke.","fields":{"Front":"mischievous","Back":"释义\n调皮的；恶作剧的\n词根词缀\nmis-错误+chief头、结果（chief）+-ous形容词后缀\n造成坏结果的→恶作剧的、有害的\n助记\nmis-（错误、坏）+ chief（=chief 头、结果，caput，参 mischief、achievement）+ -ous（…的）→ 造成坏结果的→恶作剧的、调皮的、有害的\n例句\nThe ==mischievous== boy hid his sister's shoes as a joke.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353189","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"myriad","back":"释义\n无数；大量\n词根词缀\nmyri一万、无数（myrios）+-ad名词后缀 -as\n简单词。一万→无数、极大数量\n助记\nmyri（=myrios 一万、无数，myrias）+ -ad（名词）→ 一万→无数、极大数量\n例句\nThere are a ==myriad== of ways to solve this problem.","fields":{"Front":"myriad","Back":"释义\n无数；大量\n词根词缀\nmyri一万、无数（myrios）+-ad名词后缀 -as\n简单词。一万→无数、极大数量\n助记\nmyri（=myrios 一万、无数，myrias）+ -ad（名词）→ 一万→无数、极大数量\n例句\nThere are a ==myriad== of ways to solve this problem.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353191","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"obsequious","back":"释义\n谄媚的；奉承的\n词根词缀\nob-朝向、顺从+sequ跟随（sequi）+-ious形容词后缀\n紧跟（他人意愿）→谄媚的、奉承的\n助记\nob-（朝向、顺从）+ sequ（=sequi 跟随，参 sequence、consequence、pursue、subsequent）+ -ious（…的）→ 紧跟他人意愿→谄媚的、奉承的\n例句\nThe ==obsequious== servant bowed low before the wealthy guest.","fields":{"Front":"obsequious","Back":"释义\n谄媚的；奉承的\n词根词缀\nob-朝向、顺从+sequ跟随（sequi）+-ious形容词后缀\n紧跟（他人意愿）→谄媚的、奉承的\n助记\nob-（朝向、顺从）+ sequ（=sequi 跟随，参 sequence、consequence、pursue、subsequent）+ -ious（…的）→ 紧跟他人意愿→谄媚的、奉承的\n例句\nThe ==obsequious== servant bowed low before the wealthy guest.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353193","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"obstinacy","back":"释义\n顽固；固执\n词根词缀\nob-加强、对抗+stin站立（stare）+-acy名词后缀 -acia\n站着不动→固执、顽固\n助记\nob-（加强、对抗）+ stin（=stare 站立，参 obstinate、stand）+ -acy（名词）→ 站着不动→固执、顽固\n例句\nHis ==obstinacy== in refusing help made the task much harder.","fields":{"Front":"obstinacy","Back":"释义\n顽固；固执\n词根词缀\nob-加强、对抗+stin站立（stare）+-acy名词后缀 -acia\n站着不动→固执、顽固\n助记\nob-（加强、对抗）+ stin（=stare 站立，参 obstinate、stand）+ -acy（名词）→ 站着不动→固执、顽固\n例句\nHis ==obstinacy== in refusing help made the task much harder.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353195","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"obtrusive","back":"释义\n（因不好看而）显眼的\n词根词缀\nob-对着、强加+trus推（trudere, trusus）+-ive形容词后缀 -ivus\n硬推到别人面前→冒失的、显眼的\n助记\nob-（对着、强加）+ trus（=trudere 推，trusus，参 intrude、protrude、extrude、abstruse）+ -ive（…的）→ 硬推到别人面前→冒失的、扎眼的\n例句\nThe bright advertisement was ==obtrusive== against the old buildings.","fields":{"Front":"obtrusive","Back":"释义\n（因不好看而）显眼的\n词根词缀\nob-对着、强加+trus推（trudere, trusus）+-ive形容词后缀 -ivus\n硬推到别人面前→冒失的、显眼的\n助记\nob-（对着、强加）+ trus（=trudere 推，trusus，参 intrude、protrude、extrude、abstruse）+ -ive（…的）→ 硬推到别人面前→冒失的、扎眼的\n例句\nThe bright advertisement was ==obtrusive== against the old buildings.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353197","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"paradox","back":"释义\n矛盾；悖论\n词根词缀\npara-相反、超越+dox意见（doxa）\n与通常意见相反→悖论、矛盾说法\n助记\npara-（相反、超越）+ dox（=doxa 意见，dokein 认为，参 orthodox、paradox）→ 与通常意见相反的→悖论、似是而非的说法\n例句\nIt is a strange ==paradox== that too much choice can make us unhappy.","fields":{"Front":"paradox","Back":"释义\n矛盾；悖论\n词根词缀\npara-相反、超越+dox意见（doxa）\n与通常意见相反→悖论、矛盾说法\n助记\npara-（相反、超越）+ dox（=doxa 意见，dokein 认为，参 orthodox、paradox）→ 与通常意见相反的→悖论、似是而非的说法\n例句\nIt is a strange ==paradox== that too much choice can make us unhappy.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"f