"lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353203","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"placid","back":"释义\n平静的；温和的\n词根词缀\nplac平静、取悦（placere, placidus）+-id形容词后缀 -idus\n简单词。平静的→平和的、宁静的\n助记\nplac（=placere 平静、取悦，placidus，参 please、placebo、complacent）+ -id（…的）→ 平静的→平和的、宁静的\n例句\nThe village lake was calm and ==placid== in the morning.","fields":{"Front":"placid","Back":"释义\n平静的；温和的\n词根词缀\nplac平静、取悦（placere, placidus）+-id形容词后缀 -idus\n简单词。平静的→平和的、宁静的\n助记\nplac（=placere 平静、取悦，placidus，参 please、placebo、complacent）+ -id（…的）→ 平静的→平和的、宁静的\n例句\nThe village lake was calm and ==placid== in the morning.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353205","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"precursor","back":"释义\n先驱；先兆\n词根词缀\npre-预先、前（prae-）+curs跑（currere, cursus）+-or名词后缀 -or\n跑在前面的人→先驱、前兆\n助记\npre-（在前）+ curs（=currere 跑，cursus，参 course、current、cursor）+ -or（…者）→ 跑在前面的人→先驱、先行者、前兆\n例句\nThe small experiment was a ==precursor== of the great discovery.","fields":{"Front":"precursor","Back":"释义\n先驱；先兆\n词根词缀\npre-预先、前（prae-）+curs跑（currere, cursus）+-or名词后缀 -or\n跑在前面的人→先驱、前兆\n助记\npre-（在前）+ curs（=currere 跑，cursus，参 course、current、cursor）+ -or（…者）→ 跑在前面的人→先驱、先行者、前兆\n例句\nThe small experiment was a ==precursor== of the great discovery.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353207","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"persecute","back":"释义\n迫害；纠缠\n词根词缀\nper-一直、彻底+secut跟随（sequi, secutus）+-e动词尾\n一直尾随→迫害、困扰\n助记\nper-（一直、彻底）+ secut（=sequi 跟随，secutus，参 sequence、execute、consecutive）+ -e（动词）→ 一直尾随不放→迫害、困扰\n例句\nThe government continued to ==persecute== the brave journalist.","fields":{"Front":"persecute","Back":"释义\n迫害；纠缠\n词根词缀\nper-一直、彻底+secut跟随（sequi, secutus）+-e动词尾\n一直尾随→迫害、困扰\n助记\nper-（一直、彻底）+ secut（=sequi 跟随，secutus，参 sequence、execute、consecutive）+ -e（动词）→ 一直尾随不放→迫害、困扰\n例句\nThe government continued to ==persecute== the brave journalist.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353209","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"predetermine","back":"释义\n预先决定；注定\n词根词缀\npre-预先（prae-）+determin限定（determinare, terminus 界限）+-e动词尾\n预先限定→预定、注定\n助记\npre-（预先）+ determin（=determinare 限定，terminus 界限，参 determine、term、terminal）→ 预先限定→预先决定、注定\n例句\nHis early training seemed to ==predetermine== his future career.","fields":{"Front":"predetermine","Back":"释义\n预先决定；注定\n词根词缀\npre-预先（prae-）+determin限定（determinare, terminus 界限）+-e动词尾\n预先限定→预定、注定\n助记\npre-（预先）+ determin（=determinare 限定，terminus 界限，参 determine、term、terminal）→ 预先限定→预先决定、注定\n例句\nHis early training seemed to ==predetermine== his future career.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"sat800-list-12","name":"SAT800 核心 › List 12","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["sat800","imported"],"options":{},"cards":[{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353211","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"lax","back":"释义\n松弛的；马虎的\n词根词缀\nlax松的、松弛的（laxus）\n简单词，源自拉丁语 laxus「松的」，引申为松弛的、不严格的、松懈的。\n助记\n拉丁 laxus「松的」（参 relax、release、laxative）→ 松弛的、不严格的、马虎的\n例句\nThe school has a rather ==lax== attitude toward punctuality.","fields":{"Front":"lax","Back":"释义\n松弛的；马虎的\n词根词缀\nlax松的、松弛的（laxus）\n简单词，源自拉丁语 laxus「松的」，引申为松弛的、不严格的、松懈的。\n助记\n拉丁 laxus「松的」（参 relax、release、laxative）→ 松弛的、不严格的、马虎的\n例句\nThe school has a rather ==lax== attitude toward punctuality.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353213","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mimic","back":"释义\n模仿；模拟的\n词根词缀\nmim模仿者、演员（mimos）+-ic形容词后缀（-ikos/-icus）\n源自希腊语 mimos「模仿者、滑稽演员」+ 形容词后缀 -ic，引申为模仿的、酷似的。\n助记\n希腊 mimos「模仿者、滑稽演员」（参 mime、pantomime）+ -ic（…的）→ 模仿的、酷似的\n例句\nThe young child loves to ==mimic== the way his father speaks.","fields":{"Front":"mimic","Back":"释义\n模仿；模拟的\n词根词缀\nmim模仿者、演员（mimos）+-ic形容词后缀（-ikos/-icus）\n源自希腊语 mimos「模仿者、滑稽演员」+ 形容词后缀 -ic，引申为模仿的、酷似的。\n助记\n希腊 mimos「模仿者、滑稽演员」（参 mime、pantomime）+ -ic（…的）→ 模仿的、酷似的\n例句\nThe young child loves to ==mimic== the way his father speaks.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353215","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"misconduct","back":"释义\n不端行为；渎职\n词根词缀\nmis-错、坏、不当（mis-）+conduct引导、行为（conducere，con-「一起」+ ducere「引导」）\n复合词：mis-「错误」+ conduct「行为」，字面为「错误的行为」，引申为失职、不当行为。\n助记\nmis-（错误、坏）+ conduct（=conducere 引导、行为，con- 一起 + ducere 引导，参 conduct）→ 错误的行为→失职、行为不端\n例句\nThe officer was punished for serious ==misconduct== during the investigation.","fields":{"Front":"misconduct","Back":"释义\n不端行为；渎职\n词根词缀\nmis-错、坏、不当（mis-）+conduct引导、行为（conducere，con-「一起」+ ducere「引导」）\n复合词：mis-「错误」+ conduct「行为」，字面为「错误的行为」，引申为失职、不当行为。\n助记\nmis-（错误、坏）+ conduct（=conducere 引导、行为，con- 一起 + ducere 引导，参 conduct）→ 错误的行为→失职、行为不端\n例句\nThe officer was punished for serious ==misconduct== during the investigation.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353217","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"monotonous","back":"释义\n单调的；乏味的\n词根词缀\nmono-单一、单个（monos）+ton音调、声调（tonos）+-ous形容词后缀（-osus）\nmono-「单一」+ ton「音调」+ -ous，字面「单音调的」，引申为单调乏味的。\n助记\nmono-（单一，monos，参 monopoly、monologue、monotone）+ ton（=tonos 音调，参 tone、tune、intonation）+ -ous（…的）→ 单音调的→单调乏味的\n例句\nThe ==monotonous== sound of the rain soon put her to sleep.","fields":{"Front":"monotonous","Back":"释义\n单调的；乏味的\n词根词缀\nmono-单一、单个（monos）+ton音调、声调（tonos）+-ous形容词后缀（-osus）\nmono-「单一」+ ton「音调」+ -ous，字面「单音调的」，引申为单调乏味的。\n助记\nmono-（单一，monos，参 monopoly、monologue、monotone）+ ton（=tonos 音调，参 tone、tune、intonation）+ -ous（…的）→ 单音调的→单调乏味的\n例句\nThe ==monotonous== sound of the rain soon put her to sleep.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353219","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"mystify","back":"释义\n使迷惑；使神秘\n词根词缀\nmyst神秘的、秘密入教者（mystes）+-ify使…化（facere，做）\nmyst「神秘」+ -ify「使…」，字面「使神秘化」，引申为使迷惑、使高深莫测。\n助记\nmyst（=mystes 神秘的、秘密入教者，参 mystery、mystic）+ -ify（使…化）→ 使神秘化→使迷惑、使高深莫测\n例句\nThe magician's trick continued to ==mystify== the audience.","fields":{"Front":"mystify","Back":"释义\n使迷惑；使神秘\n词根词缀\nmyst神秘的、秘密入教者（mystes）+-ify使…化（facere，做）\nmyst「神秘」+ -ify「使…」，字面「使神秘化」，引申为使迷惑、使高深莫测。\n助记\nmyst（=mystes 神秘的、秘密入教者，参 mystery、mystic）+ -ify（使…化）→ 使神秘化→使迷惑、使高深莫测\n例句\nThe magician's trick continued to ==mystify== the audience.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353221","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"negligence","back":"释义\n疏忽；过失\n词根词缀\nneg-不、非（nec，ne 的合音）+leg挑选、采集、读（legere）+-ence名词后缀（-entia）\nneg-「不」+ leg「挑选/顾及」+ -ence，字面「不顾及、不挑选」，引申为疏忽、懈怠。\n助记\nneg-（不，nec/ne）+ lig（=legere 挑选、顾及，参 elect、select、neglect、negligent）+ -ence（名词）→ 不顾及、不挑选→疏忽、粗心\n例句\nThe accident was caused by the driver's ==negligence==.","fields":{"Front":"negligence","Back":"释义\n疏忽；过失\n词根词缀\nneg-不、非（nec，ne 的合音）+leg挑选、采集、读（legere）+-ence名词后缀（-entia）\nneg-「不」+ leg「挑选/顾及」+ -ence，字面「不顾及、不挑选」，引申为疏忽、懈怠。\n助记\nneg-（不，nec/ne）+ lig（=legere 挑选、顾及，参 elect、select、neglect、negligent）+ -ence（名词）→ 不顾及、不挑选→疏忽、粗心\n例句\nThe accident was caused by the driver's ==negligence==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353223","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"nomad","back":"释义\n游牧民；流浪者\n词根词缀\nnomad游牧者、逐草而居者（nomas，nemein「放牧」）\n简单词，源自希腊语 nomas「游荡放牧者」，与 nemein「放牧、分配」同源，引申为游牧民、流浪者。\n助记\n希腊 nomas（nemein 放牧、分配，逐草而居，参 economy）→ 游荡放牧者→游牧民、流浪者\n例句\nThe ==nomad== and his family move with their herds every season.","fields":{"Front":"nomad","Back":"释义\n游牧民；流浪者\n词根词缀\nnomad游牧者、逐草而居者（nomas，nemein「放牧」）\n简单词，源自希腊语 nomas「游荡放牧者」，与 nemein「放牧、分配」同源，引申为游牧民、流浪者。\n助记\n希腊 nomas（nemein 放牧、分配，逐草而居，参 economy）→ 游荡放牧者→游牧民、流浪者\n例句\nThe ==nomad== and his family move with their herds every season.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353225","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"nonchalant","back":"释义\n漠不关心、冷淡的\n词根词缀\nnon-不、非（non）+chale关心、热衷（chaloir，源自 Lat. calere「发热、激动」）+-ant现在分词后缀（-antem）\nnon-「不」+ chaloir「在意/激动」+ -ant，字面「不热心的」，引申为冷淡的、漫不经心的。\n助记\nnon-（不）+ chal（=chaloir 在意、calere 发热、激动，参 nonchalance）+ -ant（…的）→ 不热心的→冷淡的、漫不经心的\n例句\nHe gave a ==nonchalant== reply, though he was worried inside.","fields":{"Front":"nonchalant","Back":"释义\n漠不关心、冷淡的\n词根词缀\nnon-不、非（non）+chale关心、热衷（chaloir，源自 Lat. calere「发热、激动」）+-ant现在分词后缀（-antem）\nnon-「不」+ chaloir「在意/激动」+ -ant，字面「不热心的」，引申为冷淡的、漫不经心的。\n助记\nnon-（不）+ chal（=chaloir 在意、calere 发热、激动，参 nonchalance）+ -ant（…的）→ 不热心的→冷淡的、漫不经心的\n例句\nHe gave a ==nonchalant== reply, though he was worried inside.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353227","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"palliative","back":"释义\n缓和的；姑息的\n词根词缀\npall斗篷、遮掩（pallium，palliare「披斗篷」）+-ative形容词/名词后缀（-ativus）\npall「遮掩、斗篷」+ -ative，字面「起遮掩缓解作用的」，引申为姑息的、缓解的（治标不治本）。\n助记\npall（=pallium 斗篷、遮掩，palliare 披斗篷）+ -iative（…的）→ 起遮掩缓解作用的→缓解的、姑息的（治标不治本）；缓解剂\n例句\nThe medicine offered only ==palliative== relief from the pain.","fields":{"Front":"palliative","Back":"释义\n缓和的；姑息的\n词根词缀\npall斗篷、遮掩（pallium，palliare「披斗篷」）+-ative形容词/名词后缀（-ativus）\npall「遮掩、斗篷」+ -ative，字面「起遮掩缓解作用的」，引申为姑息的、缓解的（治标不治本）。\n助记\npall（=pallium 斗篷、遮掩，palliare 披斗篷）+ -iative（…的）→ 起遮掩缓解作用的→缓解的、姑息的（治标不治本）；缓解剂\n例句\nThe medicine offered only ==palliative== relief from the pain.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353229","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"paramount","back":"释义\n至高的；首要的\n词根词缀\npar-通过、超过（per，此处演化为 par「通过、凭借」）+mount山、上升（mont，mons montis）\n源自古法语 par amont「在山上、凌驾于上」（par「通过」+ amont「向上」，a- + mont「山」），引申为至高的、最重要的。\n助记\n古法语 par amont「在山上、凌驾于上」（par 通过 + amont 向上，a- + mont 山，参 mount、amount、mountain）→ 至高无上的、最重要的\n例句\nThe safety of the passengers is of ==paramount== importance.","fields":{"Front":"paramount","Back":"释义\n至高的；首要的\n词根词缀\npar-通过、超过（per，此处演化为 par「通过、凭借」）+mount山、上升（mont，mons montis）\n源自古法语 par amont「在山上、凌驾于上」（par「通过」+ amont「向上」，a- + mont「山」），引申为至高的、最重要的。\n助记\n古法语 par amont「在山上、凌驾于上」（par 通过 + amont 向上，a- + mont 山，参 mount、amount、mountain）→ 至高无上的、最重要的\n例句\nThe safety of the passengers is of ==paramount== importance.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353231","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"partisan","back":"释义\n（坚定的）支持者；过分支持\n词根词缀\npart部分、党派（pars，partire「分割」）+-an人、…者（-anus）\npart「党派/部分」+ -an「人」，字面「属于某一派的人」，引申为党徒、坚定支持者。\n助记\npart（=pars 部分、党派，partire 分割，参 part、party、partial、partner）+ -an（…的人）→ 属于某一派的人→党徒、坚定支持者；党派的\n例句\nThe debate became a ==partisan== argument rather than a reasoned discussion.","fields":{"Front":"partisan","Back":"释义\n（坚定的）支持者；过分支持\n词根词缀\npart部分、党派（pars，partire「分割」）+-an人、…者（-anus）\npart「党派/部分」+ -an「人」，字面「属于某一派的人」，引申为党徒、坚定支持者。\n助记\npart（=pars 部分、党派，partire 分割，参 part、party、partial、partner）+ -an（…的人）→ 属于某一派的人→党徒、坚定支持者；党派的\n例句\nThe debate became a ==partisan== argument rather than a reasoned discussion.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353233","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pedestrian","back":"释义\n行人；平庸的\n词根词缀\nped脚（pes，pedis）+-estrian形容词/名词后缀（-ester + -an）\nped「脚」+ -estrian，字面「用脚行走的（人）」，引申为行人；形容词为平淡乏味的（步行远不如乘车快）。\n助记\nped（=pes 脚，pedis，参 pedal、centipede、impede）+ -estrian（…的人）→ 用脚行走的人→行人；步行远不如乘车→平淡乏味的\n例句\nThe narrow street was crowded with ==pedestrian== traffic.","fields":{"Front":"pedestrian","Back":"释义\n行人；平庸的\n词根词缀\nped脚（pes，pedis）+-estrian形容词/名词后缀（-ester + -an）\nped「脚」+ -estrian，字面「用脚行走的（人）」，引申为行人；形容词为平淡乏味的（步行远不如乘车快）。\n助记\nped（=pes 脚，pedis，参 pedal、centipede、impede）+ -estrian（…的人）→ 用脚行走的人→行人；步行远不如乘车→平淡乏味的\n例句\nThe narrow street was crowded with ==pedestrian== traffic.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353235","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prerequisite","back":"释义\n前提；必备的\n词根词缀\npre-在…之前（prae）+requis寻求、要求（quaerere，requirere「要求」）+-ite形容词/名词后缀（-itus）\npre-「先」+ re-「再」+ quis「寻求」+ -ite，字面「预先要求的」，引申为先决条件、前提。\n助记\npre-（预先）+ re-（再）+ quis（=quaerere 寻求、要求，requirere，参 require、quest、inquire）+ -ite（…的）→ 预先要求的→先决条件、前提；必备的\n例句\nA basic knowledge of algebra is a ==prerequisite== for this course.","fields":{"Front":"prerequisite","Back":"释义\n前提；必备的\n词根词缀\npre-在…之前（prae）+requis寻求、要求（quaerere，requirere「要求」）+-ite形容词/名词后缀（-itus）\npre-「先」+ re-「再」+ quis「寻求」+ -ite，字面「预先要求的」，引申为先决条件、前提。\n助记\npre-（预先）+ re-（再）+ quis（=quaerere 寻求、要求，requirere，参 require、quest、inquire）+ -ite（…的）→ 预先要求的→先决条件、前提；必备的\n例句\nA basic knowledge of algebra is a ==prerequisite== for this course.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353237","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"phlegmatic","back":"释义\n冷淡的；冷静的\n词根词缀\nphlegm黏液、痰（phlegma）+-atic…的\n古希腊四体液说中“黏液质”的人冷静、迟钝、不易激动。\n助记\nphlegm（黏液、痰）+ -atic（…的）→ 体液偏黏液的人→冷淡、冷静、迟钝。\n例句\nThe ==phlegmatic== nurse stayed calm during the busy emergency.","fields":{"Front":"phlegmatic","Back":"释义\n冷淡的；冷静的\n词根词缀\nphlegm黏液、痰（phlegma）+-atic…的\n古希腊四体液说中“黏液质”的人冷静、迟钝、不易激动。\n助记\nphlegm（黏液、痰）+ -atic（…的）→ 体液偏黏液的人→冷淡、冷静、迟钝。\n例句\nThe ==phlegmatic== nurse stayed calm during the busy emergency.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353239","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"pragmatic","back":"释义\n务实的；实用的\n词根词缀\nprag行为、事务（pragma，prattein「做」）+-atic形容词后缀（-atikos/-aticus）\nprag「事务/行动」+ -atic，字面「务实做事的」，引申为务实的、讲究实际效果的。\n助记\nprag（=pragma 行为、事务，prattein 做，参 practical）+ -atic（…的）→ 务实做事的→实用的、讲究实际效果的\n例句\nWe need a ==pragmatic== solution that will actually work.","fields":{"Front":"pragmatic","Back":"释义\n务实的；实用的\n词根词缀\nprag行为、事务（pragma，prattein「做」）+-atic形容词后缀（-atikos/-aticus）\nprag「事务/行动」+ -atic，字面「务实做事的」，引申为务实的、讲究实际效果的。\n助记\nprag（=pragma 行为、事务，prattein 做，参 practical）+ -atic（…的）→ 务实做事的→实用的、讲究实际效果的\n例句\nWe need a ==pragmatic== solution that will actually work.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353241","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prescient","back":"释义\n预知的；有先见的\n词根词缀\npre-预先（prae）+sci知道（scire）+-ent形容词后缀（-entem）\npre-「预先」+ sci「知道」+ -ent，字面「预先知晓的」，引申为有先见之明的。\n助记\npre-（预先）+ sci（=scire 知道，参 science、conscience、conscious）+ -ent（…的）→ 预先知晓的→有先见之明的\n例句\nHer ==prescient== warning about the market saved many investors money.","fields":{"Front":"prescient","Back":"释义\n预知的；有先见的\n词根词缀\npre-预先（prae）+sci知道（scire）+-ent形容词后缀（-entem）\npre-「预先」+ sci「知道」+ -ent，字面「预先知晓的」，引申为有先见之明的。\n助记\npre-（预先）+ sci（=scire 知道，参 science、conscience、conscious）+ -ent（…的）→ 预先知晓的→有先见之明的\n例句\nHer ==prescient== warning about the market saved many investors money.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353243","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prescribe","back":"释义\n开处方；规定\n词根词缀\npre-预先（prae）+scrib写（scribere）\npre-「预先」+ scrib「写」，字面「预先写下」，引申为开处方、规定、指示。\n助记\npre-（预先）+ scrib（=scribere 写，参 script、describe、manuscript、subscribe）→ 预先写下（该怎么做）→ 开处方、规定、指示\n例句\nThe doctor will ==prescribe== the proper medicine for your illness.","fields":{"Front":"prescribe","Back":"释义\n开处方；规定\n词根词缀\npre-预先（prae）+scrib写（scribere）\npre-「预先」+ scrib「写」，字面「预先写下」，引申为开处方、规定、指示。\n助记\npre-（预先）+ scrib（=scribere 写，参 script、describe、manuscript、subscribe）→ 预先写下（该怎么做）→ 开处方、规定、指示\n例句\nThe doctor will ==prescribe== the proper medicine for your illness.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353245","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prevail","back":"释义\n流行；战胜\n词根词缀\npre-在前、凌驾（prae）+vail强壮、有价值（valere）\npre-「在前」+ vail「强壮」，字面「力量占优」，引申为获胜、盛行、占优势。\n助记\npre-（在前、凌驾）+ vail（=valere 强壮、有价值，参 valid、value、prevalence、convalesce）→ 力量占优→战胜、盛行、占优势\n例句\nAfter a long struggle, justice finally managed to ==prevail==.","fields":{"Front":"prevail","Back":"释义\n流行；战胜\n词根词缀\npre-在前、凌驾（prae）+vail强壮、有价值（valere）\npre-「在前」+ vail「强壮」，字面「力量占优」，引申为获胜、盛行、占优势。\n助记\npre-（在前、凌驾）+ vail（=valere 强壮、有价值，参 valid、value、prevalence、convalesce）→ 力量占优→战胜、盛行、占优势\n例句\nAfter a long struggle, justice finally managed to ==prevail==.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353247","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prophetic","back":"释义\n预言的；预示的\n词根词缀\npro-在…之前、代…说话（pro）+phét说、宣告（phanai）+-ic形容词后缀（-ikos/-icus）\npro-「在前/代神」+ phe「说」+ -ic，字面「代神预说的」，引申为预言的、先知的。\n助记\npro-（在前、代神）+ phet（=phanai 说，phētes，参 prophet、fate、fame）+ -ic（…的）→ 代神预先说的→预言的、先知的\n例句\nHis ==prophetic== words about the war proved to be true.","fields":{"Front":"prophetic","Back":"释义\n预言的；预示的\n词根词缀\npro-在…之前、代…说话（pro）+phét说、宣告（phanai）+-ic形容词后缀（-ikos/-icus）\npro-「在前/代神」+ phe「说」+ -ic，字面「代神预说的」，引申为预言的、先知的。\n助记\npro-（在前、代神）+ phet（=phanai 说，phētes，参 prophet、fate、fame）+ -ic（…的）→ 代神预先说的→预言的、先知的\n例句\nHis ==prophetic== words about the war proved to be true.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353249","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"prudent","back":"释义\n谨慎的；精明的\n词根词缀\nprudent远见的、审慎的（prudent-，为 providens「预见」的缩合形式）\n简单词，拉丁语 providens「预见」的缩合形式（pro-「预先」+ videre「看」），引申为审慎的、精明的。\n助记\n拉丁 providens「预见」的缩合（pro- 预先 + videre 看，参 provide、provident）→ 能预见后果的→审慎的、精明的\n例句\nIt is ==prudent== to save some money for unexpected emergencies.","fields":{"Front":"prudent","Back":"释义\n谨慎的；精明的\n词根词缀\nprudent远见的、审慎的（prudent-，为 providens「预见」的缩合形式）\n简单词，拉丁语 providens「预见」的缩合形式（pro-「预先」+ videre「看」），引申为审慎的、精明的。\n助记\n拉丁 providens「预见」的缩合（pro- 预先 + videre 看，参 provide、provident）→ 能预见后果的→审慎的、精明的\n例句\nIt is ==prudent== to save some money for unexpected emergencies.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353251","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"recant","back":"释义\n公开认错；撤回\n词根词缀\nre-回、反、再（re-）+cant唱、宣告（cantare）\nre-「回」+ cant「唱/说」，字面「收回所说的话」，引申为公开撤回、放弃（主张）。\n助记\nre-（回）+ cant（=cantare 唱、宣告，参 chant、incantation）→ 收回唱过/说过的话→公开撤回、放弃（主张）\n例句\nThe witness was forced to ==recant== her earlier statement.","fields":{"Front":"recant","Back":"释义\n公开认错；撤回\n词根词缀\nre-回、反、再（re-）+cant唱、宣告（cantare）\nre-「回」+ cant「唱/说」，字面「收回所说的话」，引申为公开撤回、放弃（主张）。\n助记\nre-（回）+ cant（=cantare 唱、宣告，参 chant、incantation）→ 收回唱过/说过的话→公开撤回、放弃（主张）\n例句\nThe witness was forced to ==recant== her earlier statement.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353253","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"refuge","back":"释义\n避难所；庇护\n词根词缀\nre-回、后（re-）+fug逃（fugere）\nre-「回」+ fug「逃」，字面「逃回（安全处）」，引申为避难所、庇护。\n助记\nre-（回、后）+ fug（=fugere 逃，参 fugitive、subterfuge、centrifugal）→ 逃回安全处→避难所、庇护\n例句\nThe cave provided ==refuge== from the heavy storm.","fields":{"Front":"refuge","Back":"释义\n避难所；庇护\n词根词缀\nre-回、后（re-）+fug逃（fugere）\nre-「回」+ fug「逃」，字面「逃回（安全处）」，引申为避难所、庇护。\n助记\nre-（回、后）+ fug（=fugere 逃，参 fugitive、subterfuge、centrifugal）→ 逃回安全处→避难所、庇护\n例句\nThe cave provided ==refuge== from the heavy storm.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353255","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"restrain","back":"释义\n抑制；约束\n词根词缀\nre-回、向后（re-）+strain拉紧、束缚（stringere，strictus）\nre-「回」+ strain「拉紧」，字面「拉回、拉紧」，引申为抑制、约束、制止。\n助记\nre-（回、向后）+ strain（=stringere 拉紧，strictus，参 strain、strict、constrain、restrict）→ 拉回、拉紧→抑制、约束、制止\n例句\nHe could not ==restrain== his excitement when he heard the news.","fields":{"Front":"restrain","Back":"释义\n抑制；约束\n词根词缀\nre-回、向后（re-）+strain拉紧、束缚（stringere，strictus）\nre-「回」+ strain「拉紧」，字面「拉回、拉紧」，引申为抑制、约束、制止。\n助记\nre-（回、向后）+ strain（=stringere 拉紧，strictus，参 strain、strict、constrain、restrict）→ 拉回、拉紧→抑制、约束、制止\n例句\nHe could not ==restrain== his excitement when he heard the news.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353257","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"remorse","back":"释义\n懊悔；自责\n词根词缀\nre-加强、反复（re-）+mors咬（mordere，morsus）\nre-「反复」+ mord「咬」，字面「反复咬（心）」，引申为悔恨、内疚。\n助记\nre-（反复、加强）+ mors（=mordere 咬，morsus，参 morsel、mordant）→ 反复咬心→悔恨、内疚\n例句\nThe thief felt deep ==remorse== for the pain he had caused.","fields":{"Front":"remorse","Back":"释义\n懊悔；自责\n词根词缀\nre-加强、反复（re-）+mors咬（mordere，morsus）\nre-「反复」+ mord「咬」，字面「反复咬（心）」，引申为悔恨、内疚。\n助记\nre-（反复、加强）+ mors（=mordere 咬，morsus，参 morsel、mordant）→ 反复咬心→悔恨、内疚\n例句\nThe thief felt deep ==remorse== for the pain he had caused.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353259","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"retraction","back":"释义\n撤回；收回\n词根词缀\nre-回、向后（re-）+tract拉（trahere，tractus）+-ion名词后缀（-ionem）\nre-「回」+ tract「拉」+ -ion，字面「拉回」，引申为撤回、收回（言论）。\n助记\nre-（回、向后）+ tract（=trahere 拉，tractus，参 tractor、attract、abstract、subtract）+ -ion（名词）→ 拉回→撤回、收回（言论）\n例句\nThe newspaper printed a ==retraction== of the false story.","fields":{"Front":"retraction","Back":"释义\n撤回；收回\n词根词缀\nre-回、向后（re-）+tract拉（trahere，tractus）+-ion名词后缀（-ionem）\nre-「回」+ tract「拉」+ -ion，字面「拉回」，引申为撤回、收回（言论）。\n助记\nre-（回、向后）+ tract（=trahere 拉，tractus，参 tractor、attract、abstract、subtract）+ -ion（名词）→ 拉回→撤回、收回（言论）\n例句\nThe newspaper printed a ==retraction== of the false story.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353261","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"rival","back":"释义\n竞争对手；匹敌\n词根词缀\nrival共用一条溪水的人（rivalis，rivus「溪流」）\n简单词，拉丁语 rivalis「共用一条小溪的人」，因争水而成为对手，引申为竞争者、对手。\n助记\n拉丁 rivalis「共用一条小溪的人」（rivus 溪流，参 river、rivulet）→ 因争水而成为对手→竞争者、对手\n例句\nOur main ==rival== released a better product last month.","fields":{"Front":"rival","Back":"释义\n竞争对手；匹敌\n词根词缀\nrival共用一条溪水的人（rivalis，rivus「溪流」）\n简单词，拉丁语 rivalis「共用一条小溪的人」，因争水而成为对手，引申为竞争者、对手。\n助记\n拉丁 rivalis「共用一条小溪的人」（rivus 溪流，参 river、rivulet）→ 因争水而成为对手→竞争者、对手\n例句\nOur main ==rival== released a better product last month.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353263","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"secluded","back":"释义\n隔绝的；隐居的\n词根词缀\nse-分开、离开（se-）+clud关闭（claudere，clusus）+-ed过去分词/形容词后缀（-ed）\nse-「分开」+ clud「关闭」+ -ed，字面「被隔开关闭的」，引申为隐蔽的、与世隔绝的。\n助记\nse-（分开、离开）+ clud（=claudere 关闭，clusus，参 include、exclude、conclude、seclude）+ -ed（…的）→ 被隔开关闭的→隐蔽的、与世隔绝的\n例句\nThey live in a ==secluded== cabin deep in the mountains.","fields":{"Front":"secluded","Back":"释义\n隔绝的；隐居的\n词根词缀\nse-分开、离开（se-）+clud关闭（claudere，clusus）+-ed过去分词/形容词后缀（-ed）\nse-「分开」+ clud「关闭」+ -ed，字面「被隔开关闭的」，引申为隐蔽的、与世隔绝的。\n助记\nse-（分开、离开）+ clud（=claudere 关闭，clusus，参 include、exclude、conclude、seclude）+ -ed（…的）→ 被隔开关闭的→隐蔽的、与世隔绝的\n例句\nThey live in a ==secluded== cabin deep in the mountains.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353265","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"serene","back":"释义\n平静的\n词根词缀\nseren晴朗、宁静（serenus）\n简单词，拉丁语 serenus「晴朗无云的、平静的」，引申为安详的、澄澈的。\n助记\n拉丁 serenus「晴朗无云的、平静的」→ 安详的、宁静的、澄澈的\n例句\nThe garden was ==serene== in the soft evening light.","fields":{"Front":"serene","Back":"释义\n平静的\n词根词缀\nseren晴朗、宁静（serenus）\n简单词，拉丁语 serenus「晴朗无云的、平静的」，引申为安详的、澄澈的。\n助记\n拉丁 serenus「晴朗无云的、平静的」→ 安详的、宁静的、澄澈的\n例句\nThe garden was ==serene== in the soft evening light.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353267","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"shrewd","back":"释义\n精明的；机灵的\n词根词缀\nshrewd恶毒的、怀恶意的（从 shrew「鼩鼱、恶女」而来）+-ed形容词后缀\n源自中古英语 shrewe「邪恶的人/鼩鼱」，原指「恶狠狠的、邪恶的」，后褒义化为精明、敏锐的。\n助记\n中古英语 shrewe「邪恶的人/鼩鼱（shrew）」→ 原指恶狠狠的，后褒义化为精明敏锐的、老奸巨猾的\n例句\nThe ==shrewd== merchant knew exactly when to buy and sell.","fields":{"Front":"shrewd","Back":"释义\n精明的；机灵的\n词根词缀\nshrewd恶毒的、怀恶意的（从 shrew「鼩鼱、恶女」而来）+-ed形容词后缀\n源自中古英语 shrewe「邪恶的人/鼩鼱」，原指「恶狠狠的、邪恶的」，后褒义化为精明、敏锐的。\n助记\n中古英语 shrewe「邪恶的人/鼩鼱（shrew）」→ 原指恶狠狠的，后褒义化为精明敏锐的、老奸巨猾的\n例句\nThe ==shrewd== merchant knew exactly when to buy and sell.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353269","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"soar","back":"释义\n翱翔；猛增\n词根词缀\nex-出、向上（ex）+aure微风、空气（aura）\n经古法语 essorer 溯至俗拉丁语 *exaurare「升入风中」：ex-「出」+ aura「微风」，引申为翱翔、猛涨。\n助记\n俗拉丁语 exaurare「升入风中」（ex- 出、向上 + aura 微风、空气，参 aura）→ 升入风中→翱翔、猛涨、高飞\n例句\nPrices began to ==soar== during the long hot summer.","fields":{"Front":"soar","Back":"释义\n翱翔；猛增\n词根词缀\nex-出、向上（ex）+aure微风、空气（aura）\n经古法语 essorer 溯至俗拉丁语 *exaurare「升入风中」：ex-「出」+ aura「微风」，引申为翱翔、猛涨。\n助记\n俗拉丁语 exaurare「升入风中」（ex- 出、向上 + aura 微风、空气，参 aura）→ 升入风中→翱翔、猛涨、高飞\n例句\nPrices began to ==soar== during the long hot summer.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353271","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"sophistry","back":"释义\n诡辩\n词根词缀\nsoph智慧、聪明（sophos）+-istry表技艺/术的名词后缀（-istria）\nsoph「智慧/诡辩」+ -istry，源自希腊智者派（Sophistai），引申为诡辩、似是而非的论证。\n助记\nsoph（=sophos 智慧、聪明，参 philosopher、sophisticated、sophomore）+ -istry（…之术）→ 智者派的论辩术→诡辩、似是而非的论证\n例句\nThe lawyer's clever ==sophistry== failed to convince the judge.","fields":{"Front":"sophistry","Back":"释义\n诡辩\n词根词缀\nsoph智慧、聪明（sophos）+-istry表技艺/术的名词后缀（-istria）\nsoph「智慧/诡辩」+ -istry，源自希腊智者派（Sophistai），引申为诡辩、似是而非的论证。\n助记\nsoph（=sophos 智慧、聪明，参 philosopher、sophisticated、sophomore）+ -istry（…之术）→ 智者派的论辩术→诡辩、似是而非的论证\n例句\nThe lawyer's clever ==sophistry== failed to convince the judge.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353273","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"spontaneous","back":"释义\n自发的；自然的\n词根词缀\nspont自愿、自发（sponte，「出于自己意愿」）+-aneous形容词后缀（-aneus）\nspont「自愿」+ -aneous，字面「出于自身意愿的」，引申为自发的、自然产生的。\n助记\nspont（=sponte 出于自己意愿）+ -aneous（…的）→ 出于自身意愿的→自发的、即兴而发的、自然产生的\n例句\nThere was a ==spontaneous== outburst of applause after the performance.","fields":{"Front":"spontaneous","Back":"释义\n自发的；自然的\n词根词缀\nspont自愿、自发（sponte，「出于自己意愿」）+-aneous形容词后缀（-aneus）\nspont「自愿」+ -aneous，字面「出于自身意愿的」，引申为自发的、自然产生的。\n助记\nspont（=sponte 出于自己意愿）+ -aneous（…的）→ 出于自身意愿的→自发的、即兴而发的、自然产生的\n例句\nThere was a ==spontaneous== outburst of applause after the performance.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353275","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"squander","back":"释义\n浪费；挥霍\n词根词缀\nsquander挥霍、浪费（词源不确定，16世纪出现）\n简单词，词源不确定，16世纪出现于英语，本义可能为「分散、驱散」，引申为挥霍、浪费（时间/金钱）。\n助记\n16 世纪出现，词源不确定，本义可能为「分散、驱散」→ 挥霍、浪费（时间/金钱）\n例句\nHe would ==squander== his salary on useless luxuries.","fields":{"Front":"squander","Back":"释义\n浪费；挥霍\n词根词缀\nsquander挥霍、浪费（词源不确定，16世纪出现）\n简单词，词源不确定，16世纪出现于英语，本义可能为「分散、驱散」，引申为挥霍、浪费（时间/金钱）。\n助记\n16 世纪出现，词源不确定，本义可能为「分散、驱散」→ 挥霍、浪费（时间/金钱）\n例句\nHe would ==squander== his salary on useless luxuries.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353277","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"stoic","back":"释义\n禁欲的\n词根词缀\nsto柱廊、画廊（stoa，雅典 Zeno 讲学的彩绘柱廊）+-ic形容词后缀\n源自希腊 Stoa Poikile「彩绘柱廊」，斯多葛学派在此讲学，主张克制情感，引申为坚忍的、不以苦乐为意的。\n助记\n希腊 Stoa Poikile「彩绘柱廊」（stoa 柱廊，Zeno 在此讲学）→ 斯多葛学派主张克制情感→坚忍的、不以苦乐为意的\n例句\nThe captain remained ==stoic== despite the terrible pain.","fields":{"Front":"stoic","Back":"释义\n禁欲的\n词根词缀\nsto柱廊、画廊（stoa，雅典 Zeno 讲学的彩绘柱廊）+-ic形容词后缀\n源自希腊 Stoa Poikile「彩绘柱廊」，斯多葛学派在此讲学，主张克制情感，引申为坚忍的、不以苦乐为意的。\n助记\n希腊 Stoa Poikile「彩绘柱廊」（stoa 柱廊，Zeno 在此讲学）→ 斯多葛学派主张克制情感→坚忍的、不以苦乐为意的\n例句\nThe captain remained ==stoic== despite the terrible pain.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353279","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"unflappable","back":"释义\n镇定自若、从容不迫\n词根词缀\nun-不+flap拍打、慌乱（拍翅）+-able可…的\n不会被惊得扑腾拍翅的→镇定自若的、从容不迫的。\n助记\nun-（不）+ flap（拍翅，Flappy Bird 里扑腾的小鸟）+ -able（可…的）→ 怎么吓都不扑腾→镇定自若的。\n例句\nThe ==unflappable== pilot landed the plane safely in the storm.","fields":{"Front":"unflappable","Back":"释义\n镇定自若、从容不迫\n词根词缀\nun-不+flap拍打、慌乱（拍翅）+-able可…的\n不会被惊得扑腾拍翅的→镇定自若的、从容不迫的。\n助记\nun-（不）+ flap（拍翅，Flappy Bird 里扑腾的小鸟）+ -able（可…的）→ 怎么吓都不扑腾→镇定自若的。\n例句\nThe ==unflappable== pilot landed the plane safely in the storm.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353281","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"unleash","back":"释义\n释放；解除\n词根词缀\nun-解开、相反（un-）+leash皮带、拴绳（laisse，源自 laxare「放松」）\nun-「解开」+ leash「拴狗的皮带」，字面「松开皮带」，引申为释放、发泄（力量等）。\n助记\nun-（解开）+ leash（=laisse 拴狗皮带，源自 laxare 放松，参 lax、relax、release）→ 松开皮带→解除限制、释放（力量）\n例句\nThe government decided to ==unleash== a new wave of reforms.","fields":{"Front":"unleash","Back":"释义\n释放；解除\n词根词缀\nun-解开、相反（un-）+leash皮带、拴绳（laisse，源自 laxare「放松」）\nun-「解开」+ leash「拴狗的皮带」，字面「松开皮带」，引申为释放、发泄（力量等）。\n助记\nun-（解开）+ leash（=laisse 拴狗皮带，源自 laxare 放松，参 lax、relax、release）→ 松开皮带→解除限制、释放（力量）\n例句\nThe government decided to ==unleash== a new wave of reforms.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353283","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"vicarious","back":"释义\n间接感受\n词根词缀\nvicari接替、替换（vicis「交替、变化」）+-ous形容词后缀（-osus）\nvicis「替换/轮流」+ -ous，字面「代替他人的」，引申为代理的、间接感受到的（vicarious pleasure）。\n助记\nvicari（=vicis 交替、替换，参 vice、vicissitude）+ -ous（…的）→ 代替他人的→代理的、间接感受到的\n例句\nShe felt a ==vicarious== thrill watching her daughter win the race.","fields":{"Front":"vicarious","Back":"释义\n间接感受\n词根词缀\nvicari接替、替换（vicis「交替、变化」）+-ous形容词后缀（-osus）\nvicis「替换/轮流」+ -ous，字面「代替他人的」，引申为代理的、间接感受到的（vicarious pleasure）。\n助记\nvicari（=vicis 交替、替换，参 vice、vicissitude）+ -ous（…的）→ 代替他人的→代理的、间接感受到的\n例句\nShe felt a ==vicarious== thrill watching her daughter win the race.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353285","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"adamant","back":"释义\n固执的；强硬的\n词根词缀\na-不、无（a-，alpha privative）+damant驯服、征服（daman）\na-「不」+ daman「驯服」，字面「不可被驯服的」，引申为坚定不移的、强硬的。\n助记\na-（希腊否定前缀，不）+ damant（=daman 驯服、征服，参 tame；与 diamond 同源）→ 不可驯服的→坚定不移的、强硬的\n例句\nHe was ==adamant== that he had done nothing wrong.","fields":{"Front":"adamant","Back":"释义\n固执的；强硬的\n词根词缀\na-不、无（a-，alpha privative）+damant驯服、征服（daman）\na-「不」+ daman「驯服」，字面「不可被驯服的」，引申为坚定不移的、强硬的。\n助记\na-（希腊否定前缀，不）+ damant（=daman 驯服、征服，参 tame；与 diamond 同源）→ 不可驯服的→坚定不移的、强硬的\n例句\nHe was ==adamant== that he had done nothing wrong.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353287","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"acumen","back":"释义\n敏锐；聪明\n词根词缀\nacu针、尖锐（acus，acuere「磨尖」）+-men名词后缀（表结果/手段）\nacu「尖」+ -men，字面「尖锐（的判断力）」，引申为敏锐、精明（尤指商业/政治眼光）。\n助记\nacu（=acus 针，acuere 磨尖，参 acute、acid、acupuncture）+ -men（名词）→ 尖锐（的判断力）→敏锐、精明\n例句\nHer sharp business ==acumen== helped the small firm grow quickly.","fields":{"Front":"acumen","Back":"释义\n敏锐；聪明\n词根词缀\nacu针、尖锐（acus，acuere「磨尖」）+-men名词后缀（表结果/手段）\nacu「尖」+ -men，字面「尖锐（的判断力）」，引申为敏锐、精明（尤指商业/政治眼光）。\n助记\nacu（=acus 针，acuere 磨尖，参 acute、acid、acupuncture）+ -men（名词）→ 尖锐（的判断力）→敏锐、精明\n例句\nHer sharp business ==acumen== helped the small firm grow quickly.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353289","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"adept","back":"释义\n熟练的；内行的\n词根词缀\nad-向、到（ad-）+ept达到、获得（apisci，与 apere「贴合」同源）\nad-「向」+ apisci「达到/获得」，字面「已获得（某项技艺）的」，引申为熟练的、内行的。\n助记\nad-（向、到）+ ept（=apisci 达到、获得，与 apere 贴合相关，参 apt、adapt）→ 已获得（技艺）的→熟练的、内行的\n例句\nShe is quite ==adept== at solving difficult math problems.","fields":{"Front":"adept","Back":"释义\n熟练的；内行的\n词根词缀\nad-向、到（ad-）+ept达到、获得（apisci，与 apere「贴合」同源）\nad-「向」+ apisci「达到/获得」，字面「已获得（某项技艺）的」，引申为熟练的、内行的。\n助记\nad-（向、到）+ ept（=apisci 达到、获得，与 apere 贴合相关，参 apt、adapt）→ 已获得（技艺）的→熟练的、内行的\n例句\nShe is quite ==adept== at solving difficult math problems.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353291","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"adulation","back":"释义\n奉承\n词根词缀\nad-向、对着（ad-）+ul（词源不确定，或指「摇尾」*ala-，像狗一样）+-ation名词后缀（-ationem）\nad-「对着」+ adulari「（狗）摇尾迎人、谄媚」+ -ation，字面「如犬摇尾」，引申为谄媚、过度奉承。\n助记\nad-（对着）+ ul（=adulari 像狗一样摇尾迎人，*ala- 尾巴）+ -ation（名词）→ 如犬摇尾→谄媚、过度奉承\n例句\nThe young star received endless ==adulation== from her fans.","fields":{"Front":"adulation","Back":"释义\n奉承\n词根词缀\nad-向、对着（ad-）+ul（词源不确定，或指「摇尾」*ala-，像狗一样）+-ation名词后缀（-ationem）\nad-「对着」+ adulari「（狗）摇尾迎人、谄媚」+ -ation，字面「如犬摇尾」，引申为谄媚、过度奉承。\n助记\nad-（对着）+ ul（=adulari 像狗一样摇尾迎人，*ala- 尾巴）+ -ation（名词）→ 如犬摇尾→谄媚、过度奉承\n例句\nThe young star received endless ==adulation== from her fans.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353293","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"amalgamate","back":"释义\n合并；混合\n词根词缀\namalgam软混合物、汞齐（amalgama，源自 Gk. malagma「软膏」）+-ate动词后缀（-are）\n源自中世纪拉丁语 amalgama「汞合金、软团」（希腊语 malagma「软化物」）+ -ate，引申为合并、融合。\n助记\namalgam（=amalgama 汞合金、软团，希腊 malagma 软化物）+ -ate（动词）→ 把金属混成一团→合并、融合\n例句\nThe two departments will ==amalgamate== into one next year.","fields":{"Front":"amalgamate","Back":"释义\n合并；混合\n词根词缀\namalgam软混合物、汞齐（amalgama，源自 Gk. malagma「软膏」）+-ate动词后缀（-are）\n源自中世纪拉丁语 amalgama「汞合金、软团」（希腊语 malagma「软化物」）+ -ate，引申为合并、融合。\n助记\namalgam（=amalgama 汞合金、软团，希腊 malagma 软化物）+ -ate（动词）→ 把金属混成一团→合并、融合\n例句\nThe two departments will ==amalgamate== into one next year.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353295","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"antagonize","back":"释义\n使敌对；引起对抗\n词根词缀\nant-反对、对抗（anti-）+agon竞赛、争夺（agon）+-ize动词后缀（-izein）\nanti-「对抗」+ agon「竞赛」+ -ize，字面「与之竞赛作对」，引申为引起…敌意、使对立。\n助记\nant-（anti- 对抗）+ agon（=agon 竞赛、争夺，参 agony、protagonist、antagonist）+ -ize（动词）→ 与之竞赛作对→引起敌意、使对立\n例句\nHis rude comments only served to ==antagonize== his colleagues.","fields":{"Front":"antagonize","Back":"释义\n使敌对；引起对抗\n词根词缀\nant-反对、对抗（anti-）+agon竞赛、争夺（agon）+-ize动词后缀（-izein）\nanti-「对抗」+ agon「竞赛」+ -ize，字面「与之竞赛作对」，引申为引起…敌意、使对立。\n助记\nant-（anti- 对抗）+ agon（=agon 竞赛、争夺，参 agony、protagonist、antagonist）+ -ize（动词）→ 与之竞赛作对→引起敌意、使对立\n例句\nHis rude comments only served to ==antagonize== his colleagues.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353297","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"apprentice","back":"释义\n学徒；当学徒\n词根词缀\nap-向、去（ad-，在 p 前同化为 ap-）+prent抓取、理解（prehendere，prehensus）+-ice名词后缀（-itium）\nap-「去」+ prehend「抓取/领会」+ -ice，字面「去抓取（知识）的人」，引申为学徒、新手。\n助记\nap-（ad- 去）+ prent（=prehendere 抓取、领会，prehensus，参 comprehend、apprehend、prison）+ -ice（指人）→ 去抓取（手艺）的人→学徒\n例句\nHe worked as an ==apprentice== to a master carpenter for three years.","fields":{"Front":"apprentice","Back":"释义\n学徒；当学徒\n词根词缀\nap-向、去（ad-，在 p 前同化为 ap-）+prent抓取、理解（prehendere，prehensus）+-ice名词后缀（-itium）\nap-「去」+ prehend「抓取/领会」+ -ice，字面「去抓取（知识）的人」，引申为学徒、新手。\n助记\nap-（ad- 去）+ prent（=prehendere 抓取、领会，prehensus，参 comprehend、apprehend、prison）+ -ice（指人）→ 去抓取（手艺）的人→学徒\n例句\nHe worked as an ==apprentice== to a master carpenter for three years.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353299","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"arcane","back":"释义\n神秘难懂的\n词根词缀\narcan封闭的、秘密的（arcanus，arca「箱子」）+-e形容词后缀\n拉丁语 arca「箱子、柜子」→ arcanus「藏在箱中的」，引申为神秘的、晦涩难解的。\n助记\n拉丁 arca「箱子、柜子」→ arcanus「藏在箱中的」（参 ark）→ 神秘的、晦涩难解的、鲜为人知的\n例句\nThe old manuscript was written in an ==arcane== script.","fields":{"Front":"arcane","Back":"释义\n神秘难懂的\n词根词缀\narcan封闭的、秘密的（arcanus，arca「箱子」）+-e形容词后缀\n拉丁语 arca「箱子、柜子」→ arcanus「藏在箱中的」，引申为神秘的、晦涩难解的。\n助记\n拉丁 arca「箱子、柜子」→ arcanus「藏在箱中的」（参 ark）→ 神秘的、晦涩难解的、鲜为人知的\n例句\nThe old manuscript was written in an ==arcane== script.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353301","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"autonomy","back":"释义\n自治；自主权\n词根词缀\nauto-自己、自身（autos）+nom法律、秩序（nomos）+-y名词后缀（-ia）\nauto-「自己」+ nom「法律」+ -y，字面「自己制定法律」，引申为自治、自主权。\n助记\nauto-（自己）+ nom（=nomos 法律、秩序，参 economy、astronomy）+ -y（名词）→ 自己制定法律→自治、自主权\n例句\nThe region was granted complete ==autonomy== over its own affairs.","fields":{"Front":"autonomy","Back":"释义\n自治；自主权\n词根词缀\nauto-自己、自身（autos）+nom法律、秩序（nomos）+-y名词后缀（-ia）\nauto-「自己」+ nom「法律」+ -y，字面「自己制定法律」，引申为自治、自主权。\n助记\nauto-（自己）+ nom（=nomos 法律、秩序，参 economy、astronomy）+ -y（名词）→ 自己制定法律→自治、自主权\n例句\nThe region was granted complete ==autonomy== over its own affairs.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353303","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"belie","back":"释义\n掩饰；证明……是错的\n词根词缀\nbe-使、加以（be-，加强/及物化）+lie谎言、说谎（lyge，leogan）\nbe-「使…」+ lie「说谎」，字面「用谎言掩盖/与…不符」，引申为掩饰、与…相悖、令人失望。\n助记\nbe-（使、加以）+ lie（=leogan 说谎，lyge 谎言）→ 用谎言掩盖、与…不符→掩饰、与…相悖、证明…为假\n例句\nHis confident smile would ==belie== the fact that he was nervous.","fields":{"Front":"belie","Back":"释义\n掩饰；证明……是错的\n词根词缀\nbe-使、加以（be-，加强/及物化）+lie谎言、说谎（lyge，leogan）\nbe-「使…」+ lie「说谎」，字面「用谎言掩盖/与…不符」，引申为掩饰、与…相悖、令人失望。\n助记\nbe-（使、加以）+ lie（=leogan 说谎，lyge 谎言）→ 用谎言掩盖、与…不符→掩饰、与…相悖、证明…为假\n例句\nHis confident smile would ==belie== the fact that he was nervous.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353305","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"biased","back":"释义\n有偏见的\n词根词缀\nbias斜线、倾斜（biais，可能源自 Gk. epikarsios「斜的」）+-ed形容词后缀\n源自古法语 biais「斜线、倾斜」+ -ed，字面「歪斜的」，引申为有偏见的、片面的。\n助记\n古法语 biais「斜线、倾斜」（或源希腊 epikarsios 斜的）+ -ed（…的）→ 歪斜的→有偏见的、片面的\n例句\nThe report gave a clearly ==biased== account of the events.","fields":{"Front":"biased","Back":"释义\n有偏见的\n词根词缀\nbias斜线、倾斜（biais，可能源自 Gk. epikarsios「斜的」）+-ed形容词后缀\n源自古法语 biais「斜线、倾斜」+ -ed，字面「歪斜的」，引申为有偏见的、片面的。\n助记\n古法语 biais「斜线、倾斜」（或源希腊 epikarsios 斜的）+ -ed（…的）→ 歪斜的→有偏见的、片面的\n例句\nThe report gave a clearly ==biased== account of the events.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]},{"noteId":"sat800_c_1791885353307","ord":0,"notetype":"basic","front":"circumspect","back":"释义\n慎重的；谨慎的\n词根词缀\ncircum-环绕、周围（circum）+spect看（specere，spectus）\ncircum-「四周」+ spect「看」，字面「环顾四周」，引申为谨慎的、小心周到的。\n助记\ncircum-（环绕、周围）+ spect（=specere 看，spectus，参 inspect、spectacle、respect、prospect）→ 环顾四周→谨慎的、小心周到的\n例句\nHe was ==circumspect== about making any promises he could not keep.","fields":{"Front":"circumspect","Back":"释义\n慎重的；谨慎的\n词根词缀\ncircum-环绕、周围（circum）+spect看（specere，spectus）\ncircum-「四周」+ spect「看」，字面「环顾四周」，引申为谨慎的、小心周到的。\n助记\ncircum-（环绕、周围）+ spect（=specere 看，spectus，参 inspect、spectacle、respect、prospect）→ 环顾四周→谨慎的、小心周到的\n例句\nHe was ==circumspect== about making any promises he could not keep.","Extra":"","Source":""},"extra":"","tags":["sat800"],"flags":0,"suspended":false,"buried":false,"leeched":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","scheduling":{"difficulty":5,"stability":0.001,"due":"","lastReview":"","reps":0,"lapses":0,"elapsedDays":0,"scheduledDays":0,"step":0},"state":"new","media":[],"reviewLog":[]}]},{"id":"sat800-extra-1_2","name":"SAT800 增补 › List 1+2","createdAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","modifiedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["sat800","imported"],"options":{},"cards":[{"noteId":"s